    ["A Campaign Arbiter provides a convenient route to the area."] = "Un Campaign Arbiter ofrece una ruta cómoda hasta la zona.",
    ["A Kraken (level 37-38) may spawn above the Night Flowers."] = "Un Kraken (nivel 37-38) puede aparecer sobre las Night Flowers.",
    ["A Leather Gorget"] = "Un Leather Gorget",
    ["A Magicked Steel is found on various Goblin enemies in Oldton Movalpolos. It is advised to farm Goblin Oilman, which seem to have a higher drop rate: use the Proto-Waypoint, drop down the ledge and head west."] = "Un Magicked Steel se encuentra en varios enemigos Goblin de Oldton Movalpolos. Se aconseja farmear Goblin Oilman, que parecen tener una tasa de drop mayor: usa el Proto-Waypoint, déjate caer por la cornisa y ve al oeste.",
    ["A Meteorite is dropped by Crawler enemies in West Sarutabaruta, on Starfall Hillock (R)."] = "Un Meteorite lo sueltan los enemigos Crawler de West Sarutabaruta, en Starfall Hillock (R).",
    ["A Poroggo Casanova spawns, assisted by Mikiruru, Mikiluru, Mikirulu, Nikilulu and Mikilulu. They cannot be put to sleep, even with Elemental Seal."] = "Aparece un Poroggo Casanova, ayudado por Mikiruru, Mikiluru, Mikirulu, Nikilulu y Mikilulu. No se les puede dormir, ni siquiera con Elemental Seal.",
    ["A Punch Bug can be obtained while waiting."] = "Puedes conseguir un Punch Bug mientras esperas.",
    ["A Spruce Lumber drops from Taurus enemies in Phomiuna Aqueducts; 3 Taurus can be found at (G-6) of Map 1. Enter Phomiuna Aqueducts from Tavnazian Safehold, or use the Survival Guide and head northwest."] = "Un Spruce Lumber lo sueltan enemigos Taurus en Phomiuna Aqueducts; se pueden encontrar 3 Taurus en (G-6) del Map 1. Entra en Phomiuna Aqueducts desde Tavnazian Safehold, o usa la Survival Guide y ve al noroeste.",
    ["A White Mage may instead pull Maat and stay alive for 5 minutes, causing Maat to give up. A Thief may try to steal a Scroll of Instant Warp from Maat; once you steal it, Maat gives up."] = "Un White Mage puede en su lugar atraer a Maat y mantenerse vivo 5 minutos, lo que hace que Maat se rinda. Un Thief puede intentar robarle un Scroll of Instant Warp a Maat; una vez que lo robas, Maat se rinde.",
    ["A confidential report states that corsairs are secretly collecting the remains of shipwrecks on Ilrusi Atoll. Mission orders: demolish the shipwrecks."] = "Un informe confidencial dice que unos corsarios recogen en secreto los restos de naufragios en Ilrusi Atoll. Órdenes de la misión: demoler los naufragios.",
    ["A cutscene with Sneaking Tiger asks you for a Quadav Stew. It can only be stolen from certain Quadavs in Beadeaux, and you can steal it before going to Selbina to save time."] = "Una escena con Sneaking Tiger te pide un Quadav Stew. Solo se puede robar a ciertos Quadavs de Beadeaux, y puedes robarlo antes de ir a Selbina para ahorrar tiempo.",
    ["A location for this quest is in Caedarva Mire at (K-5), which is actually part of the Azouph Isle map."] = "Un lugar de esta quest está en Caedarva Mire en (K-5), que en realidad forma parte del mapa de Azouph Isle.",
    ["A logistics unit headed to the front lines of the war with the Far East was attacked and its supplies were stolen. The enemy then fled towards Leujaoam Sanctum. Mission orders: retrieve the supplies."] = "Una unidad logística que iba al frente de la guerra con el Far East fue atacada y le robaron los suministros. El enemigo huyó entonces hacia Leujaoam Sanctum. Órdenes de la misión: recuperar los suministros.",
    ["A long-haired marid has been found frozen in the eternal ice of Leujaoam Sanctum. Mission orders: protect the professor. The recommended level is 60."] = "Se ha encontrado un marid de pelo largo congelado en el hielo eterno de Leujaoam Sanctum. Órdenes de la misión: proteger al profesor. El nivel recomendado es 60.",
    ["A puk recently stole a treasure box containing enchanted gems from the royal treasury. The gems were then given to Mamool Ja officers as a reward for duty. Find and retrieve the treasure. Mission orders: recover the treasure."] = "Un puk robó hace poco un cofre del tesoro con gemas encantadas del tesoro real. Las gemas se dieron después a oficiales Mamool Ja como recompensa por su servicio. Encuentra y recupera el tesoro. Órdenes de la misión: recuperar el tesoro.",
    ["A quick way to reach the destination is to take the Survival Guide to Gustav Tunnel, then exit to Valkurm Dunes."] = "Una forma rápida de llegar es tomar la Survival Guide a Gustav Tunnel y luego salir a Valkurm Dunes.",
    ["A secret door opens to the south."] = "Se abre una puerta secreta al sur.",
    ["A ship carrying Princess Kadjaya of the Imperial family back from a diplomatic mission to the West has run aground near Lebros Cavern. Mission orders: rescue Princess Kadjaya."] = "Un barco que traía de vuelta a la Princess Kadjaya de la familia Imperial de una misión diplomática en el West ha encallado cerca de Lebros Cavern. Órdenes de la misión: rescatar a la Princess Kadjaya.",
    ["A squad sent to search for the Seagull Phratrie hideout has failed to report. Find any survivors, especially Private Ryaaf, a relative of the Galeserpent General. Mission orders: find the survivors."] = "Un escuadrón enviado a buscar el escondite de la Seagull Phratrie no ha informado. Encuentra a los supervivientes, sobre todo al Private Ryaaf, pariente del Galeserpent General. Órdenes de la misión: encontrar a los supervivientes.",
    ["A typical experience party has a tank, a healer, damage dealers, and someone to pull monsters back to camp."] = "Un grupo de experiencia típico tiene un tanque, un sanador, atacantes de daño y alguien que traiga los monstruos de vuelta al campamento.",
    ["A unit of Mamool Ja soldiers is training in assassination techniques. Destroy them before they can become a threat to the Empress. Mission orders: destroy the assassins."] = "Una unidad de soldados Mamool Ja entrena técnicas de asesinato. Destrúyelos antes de que se conviertan en una amenaza para la Empress. Órdenes de la misión: destruir a los asesinos.",
    ["Accept his offer to give him 10,000 gil towards his cause. You can then purchase the permanent key item Magicked astrolabe."] = "Acepta su oferta de darle 10,000 gil para su causa. Después puedes comprar el key item permanente Magicked astrolabe.",
    ["Acquire a Hatchet from the Auction House, NPC stores or crafting."] = "Consigue un Hatchet en la Auction House, en tiendas de NPCs o fabricándolo.",
    ["Acquire a Robe and a Bronze Subligar, both easy to find at the Auction House or from some armor merchants."] = "Consigue un Robe y un Bronze Subligar, fáciles de encontrar en la Auction House o en algunos comerciantes de armaduras.",
    ["Acquire a Yagudo Drink from the Auction House, or buy one from a Curio Vendor Moogle if you have the appropriate Rhapsody key item."] = "Consigue un Yagudo Drink en la Auction House, o cómpralo a un Curio Vendor Moogle si tienes el key item Rhapsody adecuado.",
    ["Advanced jobs unlock. See Jobs for each job's unlock quest."] = "Se desbloquean los trabajos avanzados. Consulta Jobs para ver la quest de desbloqueo de cada trabajo.",
    ["After Chocobo's Wounds, you can rent chocobos at stables. In the starter cities rentals open at level 15 and cost 50 gil plus your level. Elsewhere they open at level 20 and cost more. Chocobo digging and chocobo raising are both available."] = "Después de Chocobo's Wounds, puedes alquilar chocobos en los establos. En las ciudades iniciales los alquileres se abren a nivel 15 y cuestan 50 gil más tu nivel. En otros sitios se abren a nivel 20 y cuestan más. La excavación con chocobo y la cría de chocobos están disponibles.",
    ["After Ken despawns, Marin appears at the exit."] = "Cuando Ken desaparece, Marin aparece en la salida.",
    ["After a failed attempt, obtain another Umbra Bug from the Regal Pawprints near the broken tree after the required interval."] = "Tras un intento fallido, obtén otro Umbra Bug de las Regal Pawprints cerca del árbol roto una vez pasado el intervalo requerido.",
    ["After accepting the quest, talk to Nafiwaa at the Alchemist's Guild in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-5). She gives you 5 empty test tube key items."] = "Tras aceptar la quest, habla con Nafiwaa en el Alchemist's Guild de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-5). Te da 5 key items de tubos de ensayo vacíos.",
    ["After all 24 charges have detonated, report to Captain Antje."] = "Cuando hayan detonado las 24 cargas, informa al Captain Antje.",
    ["After all 3 trials are complete, you are awarded your promotion and the SL Wildcat badge, which gives access to SL Assaults. If you fail any trial, you need to pay the initiation fee of 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces again in order to repeat it."] = "Cuando se completan las 3 pruebas, te conceden el ascenso y el SL Wildcat badge, que da acceso a los SL Assaults. Si fallas alguna prueba, debes pagar de nuevo la cuota de iniciación de 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces para repetirla.",
    ["After all eight dawndrops have been obtained, they combine into the Primal glow."] = "Cuando hayas obtenido las ocho dawndrops, se combinan en el Primal glow.",
    ["After all five Shadow Bugs have been planted, examine Regal Pawprints (H-10) near the broken tree."] = "Tras plantar los cinco Shadow Bugs, examina las Regal Pawprints (H-10) cerca del árbol roto.",
    ["After arriving in the past, examine the other two Maws to open their passages between the past and present."] = "Al llegar al pasado, examina los otros dos Maws para abrir sus pasajes entre el pasado y el presente.",
    ["After cleaning the weapon twice you may choose to complete the quest or continue cleaning. Whether you stop at two cleanings or five, the quest is complete and you receive the CS Wildcat badge, access to CS Assaults, 1 Imperial Mythril Piece and possibly 1 Imperial Gold Piece as well."] = "Tras limpiar el arma dos veces puedes elegir completar la quest o seguir limpiando. Tanto si paras en dos limpiezas como en cinco, la quest queda completa y recibes el CS Wildcat badge, acceso a los CS Assaults, 1 Imperial Mythril Piece y posiblemente 1 Imperial Gold Piece también.",
    ["After collecting all nine, choose the Mark of Seed to continue or the Azure Key to open the level 60 treasure coffer in Lower Jeuno."] = "Tras reunir los nueve, elige la Mark of Seed para continuar o la Azure Key para abrir el treasure coffer de nivel 60 en Lower Jeuno.",
    ["After completing Missionary Moblin you need to zone out and back in to initiate this quest. Talk to Koblakiq in Oldton Movalpolos (H-11) to begin it. A letter has arrived from Zeelozok asking for an arnica root to be brought to Castle Oztroja, and Koblakiq entrusts the task to you. It is suggested that you have the three beastmen stronghold Survival Guides, as the quest requires traveling between the three strongholds, and that you bring Echo Drops, Holy Water or someone who can cast Cursna."] = "Tras completar Missionary Moblin debes salir de la zona y volver a entrar para iniciar esta quest. Habla con Koblakiq en Oldton Movalpolos (H-11) para empezarla. Ha llegado una carta de Zeelozok pidiendo que se lleve una arnica root a Castle Oztroja, y Koblakiq te confía la tarea. Se sugiere que tengas las tres Survival Guides de las fortalezas de beastmen, ya que la quest requiere viajar entre las tres fortalezas, y que lleves Echo Drops, Holy Water o a alguien que pueda lanzar Cursna.",
    ["After completing The Crimson Trial and reaching level 50 or higher as a Red Mage, speak with Curilla (I-9) in Chateau d'Oraguille. You no longer have to be on Red Mage after starting the quest."] = "Tras completar The Crimson Trial y alcanzar el nivel 50 o superior como Red Mage, habla con Curilla (I-9) en Chateau d'Oraguille. Ya no tienes que ser Red Mage después de empezar la quest.",
    ["After completing Vanishing Act, zone and wait one Earth minute."] = "Tras completar Vanishing Act, cambia de zona y espera un minuto terrestre.",
    ["After completing one of the three national storylines, examine a Cavernous Maw in the past near Jeuno."] = "Tras completar una de las tres historias nacionales, examina un Cavernous Maw en el pasado cerca de Jeuno.",
    ["After completing one pair of national storylines, enter Southern San d'Oria [S] by walking from East Ronfaure [S]."] = "Tras completar un par de historias nacionales, entra en Southern San d'Oria [S] caminando desde East Ronfaure [S].",
    ["After completing this quest, all Mithra in Kazham are repulsed by you, but Opo-opos are attracted to you. The only way to fix this is by completing Personal Hygiene, though it is recommended that you finish The Opo-opo and I first so you can get an Opo-opo Crown."] = "Tras completar esta quest, todos los Mithra de Kazham te rechazan, pero los Opo-opos se sienten atraídos por ti. La única forma de arreglarlo es completar Personal Hygiene, aunque se recomienda terminar antes The Opo-opo and I para conseguir un Opo-opo Crown.",
    ["After defeating Bugallug, speak with Rakorok for a cutscene in which you lose the Dawn talisman."] = "Tras derrotar a Bugallug, habla con Rakorok para una escena en la que pierdes el Dawn talisman.",
    ["After defeating Ophiotaurus, examine Undulating Confluence (G-8) again."] = "Tras derrotar a Ophiotaurus, examina de nuevo el Undulating Confluence (G-8).",
    ["After defeating all three, examine the ??? once more to receive the key item Indigested meat."] = "Tras derrotar a los tres, examina la ??? una vez más para recibir el key item Indigested meat.",
    ["After defeating the NM, click the Stone Monument once more to complete the quest and receive the Minstrel's Dagger."] = "Tras derrotar al NM, haz clic en el Stone Monument una vez más para completar la quest y recibir la Minstrel's Dagger.",
    ["After each victory, examine the corresponding protocrystal again to receive its counterseal."] = "Tras cada victoria, examina de nuevo el protocrystal correspondiente para recibir su contrasello.",
    ["After finishing all of the cutscenes after Dawn, including Blueblade Fell, walk towards the Palace in Ru'Lude Gardens to begin the cutscene with Esha'ntarl."] = "Tras terminar todas las escenas posteriores a Dawn, incluida Blueblade Fell, camina hacia el Palace de Ru'Lude Gardens para comenzar la escena con Esha'ntarl.",
    ["After giving you the Fewell of your choosing, he no longer offers to craft it and instead encourages you not to give up if you are running low on Fewell."] = "Tras darte el Fewell que elijas, ya no ofrece fabricarlo y en su lugar te anima a no rendirte si te estás quedando sin Fewell.",
    ["After hearing Nenne's story, go into the first house on Watchdog Alley (G-7), go upstairs to a bedroom and examine the ??? on the table. Click it to get the option to read a diary."] = "Tras oír la historia de Nenne, entra en la primera casa de Watchdog Alley (G-7), sube a un dormitorio y examina la ??? de la mesa. Haz clic en ella para tener la opción de leer un diario.",
    ["After joining Salaheem's Sentinels, Alib-Mufalib offers to teleport you to Aht Urhgan Whitegate for 300 gil."] = "Tras unirte a los Salaheem's Sentinels, Alib-Mufalib te ofrece teletransportarte a Aht Urhgan Whitegate por 300 gil.",
    ["After joining Salaheem's Sentinels, speak with Naja Salaheem and show her the invitation card to receive Imperial currency; the more Lure of the Wildcat quests you have completed, the greater the reward."] = "Tras unirte a los Salaheem's Sentinels, habla con Naja Salaheem y muéstrale la invitation card para recibir moneda Imperial; cuantas más quests de Lure of the Wildcat hayas completado, mayor es la recompensa.",
    ["After joining Salaheem's Sentinels, speak with Naja Salaheem with the invitation card to be rewarded with Imperial currency; the more Lure of the Wildcat quests you have completed, the greater the reward."] = "Tras unirte a los Salaheem's Sentinels, habla con Naja Salaheem con la invitation card para recibir moneda Imperial; cuantas más quests de Lure of the Wildcat hayas completado, mayor es la recompensa.",
    ["After joining Salaheem's Sentinels, speak with Naja Salaheem with the invitation card to be rewarded with Imperial currency; the more Lure of the Wildcat quests you have completed, the greater the reward. Alib-Mufalib will also offer to teleport you to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Tras unirte a los Salaheem's Sentinels, habla con Naja Salaheem con la invitation card para recibir moneda Imperial; cuantas más quests de Lure of the Wildcat hayas completado, mayor es la recompensa. Alib-Mufalib también te ofrecerá teletransportarte a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["After just completing Hearts of Mythril, you must zone to flag this quest. You need Bastok fame level 3."] = "Tras completar Hearts of Mythril, debes cambiar de zona para activar esta quest. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["After obtaining all three pieces, examine the second door at (H-10), then examine ??? (H-10), battle/cutscene target."] = "Tras obtener las tres piezas, examina la segunda puerta en (H-10) y luego la ??? (H-10), objetivo de batalla/escena.",
    ["After reaching Rank 6, enter your home nation."] = "Tras alcanzar el Rank 6, entra en tu nación de origen.",
    ["After receiving the Gilt Glasses, return them to Altiret for your reward."] = "Tras recibir las Gilt Glasses, devuélvelas a Altiret para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["After speaking with Ensetsu, make your way to (H-5)/(H-6) of Eastern Altepa Desert. From this point you can continue on any job. The shortest route to the ??? is to take the Survival Guide to Western Altepa Desert and then zone to Eastern Altepa Desert."] = "Tras hablar con Ensetsu, ve a (H-5)/(H-6) de Eastern Altepa Desert. A partir de aquí puedes continuar con cualquier trabajo. La ruta más corta a la ??? es tomar la Survival Guide a Western Altepa Desert y luego cambiar de zona a Eastern Altepa Desert.",
    ["After that, speak with Ayame again."] = "Después, habla de nuevo con Ayame.",
    ["After the Fountain of Trouble event, examine Moon Spiral again while possessing at least one elemental Sap."] = "Tras el evento de Fountain of Trouble, examina de nuevo la Moon Spiral mientras tengas al menos un Sap elemental.",
    ["After the NM is defeated, check the Hume Bones again to receive a Blue Ribbon."] = "Tras derrotar al NM, revisa de nuevo los Hume Bones para recibir una Blue Ribbon.",
    ["After the NM is defeated, examine the Viscous Liquid for a cutscene."] = "Tras derrotar al NM, examina el Viscous Liquid para una escena.",
    ["After the Qufim Island event, receive six seals."] = "Tras el evento de Qufim Island, recibes seis sellos.",
    ["After the battle, examine sparkling ??? (F-11) again."] = "Tras la batalla, examina de nuevo la ??? reluciente (F-11).",
    ["After the battle, receive the Ripe Starfruit and Peach Coral Key."] = "Tras la batalla, recibe el Ripe Starfruit y la Peach Coral Key.",
    ["After the conversation, zone out, then return and speak with him one last time to complete the quest and receive 10,000 gil."] = "Tras la conversación, sal de la zona, vuelve y habla con él una última vez para completar la quest y recibir 10,000 gil.",
    ["After the cutscene with Guilerme, return to Rosel for your reward: 200 gil if you named the right prince, only 100 gil if you named the wrong one."] = "Tras la escena con Guilerme, vuelve con Rosel por tu recompensa: 200 gil si nombraste al príncipe correcto, solo 100 gil si nombraste al equivocado.",
    ["After the cutscene you face an automaton named Valkeng. Upon defeating Valkeng, a cutscene occurs; your choice of answer does not affect any outcome."] = "Tras la escena te enfrentas a un autómata llamado Valkeng. Al derrotar a Valkeng, ocurre una escena; tu elección de respuesta no afecta a ningún resultado.",
    ["After the cutscene you may commission Corsair Artifact Armor from Leleroon. You may choose the order in which you receive the armor, and you may commission a new piece one Vana'diel day (one Earth hour) after the last piece was completed."] = "Tras la escena puedes encargar Corsair Artifact Armor a Leleroon. Puedes elegir el orden en que recibes la armadura, y puedes encargar una pieza nueva un día de Vana'diel (una hora terrestre) después de terminar la anterior.",
    ["After the cutscene you receive the key item Map of the Attohwa Chasm."] = "Tras la escena recibes el key item Map of the Attohwa Chasm.",
    ["After the cutscene, go back to Windurst Woods and speak with Perih Vashai again. A cutscene with the Mithran Tracker sends you to Castle Oztroja to search a pool for an Old Earring."] = "Tras la escena, vuelve a Windurst Woods y habla de nuevo con Perih Vashai. Una escena con el Mithran Tracker te envía a Castle Oztroja a buscar en un estanque un Old Earring.",
    ["After the cutscene, return to Bastok and speak with Carmelo to complete the quest."] = "Tras la escena, vuelve a Bastok y habla con Carmelo para completar la quest.",
    ["After the cutscene, return to Perih Vashai to receive your Sniping Bow."] = "Tras la escena, vuelve con Perih Vashai para recibir tu Sniping Bow.",
    ["After the cutscene, return to Powhatan to complete the quest and receive a Spatha."] = "Tras la escena, vuelve con Powhatan para completar la quest y recibir una Spatha.",
    ["After the cutscene, speak with Babenn in Bastok Mines (J-6) to complete the quest."] = "Tras la escena, habla con Babenn en Bastok Mines (J-6) para completar la quest.",
    ["After the cutscene, trade a Silk Cloth to Koru-Moru in Windurst Walls (E-7)."] = "Tras la escena, entrega una Silk Cloth a Koru-Moru en Windurst Walls (E-7).",
    ["After the event at Mahogany Door, examine the door again."] = "Tras el evento en la Mahogany Door, examina la puerta de nuevo.",
    ["After the event ends, head back to Elki and speak to him to complete the quest."] = "Cuando termina el evento, vuelve con Elki y habla con él para completar la quest.",
    ["After the fight, talk to Ge'Fhu Yagudoeye again for a short cutscene."] = "Tras el combate, habla otra vez con Ge'Fhu Yagudoeye para una escena corta.",
    ["After the final trial is complete, speak to Naja Salaheem to finish the quest and receive the SM Wildcat badge, which gives access to SM Assaults."] = "Tras completar la prueba final, habla con Naja Salaheem para terminar la quest y recibir el SM Wildcat badge, que da acceso a los SM Assaults.",
    ["After the questions, go to the western Acolyte Hostel building (K-5) for a cutscene and receive the Thesis on alchemy."] = "Tras las preguntas, ve al edificio oeste del Acolyte Hostel (K-5) para una escena y recibe la Thesis on alchemy.",
    ["After the required Vana'diel day has passed, leave the area and return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Cuando haya pasado el día de Vana'diel requerido, sal de la zona y vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["After the required Vana'diel day has passed, return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Cuando haya pasado el día de Vana'diel requerido, vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["After the required Vana'diel day has passed, travel to the Shararat Teahouse."] = "Cuando haya pasado el día de Vana'diel requerido, viaja a la Shararat Teahouse.",
    ["After the required interval has passed, change zones and return to Amaura (G-6)."] = "Cuando haya pasado el intervalo requerido, cambia de zona y vuelve con Amaura (G-6).",
    ["After the required time has passed, change zones before examining the Veridical Conflux again."] = "Cuando haya pasado el tiempo requerido, cambia de zona antes de examinar de nuevo el Veridical Conflux.",
    ["After the required time has passed, change zones."] = "Cuando haya pasado el tiempo requerido, cambia de zona.",
    ["After the required transition, travel to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Tras la transición requerida, viaja a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["After the three battles in La Theine, Konschtat, and Tahrongi, speak with Joachim (H-8)."] = "Tras las tres batallas en La Theine, Konschtat y Tahrongi, habla con Joachim (H-8).",
    ["After the wait, check the campfire again and it drops a Galkan Sausage into your inventory, so make sure you have inventory room."] = "Tras la espera, revisa de nuevo la campfire y suelta un Galkan Sausage en tu inventario, así que asegúrate de tener espacio.",
    ["After this cutscene you may commission Blue Mage Artifact Armor (Magus Shalwar, Magus Bazubands and Magus Jubbah) from Lathuya, who gives you a Magus order slip and tells you to come back later. You do not have to defeat the Nepionic Soulflayer first."] = "Tras esta escena puedes encargar a Lathuya Blue Mage Artifact Armor (Magus Shalwar, Magus Bazubands y Magus Jubbah); te da una Magus order slip y te dice que vuelvas más tarde. No tienes que derrotar antes al Nepionic Soulflayer.",
    ["After winning, return and speak with Aurege for your reward. The quest does not appear in your log until it is completed."] = "Tras ganar, vuelve y habla con Aurege por tu recompensa. La quest no aparece en tu log hasta que se completa.",
    ["After years of quietly defying Imperial rule, the recluse Count Dracula has begun preparations for an assault on Al Zahbi. Infiltrate Leujaoam Sanctum, locate the count and slay him before he can execute his plans. Mission orders: defeat the count."] = "Tras años desafiando en silencio el dominio Imperial, el recluso Count Dracula ha empezado a preparar un ataque contra Al Zahbi. Infíltrate en Leujaoam Sanctum, localiza al conde y mátalo antes de que ejecute sus planes. Órdenes de la misión: derrotar al conde.",
    ["After you have all five Brand key items, speak to Waoud again for the final cutscene to finish the quest and receive the Immortal's Scimitar. You also receive the title Branded by the Five Serpents."] = "Cuando tengas los cinco key items Brand, habla de nuevo con Waoud para la escena final que termina la quest y te da el Immortal's Scimitar. También recibes el título Branded by the Five Serpents.",
    ["After you have defeated Bullheaded Grosvez, touch the ??? again to receive the Red oil."] = "Cuando hayas derrotado a Bullheaded Grosvez, toca la ??? de nuevo para recibir el Red oil.",
    ["Afterward, speak with Squintrox Dryeyes (G-8) to receive the Viridian Key."] = "Después, habla con Squintrox Dryeyes (G-8) para recibir la Viridian Key.",
    ["Afterwards, speak with Antreneau and he gives you a Grilled Hare."] = "Después, habla con Antreneau y te da un Grilled Hare.",
    ["All enemies in the assault aggro Professor Chanoix, as well as any party member without Sneak or with yellow or lower HP."] = "Todos los enemigos del assault atacan al Professor Chanoix, así como a cualquier miembro del grupo sin Sneak o con HP en amarillo o menos.",
    ["All the required items can also be found at the Auction House, under Others, Misc. 1. The quest gives you the title Black Marketeer and can be repeated."] = "Todos los objetos necesarios también están en la Auction House, en Others, Misc. 1. La quest te da el título Black Marketeer y se puede repetir.",
    ["All three items can be farmed (Sleepshroom from Funguar type enemies, Treant Bulb from Sapling type enemies, and Wild Onion from Goblin Thug enemies or by gardening) or bought at the Auction House. If you buy, avoid Wild Onion, which is a hugely popular item for cooks and always expensive."] = "Los tres objetos se pueden farmear (Sleepshroom de enemigos de tipo Funguar, Treant Bulb de enemigos de tipo Sapling y Wild Onion de enemigos Goblin Thug o con jardinería) o comprar en la Auction House. Si compras, evita el Wild Onion, que es un objeto muy popular entre los cocineros y siempre es caro.",
    ["Allow each operative to detonate its charge."] = "Deja que cada operativo detone su carga.",
    ["Alternatively, buy a Carnation in Upper Jeuno for 60 gil and trade it to Moari-Kaaori after speaking with him, which skips the trip."] = "Como alternativa, compra una Carnation en Upper Jeuno por 60 gil y entrégasela a Moari-Kaaori tras hablar con él, lo que te ahorra el viaje.",
    ["Alternatively, for the fastest route, use the Unity Warp to Ro'Maeve (level 125), then zone into The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah."] = "Como alternativa, para la ruta más rápida, usa el Unity Warp a Ro'Maeve (nivel 125), luego entra en The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah.",
    ["Alternatively, trade Harith one of these Recollections, without gil, to receive an item: Recollection of Suffering gives a Hamayumi, Recollection of Anxiety gives a Stone Gorget and Recollection of Animosity gives a Dia Wand. The Recollections of Suffering and Animosity come from Notorious Monsters in Promyvion - Vahzl."] = "Como alternativa, entrega a Harith una de estas Recollections, sin gil, para recibir un objeto: Recollection of Suffering da un Hamayumi, Recollection of Anxiety da un Stone Gorget y Recollection of Animosity da una Dia Wand. Las Recollections of Suffering y Animosity vienen de Notorious Monsters de Promyvion - Vahzl.",
    ["Alternatively, use the Ark Pentasphere at La'Loff Amphitheater and defeat all five Ark Angels in the same battle."] = "Como alternativa, usa la Ark Pentasphere en el La'Loff Amphitheater y derrota a los cinco Ark Angels en la misma batalla.",
    ["Although he does not ask for help, bring him a Slime Oil to solve his problem and obtain your reward, a Scroll of Warp."] = "Aunque no pide ayuda, llévale un Slime Oil para resolver su problema y obtener tu recompensa, un Scroll of Warp.",
    ["Among the enemies are Mamool Ja Executioners and Puk Executioners."] = "Entre los enemigos hay Mamool Ja Executioners y Puk Executioners.",
    ["An Extra-Fine File drops from Fomor enemies in Lufaise Meadows: Fomor Warrior, Fomor Monk, Fomor Dark Knight, Fomor Paladin and Fomor Samurai."] = "Un Extra-Fine File lo sueltan enemigos Fomor en Lufaise Meadows: Fomor Warrior, Fomor Monk, Fomor Dark Knight, Fomor Paladin y Fomor Samurai.",
    ["An Immortals unit also joins in the recovery."] = "Una unidad de Immortals también participa en la recuperación.",
    ["An agent sent to spy on the secret training grounds of the Mamool Ja has been captured. Rescue him before he is interrogated for Imperial secrets. Mission orders: rescue the agent."] = "Un agente enviado a espiar los terrenos secretos de entrenamiento de los Mamool Ja ha sido capturado. Rescátalo antes de que lo interroguen sobre secretos Imperial. Órdenes de la misión: rescatar al agente.",
    ["An imp known as the Black Baron has hit Periqia like a meteor strike, single-handedly defeating 79 Imperial soldiers. Mission orders: eliminate the Black Baron. The recommended level is 60."] = "Un imp conocido como el Black Baron ha golpeado Periqia como un meteorito, derrotando él solo a 79 soldados Imperial. Órdenes de la misión: eliminar al Black Baron. El nivel recomendado es 60.",
    ["Ancient Papyrus drops from Lich enemies (common), or you can receive it after obtaining three Ancient papyrus shreds from ??? spots. Do not walk over the graves throughout the zone, as you may fall through them to a lower level."] = "El Ancient Papyrus lo sueltan los enemigos Lich (común), o puedes recibirlo tras obtener tres Ancient papyrus shreds de lugares ???. No camines sobre las tumbas de la zona, porque podrías caer a un nivel inferior.",
    ["Andecia, Southern San d'Oria"] = "Andecia, Southern San d'Oria",
    ["Answer \"I have no recollection at all\" to continue, then speak with Jatan-Paratan again; the quest now appears in your quest log."] = "Responde \"I have no recollection at all\" para continuar, luego habla de nuevo con Jatan-Paratan; la quest ya aparece en tu quest log.",
    ["Answer the mandragora questions: Leafed = 4, Black = 4, and Flowered = 5."] = "Responde a las preguntas sobre mandragoras: Leafed = 4, Black = 4 y Flowered = 5.",
    ["Answer the questions presented there."] = "Responde a las preguntas que se te planteen allí.",
    ["Answering all 6 questions correctly also gives you a Vile Elixir. If you already have one you cannot complete the quest: zone out, get rid of it, then come back to continue. With 4 correct answers the quest continues, but you get no Vile Elixir."] = "Responder correctamente las 6 preguntas también te da un Vile Elixir. Si ya tienes uno no puedes completar la quest: sal de la zona, deshazte de él y vuelve para continuar. Con 4 respuestas correctas la quest continúa, pero no recibes Vile Elixir.",
    ["Any Tablets of Hexes you possess are consumed upon entry and grant battle enhancements."] = "Todas las Tablets of Hexes que tengas se consumen al entrar y otorgan mejoras de combate.",
    ["Anyone seeking the Ivory Key must have a Mark of Seed."] = "Quien busque la Ivory Key debe tener una Mark of Seed.",
    ["Approach Cutter at (H-8)."] = "Acércate a Cutter en (H-8).",
    ["Approach Cutter."] = "Acércate a Cutter.",
    ["Approach Departures Entrance (F-7)."] = "Acércate a la Departures Entrance (F-7).",
    ["Approach Imperial Gate Door to enter the palace event."] = "Acércate a la Imperial Gate Door para entrar en el evento del palacio.",
    ["Approach Naja Salaheem (I-10)."] = "Acércate a Naja Salaheem (I-10).",
    ["Approach Naja Salaheem in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) for a cutscene that begins the quest. If you are repeating this quest, skip this step and go straight to the Imperial Whitegate in the next step. This quest follows Waking the Colossus."] = "Acércate a Naja Salaheem en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para una escena que empieza la quest. Si repites esta quest, salta este paso y ve directo a la Imperial Whitegate en el siguiente paso. Esta quest sigue a Waking the Colossus.",
    ["Approach Naja Salaheem in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) for a cutscene that begins the quest. Imperial researchers are uneasy about curious readings from the chamber where the iron colossus sleeps."] = "Acércate a Naja Salaheem en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para una escena que empieza la quest. Los investigadores imperiales están inquietos por unas lecturas extrañas de la cámara donde duerme el coloso de hierro.",
    ["Approach Queen Leaute's Garden for the required event."] = "Acércate a la Queen Leaute's Garden para el evento requerido.",
    ["Approach Queen Leaute's Garden for the royal sequence."] = "Acércate a la Queen Leaute's Garden para la secuencia real.",
    ["Approach the Audience Chamber in the Grand Duke's Palace."] = "Acércate a la Audience Chamber en el Grand Duke's Palace.",
    ["Approach the Cutter for a cutscene. Examine the Cutter to enter a battlefield against Yazquhl and Gowam."] = "Acércate al Cutter para una escena. Examina el Cutter para entrar en un campo de batalla contra Yazquhl y Gowam.",
    ["Approach the Ergon Locus (Torchbloom) at (J-7)/(K-7), near the Frontier Station Waypoint."] = "Acércate al Ergon Locus (Torchbloom) en (J-7)/(K-7), cerca del Frontier Station Waypoint.",
    ["Approach the Palace and Audience Chamber area around (H-7)."] = "Acércate al Palace y a la zona de la Audience Chamber cerca de (H-7).",
    ["Approach the Palace."] = "Acércate al Palace.",
    ["Arawn, Bastok Markets"] = "Arawn, Bastok Markets",
    ["Arva (Bastok Mines), Reet (Bastok Markets), Dulsie (Port Bastok)"] = "Arva (Bastok Mines), Reet (Bastok Markets), Dulsie (Port Bastok)",
    ["As a White Mage of level 50 or higher, examine the Door: Prince Regent's Rm in Chateau d'Oraguille at (H-8) to start the quest. You must be able to enter Chateau d'Oraguille."] = "Como White Mage de nivel 50 o superior, examina la Door: Prince Regent's Rm en Chateau d'Oraguille en (H-8) para empezar la quest. Debes poder entrar en Chateau d'Oraguille.",
    ["As a White Mage, level 40 or higher, speak with Narcheral upstairs in the Cathedral in Northern San d'Oria (M-6) to get the quest. You can do the rest of the quest on any job."] = "Como White Mage de nivel 40 o superior, habla con Narcheral arriba en la Cathedral de Northern San d'Oria (M-6) para obtener la quest. El resto de la quest se puede hacer con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["As a job at level 30 or higher, speak with Ratihb in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12), at the Shararat Teahouse, for a cutscene that begins the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Como un trabajo de nivel 30 o superior, habla con Ratihb en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12), en la Shararat Teahouse, para una escena que empieza la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["As soon as you enter Nashmau, a cutscene should start. If it does not, trigger it by talking to Sajhra at (H-9), in the docks. Travel back to Aht Urhgan Whitegate to speak with Iruki-Waraki once again for a cutscene if the quest asks for it."] = "En cuanto entres en Nashmau, debería empezar una escena. Si no, actívala hablando con Sajhra en (H-9), en los muelles. Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate a hablar de nuevo con Iruki-Waraki para otra escena si la quest te lo pide.",
    ["Ascend to the fourth floor of your race's tower."] = "Sube al cuarto piso de la torre de tu raza.",
    ["Ask for a divination by selecting \"Gaze away.\" and pay the 1,000 gil. He tells you that your fate lies beyond the gate of nobility. There are other cutscenes possible here, so make sure you have the quest flagged before leaving Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Pide una adivinación eligiendo \"Gaze away.\" y paga los 1,000 gil. Te dice que tu destino está más allá de la puerta de la nobleza. Aquí son posibles otras escenas, así que asegúrate de tener la quest marcada antes de salir de Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["At (H-9) in Nashmau, another cutscene takes place. Choose \"No, let's keep trying!\". If you choose the wrong answer during the cutscene, you need to wait for a new game day before repeating it."] = "En (H-9) de Nashmau tiene lugar otra escena. Elige \"No, let's keep trying!\". Si eliges la respuesta equivocada durante la escena, tendrás que esperar a un nuevo día de juego para repetirla.",
    ["At (I-9) you find two Mythril Seams. Mine the western seam to get a Sharp Stone."] = "En (I-9) encuentras dos Mythril Seams. Mina la veta occidental para obtener una Sharp Stone.",
    ["At Konschtat Highlands, examine Crag of Dem (I-7)."] = "En Konschtat Highlands, examina el Crag of Dem (I-7).",
    ["At La Theine Plateau, examine Crag of Holla (J-8)."] = "En La Theine Plateau, examina el Crag of Holla (J-8).",
    ["At Tahrongi Canyon, examine Crag of Mea (I-6)."] = "En Tahrongi Canyon, examina el Crag of Mea (I-6).",
    ["At that point trade the Pugil Scales to the tree to receive your Starfall Tear."] = "En ese momento entrega las Pugil Scales al árbol para recibir tu Starfall Tear.",
    ["At the Cloister of Flames protocrystal, defeat Ifrit Prime."] = "En el protocrystal del Cloister of Flames, derrota a Ifrit Prime.",
    ["At the Cloister of Frost protocrystal, defeat Shiva Prime."] = "En el protocrystal del Cloister of Frost, derrota a Shiva Prime.",
    ["At the Cloister of Gales protocrystal, defeat Garuda Prime."] = "En el protocrystal del Cloister of Gales, derrota a Garuda Prime.",
    ["At the Cloister of Storms protocrystal, defeat Ramuh Prime."] = "En el protocrystal del Cloister of Storms, derrota a Ramuh Prime.",
    ["At the Cloister of Tides protocrystal, defeat Leviathan Prime."] = "En el protocrystal del Cloister of Tides, derrota a Leviathan Prime.",
    ["At the Cloister of Tremors protocrystal, defeat Titan Prime."] = "En el protocrystal del Cloister of Tremors, derrota a Titan Prime.",
    ["At the Nyzul Isle staging point, examine blank target at (J-9)."] = "En el Nyzul Isle staging point, examina el blank target en (J-9).",
    ["At the end of the cutscene, trade the Dog Collar to Gudav to complete the quest and receive the Map of the Gusgen Mines."] = "Al final de la escena, entrega el Dog Collar a Gudav para completar la quest y recibir el Map of the Gusgen Mines.",
    ["At the end of the tunnel (L-9) there is a ??? you need to examine for another cutscene."] = "Al final del túnel (L-9) hay una ??? que debes examinar para otra escena.",
    ["At the staging point, speak with the Immortal beside the Runic Portal and deliver the package."] = "En el staging point, habla con el Immortal junto al Runic Portal y entrega el paquete.",
    ["At this point the quest is completed. If you trade the Lightning Band to the Leypoint in Wajaom Woodlands (G-8), it transforms into an Olduum Ring."] = "En este punto la quest está completada. Si entregas la Lightning Band al Leypoint de Wajaom Woodlands (G-8), se transforma en una Olduum Ring.",
    ["At this point you can commission Dhima Polevhia to craft three Artifact pieces."] = "En este punto puedes encargar a Dhima Polevhia que fabrique tres piezas de Artifact.",
    ["Attend the emergency convocation."] = "Asiste a la convocatoria de emergencia.",
    ["Attend the royal ceremony at the Palace."] = "Asiste a la ceremonia real en el Palace.",
    ["Attune the Geomagnetron to the required energy source."] = "Sintoniza el Geomagnetron con la fuente de energía requerida.",
    ["Avoid the ??? at (M-8), which is used for a different purpose."] = "Evita la ??? en (M-8), que se usa para otro fin.",
    ["Back inside, head west, then south until you reach (H-10). There you receive the key item Nonberry's knife."] = "Dentro de nuevo, ve al oeste y luego al sur hasta llegar a (H-10). Allí recibes el key item Nonberry's knife.",
    ["Bane is inflicted by Lost Soul enemies in The Eldieme Necropolis, and pays 1,200 gil."] = "Bane lo infligen los enemigos Lost Soul en The Eldieme Necropolis, y paga 1,200 gil.",
    ["Banishing Gate#2"] = "Banishing Gate#2",
    ["Bastok"] = "Bastok",
    ["Bastok First:"] = "Bastok First:",
    ["Bastok Path:"] = "Bastok Path:",
    ["Bastok: Bastok Mines (I-9), Bastok Markets (I-8), or Port Bastok (D-7)."] = "Bastok: Bastok Mines (I-9), Bastok Markets (I-8) o Port Bastok (D-7).",
    ["Bastok: complete Light in the Darkness and Burden of Suspicion."] = "Bastok: completa Light in the Darkness y Burden of Suspicion.",
    ["Bastok: complete Storm on the Horizon and Fire in the Hole."] = "Bastok: completa Storm on the Horizon y Fire in the Hole.",
    ["Bastok: complete Xarcabard, Land of Truths."] = "Bastok: completa Xarcabard, Land of Truths.",
    ["Bastok: speak with Adelbrecht (E-9) in Bastok Markets [S] and complete The Fighting Fourth, Better Part of Valor, and Fires of Discontent."] = "Bastok: habla con Adelbrecht (E-9) en Bastok Markets [S] y completa The Fighting Fourth, Better Part of Valor y Fires of Discontent.",
    ["Batallia Downs: Cavernous Maw (H-5)."] = "Batallia Downs: Cavernous Maw (H-5).",
    ["Be careful to do the NPC interactions above: if you skip them, you use up the Giant Shell Bug you get in the next step."] = "Ten cuidado de hacer las interacciones con NPC anteriores: si te las saltas, gastas el Giant Shell Bug que obtienes en el siguiente paso.",
    ["Beadeaux: follow the left wall to (H-7), enter Qulun Dome, open the inner door, and obtain Aurastone."] = "Beadeaux: sigue la pared izquierda hasta (H-7), entra en Qulun Dome, abre la puerta interior y obtén Aurastone.",
    ["Beadeaux: follow the left wall to the tunnel at (H-7), enter Qulun Dome, and obtain the magicite."] = "Beadeaux: sigue la pared izquierda hasta el túnel en (H-7), entra en Qulun Dome y obtén la magicite.",
    ["Before starting, check whether Kerutoto keeps asking about challenging Diabolos. If so, you must accept that quest (Waking Dreams) first; once it is in your quest log, you can start Food for Thought."] = "Antes de empezar, comprueba si Kerutoto sigue preguntando por desafiar a Diabolos. Si es así, debes aceptar primero esa quest (Waking Dreams); cuando esté en tu quest log, puedes empezar Food for Thought.",
    ["Before you go on, speak with Lokpix in Eastern Altepa Desert (G-7) and complete the quest Open Sesame."] = "Antes de continuar, habla con Lokpix en Eastern Altepa Desert (G-7) y completa la quest Open Sesame.",
    ["Begin harvesting in Wajaom Woodlands with a Sickle (you may need several) to obtain the Rainbow berry."] = "Empieza a recolectar en Wajaom Woodlands con una Sickle (puede que necesites varias) para conseguir la Rainbow berry.",
    ["Begin this quest by speaking to Waoud in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) once your Blue Mage is level 40 and you have completed Aht Urhgan Mission 2. This quest follows An Empty Vessel."] = "Empieza esta quest hablando con Waoud en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) cuando tu Blue Mage sea nivel 40 y hayas completado la Aht Urhgan Mission 2. Esta quest sigue a An Empty Vessel.",
    ["Between 18:00 and 5:00 a ??? appears near the Song Runes. Click it to spawn Marchelute."] = "Entre las 18:00 y las 5:00 aparece una ??? cerca de las Song Runes. Haz clic en ella para invocar a Marchelute.",
    ["Beware of Orcish Farkiller enemies on top of the ledge, which can aggro even at level 99, and of Pugil enemies in the river, which aggro by sound to characters near level 30."] = "Cuidado con los enemigos Orcish Farkiller en lo alto de la cornisa, que pueden atacarte incluso a nivel 99, y con los enemigos Pugil del río, que atacan por sonido a personajes cerca de nivel 30.",
    ["Black Curry can be bought at the Auction House (Food, Meals, Soups)."] = "El Black Curry se puede comprar en la Auction House (Food, Meals, Soups).",
    ["Blank Target (F-8)."] = "Blank Target (F-8).",
    ["Blank Target (H-9)."] = "Blank Target (H-9).",
    ["Blank Target (I-6)."] = "Blank Target (I-6).",
    ["Blank Target (K-6)."] = "Blank Target (K-6).",
    ["Blank Target (K-9)."] = "Blank Target (K-9).",
    ["Blank Target south of the conflux."] = "Blank Target al sur del conflux.",
    ["Blank Target."] = "Blank Target.",
    ["Board the next airship."] = "Sube a la siguiente airship.",
    ["Bomb Coal drops from Explosure enemies, or you can receive it after obtaining three Bomb coal fragments from ??? spots."] = "La Bomb Coal la sueltan los enemigos Explosure, o puedes recibirla tras obtener tres Bomb coal fragments de lugares ???.",
    ["Both players must speak to Halver, and each one receives the same cutscene. The player who started the quest gains the title Royal Wedding Planner as well as Castor's Ring. The player who matches the description gains the title Consort Candidate and Pollux's Ring."] = "Ambos jugadores deben hablar con Halver, y cada uno recibe la misma escena. El jugador que empezó la quest obtiene el título Royal Wedding Planner además de Castor's Ring. El jugador que coincide con la descripción obtiene el título Consort Candidate y Pollux's Ring.",
    ["Break the latent on the Bow of Trials before completing the rest of the quest. The latent is active while you have fewer than 300 Skillchain points accumulated; you know you have enough when it breaks and the weapon's elemental resistances disappear from your active resistances."] = "Rompe el latent del Bow of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest. El latent está activo mientras tengas menos de 300 puntos de Skillchain acumulados; sabes que tienes suficientes cuando se rompe y las resistencias elementales del arma desaparecen de tus resistencias activas.",
    ["Break the latent on the Club of Trials before doing the rest of the quest. Each skillchain gives trial points: 5 with no skillchain, 7 at level 1, 9 at level 2 and 11 at level 3."] = "Rompe el latent del Club of Trials antes de hacer el resto de la quest. Cada skillchain da trial points: 5 sin skillchain, 7 en nivel 1, 9 en nivel 2 y 11 en nivel 3.",
    ["Break the latent on the Pole of Trials. With it equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains until you accumulate 300 Trial Points: 5 points with no skillchain, 7 at level 1, 9 at level 2 and 11 at level 3."] = "Rompe el latent de la Pole of Trials. Con ella equipada en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas hasta acumular 300 Trial Points: 5 puntos sin skillchain, 7 en nivel 1, 9 en nivel 2 y 11 en nivel 3.",
    ["Break the latent on the Spear of Trials before doing the rest of the quest. Each skillchain gives points: 5 with no skillchain, 7 at level 1, 9 at level 2 and 11 at level 3."] = "Rompe el latent de la Spear of Trials antes de hacer el resto de la quest. Cada skillchain da puntos: 5 sin skillchain, 7 en nivel 1, 9 en nivel 2 y 11 en nivel 3.",
    ["Bring Baren-Moren Dhalmel Hide x4 so he can repair the cap."] = "Llévale a Baren-Moren Dhalmel Hide x4 para que repare la gorra.",
    ["Bring Brygid what she requests to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Llévale a Brygid lo que te pide para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Bring Calovour a Mistletoe to complete the quest."] = "Llévale a Calovour un Mistletoe para completar la quest.",
    ["Bring Magephaud the 3 gold beastcoins. You receive the permanent key item Tonberry key (Zilart)."] = "Tráele a Magephaud las 3 gold beastcoins. Recibes el key item permanente Tonberry key (Zilart).",
    ["Bring Shamarhaan down to -20% HP and you should win the battle. The quest does not need to be completed for the level limit increase if you have already completed New Worlds Await or better."] = "Baja a Shamarhaan a -20% de HP y deberías ganar la batalla. No hace falta completar la quest para el aumento del límite de nivel si ya has completado New Worlds Await o superior.",
    ["Bring him either 4 Eastern Pottery, 4 Northern Fur or 4 Southern Mummy to complete the quest. Eastern Pottery x4 pays 2,000 gil and drops from Clockwork Pods in Garlaige Citadel or Fei'Yin."] = "Tráele 4 Eastern Pottery, 4 Northern Fur o 4 Southern Mummy para completar la quest. Eastern Pottery x4 paga 2,000 gil y lo sueltan los Clockwork Pods de Garlaige Citadel o Fei'Yin.",
    ["Bring the Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls to Gentle Tiger (H-6) to obtain Trust: Klara."] = "Lleva el Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls a Gentle Tiger (H-6) para obtener Trust: Klara.",
    ["Bring the Gusgen Clay to Nereus for your reward, 2,160 gil. You can repeat the quest."] = "Lleva el Gusgen Clay a Nereus por tu recompensa, 2,160 gil. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Bring the Star Spinel to Honoi-Gomoi, who gives you the Star Necklace after a cutscene."] = "Lleva el Star Spinel a Honoi-Gomoi, que te da el Star Necklace tras una escena.",
    ["Bring the Twinstone Earring back to Gioh Ajihri to receive your reward."] = "Lleva el Twinstone Earring a Gioh Ajihri para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Bring the Weapons order to Alexius in Jugner Forest (I-6), near the lake; you receive the key item Weapons receipt."] = "Lleva el Weapons order a Alexius en Jugner Forest (I-6), cerca del lago; recibes el key item Weapons receipt.",
    ["Bring the dish back to Take for your reward, the Tableware Set, and the title Three-Star Purveyor."] = "Lleva el plato a Take por tu recompensa, el Tableware Set, y el título Three-Star Purveyor.",
    ["Bring the item she asks for: Bronze Harness (Warrior, Paladin, Dark Knight, Dragoon, Corsair), Robe (Monk, Bard, Blue Mage), Leather Vest (Thief, Beastmaster, Ranger, Dancer), Tunic (White Mage, Red Mage, Black Mage, Summoner, Puppetmaster) or Kenpogi (Ninja, Samurai). The +1 versions do not work."] = "Trae el objeto que pide: Bronze Harness (Warrior, Paladin, Dark Knight, Dragoon, Corsair), Robe (Monk, Bard, Blue Mage), Leather Vest (Thief, Beastmaster, Ranger, Dancer), Tunic (White Mage, Red Mage, Black Mage, Summoner, Puppetmaster) o Kenpogi (Ninja, Samurai). Las versiones +1 no sirven.",
    ["Bring the ring back to Oswald for your reward, the Amber Earring."] = "Devuelve el anillo a Oswald por tu recompensa, el Amber Earring.",
    ["Brygid asks for armor pieces from a list of ordinary body and leg armors, for example Banded Mail, Bishop's Robe, Pyro Robe or Silver Mail."] = "Brygid pide piezas de armadura de una lista de armaduras corrientes de cuerpo y piernas, por ejemplo Banded Mail, Bishop's Robe, Pyro Robe o Silver Mail.",
    ["Buburimu Peninsula, near the port of Mhaura, reached through Tahrongi Canyon."] = "Buburimu Peninsula, cerca del puerto de Mhaura, a la que se llega por Tahrongi Canyon.",
    ["Buy a Cupboard from the furniture shop in Northern San d'Oria (F-8) and put it in your Mog House."] = "Compra un Cupboard en la tienda de muebles de Northern San d'Oria (F-8) y colócalo en tu Mog House.",
    ["Buy as many sheep as you can from the markets in Leujaoam. Read all the information given in the assault carefully before you begin."] = "Compra todas las ovejas que puedas en los mercados de Leujaoam. Lee con atención toda la información del assault antes de empezar.",
    ["By completing this quest ten times, the fourth segment of the airship name is unlocked, and it can then be changed from the default, C.I.D."] = "Al completar esta quest diez veces, se desbloquea el cuarto segmento del nombre de la airship, y entonces se puede cambiar del valor por defecto, C.I.D.",
    ["Cait Sith Aon: use the tower around (H-8)."] = "Cait Sith Aon: usa la torre cerca de (H-8).",
    ["Cait Sith Ceithir: use the tower around (G-9)."] = "Cait Sith Ceithir: usa la torre cerca de (G-9).",
    ["Cait Sith Tri: use the tower around (F-7)."] = "Cait Sith Tri: usa la torre cerca de (F-7).",
    ["Castle Oztroja: enter through the Brass Door at (I-8), proceed through the upper floors, light the torch at (H-9), then reach the Altar Room and obtain the magicite."] = "Castle Oztroja: entra por la Brass Door en (I-8), avanza por los pisos superiores, enciende la antorcha en (H-9), llega a la Altar Room y obtén la magicite.",
    ["Castle Oztroja: follow the right wall to the Brass Door at (H-9), light the torch, continue south, turn right to the next Brass Door, and enter the Altar Room to obtain Orastone."] = "Castle Oztroja: sigue la pared derecha hasta la Brass Door en (H-9), enciende la antorcha, continúa al sur, gira a la derecha hasta la siguiente Brass Door y entra en la Altar Room para obtener Orastone.",
    ["Catoblepas/1st tier Hobgoblin"] = "Catoblepas/Hobgoblin de 1.er nivel",
    ["Catoblepas/2nd tier Hobgoblin"] = "Catoblepas/Hobgoblin de 2.º nivel",
    ["Chamama does not always accept the stone: if she refuses it, get another Smooth Stone and bring it to her. It can be rejected several times in a row."] = "Chamama no siempre acepta la piedra: si la rechaza, consigue otra Smooth Stone y llévasela. Puede rechazarla varias veces seguidas.",
    ["Change areas after completing the previous mission."] = "Cambia de zona tras completar la misión anterior.",
    ["Change the water at a tombstone in King Ranperre's Tomb (needs fame level 1)"] = "Cambia el agua de una lápida en King Ranperre's Tomb (requiere nivel de fama 1)",
    ["Change to BLM, RDM, SMN, or BLU and activate Astral Flow, Chainspell, Azure Lore, or Manafont."] = "Cambia a BLM, RDM, SMN o BLU y activa Astral Flow, Chainspell, Azure Lore o Manafont.",
    ["Change your main job to Ninja (level 20 or above) and speak with Romualdo at (K-9), in the southern Cannonry in Metalworks, to begin the quest. You need Norg fame level 4 and to have completed Ayame and Kaede."] = "Cambia tu trabajo principal a Ninja (nivel 20 o superior) y habla con Romualdo en (K-9), en el Cannonry sur de Metalworks, para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Norg y haber completado Ayame and Kaede.",
    ["Change zones and return to Kipopo to receive the Repaired Handbag."] = "Cambia de zona y vuelve con Kipopo para recibir el Repaired Handbag.",
    ["Change zones and return to Thierride (F-8) to receive the Angler's Cassoulet reward."] = "Cambia de zona y vuelve con Thierride (F-8) para recibir la recompensa Angler's Cassoulet.",
    ["Change zones and speak with Scarred Shark (G-5) again to receive the Trainee Hammer."] = "Cambia de zona y habla de nuevo con Scarred Shark (G-5) para recibir el Trainee Hammer.",
    ["Check ??? (F-11)."] = "Revisa la ??? (F-11).",
    ["Check ??? (F-5)."] = "Revisa la ??? (F-5).",
    ["Check ??? (G-11)."] = "Revisa la ??? (G-11).",
    ["Check ??? (G-5)."] = "Revisa la ??? (G-5).",
    ["Check ??? (H-11)."] = "Revisa la ??? (H-11).",
    ["Check ??? (H-5)."] = "Revisa la ??? (H-5).",
    ["Check Door: Acolyte Hostel (K-5) in Windurst Waters (S)."] = "Revisa la Door: Acolyte Hostel (K-5) en Windurst Waters (S).",
    ["Check monsters, stay at camp, and ask before pulling extra monsters."] = "Revisa los monstruos, quédate en el campamento y pregunta antes de traer monstruos de más.",
    ["Check the ??? again after defeating Plague Chigoe to complete the quest and receive the Map of Caedarva Mire."] = "Revisa de nuevo la ??? tras derrotar a Plague Chigoe para completar la quest y recibir el Map of Caedarva Mire.",
    ["Check the ??? among the grass at (I-8) for a cutscene. Plague Chigoe appears when the cutscene ends."] = "Revisa la ??? entre la hierba en (I-8) para una escena. Plague Chigoe aparece cuando termina la escena.",
    ["Check the ???."] = "Revisa la ???.",
    ["Check the Blank Target in that room to receive the key item Old ring."] = "Revisa el Blank Target de esa sala para recibir el key item Old ring.",
    ["Check the Bulwark Gate repeatedly until the \"door is firmly sealed\" message appears at least three times."] = "Revisa la Bulwark Gate repetidamente hasta que aparezca el mensaje \"door is firmly sealed\" al menos tres veces.",
    ["Check the Door: Acolyte Hostel (K-5)."] = "Revisa la Door: Acolyte Hostel (K-5).",
    ["Check the acidity tester to confirm that it has changed to the Red acidity tester."] = "Comprueba el acidity tester para confirmar que se ha convertido en el Red acidity tester.",
    ["Check the mission orders shown when you enter the assault, as they describe the objective."] = "Revisa las órdenes de la misión que se muestran al entrar en el assault, porque describen el objetivo.",
    ["Check the objective of the operation in your mission menu once you have signed up."] = "Consulta el objetivo de la operación en tu menú de misiones cuando te hayas apuntado.",
    ["Chocobo digging, once you can ride. Dig fatigue is shared across your whole account."] = "Excavación con chocobo, cuando ya puedas montar. La fatiga de excavación se comparte en toda tu cuenta.",
    ["Chocobos"] = "Chocobos",
    ["Choose Aphmau when prompted."] = "Elige Aphmau cuando se te pida.",
    ["Choose a nation and enlist with its Allied forces."] = "Elige una nación y alístate en sus fuerzas Allied.",
    ["Choose a reward, then trade the appropriate base item and chip to Yurim. Be careful: you cannot cancel the quest after making your decision. You can repeat the quest."] = "Elige una recompensa y luego entrega a Yurim el objeto base y el chip correspondientes. Ojo: no puedes cancelar la quest después de decidir. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Choose a type from the list and you are given three of that choice, which completes the quest."] = "Elige un tipo de la lista y te dan tres de esa elección, lo que completa la quest.",
    ["Choose one of the NPC outfits Brygid offers for the fashion show."] = "Elige uno de los atuendos de NPC que ofrece Brygid para el desfile de moda.",
    ["Choose one of the available rings after the battle."] = "Elige uno de los anillos disponibles tras la batalla.",
    ["Choose one of the three rings: Balrahn's Ring, Jalzahn's Ring, or Ulthalam's Ring."] = "Elige uno de los tres anillos: Balrahn's Ring, Jalzahn's Ring o Ulthalam's Ring.",
    ["Choose one training focus for Iroha: Strength, Endurance, or Style."] = "Elige un enfoque de entrenamiento para Iroha: Strength, Endurance o Style.",
    ["Choose one: Blitzer Poleyn, Desultor Tassets, or Tatsumaki Sitagoromo."] = "Elige una: Blitzer Poleyn, Desultor Tassets o Tatsumaki Sitagoromo.",
    ["Choose one: Champion's Galea, Anwig Salade, or Selenian Cap."] = "Elige una: Champion's Galea, Anwig Salade o Selenian Cap.",
    ["Choose the Qufim Island response to continue."] = "Elige la respuesta de Qufim Island para continuar.",
    ["Choose the affirmative response when asked for assistance."] = "Elige la respuesta afirmativa cuando te pidan ayuda.",
    ["Choose the dialogue option concerning Altana's help when prompted."] = "Elige la opción de diálogo sobre la ayuda de Altana cuando se te pida.",
    ["Choose the first dialogue option."] = "Elige la primera opción de diálogo.",
    ["Choose the second dialogue option."] = "Elige la segunda opción de diálogo.",
    ["Choose to begin the Seekers of Adoulin storyline."] = "Elige comenzar la historia de Seekers of Adoulin.",
    ["Choose to proceed."] = "Elige continuar.",
    ["Choose whether to visit Bastok or Windurst first. The two paths can be completed in either order."] = "Elige si visitas primero Bastok o Windurst. Los dos caminos se pueden completar en cualquier orden.",
    ["Choose whether to visit San d'Oria or Windurst first."] = "Elige si visitas primero San d'Oria o Windurst.",
    ["Choose your ring reward."] = "Elige tu recompensa de anillo.",
    ["Choosing a nation"] = "Elegir una nación",
    ["Clear the area and examine the ??? once ready. Two Tsuchigumo NMs spawn. Both NM corpses must disappear before you can obtain the Trick box."] = "Despeja la zona y examina la ??? cuando estés listo. Aparecen dos NMs Tsuchigumo. Los cadáveres de ambos NM deben desaparecer antes de que puedas obtener el Trick box.",
    ["Clear the nearby enemies and examine the correct ??? to face two Mokkurkalfi."] = "Elimina a los enemigos cercanos y examina la ??? correcta para enfrentarte a dos Mokkurkalfi.",
    ["Click again to enter the battlefield Moment of Truth. Protect Blacktattoo Vedool Ja (BLM), Shadowhand Kajeel Ja (NIN) and Whitetattoo Rahool Ja (WHM), who must not die."] = "Haz clic de nuevo para entrar en el campo de batalla Moment of Truth. Protege a Blacktattoo Vedool Ja (BLM), Shadowhand Kajeel Ja (NIN) y Whitetattoo Rahool Ja (WHM), que no deben morir.",
    ["Click on the ??? around the enemy stronghold. You receive a Commencing intel extraction message, then repeated Gathering intel messages, until you receive Investigation complete!"] = "Haz clic en la ??? que hay alrededor de la fortaleza enemiga. Recibes el mensaje Commencing intel extraction y después mensajes Gathering intel repetidos, hasta que recibes Investigation complete!",
    ["Click on the Withered Petals at (L-6), in the southeast portion near the coastal cliffs, between 18:00 and 06:00."] = "Haz clic en los Withered Petals en (L-6), en la parte sureste cerca de los acantilados de la costa, entre las 18:00 y las 06:00.",
    ["Click the ??? at (F-5) between 18:00 and 4:00 to spawn two NMs, Giollemitte B Feroun and Skeleton Esquire. Both must be defeated to proceed."] = "Haz clic en la ??? en (F-5) entre las 18:00 y las 4:00 para invocar a dos NMs, Giollemitte B Feroun y Skeleton Esquire. Hay que derrotar a ambos para continuar.",
    ["Click the ??? at the top of the platform to spawn Splinterspine Grukjuk, a Ranger Orc NM, and defeat it."] = "Haz clic en la ??? de lo alto de la plataforma para invocar a Splinterspine Grukjuk, un NM Orc Ranger, y derrótalo.",
    ["Click the ??? to spawn the NMs Lamia No. 27 and Moshdahn."] = "Haz clic en la ??? para invocar a los NMs Lamia No. 27 y Moshdahn.",
    ["Click the ???; the incense always fails to light. If others are also doing the quest, the ??? remains after you click it."] = "Haz clic en la ???; el incienso siempre falla al encenderse. Si otros también hacen la quest, la ??? permanece tras hacer clic.",
    ["Click the green Unstable Displacement again to enter the battlefield Storms of Fate against Bahamut."] = "Haz clic de nuevo en el Unstable Displacement verde para entrar en el campo de batalla Storms of Fate contra Bahamut.",
    ["Climb Parradamo Tor and reach the Cradle of Rebirth within 12 Vana'diel hours and 30 Vana'diel minutes. Obtain the Mimeo Feather, Second Mimeo Feather, and Third Mimeo Feather."] = "Sube a Parradamo Tor y llega a la Cradle of Rebirth en un máximo de 12 horas y 30 minutos de Vana'diel. Obtén la Mimeo Feather, la Second Mimeo Feather y la Third Mimeo Feather.",
    ["Climb the ladder and enter the upper room."] = "Sube la escalera y entra en la sala superior.",
    ["Collect Bomb Arm x2, a Revival Tree Root and Hiwon's Hair. Bomb Arm can be bought from Nogga on the top floor of Metalworks (G-7) for 690 gil when Bastok is at least 2nd place in Conquest."] = "Reúne Bomb Arm x2, una Revival Tree Root y Hiwon's Hair. La Bomb Arm se puede comprar a Nogga en el piso superior de Metalworks (G-7) por 690 gil cuando Bastok está al menos en 2nd lugar en Conquest.",
    ["Collect Giant Bird Feather x3, which drop from Tabar Beak and Axe Beak enemies in the Meriphataud Mountains and Sauromugue Champaign."] = "Reúne Giant Bird Feather x3, que sueltan enemigos Tabar Beak y Axe Beak en Meriphataud Mountains y Sauromugue Champaign.",
    ["Collect Muddy Bar Tab, which drops from Savanna Rarab in East Sarutabaruta."] = "Reúne Muddy Bar Tab, que cae de Savanna Rarab en East Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Collect Odd Postcard and Damp Envelope, which drop from Canyon Rarab in Tahrongi Canyon."] = "Reúne Odd Postcard y Damp Envelope, que caen de Canyon Rarab en Tahrongi Canyon.",
    ["Collect Seed Afterglow (F-10)."] = "Reúne el Seed Afterglow (F-10).",
    ["Collect Seed Afterglow (F-8)."] = "Reúne el Seed Afterglow (F-8).",
    ["Collect Seed Afterglow (G-7)."] = "Reúne el Seed Afterglow (G-7).",
    ["Collect Seed Afterglow (G-8)."] = "Reúne el Seed Afterglow (G-8).",
    ["Collect Seed Afterglow (H-10)."] = "Reúne el Seed Afterglow (H-10).",
    ["Collect Seed Afterglow (H-7)."] = "Reúne el Seed Afterglow (H-7).",
    ["Collect Seed Afterglow (H-9)."] = "Reúne el Seed Afterglow (H-9).",
    ["Collect Seed Afterglow (I-8)."] = "Reúne el Seed Afterglow (I-8).",
    ["Collect Seed Afterglow (I-9)."] = "Reúne el Seed Afterglow (I-9).",
    ["Collect Seed Afterglow (J-10)."] = "Reúne el Seed Afterglow (J-10).",
    ["Collect Seedspall Astrum from Yagudos in Meriphataud Mountains around (K-8)."] = "Reúne Seedspall Astrum de los Yagudos de Meriphataud Mountains, cerca de (K-8).",
    ["Collect Seedspall Luna from Quadavs in Pashhow Marshlands around (K-10)."] = "Reúne Seedspall Luna de los Quadavs de Pashhow Marshlands, cerca de (K-10).",
    ["Collect Seedspall Lux from Orcs in Jugner Forest around (G-11)."] = "Reúne Seedspall Lux de los Orcs de Jugner Forest, cerca de (G-11).",
    ["Collect Torn Epistle, which drops from Savanna Rarab in West Sarutabaruta."] = "Reúne Torn Epistle, que cae de Savanna Rarab en West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Collect Zeruhn Soot x3, either by defeating the monsters in Zeruhn Mines or by buying it at the Auction House."] = "Reúne Zeruhn Soot x3, derrotando a los monstruos de Zeruhn Mines o comprándola en la Auction House.",
    ["Collect all 12 stone key items, then examine Seed Fragment to receive the Omnis Stone."] = "Reúne los 12 key items de piedra y luego examina el Seed Fragment para recibir la Omnis Stone.",
    ["Collect an Eschan Droplet at each required location and use the corresponding Eschan Portal to reach the next area."] = "Reúne una Eschan Droplet en cada ubicación requerida y usa el Eschan Portal correspondiente para llegar a la siguiente zona.",
    ["Collect at least one elemental Sap Key Item."] = "Reúne al menos un Sap Key Item elemental.",
    ["Collect news scoops from reporters across Windurst"] = "Reúne noticias exclusivas de los reporteros de Windurst",
    ["Collect stamps from seven NPCs around Bastok"] = "Reúne sellos de siete NPCs por Bastok",
    ["Collect the 7 letters in total. The source I found does not say who gives the first D."] = "Reúne las 7 letras en total. La fuente que encontré no dice quién da la primera D.",
    ["Collect the four psyche fragments from the four Twinkling Presence targets."] = "Reúne los cuatro fragmentos de psique de los cuatro objetivos Twinkling Presence.",
    ["Collect the letters from NPCs in Aht Urhgan Whitegate: Qutiba (K-12) gives an A, Zabahf (F-8) gives the T, Mathlouq (F-5) gives the U, Mhasbaf (J-8) gives the M, Balakaf (I-5) gives a D, and Ekhu Pesshyadha (H-6) gives the second A. You may need to speak to Ekhu Pesshyadha twice if you have logged The Die Is Cast."] = "Reúne las letras de los NPCs de Aht Urhgan Whitegate: Qutiba (K-12) da una A, Zabahf (F-8) da la T, Mathlouq (F-5) da la U, Mhasbaf (J-8) da la M, Balakaf (I-5) da una D y Ekhu Pesshyadha (H-6) da la segunda A. Puede que tengas que hablar dos veces con Ekhu Pesshyadha si has registrado The Die Is Cast.",
    ["Collect the nine Seed Afterglows in Fei'Yin:"] = "Reúne los nueve Seed Afterglows de Fei'Yin:",
    ["Collect the remaining dawndrops:"] = "Reúne las dawndrops restantes:",
    ["Collect the required grafting materials."] = "Reúne los materiales de injerto necesarios.",
    ["Collect the required signatures from NPCs throughout Southern San d'Oria [S]."] = "Reúne las firmas requeridas de los NPCs de todo Southern San d'Oria [S].",
    ["Collect the six Luminous Fragments by defeating the required Notorious Monsters."] = "Reúne los seis Luminous Fragments derrotando a los Notorious Monsters requeridos.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Chief Sergeant. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. You also need 3 Imperial Gold Pieces and 6 Imperial Mythril Pieces. You have enrolled in the Salaheem Officer Academy to earn your position in the upper ranks of Salaheem's Sentinels."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Chief Sergeant. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. También necesitas 3 Imperial Gold Pieces y 6 Imperial Mythril Pieces. Te has matriculado en la Salaheem Officer Academy para ganarte tu puesto en los rangos altos de Salaheem's Sentinels.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Corporal. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. The perfumier Liliroon has come to Salaheem's Sentinels in search of help, believing it to be a famous detective agency, and President Naja wants you to help collect her reward."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Corporal. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. La perfumista Liliroon ha venido a Salaheem's Sentinels en busca de ayuda, creyendo que es una famosa agencia de detectives, y President Naja quiere que ayudes a cobrar su recompensa.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Lance Corporal. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. To track the movements of the Dark Rider, you are given a quartz transmitter to place in his warhorse's hoofprint."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Lance Corporal. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Para seguir los movimientos del Dark Rider, te dan un quartz transmitter para colocarlo en la huella del caballo de guerra.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Private First Class. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. Your task is to find hard evidence that the Dark Rider has truly appeared out of legend and is terrorizing the Empire."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Private First Class. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Tu tarea es encontrar pruebas firmes de que el Dark Rider ha salido realmente de la leyenda y aterroriza al Empire.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Private Second Class. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. President Naja wants you to bring her an Imp Wing."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Private Second Class. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. President Naja quiere que le traigas un Imp Wing.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Second Lieutenant. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1, the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack and 5 Imperial Gold Pieces. Your final term at the Salaheem Officer Academy has begun."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Second Lieutenant. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan, el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan y 5 Imperial Gold Pieces. Ha empezado tu último trimestre en la Salaheem Officer Academy.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Sergeant Major (5 points for a previously unbeaten Assault, 1 point for one already beaten). You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. Abquhbah asks you to visit the weapon shop in his stead; his heavy sighs have you slightly worried."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Sergeant Major (5 puntos por un Assault no superado antes, 1 punto por uno ya superado). Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Abquhbah te pide que visites la tienda de armas en su lugar; sus pesados suspiros te preocupan un poco.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Sergeant. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. You must fulfill your duty as a sergeant by training your subordinates into proper mercenaries. Head to Salaheem's Sentinels in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) for a cutscene with Naja Salaheem."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Sergeant. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Debes cumplir tu deber de sargento formando a tus subordinados como verdaderos mercenarios. Ve a Salaheem's Sentinels en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para una escena con Naja Salaheem.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Superior Private (5 points for a previously unbeaten Assault, 1 point for one already beaten). You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. Falzum, your fellow mercenary, has been given the task of creating a batch of mythralline liquid, and as his superior it is your job to teach him how a mercenary carries out his duty. Speak with Abquhbah in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) for a cutscene that starts the quest."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Superior Private (5 puntos por un Assault no superado antes, 1 punto por uno ya superado). Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Falzum, tu compañero mercenario, tiene la tarea de crear un lote de mythralline liquid, y como su superior te toca enseñarle cómo cumple su deber un mercenario. Habla con Abquhbah en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para una escena que empieza la quest.",
    ["Complete Brygid the Stylist first. Then speak with Brygid in Bastok Markets (K-9), on any job, while wearing any 1 to 5 pieces of Artifact Armor to begin the quest."] = "Completa primero Brygid the Stylist. Luego habla con Brygid en Bastok Markets (K-9), con cualquier trabajo, llevando de 1 a 5 piezas de Artifact Armor para empezar la quest.",
    ["Complete Chains of Promathia through The Road Forks."] = "Completa Chains of Promathia hasta The Road Forks.",
    ["Complete Hat in Hand first, then zone before taking this quest."] = "Completa primero Hat in Hand y luego cambia de zona antes de aceptar esta quest.",
    ["Complete Her Memories: Homecoming Queen to obtain the first Large Memory Fragment."] = "Completa Her Memories: Homecoming Queen para obtener el primer Large Memory Fragment.",
    ["Complete Her Memories: Of Malign Maladies to obtain the second Large Memory Fragment."] = "Completa Her Memories: Of Malign Maladies para obtener el segundo Large Memory Fragment.",
    ["Complete Her Memories: Old Bean, Her Memories: The Faux Pas, and Her Memories: Grave Resolve."] = "Completa Her Memories: Old Bean, Her Memories: The Faux Pas y Her Memories: Grave Resolve.",
    ["Complete Her Memories: Operation Cupid to obtain the third Large Memory Fragment."] = "Completa Her Memories: Operation Cupid para obtener el tercer Large Memory Fragment.",
    ["Complete Promyvion-Dem, Promyvion-Mea, and Promyvion-Holla."] = "Completa Promyvion-Dem, Promyvion-Mea y Promyvion-Holla.",
    ["Complete Rosulatia's event."] = "Completa el evento de Rosulatia.",
    ["Complete Seekers of Adoulin through An Aimless Journey."] = "Completa Seekers of Adoulin hasta An Aimless Journey.",
    ["Complete Seekers of Adoulin through Meeting of the Minds."] = "Completa Seekers of Adoulin hasta Meeting of the Minds.",
    ["Complete The Geomagnetron."] = "Completa The Geomagnetron.",
