    ["Defeat Garuda Prime to complete the quest. Clarsach Call is wind-elemental and gets absorbed, so do not use it."] = "Derrota a Garuda Prime para completar la quest. Clarsach Call es de elemento viento y se absorbe, así que no la uses.",
