    ["Defeat the humanoid opponent."] = "Derrota al oponente humanoide.",
    ["Defeat the monster that appears to obtain a Tavnazian Mask. If more than one character is doing this quest, you will have to wait a few minutes before popping it again."] = "Derrota al monstruo que aparece para obtener una Tavnazian Mask. Si más de un personaje hace esta quest, tendrás que esperar unos minutos antes de volver a invocarlo.",
