    ["Defeat the required enemy."] = "Derrota al enemigo requerido.",
    ["Defeat the required number of monsters with the Chaosbringer. If you need to reobtain it, return to Palborough Mines and ride the boat back to Zeruhn Mines; your kill count is reset to zero."] = "Derrota el número requerido de monstruos con el Chaosbringer. Si necesitas volver a obtenerlo, vuelve a Palborough Mines y toma el barco de vuelta a Zeruhn Mines; tu contador de muertes se reinicia a cero.",
    ["Defeat the six avatar primes to collect their whispers. Do not give the whispers to the NPCs who grant access to those battles, or you will lose them."] = "Derrota a los seis avatar primes para reunir sus whispers. No entregues los whispers a los NPCs que dan acceso a esas batallas, o los perderás.",
    ["Defeat the spawned Magma to obtain a Frag Rock."] = "Derrota al Magma invocado para obtener una Frag Rock.",
