    ["Deliver it to Arciela."] = "Entrégaselo a Arciela.",
    ["Deliver it to Orn at (F-10), in the Rarab Tail Hostelry room above the Timbre Timbers Tavern."] = "Entrégaselo a Orn en (F-10), en la habitación del Rarab Tail Hostelry sobre la Timbre Timbers Tavern.",
    ["Deliver the Auction Parcel to Apstaule, who is upstairs (H-10)."] = "Entrega el Auction Parcel a Apstaule, que está arriba (H-10).",
