    ["Deliver them to the requested NPC."] = "Entrégaselos al NPC indicado.",
    ["Depending on your character's progress, you may get the Savage Blade quest and The General's Secret first."] = "Según el progreso de tu personaje, puede que obtengas primero la quest Savage Blade y The General's Secret.",
    ["Determine the correct herb color from the current time: Red/Sandy 00:00-07:59, Blue/Bastok 08:00-15:59, Green/Windurst 16:00-23:59."] = "Determina el color correcto de la hierba según la hora actual: Red/Sandy 00:00-07:59, Blue/Bastok 08:00-15:59, Green/Windurst 16:00-23:59.",
    ["Do not use the northern Ergon Locus ???; it is not the correct target."] = "No uses el Ergon Locus ??? del norte; no es el objetivo correcto.",
