    ["Examine the Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7) again to unlock Trust: Trion."] = "Examina de nuevo la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7) para desbloquear Trust: Trion.",
    ["Examine the Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7)."] = "Examina la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7).",
    ["Examine the Quadav Inquest again to face Do'Bho Venomtail, Old Quadav, Brass Quadav, and Copper Quadav."] = "Examina de nuevo el Quadav Inquest para enfrentarte a Do'Bho Venomtail, Old Quadav, Brass Quadav y Copper Quadav.",
    ["Examine the Rally Point."] = "Examina el Rally Point.",
    ["Examine the Regal Pawprints again to enter the Everbloom Hollow battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo las Regal Pawprints para entrar en el campo de batalla Everbloom Hollow.",
    ["Examine the Reinforced Gateway."] = "Examina el Reinforced Gateway.",
    ["Examine the Rubious Crystal again."] = "Examina de nuevo el Rubious Crystal.",
    ["Examine the Rune of Release before the time limit runs out, or the mission fails even if all the objectives were met. Then speak with Rytaal in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10) to finalize the mission and hand back the Assault Orders."] = "Examina la Rune of Release antes de que se acabe el tiempo, o la misión falla aunque se hayan cumplido todos los objetivos. Después habla con Rytaal en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10) para cerrar la misión y devolver las Assault Orders.",
    ["Examine the Sarcophagus at (I-9) to obtain the right map piece."] = "Examina el Sarcophagus en (I-9) para obtener la pieza de mapa derecha.",
    ["Examine the Savage Scars again to face Arisen Soulflayer and the Descended Winebibbers."] = "Examina de nuevo las Savage Scars para enfrentarte a Arisen Soulflayer y a los Descended Winebibbers.",
    ["Examine the Savage Scars again to face the Returned Soulflayer."] = "Examina de nuevo las Savage Scars para enfrentarte al Returned Soulflayer.",
    ["Examine the Shaft Entrance again to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo la Shaft Entrance para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine the Shattered Telepoint."] = "Examina el Shattered Telepoint.",
    ["Examine the Spatial Displacement around (D-6)."] = "Examina el Spatial Displacement cerca de (D-6).",
    ["Examine the Spatial Displacement to enter the Ouryu battlefield."] = "Examina el Spatial Displacement para entrar en el campo de batalla Ouryu.",
    ["Examine the Stalagmite again to begin the battle against Gloom Phantom, Dazbog, and Magh Bihu."] = "Examina de nuevo la Stalagmite para comenzar la batalla contra Gloom Phantom, Dazbog y Magh Bihu.",
    ["Examine the Stone Door to enter Promyvion-Vahzl."] = "Examina la Stone Door para entrar en Promyvion-Vahzl.",
    ["Examine the Stone Door to face Nunyunuwi."] = "Examina la Stone Door para enfrentarte a Nunyunuwi.",
    ["Examine the Test of Talents again to enter the solo battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo el Test of Talents para entrar en el campo de batalla en solitario.",
    ["Examine the Throne Room door again to enter battle and defeat the humanoid opponent with Zeid assisting."] = "Examina de nuevo la Throne Room door para entrar en la batalla y derrota al oponente humanoide con la ayuda de Zeid.",
    ["Examine the Throne Room door to enter the battlefield against Aquila and Haudrale."] = "Examina la Throne Room door para entrar en el campo de batalla contra Aquila y Haudrale.",
    ["Examine the Tiger Bones in the cave to spawn the Old Sabertooth, and watch it die naturally, which takes about three Earth minutes."] = "Examina los Tiger Bones de la cueva para invocar al Old Sabertooth, y mira cómo muere de forma natural, lo que tarda unos tres minutos terrestres.",
    ["Examine the Tome of Magic at the mission location."] = "Examina el Tome of Magic en la ubicación de la misión.",
    ["Examine the Transcendental Radiance again to enter the Dawn battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo la Transcendental Radiance para entrar en el campo de batalla Dawn.",
    ["Examine the Treasure Coffer at (J-8)."] = "Examina el Treasure Coffer en (J-8).",
    ["Examine the Valhallan Rift again to enter The Voracious Beast battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo la Valhallan Rift para entrar en el campo de batalla The Voracious Beast.",
    ["Examine the Valhallan Rift again to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo la Valhallan Rift para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine the Veridical Conflux again."] = "Examina de nuevo el Veridical Conflux.",
    ["Examine the Vexing Sniffles again after the battle."] = "Examina de nuevo las Vexing Sniffles tras la batalla.",
    ["Examine the Vexing Sniffles again to face Gloom Phantom, Magh Bihu, and Dazbog."] = "Examina de nuevo las Vexing Sniffles para enfrentarte a Gloom Phantom, Magh Bihu y Dazbog.",
    ["Examine the Viscous Liquid again to spawn the NM Mamool Ja."] = "Examina de nuevo el Viscous Liquid para invocar al NM Mamool Ja.",
    ["Examine the blank spot at (G-7) to spawn the NM Nepionic Soulflayer. When you have defeated it, examine the blank spot again to receive your Magus Keffiyeh and the title Paragon of Blue Mage Excellence."] = "Examina el punto vacío en (G-7) para invocar al NM Nepionic Soulflayer. Cuando lo hayas derrotado, examina de nuevo el punto vacío para recibir tu Magus Keffiyeh y el título Paragon of Blue Mage Excellence.",
    ["Examine the blue ??? at the top of the stairs."] = "Examina la ??? azul en lo alto de las escaleras.",
    ["Examine the correct ??? behind the bookshelf in the southwest corner."] = "Examina la ??? correcta detrás de la estantería de la esquina suroeste.",
    ["Examine the correct ???."] = "Examina la ??? correcta.",
    ["Examine the designated ??? at (J-7), (I-8), and (H-8) to complete the three required steps."] = "Examina las ??? designadas en (J-7), (I-8) y (H-8) para completar los tres pasos requeridos.",
    ["Examine the door again after the airship sequence."] = "Examina la puerta de nuevo tras la secuencia del dirigible.",
    ["Examine the door again to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo la puerta para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine the door to Prince Trion's room (Door: Prince Royal's Rm) at Chateau d'Oraguille (H-7) while you are a Paladin, for a cutscene. Check your active quests: you should see Under Oath. The rest of the quest can be completed as any job."] = "Examina la puerta de la habitación del Prince Trion (Door: Prince Royal's Rm) en Chateau d'Oraguille (H-7) siendo Paladin, para una escena. Comprueba tus quests activas: deberías ver Under Oath. El resto de la quest se puede completar con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Examine the first Toppled Cresset at (I-8), then the second at (F-9)/(F-8) in Vunkerl Inlet (S)."] = "Examina el primer Toppled Cresset en (I-8) y luego el segundo en (F-9)/(F-8) en Vunkerl Inlet (S).",
    ["Examine the green Unstable Displacement in the northwest section of Riverne - Site #B01 (E-7) for a cutscene. You can warp and use the Home Point to get there, or farm one Giant Scale to get to (E-7) the long way."] = "Examina el Unstable Displacement verde en la sección noroeste de Riverne - Site #B01 (E-7) para una escena. Puedes teletransportarte y usar el Home Point para llegar, o farmear una Giant Scale para llegar a (E-7) por el camino largo.",
    ["Examine the headstone a third time to receive the Ephramadian Gold Coin."] = "Examina la headstone por tercera vez para recibir la Ephramadian Gold Coin.",
    ["Examine the headstone again to face Jazaraat."] = "Examina de nuevo la headstone para enfrentarte a Jazaraat.",
    ["Examine the headstone to begin the event."] = "Examina la headstone para comenzar el evento.",
    ["Examine the pools on map 2 of Fei'Yin, located at (H-8), (H-5) and lastly (F-5). They are the little green marks on the map. Home Point #2, just outside the Cloister of Frost, is the closest warp."] = "Examina los estanques del mapa 2 de Fei'Yin, situados en (H-8), (H-5) y por último (F-5). Son las pequeñas marcas verdes del mapa. El Home Point #2, justo fuera del Cloister of Frost, es el warp más cercano.",
    ["Examine the same ??? again to receive the Reliquiarium Key."] = "Examina de nuevo la misma ??? para recibir la Reliquiarium Key.",
    ["Examine the same target again to receive the Ancient San d'Orian Tablet."] = "Examina de nuevo el mismo objetivo para recibir la Ancient San d'Orian Tablet.",
    ["Examine the second Cracked Wall at (J-8)."] = "Examina la segunda Cracked Wall en (J-8).",
    ["Examine the seven required Cermet Headstones in any order."] = "Examina los siete Cermet Headstones requeridos en cualquier orden.",
    ["Examine the shimmering light."] = "Examina la luz brillante.",
    ["Examine the shining ??? at Eschan Portal #15 (H-12)."] = "Examina la ??? brillante en el Eschan Portal #15 (H-12).",
    ["Examine the site again to begin the battle."] = "Examina de nuevo el lugar para comenzar la batalla.",
    ["Examine the six Pip objects around the tower and follow the elemental day order to determine the number formed by their connections."] = "Examina los seis objetos Pip alrededor de la torre y sigue el orden elemental de los días para determinar el número que forman sus conexiones.",
    ["Examine the southern Rhinostery door in Windurst Waters (S)."] = "Examina la puerta sur del Rhinostery en Windurst Waters (S).",
    ["Examine the sparkling ??? beside a Cavernous Maw in Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields, or Sauromugue Champaign."] = "Examina la ??? reluciente junto a un Cavernous Maw en Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields o Sauromugue Champaign.",
    ["Examine the target near Castle Zvahl at (D-7) after collecting all four fragments."] = "Examina el objetivo cerca de Castle Zvahl en (D-7) tras reunir los cuatro fragmentos.",
    ["Examine the tombstone inside to receive the Ancient San d'Orian Book."] = "Examina la tombstone del interior para recibir el Ancient San d'Orian Book.",
    ["Examine the two doors to the Princes' quarters if you want to hear their additional dialogue."] = "Examina las dos puertas de los aposentos de los Princes si quieres oír su diálogo adicional.",
    ["Examine the unnamed target on a manhole cover at (L-7) in Mount Zhayolm for a cutscene that begins the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. Zurtermor has dropped his precious pickaxe into a crevasse."] = "Examina el objetivo sin nombre de una tapa de alcantarilla en (L-7) de Mount Zhayolm para una escena que empieza la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Zurtermor ha dejado caer su valioso pico en una grieta.",
    ["Exit Norg into Sea Serpent Grotto. Head south until you reach the fork at (H-6) and go east. Turn south at (J-5), head east at (J-10), and turn east at (K-12)."] = "Sal de Norg a Sea Serpent Grotto. Ve al sur hasta la bifurcación de (H-6) y ve al este. Gira al sur en (J-5), ve al este en (J-10) y gira al este en (K-12).",
    ["Exit Norg into Sea Serpent Grotto. Once there, head south until you reach (H-7) and go west from there."] = "Sal de Norg a Sea Serpent Grotto. Una vez allí, ve al sur hasta (H-7) y desde allí ve al oeste.",
    ["Exit Norg, re-enter, and speak with Jaucribaix to receive the key item Yomotsu Hirasaka."] = "Sal de Norg, vuelve a entrar y habla con Jaucribaix para recibir el key item Yomotsu Hirasaka.",
    ["Exit Sealion's Den and examine the Phomiuna Aqueducts entrance on the bottom floor."] = "Sal de Sealion's Den y examina la entrada de Phomiuna Aqueducts en el piso inferior.",
    ["Exit east to Caedarva Mire and go to (I-10). Check the ??? on the east side of the pond for a cutscene."] = "Sal hacia el este a Caedarva Mire y ve a (I-10). Revisa la ??? en el lado este del estanque para una escena.",
    ["Exit the dock, then talk to Blandine again."] = "Sal del muelle y vuelve a hablar con Blandine.",
    ["Exit the fortress and examine ??? (I-9), then examine it again to face War Lynx."] = "Sal de la fortaleza y examina la ??? (I-9), luego examínala de nuevo para enfrentarte a War Lynx.",
    ["Exit through the southern Particle Gate."] = "Sal por el Particle Gate del sur.",
    ["Exoray Mold drops from Exoray enemies (uncommon), or you can receive it after obtaining three Exoray mold crumbs from ??? spots."] = "El Exoray Mold lo sueltan los enemigos Exoray (poco común), o puedes recibirlo tras obtener tres Exoray mold crumbs de lugares ???.",
    ["Face Shinryu beyond the radiance."] = "Enfréntate a Shinryu más allá del resplandor.",
    ["Fall off the path to the one below at (H-8) and continue north. Follow the path until you find the ??? at (H-3). Interacting with it gives you a Sea serpent statue."] = "Déjate caer del camino al de abajo en (H-8) y sigue al norte. Sigue el camino hasta encontrar la ??? en (H-3). Al interactuar con ella recibes una Sea serpent statue.",
    ["Famous biologist Professor Clavauert is researching apkallu on Ilrusi Atoll. The more discoveries he makes in Aht Urhgan, the more likely he is to join the Empire. Assist him by capturing apkallu. Mission orders: capture the apkallu."] = "El famoso biólogo Professor Clavauert investiga a los apkallu en Ilrusi Atoll. Cuantos más descubrimientos haga en Aht Urhgan, más probable es que se una al Empire. Ayúdale capturando apkallu. Órdenes de la misión: capturar a los apkallu.",
    ["Farm Topaz Quadav enemies until you obtain a Quadav Mage Blood. Only one is needed if you are doing this with a group."] = "Farmea enemigos Topaz Quadav hasta obtener una Quadav Mage Blood. Solo hace falta una si lo haces en grupo.",
    ["Feed the chocobo standing next to Osker by trading it one Gausebit Grass. You can feed it once every real life minute."] = "Alimenta al chocobo que está junto a Osker entregándole una Gausebit Grass. Puedes alimentarlo una vez por minuto real.",
    ["Fill each test tube at its Mythralline Wellspring (the ??? at each pond), in any order. Enter Wajaom Woodlands through the Ironbound Gate at (H-10) and Bhaflau Thickets through the Ironbound Gate at (H-7)."] = "Llena cada tubo de ensayo en su Mythralline Wellspring (la ??? de cada estanque), en cualquier orden. Entra en Wajaom Woodlands por la Ironbound Gate de (H-10) y en Bhaflau Thickets por la Ironbound Gate de (H-7).",
    ["Final cutscene: if you have killed Fenrir after reaching Windurst Rank 10, you have the Dark Mana Orb among your temporary key items. Zone, then speak with Kohlo-Lakolo again with that key item for a final, concluding cutscene."] = "Escena final: si has matado a Fenrir tras alcanzar el Windurst Rank 10, tienes la Dark Mana Orb entre tus key items temporales. Cambia de zona y luego habla de nuevo con Kohlo-Lakolo con ese key item para una escena final de cierre.",
    ["Finally, enter the southern Eldieme Necropolis entrance from Batallia Downs at (I-10)."] = "Por último, entra por la entrada sur de Eldieme Necropolis desde Batallia Downs en (I-10).",
    ["Finally, return to Kubhe Ijyuhla to complete the quest. She rewards you with an Imperial Bronze Piece."] = "Por último, vuelve con Kubhe Ijyuhla para completar la quest. Te recompensa con una Imperial Bronze Piece.",
    ["Finally, speak with Alois in the conference room of the President's Office in Metalworks (J-8) to complete the quest and receive the Fukuro."] = "Por último, habla con Alois en la sala de conferencias de la President's Office en Metalworks (J-8) para completar la quest y recibir el Fukuro.",
    ["Finally, speak with Saliyahf at (G-7) for your reward, 3 Imperial Bronze Pieces, and to finish the quest."] = "Por último, habla con Saliyahf en (G-7) por tu recompensa, 3 Imperial Bronze Pieces, y para terminar la quest.",
    ["Find Varchet in Southern San d'Oria at (L-6), right next to the fountains. You need to gamble against him; each attempt costs 5 gil, so keep trying until you win. You can still gamble with him after the quest is complete."] = "Encuentra a Varchet en Southern San d'Oria en (L-6), justo al lado de las fuentes. Tienes que apostar contra él; cada intento cuesta 5 gil, así que sigue intentándolo hasta ganar. Puedes seguir apostando con él después de completar la quest.",
    ["Find Zantaviat just inside Davoi."] = "Encuentra a Zantaviat nada más entrar en Davoi.",
    ["Find a pair of Moccasins."] = "Encuentra un par de Moccasins.",
    ["Find a player who matches the description and make a party with them. Then return to Halver while in the same party as the match. Having a female character in the party does not force Halver to ask for that character; the choice is random."] = "Encuentra a un jugador que coincida con la descripción y forma grupo con él. Luego vuelve con Halver estando en el mismo grupo que esa persona. Tener un personaje femenino en el grupo no obliga a Halver a pedir ese personaje; la elección es aleatoria.",
    ["Find his father, Exoroche, in Southern San d'Oria at (K-7) in Helbort's Blade."] = "Encuentra a su padre, Exoroche, en Southern San d'Oria en (K-7), en Helbort's Blade.",
    ["Find the ??? in Dangruf Wadi to get a Dangruf Stone. The monsters around the ??? are level 90 to 95; only the Goblins are aggressive, and they can be avoided with just Invisible since they do not have pets. You lose Invisible when riding the geyser at (I-8) in Dangruf Wadi, so Field Support from the Grounds Tome will fail."] = "Encuentra la ??? en Dangruf Wadi para conseguir una Dangruf Stone. Los monstruos alrededor de la ??? son de nivel 90 a 95; solo los Goblins son agresivos, y se pueden evitar con solo Invisible ya que no tienen mascotas. Pierdes Invisible al montar el geyser en (I-8) de Dangruf Wadi, así que el Field Support del Grounds Tome fallará.",
    ["Find the Mandragora Warden and trade it Goobbue Humus."] = "Encuentra al Mandragora Warden y entrégale Goobbue Humus.",
    ["Find the Warhorse Hoofprint and click on it to place the Quartz transmitter. The Warhorse Hoofprint is visible on Widescan and is found in four different zones: Bhaflau Thickets, Caedarva Mire, Mount Zhayolm and Wajaom Woodlands."] = "Busca la Warhorse Hoofprint y haz clic en ella para colocar el Quartz transmitter. La Warhorse Hoofprint es visible con Widescan y se encuentra en cuatro zonas distintas: Bhaflau Thickets, Caedarva Mire, Mount Zhayolm y Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Find the cave at (E-7) in Xarcabard and examine the ???: after a cutscene a Koenigstiger appears."] = "Encuentra la cueva en (E-7) de Xarcabard y examina la ???: tras una escena aparece un Koenigstiger.",
    ["Find the piece of the old floorplans in the Sacrarium and bring it back to Nivorajean for your reward, the Map of the Sacrarium."] = "Encuentra el trozo de los planos antiguos en Sacrarium y llévaselo a Nivorajean por tu recompensa, el Map of the Sacrarium.",
    ["First Rubious Crystal:"] = "Primer Rubious Crystal:",
    ["First enter any Promyvion area, and return to Harith in the Grand Duke's house in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) without erasing your memory at the Large Apparatus."] = "Primero entra en cualquier zona de Promyvion y vuelve con Harith a la casa del Grand Duke en Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) sin borrar tu memoria en el Large Apparatus.",
    ["First go to the second floor of the house at (G-7) in Southern San d'Oria and read the diary there until you have read up to Page 4. This quest requires the Chains of Promathia pack, and follows A Squire's Test II."] = "Primero ve al segundo piso de la casa en (G-7) de Southern San d'Oria y lee el diario hasta llegar a la Page 4. Esta quest requiere el pack Chains of Promathia y sigue a A Squire's Test II.",
    ["First head to Rabao and talk to Rudolfo (J-7). You need to have completed Promathia Mission 2-1 and have the Chains of Promathia pack. A young cargo hauler named Sanctia has suddenly left Rabao, and Zoriboh wants you to find her; she has probably headed for Norg to board a ship bound for the Tavnazian Marquisate."] = "Primero ve a Rabao y habla con Rudolfo (J-7). Debes haber completado Promathia Mission 2-1 y tener el pack Chains of Promathia. Una joven transportista llamada Sanctia se ha ido de pronto de Rabao, y Zoriboh quiere que la encuentres; probablemente se ha dirigido a Norg para embarcar en un barco con destino al Tavnazian Marquisate.",
    ["First, travel to Cape Terrigan and reach the Valley of Sorrows entrance at (J-8). Cross to (I-8) and examine ??? (I-8) to receive the Figure of Titan."] = "Primero, viaja a Cape Terrigan y llega a la entrada del Valley of Sorrows en (J-8). Cruza hasta (I-8) y examina la ??? (I-8) para recibir la Figure of Titan.",
    ["Fish a Ripped Cap out of the water and trade it to Paytah."] = "Pesca una Ripped Cap del agua y entrégala a Paytah.",
    ["Fish for Paladin Lobster at (G-10), Scutum Crab at (J-7), and Lance Fish at (H-9)."] = "Pesca Paladin Lobster en (G-10), Scutum Crab en (J-7) y Lance Fish en (H-9).",
    ["Fish in Castle Oztroja with a rod used for catching big fish, using the Giant Shell Bug as bait. Bring more than one Giant Shell Bug."] = "Pesca en Castle Oztroja con una caña para pescar peces grandes, usando el Giant Shell Bug como cebo. Lleva más de un Giant Shell Bug.",
    ["Fishing tip: with a Lu Shang's Fishing Rod you can do this at fishing skill 32. Fishing in Nashmau with Minnow, Sinking Minnow and Crayfish Balls eventually gives 4 of the 5 fish, and the Istavrit can be fished in Talacca Cove with a Sinking Minnow. You can also catch 4 of the 5 in Talacca Cove and the Istiridye in Nashmau."] = "Consejo de pesca: con una Lu Shang's Fishing Rod puedes hacerlo con habilidad de pesca 32. Pescando en Nashmau con Minnow, Sinking Minnow y Crayfish Balls acabas consiguiendo 4 de los 5 pescados, y el Istavrit se puede pescar en Talacca Cove con un Sinking Minnow. También puedes pescar 4 de los 5 en Talacca Cove y el Istiridye en Nashmau.",
    ["Fishing. The fishing page lists what bites where and the skill each catch needs."] = "Pesca. La página de pesca enumera qué pica dónde y la habilidad que exige cada captura.",
    ["Follow Arciela into the required wilderness sequence."] = "Sigue a Arciela en la secuencia de naturaleza salvaje requerida.",
    ["Follow Romualdo (I-7).'s instructions and investigate the requested location in the Shadowreign area."] = "Sigue las instrucciones de Romualdo (I-7) e investiga el lugar solicitado en la zona de Shadowreign.",
    ["Follow Teodor.'s instructions."] = "Sigue las instrucciones de Teodor.",
    ["Follow Teodor.'s summons."] = "Sigue la convocatoria de Teodor.",
    ["Follow the Chocobo digging clues until you find the Moldy, worm-eaten chest."] = "Sigue las pistas de excavación del Chocobo hasta encontrar el Moldy, worm-eaten chest.",
    ["Follow the Curilla investigation and complete the required battle."] = "Sigue la investigación de Curilla y completa el combate requerido.",
    ["Follow the Gate Guard's instructions and return to Prince Trion in Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7)."] = "Sigue las instrucciones del Gate Guard y vuelve con Prince Trion en la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7).",
    ["Follow the beastmen beacon teleports and examine the Craggy Pillar in each room until you find the correct one."] = "Sigue los teletransportes de los beastmen beacons y examina el Craggy Pillar de cada sala hasta encontrar el correcto.",
    ["Follow the hallway and examine the two oil lamps corresponding to the current Vana'diel day."] = "Sigue el pasillo y examina las dos lámparas de aceite correspondientes al día de Vana'diel actual.",
    ["Follow the hallway to the next Stone Door."] = "Sigue el pasillo hasta la siguiente Stone Door.",
    ["Follow the leads through Adoulin."] = "Sigue las pistas por Adoulin.",
    ["Follow the northwestern path to the Stone Gate leading to The Shrouded Maw."] = "Sigue el camino del noroeste hasta la Stone Gate que lleva a The Shrouded Maw.",
    ["Follow the path north to (I-8), then stand on the geyser in the southeastern corner until it carries you onto the ledge."] = "Sigue el camino al norte hasta (I-8), luego colócate sobre el géiser de la esquina sureste hasta que te lleve a la cornisa.",
    ["Follow the path without dropping down until you reach Stone Door (H-8) around (H-8)."] = "Sigue el camino sin dejarte caer hasta llegar a la Stone Door (H-8) cerca de (H-8).",
    ["Follow the quest route into Jugner Forest (S) and gather the required logging key items."] = "Sigue la ruta de la quest hasta Jugner Forest (S) y reúne los key items de tala requeridos.",
    ["Follow the required sequence."] = "Sigue la secuencia requerida.",
    ["Follow the right wall through the lower area and zone into West Ronfaure."] = "Sigue la pared derecha por la zona inferior y entra en West Ronfaure.",
    ["Follow the right wall until the path turns north, then take the left path at the three-way intersection to reach the bridge."] = "Sigue la pared derecha hasta que el camino gire al norte, luego toma el camino de la izquierda en la intersección de tres vías para llegar al puente.",
    ["Follow the route to the transporter at (G-12)."] = "Sigue la ruta hasta el transportador en (G-12).",
    ["Follow the royal investigation concerning Excenmille."] = "Sigue la investigación real sobre Excenmille.",
    ["Follow the surface path along, south past the Mute at (F-9). When the weather is raining, a ??? appears; take your sample of polluted dirt from it."] = "Sigue el camino de la superficie, al sur pasando el Mute en (F-9). Cuando llueve, aparece una ???; toma de ella tu muestra de tierra contaminada.",
    ["Follow the trail to the required location."] = "Sigue el rastro hasta el lugar requerido.",
    ["For the Orcish crest, either you or a player assisting you must possess the Crimson orb key item from the mini-quest. Exit Monastic Cavern at (I-8) and proceed to the (J-9) entrance of Monastic Cavern; you or a partner need a Crimson orb from Sedal-Godjal to enter. Once inside, click the ???."] = "Para el Orcish crest, tú o un jugador que te ayude debéis poseer el key item Crimson orb de la mini-quest. Sal de Monastic Cavern por (I-8) y ve a la entrada (J-9) de Monastic Cavern; tú o un compañero necesitáis una Crimson orb de Sedal-Godjal para entrar. Una vez dentro, haz clic en la ???.",
    ["Form a party of two, yourself and one other player, with the same allegiance, then speak with him again to complete the quest."] = "Forma un grupo de dos, tú y otro jugador, con la misma allegiance, y luego habla de nuevo con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Form a party of two, yourself and one other player, with the same job, then speak with him again to complete the quest."] = "Forma un grupo de dos, tú y otro jugador, con el mismo trabajo, y luego habla de nuevo con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Form a party of two, yourself and one other player, with the same race, then speak with him again to complete the quest."] = "Forma un grupo de dos, tú y otro jugador, con la misma raza, y luego habla de nuevo con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Form a party with at least two people who are level 40 or lower. Level sync does work. If you buy a chocobo in Rabao, you can cross the desert without having to worry about aggro."] = "Forma un grupo con al menos dos personas de nivel 40 o inferior. El level sync funciona. Si compras un chocobo en Rabao, puedes cruzar el desierto sin preocuparte por el aggro.",
    ["Foss, Bastok Markets"] = "Foss, Bastok Markets",
    ["From around level 10, most players leave their home region and group up. Common places to go:"] = "A partir del nivel 10, la mayoría de los jugadores salen de su región de origen y forman grupo. Lugares habituales:",
    ["From the 10th floor, go to (F-8) and continue through Upper Delkfutt's Tower to the 11th floor."] = "Desde el piso 10, ve a (F-8) y continúa por Upper Delkfutt's Tower hasta el piso 11.",
    ["From the Fly Agaric room, take the southwest passage (to Point C, G-6/H-6) to reach map 2, and proceed to the large room at (G-7)."] = "Desde la sala de los Fly Agaric, toma el pasaje suroeste (hacia Point C, G-6/H-6) para llegar al mapa 2 y avanza hasta la sala grande en (G-7).",
    ["From there go west and south as you can until you come to the tunnel at (F-8) that leads back to the surface; you pass one Afflictor that curses you as you proceed."] = "Desde allí ve al oeste y al sur según puedas hasta llegar al túnel en (F-8) que vuelve a la superficie; pasas junto a un Afflictor que te maldice al avanzar.",
    ["From there head south and you will go into a cave that leads down. Take it down until it exits at (H-7) on the lower map."] = "Desde allí ve al sur y entrarás en una cueva que baja. Bájala hasta que salga en (H-7) del mapa inferior.",
    ["Fuepepe may need to be spoken to several times, repeating the same unrelated text before giving the text that continues the quest."] = "Puede que haya que hablar varias veces con Fuepepe, que repite el mismo texto sin relación antes de dar el texto que continúa la quest.",
    ["Gather all 5 Mannequin pieces and trade them to Fyi Chalmwoh. They can also be bought from player bazaars."] = "Reúne las 5 piezas de Mannequin y entrégaselas a Fyi Chalmwoh. También se pueden comprar en los bazares de otros jugadores.",
    ["Gather the required allies."] = "Reúne a los aliados necesarios.",
    ["Gather the required components and synthesize the completed Enfeeblement Kit yourself."] = "Reúne los componentes necesarios y sintetiza tú mismo el Enfeeblement Kit completo.",
    ["Gather those items and trade them to Amaura to receive the key item Cold medicine."] = "Reúne esos objetos y entrégaselos a Amaura para recibir el key item Cold medicine.",
    ["Gathering. Harvesting, Logging, Mining, and Excavation points appear throughout the early zones. You need the matching tool."] = "Recolección. Los puntos de Harvesting, Logging, Mining y Excavation aparecen por las primeras zonas. Necesitas la herramienta correspondiente.",
    ["General Afkaam is to inspect Leujaoam Sanctum. Mission orders: remove all threats. The recommended level is 50."] = "General Afkaam va a inspeccionar Leujaoam Sanctum. Órdenes de la misión: eliminar todas las amenazas. El nivel recomendado es 50.",
    ["Generals Karazahm and Umarid of the Imperial Army's Arrapago division have disappeared from camp headquarters while on a mission on Sharug Isle. Mission orders: locate the generals."] = "Los Generals Karazahm y Umarid de la división Arrapago del Imperial Army han desaparecido del cuartel del campamento durante una misión en Sharug Isle. Órdenes de la misión: localizar a los generales.",
    ["Gerbaum, Bastok Mines"] = "Gerbaum, Bastok Mines",
    ["Gessho withdraws after being reduced to approximately 10% HP."] = "Gessho se retira al quedar reducido a aproximadamente el 10% de HP.",
    ["Get Signet from a gate guard"] = "Consigue Signet de un guardia de puerta",
    ["Get a Pickaxe from the Auction House or from any other source."] = "Consigue una Pickaxe en la Auction House o de cualquier otra fuente.",
    ["Get a Pickaxe. Zone into Ordelle's Caves and back out again before continuing, or you will not be able to trade the pickaxe."] = "Consigue una Pickaxe. Entra en Ordelle's Caves y vuelve a salir antes de continuar, o no podrás entregar la pickaxe.",
    ["Get your chocobo license with Chocobo's Wounds (Brutus in Upper Jeuno). You feed a wounded chocobo Gausebit Grass. Each feeding has to wait one Vana'diel day. Chocobos can then be rented at level 20 anywhere."] = "Consigue tu licencia de chocobo con Chocobo's Wounds (Brutus en Upper Jeuno). Das de comer Gausebit Grass a un chocobo herido. Cada comida tiene que esperar un día de Vana'diel. Después se pueden alquilar chocobos en cualquier sitio a nivel 20.",
    ["Getting around"] = "Desplazarse",
    ["Give Cacaroon either 1,000 gil or one Imperial Bronze Piece."] = "Dale a Cacaroon 1,000 gil o una Imperial Bronze Piece.",
    ["Give the Purple Ribbon to Kerutoto in the northern Rhinostery building in Windurst Waters South (J-8)."] = "Entrega la Purple Ribbon a Kerutoto en el edificio norte del Rhinostery de Windurst Waters South (J-8).",
    ["Give the flower to Moari-Kaaori to receive your reward: an Iron Sword the first time and 400 gil on later completions."] = "Entrega la flor a Moari-Kaaori para recibir tu recompensa: una Iron Sword la primera vez y 400 gil en las siguientes.",
    ["Give the resulting number to Goblin Grenadier (H-8) to receive the Pocket Mogbomb."] = "Dale el número resultante al Goblin Grenadier (H-8) para recibir la Pocket Mogbomb.",
    ["Go back and speak with Balasiel to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve y habla con Balasiel para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Go back and speak with Brutus to receive your reward, the Decimation weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Brutus para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Decimation.",
    ["Go back and speak with Cid to receive your reward, the Detonator weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Cid para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Detonator.",
    ["Go back and speak with Curilla to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve y habla con Curilla para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Go back and speak with Deraquien."] = "Vuelve y habla con Deraquien.",
    ["Go back and speak with Gumbah to receive your reward, the Ground Strike weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Gumbah para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Ground Strike.",
    ["Go back and speak with Iron Eater to receive your reward, the Steel Cyclone weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Iron Eater para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Steel Cyclone.",
    ["Go back and speak with Kuroido-Moido to receive your reward, the Black Halo weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Kuroido-Moido para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Black Halo.",
    ["Go back and speak with Novalmauge to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve y habla con Novalmauge para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Go back and speak with Oggbi to receive your Temple Gaiters."] = "Vuelve y habla con Oggbi para recibir tus Temple Gaiters.",
    ["Go back and speak with Oggbi to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve y habla con Oggbi para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Go back and speak with Perih Vashai to receive your reward, the Empyreal Arrow weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Perih Vashai para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Empyreal Arrow.",
    ["Go back to Gantineux, who gives you the key item Gantineux's letter and tells you to deliver it to Eperdur."] = "Vuelve con Gantineux, que te da el key item Gantineux's letter y te dice que se la entregues a Eperdur.",
    ["Go back to Imasuke, who tells you to find someone who can translate the ring."] = "Vuelve con Imasuke, que te dice que busques a alguien que pueda traducir el anillo.",
    ["Go back to Iruki-Waraki in Aht Urhgan Whitegate to receive your Turbo Animator."] = "Vuelve con Iruki-Waraki en Aht Urhgan Whitegate para recibir tu Turbo Animator.",
    ["Go back to Kazham and talk to Etteh Sulaej."] = "Vuelve a Kazham y habla con Etteh Sulaej.",
    ["Go back to Wahid and trade the Siren's Tear to complete the quest and receive 150 gil. If you are doing this quest for a Vana'Bout objective and have already completed it once, you do not need to speak to Wahid again to start it."] = "Vuelve con Wahid y entrega la Siren's Tear para completar la quest y recibir 150 gil. Si haces esta quest para un objetivo de Vana'Bout y ya la completaste una vez, no necesitas hablar de nuevo con Wahid para empezarla.",
    ["Go back to Windurst Woods and speak with Nanaa Mihgo. The correct answer is \"Blank\", but any answer progresses the quest."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Woods y habla con Nanaa Mihgo. La respuesta correcta es \"Blank\", pero cualquier respuesta hace avanzar la quest.",
    ["Go back to the Tavnazian Safehold and talk to Enaremand again for your reward, the Mannequin Pumps."] = "Vuelve a Tavnazian Safehold y habla de nuevo con Enaremand por tu recompensa, el Mannequin Pumps.",
    ["Go down into the underground cave area behind the food or drink altar and examine the altar to receive the key item Off Offering."] = "Baja a la zona de cueva subterránea detrás del altar de comida o bebida y examina el altar para recibir el key item Off Offering.",
    ["Go down to the main room for a cutscene and take the right teleporter."] = "Baja a la sala principal para una escena y toma el teletransportador de la derecha.",
    ["Go north and descend the stairs to Celestial Nexus (H-9) at (H-9)."] = "Ve al norte y baja las escaleras hasta el Celestial Nexus (H-9) en (H-9).",
    ["Go north to the Acolyte Hostel (K-6) and interact with each of the six doors on the ground floor to play Quiz de Vana'diel. Answer a question correctly, then go to another door, until you have 4 to 6 correct answers."] = "Ve al norte hasta el Acolyte Hostel (K-6) e interactúa con cada una de las seis puertas de la planta baja para jugar a Quiz de Vana'diel. Responde correctamente una pregunta y luego ve a otra puerta, hasta tener de 4 a 6 respuestas correctas.",
    ["Go past the Silver Door at (N-14): examine the door three times and trade it a Silver Beastcoin to get through. You keep the Silver Beastcoin."] = "Pasa la Silver Door de (N-14): examina la puerta tres veces y entrégale una Silver Beastcoin para pasar. Te quedas con la Silver Beastcoin.",
    ["Go through Banishing Gate #1 at (I-9) on map 1, then Banishing Gate #2 at (H-10) on map 2."] = "Atraviesa la Banishing Gate #1 en (I-9) del mapa 1 y luego la Banishing Gate #2 en (H-10) del mapa 2.",
    ["Go through the Portcullis and check Door: House (M-8) at (M-8) to complete the quest and receive the reward."] = "Atraviesa la Portcullis y revisa la Door: House (M-8) en (M-8) para completar la quest y recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Go to (E-11) and speak with Roderich (E-11)."] = "Ve a (E-11) y habla con Roderich (E-11).",
    ["Go to (E-7) and interact with Barricade (E-7)."] = "Ve a (E-7) e interactúa con la Barricade (E-7).",
    ["Go to (G-8) on the first map of the Temple of Uggalepih and hang the picture at the Stone Picture Frame, on the south wall of the Paintbrush Room, to spawn the Golem NM Trompe L'Oeil. The Temple of Uggalepih Survival Guide warp puts you a short distance from the Stone Frame."] = "Ve a (G-8) del primer mapa del Temple of Uggalepih y cuelga el cuadro en el Stone Picture Frame, en la pared sur de la Paintbrush Room, para invocar al NM Golem Trompe L'Oeil. El warp de la Survival Guide del Temple of Uggalepih te deja a poca distancia del Stone Frame.",
    ["Go to (H-8) on map 1 to reach map 2."] = "Ve a (H-8) del mapa 1 para llegar al mapa 2.",
    ["Go to (I-10) on map 2 and examine the ??? to spawn three Wyrmfly (Fly NMs)."] = "Ve a (I-10) del mapa 2 y examina la ??? para invocar a tres Wyrmfly (Fly NMs).",
    ["Go to (I-5) in Port Bastok and speak with Ensetsu."] = "Ve a (I-5) de Port Bastok y habla con Ensetsu.",
    ["Go to (I-6) and examine ??? tree stump (I-6) on the tree stump."] = "Ve a (I-6) y examina el tocón ??? (I-6).",
    ["Go to (J-8) and examine the ??? again for another cutscene."] = "Ve a (J-8) y examina de nuevo la ??? para otra escena.",
    ["Go to Arrapago Reef and click on the ??? (not the shining spot labeled \"-\") at the northeast corner of (H-10) for a cutscene. It is located on a ship, and you need a Lamian Fang Key to get there. There are only a few possible opponents (5) between the zone line and the gate before the quest marker."] = "Ve a Arrapago Reef y haz clic en la ??? (no en el punto brillante marcado \"-\") en la esquina noreste de (H-10) para una escena. Está en un barco y necesitas una Lamian Fang Key para llegar. Hay pocos oponentes posibles (5) entre la línea de zona y la puerta antes del marcador de la quest.",
    ["Go to Arrapago Reef. Use the Arrapago Reef Survival Guide to get there quickly; if you do not have it, you can get it by walking from Nashmau or take the long way using the Azouph Isle Staging Point from Aht Urhgan Whitegate. You need a Lamian Fang Key to get to the ???."] = "Ve a Arrapago Reef. Usa la Survival Guide de Arrapago Reef para llegar rápido; si no la tienes, puedes conseguirla andando desde Nashmau o tomar el camino largo con el Azouph Isle Staging Point desde Aht Urhgan Whitegate. Necesitas una Lamian Fang Key para llegar a la ???.",
    ["Go to Attohwa Chasm, which you can enter from the Maze of Shakhrami, and make your way through it to the Boneyard Gully zone, in the eastern part of (G-6)."] = "Ve a Attohwa Chasm, al que puedes entrar desde Maze of Shakhrami, y abre camino hasta la zona Boneyard Gully, en la parte este de (G-6).",
    ["Go to Balrahn Way for another cutscene. When presented an option, choose \"Where have you been\"."] = "Ve a Balrahn Way para otra escena. Cuando te den una opción, elige \"Where have you been\".",
    ["Go to Bastok Markets (Home Point #1) and look for Michea at (F-10), upstairs inside Brunhilde the Armorer's shop."] = "Ve a Bastok Markets (Home Point #1) y busca a Michea en (F-10), arriba dentro de la tienda de Brunhilde the Armorer.",
    ["Go to Bastok Markets (S) and speak with Raginmund near Harmodio's Music Shop (L-10)."] = "Ve a Bastok Markets (S) y habla con Raginmund cerca de Harmodio's Music Shop (L-10).",
    ["Go to Bastok Markets and speak with Shamarhaan. He compliments you on becoming a fine Puppetmaster and, after contemplating, tells you that Iruki-Waraki has always had what a Puppetmaster should ideally have. You receive the key items Valkeng's memory chip and Toggle switch."] = "Ve a Bastok Markets y habla con Shamarhaan. Te felicita por haberte convertido en un buen Puppetmaster y, tras meditarlo, te dice que Iruki-Waraki siempre ha tenido lo que idealmente debe tener un Puppetmaster. Recibes los key items Valkeng's memory chip y Toggle switch.",
    ["Go to Bastok Mines and speak with Pavvke in his residence on the lower level (I-7) for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives you your reward."] = "Ve a Bastok Mines y habla con Pavvke en su residencia del nivel inferior (I-7) para una escena que completa la quest y te da tu recompensa.",
    ["Go to Bastok Mines and speak with Virnage at (I-5) for a cutscene. Agree to his proposal and you receive the Dawn talisman."] = "Ve a Bastok Mines y habla con Virnage en (I-5) para una escena. Acepta su propuesta y recibes el Dawn talisman.",
    ["Go to Beadeaux and find a Treasure Coffer. Either obtain a Beadeaux Coffer Key or pick the lock as a Thief. The key is sold for 5,000 gil by the Curio Vendor Moogle."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y encuentra un Treasure Coffer. Consigue una Beadeaux Coffer Key o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave por 5,000 gil.",
    ["Go to Beadeaux and proceed to one of the sets of machines. You need to visit an Afflictor, which curses whoever comes near it unless they are currently silenced, and a Mute, which silences whoever touches it. So get cursed first by coming near the Afflictor, then touch the Mute to become silenced."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y dirígete a uno de los conjuntos de máquinas. Debes visitar un Afflictor, que maldice a quien se acerque a menos que esté silenciado, y un Mute, que silencia a quien lo toque. Así que primero maldícete acercándote al Afflictor y luego toca el Mute para quedar silenciado.",
    ["Go to Beadeaux and steal from Garnet Quadav, Silver Quadav, Zircon Quadav and Bronze Quadav until you obtain the Quadav Stew."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y roba a Garnet Quadav, Silver Quadav, Zircon Quadav y Bronze Quadav hasta obtener el Quadav Stew.",
    ["Go to Carpenters' Landing, entering from Jugner Forest at (J-8), where you will fight an Orc NM. When you touch the ???, Bullheaded Grosvez spawns."] = "Ve a Carpenters' Landing, entrando desde Jugner Forest en (J-8), donde lucharás contra un NM Orc. Al tocar la ???, aparece Bullheaded Grosvez.",
    ["Go to Castle Oztroja and defeat the Yagudo Parasite in the pond on the third floor (H-9) for a Parasite Skin."] = "Ve a Castle Oztroja y derrota al Yagudo Parasite en el estanque del tercer piso (H-9) para obtener una Parasite Skin.",
    ["Go to Castle Oztroja and head to the door at (I-8) on the first map."] = "Ve a Castle Oztroja y dirígete a la puerta en (I-8) del primer mapa.",
    ["Go to Castle Oztroja or Castle Zvahl Keep and defeat Yagudo Abbot enemies until a Yagudo Holy Water drops."] = "Ve a Castle Oztroja o Castle Zvahl Keep y derrota a enemigos Yagudo Abbot hasta que caiga un Yagudo Holy Water.",
    ["Go to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Halver. If you have just cleared The Voracious Resurgence, you will have to rezone after the cutscene and speak with him again."] = "Ve a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Halver. Si acabas de completar The Voracious Resurgence, tendrás que cambiar de zona tras la escena y hablar de nuevo con él.",
    ["Go to Crawlers' Nest. Either obtain a Nest Coffer Key or pick the lock as a Thief. You do not need to be on Beastmaster when opening the coffer."] = "Ve a Crawlers' Nest. Consigue una Nest Coffer Key o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. No necesitas ser Beastmaster al abrir el cofre.",
    ["Go to Davoi and defeat Purpleflash Brukdok (BLM) at (E-9)/(F-9) to obtain a Davoi Storage Key. It drops one key and respawns after about 10 minutes; each Red Mage doing the quest needs a key. To get there, run along the creekbed from (J-10) to (D-8)."] = "Ve a Davoi y derrota a Purpleflash Brukdok (BLM) en (E-9)/(F-9) para obtener una Davoi Storage Key. Suelta una llave y reaparece tras unos 10 minutos; cada Red Mage que haga la quest necesita una llave. Para llegar, corre por el lecho del arroyo desde (J-10) hasta (D-8).",
    ["Go to Davoi, then travel to Monastic Cavern and locate a Treasure Coffer. Either obtain a Davoi Coffer Key to open it, or pick the lock. You do not need to be on Thief when opening the coffer."] = "Ve a Davoi, luego viaja a Monastic Cavern y localiza un Treasure Coffer. Consigue una Davoi Coffer Key para abrirlo, o fuerza la cerradura. No necesitas ser Thief al abrir el cofre.",
    ["Go to Eldieme Necropolis and defeat Dark Stalker enemies until a Tavnazia Bell drops."] = "Ve a Eldieme Necropolis y derrota a enemigos Dark Stalker hasta que caiga una Tavnazia Bell.",
    ["Go to Fei'Yin and defeat Miser Murphy for an Antique Coin. He appears at (H-8) on map 1 if the quest is active."] = "Ve a Fei'Yin y derrota a Miser Murphy para obtener una Antique Coin. Aparece en (H-8) del mapa 1 si la quest está activa.",
    ["Go to Fei'Yin. In the basement (map B) travel to (I-5) to find the entrance to the Cloister of Frost. Each party member must have their own Tuning fork of ice."] = "Ve a Fei'Yin. En el sótano (mapa B) viaja a (I-5) para encontrar la entrada al Cloister of Frost. Cada miembro del grupo debe tener su propio Tuning fork of ice.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel and find a Treasure Coffer. Either obtain a Garlaige Coffer Key or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key for 5,000 gil."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel y encuentra un Treasure Coffer. Consigue una Garlaige Coffer Key o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave por 5,000 gil.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel. As soon as you zone in you get a cutscene, after which the NPC Wanzo-Unzozo appears. You can summon Trusts, but zoning in with an Adventuring Fellow makes the escort NPC disappear."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel. En cuanto entras en la zona recibes una escena, tras la cual aparece el NPC Wanzo-Unzozo. Puedes invocar Trusts, pero entrar con un Adventuring Fellow hace desaparecer al NPC escoltado.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel. Either obtain a Garlaige Coffer Key or pick the lock as a Thief."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel. Consigue una Garlaige Coffer Key o fuerza la cerradura como Thief.",
    ["Go to Giddeus and speak with Quu Bokye, then trade a Silver Beastcoin to receive \"Art for Everyone\"."] = "Ve a Giddeus y habla con Quu Bokye, luego entrega una Silver Beastcoin para recibir \"Art for Everyone\".",
    ["Go to Gusgen Mines and trade the Chaosbringer to the ??? at (J-7) on map 1 to receive your reward, the Deathbringer. It is the same ??? used in Bastok Mission 3-2 to spawn the NM Blind Moby."] = "Ve a Gusgen Mines y entrega el Chaosbringer a la ??? en (J-7) del mapa 1 para recibir tu recompensa, el Deathbringer. Es la misma ??? que se usa en la Bastok Mission 3-2 para invocar al NM Blind Moby.",
    ["Go to Heavens Tower and speak with Kupipi. If this is not your first Trust quest, you are finished here and receive the key item Windurst Trust permit."] = "Ve a Heavens Tower y habla con Kupipi. Si no es tu primera quest de Trust, terminas aquí y recibes el key item Windurst Trust permit.",
    ["Go to Ifrit's Cauldron. A quick route is the Unity Warp (level 122) to Yhoator Jungle, then hug the right wall; it is a short ride."] = "Ve a Ifrit's Cauldron. Una ruta rápida es el Unity Warp (nivel 122) a Yhoator Jungle y luego pegarte a la pared derecha; es un trayecto corto.",
    ["Go to King Ranperre's Tomb (I-10) on the first map."] = "Ve a King Ranperre's Tomb (I-10) en el primer mapa.",
    ["Go to La Theine Plateau (G-6) and trade the Carbuncle's Ruby to the ??? for a cutscene that completes the quest."] = "Ve a La Theine Plateau (G-6) y entrega el Carbuncle's Ruby a la ??? para una escena que completa la quest.",
    ["Go to La Theine Plateau and speak with Narvecaint (F-7) for another cutscene."] = "Ve a La Theine Plateau y habla con Narvecaint (F-7) para otra escena.",
    ["Go to Lower Jeuno and speak with Harnek inside the Tenshodo at (J-7) for a cutscene. You receive the key item Tenshodo envelope."] = "Ve a Lower Jeuno y habla con Harnek dentro del Tenshodo en (J-7) para una escena. Recibes el key item Tenshodo envelope.",
    ["Go to Lower Jeuno and speak with Ruslan (I-8) in the Merry Minstrel tavern."] = "Ve a Lower Jeuno y habla con Ruslan (I-8) en la taberna Merry Minstrel.",
    ["Go to Mhaura and speak with Kotan-Purutan at (I-9), near the ferry ticket area, after 18:00 Vana'diel time to obtain a Small bag."] = "Ve a Mhaura y habla con Kotan-Purutan en (I-9), cerca de la zona de billetes del ferry, después de las 18:00 hora de Vana'diel para obtener una Small bag.",
    ["Go to Mhaura and speak with Ripapa (I-9) to obtain a Lightning Pendulum."] = "Ve a Mhaura y habla con Ripapa (I-9) para obtener un Lightning Pendulum.",
    ["Go to Mhaura and talk with Fyi Chalmwoh at (G-8)."] = "Ve a Mhaura y habla con Fyi Chalmwoh en (G-8).",
    ["Go to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Eperdur (M-7) upstairs in the Cathedral to complete the quest and receive a Scroll of Teleport-Mea."] = "Ve a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Eperdur (M-7) arriba en la Cathedral para completar la quest y recibir un Scroll of Teleport-Mea.",
    ["Go to Oldton Movalpolos and speak with Brakobrik at (K-10). The closest warp is the Proto-Waypoint to the Geomagnetic Fount at (K-11), if you have it."] = "Ve a Oldton Movalpolos y habla con Brakobrik en (K-10). El warp más cercano es el Proto-Waypoint al Geomagnetic Fount en (K-11), si lo tienes.",
    ["Go to Oldton Movalpolos and speak with Rakorok at (K-10). This spawns the NM Bugallug, which must be defeated. It has around 5,000 HP and uses the standard Bugbear attacks (Earthshock, Heavy Whisk, Flying Hip Press, etc.)."] = "Ve a Oldton Movalpolos y habla con Rakorok en (K-10). Esto invoca al NM Bugallug, que hay que derrotar. Tiene unos 5,000 HP y usa los ataques estándar de Bugbear (Earthshock, Heavy Whisk, Flying Hip Press, etc.).",
    ["Go to Oldton Movalpolos for a cutscene upon zoning."] = "Ve a Oldton Movalpolos para una escena al entrar en la zona.",
    ["Go to Ordelle's Caves and obtain an Ordelle Chest Key from the monsters inside. Certain monsters in the cave drop it; to reach that area take path D on map 1, drop into the southeastern hole shown on map 2, then take path E. The high-level monsters Buds Bunny, Swagger Spruce and Targe Beetle do not aggro."] = "Ve a Ordelle's Caves y obtén una Ordelle Chest Key de los monstruos del interior. Ciertos monstruos de la cueva la sueltan; para llegar a esa zona toma el camino D del mapa 1, déjate caer por el agujero sureste que aparece en el mapa 2 y luego toma el camino E. Los monstruos de nivel alto Buds Bunny, Swagger Spruce y Targe Beetle no atacan.",
    ["Go to Ordelle's Caves. You can use the Abyssea La Theine Plateau warp and enter from La Theine Plateau (H-7), or the Survival Guide if you have picked it up."] = "Ve a Ordelle's Caves. Puedes usar el Abyssea La Theine Plateau warp y entrar desde La Theine Plateau (H-7), o la Survival Guide si la has conseguido.",
    ["Go to Palborough Mines and work your way to the top floor. You will find a ??? at (G-10) in a dead-end room."] = "Ve a Palborough Mines y abre camino hasta el piso superior. Encontrarás una ??? en (G-10) en una sala sin salida.",
    ["Go to Phomiuna Aqueducts, find a Wooden Ladder at (C-9) on the second map, and climb the ladder for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Phomiuna Aqueducts, busca una Wooden Ladder en (C-9) del segundo mapa y sube la escalera para una escena.",
    ["Go to Port Bastok and speak with Ravorara at (E-7), outside the Steaming Sheep Restaurant, for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Port Bastok y habla con Ravorara en (E-7), fuera del Steaming Sheep Restaurant, para una escena.",
    ["Go to Pso'Xja Home Point #1. Alternatively, travel to Beaucedine Glacier (H-8) and enter Pso'Xja; the Beaucedine Glacier Survival Guide brings you to (H-9), just south of the entrance."] = "Ve al Home Point #1 de Pso'Xja. Como alternativa, viaja a Beaucedine Glacier (H-8) y entra en Pso'Xja; la Survival Guide de Beaucedine Glacier te lleva a (H-9), justo al sur de la entrada.",
    ["Go to Rabao and speak with Agado-Pugado (G-9) to receive a Wind Pendulum."] = "Ve a Rabao y habla con Agado-Pugado (G-9) para recibir un Wind Pendulum.",
    ["Go to Ranpi-Monpi in the northern part of Windurst Waters (D-9) and trade him Woozyshroom x3 to receive the key item Ranpi-Monpi's special stew."] = "Ve a Ranpi-Monpi en la parte norte de Windurst Waters (D-9) y entrégale Woozyshroom x3 para recibir el key item Ranpi-Monpi's special stew.",
    ["Go to Selbina and trade the Quadav Stew to Elfriede (J-9)."] = "Ve a Selbina y entrega el Quadav Stew a Elfriede (J-9).",
    ["Go to Southern San d'Oria (G-6) and speak with Amaura. She needs certain ingredients to brew the medicine and gives you Amaura's formula, which lists them: 1 Insect Wing, 1 Malboro Vine and 1 Zinc Ore."] = "Ve a Southern San d'Oria (G-6) y habla con Amaura. Necesita ciertos ingredientes para preparar la medicina y te da Amaura's formula, que los enumera: 1 Insect Wing, 1 Malboro Vine y 1 Zinc Ore.",
    ["Go to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Hae Jakhya (G-9) to receive the overdue library book, \"A Song of Love\". She is on top of the wall, so take the passage at (F-8) to get up there."] = "Ve a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Hae Jakhya (G-9) para recibir el libro atrasado de la biblioteca, \"A Song of Love\". Está encima del muro, así que toma el pasaje en (F-8) para subir.",
    ["Go to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Sharzalion in the Lion Springs Tavern (K-6)."] = "Ve a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Sharzalion en la Lion Springs Tavern (K-6).",
    ["Go to Tahrongi Canyon (F-6) and examine the Tahrongi Cacti there to get a Tahrongi Cactus."] = "Ve a Tahrongi Canyon (F-6) y examina los Tahrongi Cacti de allí para conseguir un Tahrongi Cactus.",
    ["Go to The Boyahda Tree. Either obtain a Boyahda Coffer Key or pick the lock as a Thief."] = "Ve a The Boyahda Tree. Consigue una Boyahda Coffer Key o fuerza la cerradura como Thief.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis and find a Treasure Coffer."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis y encuentra un Treasure Coffer.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis and look for a ??? that spawns in one of four locations. It can be reached via Beaucedine Glacier, the Lycopodium warps or the Unity warp to the zone."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis y busca una ??? que aparece en una de cuatro ubicaciones. Se puede llegar por Beaucedine Glacier, los warps de Lycopodium o el Unity warp a la zona.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis. You can buy the permanent key item Magicked astrolabe for 10,000 gil from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8)."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis. Puedes comprar el key item permanente Magicked astrolabe por 10,000 gil a Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8).",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis. You can buy the permanent key item Magicked astrolabe for 10,000 gil from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8); it lets you open the doors in The Eldieme Necropolis by yourself."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis. Puedes comprar el key item permanente Magicked astrolabe por 10,000 gil a Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8); te permite abrir tú solo las puertas de The Eldieme Necropolis.",
    ["Go to Toraimarai Canal and locate the two ???. Black Mage is needed to investigate them; the rest of the quest does not require it."] = "Ve a Toraimarai Canal y localiza las dos ???. Se necesita Black Mage para investigarlas; el resto de la quest no lo requiere.",
    ["Go to Toraimarai Canal and open a Coffer there to obtain the Joker card. Various enemies in the zone drop the Toraimarai Coffer Key, or you can buy one from the Curio Vendor Moogle for 5,000 gil."] = "Ve a Toraimarai Canal y abre un Coffer allí para obtener la Joker card. Varios enemigos de la zona sueltan la Toraimarai Coffer Key, o puedes comprar una al Curio Vendor Moogle por 5,000 gil.",
    ["Go to Wajaom Woodlands (C-8) to enter Halvung. Go to (H-11) and examine the ??? to acquire a Lilac ribbon. The fastest way is the Wajaom Woodlands Survival Guide."] = "Ve a Wajaom Woodlands (C-8) para entrar en Halvung. Ve a (H-11) y examina la ??? para conseguir una Lilac ribbon. La forma más rápida es la Survival Guide de Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Go to West Sarutabaruta and defeat Crawler enemies there until one drops a Meteorite."] = "Ve a West Sarutabaruta y derrota allí a enemigos Crawler hasta que uno suelte un Meteorite.",
    ["Go to Windurst Walls (G-3) and check the door of the House of the Hero."] = "Ve a Windurst Walls (G-3) y revisa la puerta de la House of the Hero.",
    ["Go to Windurst Walls (G-3) and examine the door of the House of the Hero for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Windurst Walls (G-3) y examina la puerta de la House of the Hero para una escena.",
    ["Go to Windurst Waters South (a short walk away, or use Home Point #3) and speak with Honoi-Gomoi (E-7) for a cutscene. He is upstairs in his house, reached by a back stairway."] = "Ve a Windurst Waters South (a poca distancia, o usa el Home Point #3) y habla con Honoi-Gomoi (E-7) para una escena. Está arriba en su casa, a la que se llega por una escalera trasera.",
    ["Go to Windurst Waters and speak with Chamama at (F-10) (Home Point #4). She asks for Saruta Cotton x4 to make a Fake moustache."] = "Ve a Windurst Waters y habla con Chamama en (F-10) (Home Point #4). Pide Saruta Cotton x4 para hacer un Fake moustache.",
    ["Go to a Gate Sentry in an area that your nation controls and speak with him. A Reinforcement appears and follows you. Escort it to the outpost of that zone."] = "Ve a un Gate Sentry de una zona que controle tu nación y habla con él. Aparece un Reinforcement que te sigue. Escóltalo hasta el puesto avanzado de esa zona.",
    ["Go to any Telepoint and trade a synthesis crystal to receive a Faded Crystal."] = "Ve a cualquier Telepoint y entrega un synthesis crystal para recibir un Faded Crystal.",
    ["Go to the ??? at the northeast corner of (G-9)."] = "Ve a la ??? en la esquina noreste de (G-9).",
    ["Go to the Azouph Isle Staging Point in Caedarva Mire (K-9). Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Azouph Isle Staging Point en Caedarva Mire (K-9). Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Dvucca Isle Staging Point in Caedarva Mire (I-9). Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Dvucca Isle Staging Point en Caedarva Mire (I-9). Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Full Moon Fountain. It helps to home point at Toraimarai Canal #1 beforehand, or you can warp to Toraimarai Canal with the Survival Guide."] = "Ve a la Full Moon Fountain. Ayuda registrar el home point en Toraimarai Canal #1 antes, o puedes teletransportarte a Toraimarai Canal con la Survival Guide.",
    ["Go to the Giwahb Watchtower in Wajaom Woodlands (F-5) and trade the Frayed Arrow to the door for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives you 500 Imperial Standing."] = "Ve a la Giwahb Watchtower en Wajaom Woodlands (F-5) y entrega la Frayed Arrow a la puerta para una escena que completa la quest y te da 500 Imperial Standing.",
    ["Go to the Halvung Staging Point inside Mount Zhayolm. Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Halvung Staging Point dentro de Mount Zhayolm. Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point in Arrapago Reef (G-5). Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point en Arrapago Reef (G-5). Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Leypoint in Wajaom Woodlands (G-8) and trade the Rusty Medal for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives you 500 Imperial Standing."] = "Ve al Leypoint de Wajaom Woodlands (G-8) y entrega la Rusty Medal para una escena que completa la quest y te da 500 Imperial Standing.",
    ["Go to the Mamool Ja Staging Point inside Bhaflau Thickets. Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Mamool Ja Staging Point dentro de Bhaflau Thickets. Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Manaclipper in Bibiki Bay and take the tour that goes to Purgonorgo Isle; the clipper does three tours."] = "Ve al Manaclipper de Bibiki Bay y toma el tour que va a Purgonorgo Isle; el clipper hace tres tours.",
    ["Go to the Maze of Shakhrami and defeat Wight enemies to obtain a Rusty Key."] = "Ve a Maze of Shakhrami y derrota a enemigos Wight para obtener una Rusty Key.",
    ["Go to the Maze of Shakhrami and speak with Ahko Mhalijikhari (C-9) to receive the level cap status. The level cap is 25, Trust magic is usable and buffs do not wear off."] = "Ve a Maze of Shakhrami y habla con Ahko Mhalijikhari (C-9) para recibir el estado de límite de nivel. El límite es 25, la Trust magic se puede usar y los buffs no desaparecen.",
    ["Go to the Maze of Shakhrami."] = "Ve a Maze of Shakhrami.",
    ["Go to the Nyzul Isle Staging Point in Alzadaal Undersea Ruins. Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Nyzul Isle Staging Point en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins. Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Ore Door at (H-7) and trade the Whine Cellar Key to it for a cutscene and the key item Foe Finder Mk. I."] = "Ve a la Ore Door en (H-7) y entrégale la Whine Cellar Key para una escena y el key item Foe Finder Mk. I.",
    ["Go to the Riverbed in Grauberg (S) (F-13). To extract gold you must wash away as much sediment as possible without washing away any gold dust, so wash carefully."] = "Ve al Riverbed de Grauberg (S) (F-13). Para extraer oro debes lavar la mayor cantidad posible de sedimento sin llevarte el polvo de oro, así que lava con cuidado.",
    ["Go to the Rock Slab in Arrapago Reef (H-10), on map 1. You end up in the correct area to continue after the conclusion of Against All Odds."] = "Ve a la Rock Slab en Arrapago Reef (H-10), en el mapa 1. Terminas en la zona correcta para continuar tras la conclusión de Against All Odds.",
    ["Go to the Shararat Teahouse (J-12) for another cutscene."] = "Ve a la Shararat Teahouse (J-12) para otra escena.",
    ["Go to the Shararat Teahouse (K-12), on the upper level, and talk to either Ulamaal or Qutiba for another cutscene."] = "Ve a la Shararat Teahouse (K-12), en el nivel superior, y habla con Ulamaal o con Qutiba para otra escena.",
    ["Go to the basement of Crawlers' Nest and obtain a Bag of Seeds, which drops from a Fire Elemental or a Water Elemental."] = "Ve al sótano de Crawlers' Nest y obtén una Bag of Seeds, que cae de un Fire Elemental o de un Water Elemental.",
    ["Go to the dead end at (E-10) in Davoi and examine the Disused Well to receive the Knight's soul. To get there, follow the river west from (J-10), then head south after reaching (D-8)."] = "Ve al callejón sin salida en (E-10) de Davoi y examina el Disused Well para recibir el Knight's soul. Para llegar, sigue el río al oeste desde (J-10) y luego ve al sur al llegar a (D-8).",
    ["Go to the lower level of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) to trigger a cutscene, near the NPC Hajaom."] = "Ve al nivel inferior de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) para activar una escena, cerca del NPC Hajaom.",
    ["Go to the northern Rhinostery building and speak with Kerutoto in Windurst Waters South (J-8); the quest is added to your quest log."] = "Ve al edificio norte del Rhinostery y habla con Kerutoto en Windurst Waters South (J-8); la quest se añade a tu quest log.",
    ["Go to the pond at (E-5) and defeat Evil Weapon enemies until you get a Glittersand."] = "Ve al estanque en (E-5) y derrota a enemigos Evil Weapon hasta conseguir una Glittersand.",
    ["Go upstairs and examine the Audience Chamber."] = "Sube las escaleras y examina la Audience Chamber.",
    ["Grin shows you a picture of an NPC that you must memorize."] = "Grin te muestra una imagen de un NPC que debes memorizar.",
    ["Guide and protect Professor Clavauert B Chanoix to the room at (J-5) or (G-9)."] = "Guía y protege al Professor Clavauert B Chanoix hasta la sala de (J-5) o (G-9).",
    ["Guslam mentions that there is still armor scattered about Vana'diel. These coffers are not required to complete the quest: once you receive your hands the quest is completed, but it must be either active or completed for you to receive those attire pieces."] = "Guslam menciona que aún quedan armaduras dispersas por Vana'diel. Esos cofres no son necesarios para completar la quest: cuando recibes tus guantes la quest se da por completada, pero debe estar activa o completada para que recibas esas piezas de atuendo.",
    ["Guslam mentions that there is still armor scattered about Vana'diel. These coffers are not required to complete the quest: once you receive your hands the quest is completed."] = "Guslam menciona que aún quedan armaduras dispersas por Vana'diel. Esos cofres no son necesarios para completar la quest: cuando recibes tus guantes la quest se da por completada.",
    ["Guslam mentions that there is still armor scattered about Vana'diel. These coffers are not required to complete the quest: once you receive your hands the quest is completed. Borghertz's Warring Hands must either be active or completed for you to receive those attire pieces."] = "Guslam menciona que aún quedan armaduras dispersas por Vana'diel. Esos cofres no son necesarios para completar la quest: cuando recibes tus guantes la quest se da por completada. Borghertz's Warring Hands debe estar activa o completada para que recibas esas piezas de atuendo.",
    ["Guslam mentions that there is still armor scattered about Vana'diel. You can find two more pieces of armor by opening coffers in other zones with the corresponding coffer key. These coffers are not required to complete the quest: once you receive your hands the quest is completed."] = "Guslam menciona que aún quedan armaduras dispersas por Vana'diel. Puedes encontrar dos piezas más abriendo cofres en otras zonas con la coffer key correspondiente. Esos cofres no son necesarios para completar la quest: cuando recibes tus guantes la quest se da por completada.",
    ["Habaneros can be bought at the Auction House (Food, Ingredients) or from regional vendors, grown from Herb Seeds in your Mog Garden, or farmed from Mantrap enemies in Misareaux Coast."] = "Los Habaneros se pueden comprar en la Auction House (Food, Ingredients) o a vendedores regionales, cultivarse con Herb Seeds en tu Mog Garden o farmearse de enemigos Mantrap en Misareaux Coast.",
    ["Hand out 15 flyers to NPCs around the city"] = "Reparte 15 folletos a los NPCs de la ciudad",
    ["Hand out the 15 Magicmart Flyers, only to townsfolk and not to adventurers. While the quest is active, when you come close to an NPC who should get a flyer, a message in /say tells you that the NPC looks over curiously for a moment."] = "Reparte los 15 Magicmart Flyers, solo a los habitantes del pueblo y no a aventureros. Mientras la quest está activa, cuando te acercas a un NPC que debe recibir un folleto, un mensaje en /say te indica que el NPC mira con curiosidad por un momento.",
    ["Harvest at the ??? at (E-5) to obtain the Blazing Pepper."] = "Cosecha en la ??? en (E-5) para obtener el Blazing Pepper.",
    ["Having Windurst Mission 2-1 active prevents you from starting this quest. Nanaa Mihgo is involved in several quests and missions, so you may have to speak with her several times to trigger the cutscene that starts it."] = "Tener activa la Windurst Mission 2-1 te impide empezar esta quest. Nanaa Mihgo participa en varias quests y misiones, así que puede que tengas que hablar con ella varias veces para activar la escena que la inicia.",
    ["He also accepts a Snobby Letter. In total the quest pays between 120 and 5,500 gil, depending on the item."] = "También acepta una Snobby Letter. En total la quest paga entre 120 y 5,500 gil, según el objeto.",
    ["He asks you to arrange a meeting with the thief in Nashmau. Head to Nashmau and seek out Dnegan at (H-6), on the second floor. Do not choose \"Ask about the automaton.\"; choose either of the other first dialogue options to continue."] = "Te pide que organices un encuentro con el ladrón en Nashmau. Ve a Nashmau y busca a Dnegan en (H-6), en el segundo piso. No elijas \"Ask about the automaton.\"; elige cualquiera de las otras opciones de diálogo iniciales para continuar.",
    ["He asks you to bring him a few items from a list of possible requests."] = "Te pide que le traigas algunos objetos de una lista de posibles peticiones.",
    ["He asks you to go to Nashmau and search for the culprit. Once in Nashmau, proceed to (H-6) (second floor) and speak with Dnegan."] = "Te pide que vayas a Nashmau y busques al culpable. Una vez en Nashmau, ve a (H-6) (segundo piso) y habla con Dnegan.",
    ["He offers a divination for 1,000 gil and asks a series of questions. Upon success, Waoud mentions seeing all five serpent symbols. It is possible not to be able to progress further, as he may mention only one serpent."] = "Te ofrece una adivinación por 1,000 gil y te hace una serie de preguntas. Si lo consigues, Waoud menciona haber visto los cinco símbolos de serpiente. Es posible no poder avanzar, ya que puede mencionar solo una serpiente.",
    ["Head back to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Prince Trion for your reward."] = "Vuelve a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Prince Trion para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Head back to Horatius to trade the Dangruf Stone and receive your reward, 400 gil."] = "Vuelve con Horatius para entregar la Dangruf Stone y recibir tu recompensa, 400 gil.",
    ["Head back to Kubhe Ijyuhla, who started the quest, for another cutscene."] = "Vuelve con Kubhe Ijyuhla, que empezó la quest, para otra escena.",
    ["Head back to Norg and speak with Ryoma to complete the quest and receive your reward, Anju and Zushio."] = "Vuelve a Norg y habla con Ryoma para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa, Anju y Zushio.",
    ["Head back to Oldton Movalpolos and speak with Koblakiq to complete the quest and receive your Jaguar Mantle."] = "Vuelve a Oldton Movalpolos y habla con Koblakiq para completar la quest y recibir tu Jaguar Mantle.",
    ["Head back to the Stone Monument in Riverne - Site #A01 and check it for a cutscene. Examine it again to spawn the NM Arcane Phantasm."] = "Vuelve al Stone Monument de Riverne - Site #A01 y revísalo para una escena. Examínalo de nuevo para invocar al NM Arcane Phantasm.",
    ["Head north up the ramp, then take the first left and continue west-northwest toward (H-10)."] = "Ve al norte subiendo la rampa, luego toma la primera a la izquierda y continúa al oeste-noroeste hacia (H-10).",
    ["Head north, down the stairs, and hit the lever to go through the middle door at (H-6). Then north again, down the stairs, and hit the lever for the left door this time."] = "Ve al norte, baja las escaleras y golpea la palanca para pasar por la puerta del medio en (H-6). Luego al norte de nuevo, baja las escaleras y golpea la palanca de la puerta izquierda esta vez.",
    ["Head northwest to (E-8) and check the Viscous Liquid for a cutscene."] = "Ve al noroeste hasta (E-8) y revisa el Viscous Liquid para una escena.",
    ["Head out to Zegham Hill in North Gustaberg. Go up the winding hill until you reach the peak and find a monument at (J-7). Alternatively, use the Port Bastok exit near Home Point #1 and in North Gustaberg climb starting on the southwest part of the hill, in a patch of trees at the (H-8)/(I-8) border."] = "Ve a Zegham Hill en North Gustaberg. Sube por la colina serpenteante hasta la cima y encuentra un monument en (J-7). Alternativamente, usa la salida de Port Bastok cerca del Home Point #1 y en North Gustaberg sube empezando por la parte suroeste de la colina, en un grupo de árboles en el límite (H-8)/(I-8).",
    ["Head south to enter a large square room and trade Gerwitz's Sword to the ??? at (H-10) to spawn Gerwitz's Soul."] = "Ve al sur para entrar en una gran sala cuadrada y entrega Gerwitz's Sword a la ??? en (H-10) para invocar a Gerwitz's Soul.",
    ["Head south to zone out of Mount Zhayolm, then zone back in."] = "Ve al sur para salir de Mount Zhayolm y vuelve a entrar.",
    ["Head to (B-8), the Secret Beach, in Valkurm Dunes. The Survival Guide teleport to Gustav Tunnel, then walking out, leaves you right next to the spawn point."] = "Ve a (B-8), la Secret Beach, en Valkurm Dunes. El teletransporte de la Survival Guide a Gustav Tunnel, y luego salir caminando, te deja justo al lado del punto de aparición.",
    ["Head to (G-8) in Wajaom Woodlands and trade the Hydrogauge to the Leypoint."] = "Ve a (G-8) en Wajaom Woodlands y entrega el Hydrogauge al Leypoint.",
    ["Head to (H-6) to find a ???. It is on the top floor; do not go down the stairs. It is advised to clear the area around the ???."] = "Ve a (H-6) para encontrar una ???. Está en el piso superior; no bajes las escaleras. Se aconseja eliminar a los enemigos de alrededor de la ???.",
    ["Head to (I-8) and trade the Quadav Charm to the Jail Door, on the ground floor, for a cutscene and a Trader's sack."] = "Ve a (I-8) y entrega el Quadav Charm a la Jail Door, en la planta baja, para una escena y un Trader's sack.",
    ["Head to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and talk to Iruki-Waraki (K-9, top floor)."] = "Ve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla con Iruki-Waraki (K-9, piso superior).",
    ["Head to Beadeaux and kill a De'Vyu Headhunter to obtain a Quadav Charm."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y mata a un De'Vyu Headhunter para obtener un Quadav Charm.",
    ["Head to Boneyard Gully and select \"Tango with a Tracker\" at the Dark Miasma to enter a battlefield."] = "Ve a Boneyard Gully y selecciona \"Tango with a Tracker\" en el Dark Miasma para entrar en un campo de batalla.",
    ["Head to Caedarva Mire and click the ??? at (K-8)."] = "Ve a Caedarva Mire y haz clic en la ??? en (K-8).",
    ["Head to Castle Oztroja and go to the Brass Door at (I-8)."] = "Ve a Castle Oztroja y dirígete a la Brass Door en (I-8).",
    ["Head to Castle Zvahl Baileys and fight Blood Demons and Demon Generals until you obtain a Demon Pen."] = "Ve a Castle Zvahl Baileys y lucha contra Blood Demons y Demon Generals hasta que obtengas una Demon Pen.",
    ["Head to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Chalvatot at (F-7) to receive the Moon ring."] = "Ve a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Chalvatot en (F-7) para recibir el Moon ring.",
    ["Head to Crawlers' Nest and open a Treasure Chest with a Nest Chest Key to obtain the key item Crawler blood. The chest has a 3 minute respawn time."] = "Ve a Crawlers' Nest y abre un Treasure Chest con una Nest Chest Key para obtener el key item Crawler blood. El cofre reaparece a los 3 minutos.",
    ["Head to Eldieme Necropolis from Batallia Downs (I-10). As soon as you zone in you receive a cutscene, after which the NPC Cannau appears. You can summon Trusts, but zoning in with an Adventuring Fellow makes the escort NPC disappear."] = "Ve a Eldieme Necropolis desde Batallia Downs (I-10). En cuanto entras en la zona recibes una escena, tras la cual aparece el NPC Cannau. Puedes invocar Trusts, pero entrar con un Adventuring Fellow hace desaparecer al NPC escoltado.",
    ["Head to Gusgen Mines and speak with Degga (H-9). Your level will be restricted to 25."] = "Ve a Gusgen Mines y habla con Degga (H-9). Tu nivel quedará limitado a 25.",
    ["Head to Horlais Peak by going through Yughott Grotto."] = "Ve a Horlais Peak pasando por Yughott Grotto.",
    ["Head to Ifrit's Cauldron using the entrance from (G-6) in Yhoator Jungle. The Survival Guide can also bring you there."] = "Ve a Ifrit's Cauldron por la entrada de (G-6) en Yhoator Jungle. La Survival Guide también te puede llevar.",
    ["Head to Jade Sepulcher and click the battlefield entrance (Ornamental Door) for a cutscene. The Home Point #1 warp from Aht Urhgan Whitegate to Bhaflau Thickets makes this fast."] = "Ve a Jade Sepulcher y haz clic en la entrada del campo de batalla (Ornamental Door) para una escena. El warp del Home Point #1 de Aht Urhgan Whitegate a Bhaflau Thickets lo hace rápido.",
    ["Head to Jugner Forest through King Ranperre's Tomb. If you have access to the Proto-Waypoint, it is the fastest way to reach the location."] = "Ve a Jugner Forest por King Ranperre's Tomb. Si tienes acceso al Proto-Waypoint, es la forma más rápida de llegar al lugar.",
    ["Head to Korroloka Tunnel. You need to fill the flask by interacting with four different Giant Clams. The first Giant Clam is at (F-10) on map 1, as you zone into Korroloka Tunnel from Zeruhn Mines."] = "Ve a Korroloka Tunnel. Debes llenar el frasco interactuando con cuatro Giant Clams distintas. La primera Giant Clam está en (F-10) del mapa 1, al entrar en Korroloka Tunnel desde Zeruhn Mines.",
    ["Head to Kuftal Tunnel and examine the ??? just inside the entrance for a cutscene, with your party members close by. You and your party overlook the Kuftal Tunnel."] = "Ve a Kuftal Tunnel y examina la ??? justo en la entrada para una escena, con los miembros de tu grupo cerca. Tú y tu grupo contempláis el Kuftal Tunnel.",
    ["Head to La Theine Plateau and check the Chocobo Tracks at the far northwest corner of (E-5), just south of the sliver of map in (E-4)."] = "Ve a La Theine Plateau y revisa las Chocobo Tracks en la esquina noroeste de (E-5), justo al sur del trocito de mapa en (E-4).",
    ["Head to Mamook using the (E-12) entrance in Wajaom Woodlands."] = "Ve a Mamook por la entrada (E-12) de Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Head to Metalworks, Home Point #1 (J-8), and speak with Naji."] = "Ve a Metalworks, Home Point #1 (J-8), y habla con Naji.",
    ["Head to Mount Zhayolm and click on the Sprightly Footsteps at (L-7) between 18:00 and 06:00. The Voidwatch teleport takes you to the exact location; casting Escape from inside Halvung puts you at (L-7), just north of the location."] = "Ve a Mount Zhayolm y haz clic en las Sprightly Footsteps en (L-7) entre las 18:00 y las 06:00. El teletransporte de Voidwatch te lleva al lugar exacto; lanzar Escape desde dentro de Halvung te deja en (L-7), justo al norte del lugar.",
    ["Head to Nashmau and zone into Caedarva Mire at (G-7), on the second floor (west exit). The battlefield Puppetmaster Blues has a maximum of 6 people and a time limit of 30 minutes."] = "Ve a Nashmau y entra en Caedarva Mire en (G-7), en el segundo piso (salida oeste). El campo de batalla Puppetmaster Blues admite un máximo de 6 personas y tiene un límite de tiempo de 30 minutos.",
    ["Head to Norg and talk to Sohyon (J-8). Then talk to Washu to receive the key item Washu's flask."] = "Ve a Norg y habla con Sohyon (J-8). Luego habla con Washu para recibir el key item Washu's flask.",
    ["Head to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Mulaujeant at (E-5), on the second floor near the Blacksmithing Guild."] = "Ve a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Mulaujeant en (E-5), en el segundo piso cerca del Blacksmithing Guild.",
    ["Head to Oldton Movalpolos and defeat Moblin Ashman and Moblin Gurneyman enemies until one drops a Moblin Hotrok. Alternatively, go to Newton Movalpolos and defeat Moblin Groundman enemies."] = "Ve a Oldton Movalpolos y derrota a enemigos Moblin Ashman y Moblin Gurneyman hasta que uno suelte un Moblin Hotrok. Como alternativa, ve a Newton Movalpolos y derrota a enemigos Moblin Groundman.",
    ["Head to Qufim Island and kill Dancing Weapon enemies until you obtain a Kaiser Sword. Kaiser Swords can also sometimes be found at the Auction House."] = "Ve a Qufim Island y mata enemigos Dancing Weapon hasta conseguir una Kaiser Sword. A veces también se pueden encontrar Kaiser Swords en la Auction House.",
    ["Head to Rabao and talk to Zoriboh (F-6) to complete the quest and receive your reward, the Venerer Ring and 4,000 gil."] = "Ve a Rabao y habla con Zoriboh (F-6) para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa, el Venerer Ring y 4,000 gil.",
    ["Head to Salaheem's Sentinels in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) for a cutscene with Abquhbah, who redirects you to Hagakoff at (K-10)."] = "Ve a Salaheem's Sentinels en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para una escena con Abquhbah, que te redirige a Hagakoff en (K-10).",
    ["Head to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Sharzalion, and then with Daggao, who is in the bar as well."] = "Ve a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Sharzalion, y luego con Daggao, que también está en el bar.",
    ["Head to Uleguerand Range and climb to the top, where Jormungand spawns."] = "Ve a Uleguerand Range y sube hasta lo alto, donde aparece Jormungand.",
    ["Head to Upper Jeuno and speak with Brutus at (G-7). This quest starts the first time you speak to him, together with Chocobo's Wounds."] = "Ve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Brutus en (G-7). Esta quest empieza la primera vez que le hablas, junto con Chocobo's Wounds.",
    ["Head to Wajaom Woodlands (D-9) and zone into Aydeewa Subterrane. Reach (G-10) on map 3 for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Wajaom Woodlands (D-9) y entra en Aydeewa Subterrane. Llega a (G-10) del mapa 3 para una escena.",
    ["Head to Wajaom Woodlands (K-7) and check the ??? at night (after 20:00 game time) for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Wajaom Woodlands (K-7) y revisa la ??? de noche (después de las 20:00 hora del juego) para una escena.",
    ["Head to West Ronfaure and look for Esca inside a tower at (F-6)."] = "Ve a West Ronfaure y busca a Esca dentro de una torre en (F-6).",
    ["Head to the (G/H-10) boundary and exit into Wajaom Woodlands through the Ironbound Gate. As you zone, you watch a cutscene."] = "Ve al límite (G/H-10) y sal a Wajaom Woodlands por la Ironbound Gate. Al cambiar de zona, ves una escena.",
    ["Head to the Alchemy Guild at (G-5) for a cutscene."] = "Ve al Alchemy Guild en (G-5) para una escena.",
    ["Head to the Ashu Talif in Arrapago Reef through the Dvucca Isle Staging Point or Alzadaal Undersea Ruins. To access the Cutter, first travel to the Dvucca Isle Staging Point and leave it, which puts you in Caedarva Mire (Map 2)."] = "Ve al Ashu Talif de Arrapago Reef por el Dvucca Isle Staging Point o las Alzadaal Undersea Ruins. Para acceder al Cutter, primero ve al Dvucca Isle Staging Point y sal de él, lo que te deja en Caedarva Mire (Map 2).",
    ["Head to the Dilapidated Gate in Misareaux Coast at (F-7)."] = "Dirígete a la Dilapidated Gate en Misareaux Coast, en (F-7).",
    ["Head to the island in Batallia Downs (J-11). The only way to get there is through The Eldieme Necropolis: enter it from (I-10) in Batallia Downs. The Survival Guide puts you in the correct part of the Eldieme for this quest."] = "Ve a la isla de Batallia Downs (J-11). La única forma de llegar es por The Eldieme Necropolis: entra desde (I-10) en Batallia Downs. La Survival Guide te deja en la parte correcta de la Eldieme para esta quest.",
    ["Head to the room at (H-9) and mine in it until you find one of three key items: Electrocell, Electropot or Electrolocomotive. This is the same room where you finish the Blue Mage flag quest."] = "Ve a la sala en (H-9) y mina en ella hasta encontrar uno de tres key items: Electrocell, Electropot o Electrolocomotive. Es la misma sala donde terminas la quest de flag de Blue Mage.",
    ["Head toward the west side of the zone around (K-9)."] = "Dirígete hacia el lado oeste de la zona, cerca de (K-9).",
    ["Head towards Sea Serpent Grotto; you get another cutscene shortly before you reach the zone line."] = "Dirígete a Sea Serpent Grotto; verás otra escena poco antes de llegar a la línea de zona.",
    ["Head up to the second floor of the safehold and examine the ??? behind the pillar at (K-9), near the Walnut Door. You obtain the Alabaster hairpin."] = "Sube al segundo piso del safehold y examina la ??? tras el pilar en (K-9), cerca de la Walnut Door. Obtienes la Alabaster hairpin.",
    ["Head west to (F-9) and zone into Arrapago Reef through entrance 3. Head north to (H-8) to find the Cutter."] = "Ve al oeste hasta (F-9) y entra en Arrapago Reef por la entrada 3. Ve al norte hasta (H-8) para encontrar el Cutter.",
    ["Help the chocobo leave when prompted."] = "Ayuda al chocobo a marcharse cuando se te pida.",
    ["Hieronymus sends you to the Quartermaster at (H-9) in Bastok Markets (S). Obtain the supplies that he requests, either by gathering them or by buying them at the Auction House, and hand them over."] = "Hieronymus te envía al Quartermaster at (H-9) in Bastok Markets (S). Consigue los suministros que pide, ya sea recolectándolos o comprándolos en la Auction House, y entrégaselos.",
    ["Home points only set where you return after being knocked out. They don't teleport you."] = "Los home points solo fijan dónde vuelves tras ser noqueado. No te teletransportan.",
    ["How Phoenix differs from retail"] = "Diferencias de Phoenix con el juego original",
    ["Hungry Wolf, Metalworks"] = "Hungry Wolf, Metalworks",
    ["Hunt Orcish Fodders in East or West Ronfaure for an Orcish Axe."] = "Caza Orcish Fodders en East o West Ronfaure para conseguir un Orcish Axe.",
    ["Huu Xalmo the Savage drops the Xalmo Feather. Trade the feather to Ayame for your Temple Hose."] = "Huu Xalmo the Savage suelta la Xalmo Feather. Entrega la pluma a Ayame por tus Temple Hose.",
    ["If Champion of the Dawn blocks your progress, enter Walk of Echoes from Xarcabard (S) and complete the required Wings of the Goddess progression first."] = "Si Champion of the Dawn bloquea tu progreso, entra en el Walk of Echoes desde Xarcabard (S) y completa primero la progresión de Wings of the Goddess requerida.",
    ["If Gilgamesh directs you to Jakoh Wahcondalo, speak with Jakoh Wahcondalo (J-9) at (J-9) in Kazham."] = "Si Gilgamesh te envía con Jakoh Wahcondalo, habla con Jakoh Wahcondalo (J-9) en (J-9), en Kazham.",
    ["If Halver directs you to Rahal, follow the requested storyline before returning."] = "Si Halver te envía con Rahal, sigue la historia que te pida antes de volver.",
    ["If Suldiran is taken prisoner during Besieged, this quest is unavailable until he is rescued. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Si Suldiran es hecho prisionero durante Besieged, esta quest no está disponible hasta que sea rescatado. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["If Treasures of Aht Urhgan is complete through Royal Puppeteer, examine Imperial Whitegate (L-9)."] = "Si Treasures of Aht Urhgan está completo hasta Royal Puppeteer, examina la Imperial Whitegate (L-9).",
    ["If Treasures of Aht Urhgan is not yet complete, continue that storyline until Royal Puppeteer."] = "Si Treasures of Aht Urhgan aún no está completo, continúa esa historia hasta Royal Puppeteer.",
    ["If Wings of the Goddess has not been started, receive Lightsworm here."] = "Si Wings of the Goddess no se ha empezado, recibe Lightsworm aquí.",
    ["If Wings of the Goddess is complete, examine the sparkling ??? beside a Cavernous Maw in Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields, or Sauromugue Champaign."] = "Si Wings of the Goddess está completo, examina la ??? reluciente junto a un Cavernous Maw en Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields o Sauromugue Champaign.",
    ["If Wings of the Goddess is incomplete, progress to at least In the Name of the Father and zone into Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Si Wings of the Goddess está incompleto, avanza al menos hasta In the Name of the Father y entra en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["If Zayhi-Bauhi speaks normally instead of coughing, speak with Kalupa-Tawalupa and Rutango-Botango in front of him to receive the quest."] = "Si Zayhi-Bauhi habla con normalidad en lugar de toser, habla con Kalupa-Tawalupa y Rutango-Botango delante de él para recibir la quest.",
    ["If multiple people are doing the quest, you will have to wait 5 minutes for the monsters to pop again."] = "Si varias personas hacen la quest, tendrás que esperar 5 minutos a que los monstruos aparezcan de nuevo.",
    ["If several people are doing the quest, wait 3 minutes after it dies for it to appear again."] = "Si varias personas hacen la quest, espera 3 minutos tras su muerte para que aparezca de nuevo.",
    ["If the Batallia Downs [H-5] Maw route leaves you in the wrong section for the next mission, exit and use one of the other Walk of Echoes entrances."] = "Si la ruta del Maw de Batallia Downs [H-5] te deja en la sección equivocada para la siguiente misión, sal y usa una de las otras entradas del Walk of Echoes.",
    ["If the Nyzul Isle staging point is not yet accessible, trade one Imperial Silver Piece to Kamih Mapokhalam in Bhaflau Thickets (F-6) to open the route."] = "Si el Nyzul Isle staging point aún no es accesible, entrega una Imperial Silver Piece a Kamih Mapokhalam en Bhaflau Thickets (F-6) para abrir la ruta.",
    ["If the Southern San d'Oria (S) event does not occur, first examine the sparkling ??? beside a present-day Cavernous Maw."] = "Si no se produce el evento de Southern San d'Oria (S), examina primero la ??? reluciente junto a un Cavernous Maw actual.",
    ["If the Temple Guardian blocks the route, defeat it to open the way, then continue through the nearby passage."] = "Si el Temple Guardian bloquea la ruta, derrótalo para abrir el paso y luego continúa por el pasaje cercano.",
    ["If the battle is failed, return after one Vana'diel day and obtain another permit from Nahshib."] = "Si fallas la batalla, vuelve tras un día de Vana'diel y obtén otro permiso de Nahshib.",
    ["If the home-nation event appears during this progression, return there and continue to Aht Urhgan Whitegate afterward."] = "Si el evento de la nación de origen aparece durante esta progresión, vuelve allí y continúa después a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["If the opening dialogue does not occur, proceed to the Captain's Chamber and speak with Gilgamesh (L-8) there."] = "Si no se produce el diálogo inicial, ve a la Captain's Chamber y habla allí con Gilgamesh (L-8).",
    ["If the opening event does not occur, examine a Tales' Beginning at one of those locations."] = "Si no se produce el evento inicial, examina un Tales' Beginning en una de esas ubicaciones.",
    ["If the quest Class Reunion is active, finish it first: you cannot start this quest until it is complete."] = "Si la quest Class Reunion está activa, termínala primero: no puedes empezar esta quest hasta completarla.",
    ["If the relevant rank missions were already completed, speak with Halver at Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) for Cipher: Halver's Alter Ego."] = "Si las rank missions relevantes ya estaban completadas, habla con Halver en Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) para Cipher: Halver's Alter Ego.",
    ["If the relevant rank missions were already completed, speak with Kupipi in Heavens Tower for Cipher: Semih's Alter Ego."] = "Si las rank missions relevantes ya estaban completadas, habla con Kupipi en Heavens Tower para Cipher: Semih's Alter Ego.",
    ["If the rod does not drop, rezone without touching the Hume Bones and repeat the quest from the beginning for another chance."] = "Si la vara no cae, cambia de zona sin tocar los Hume Bones y repite la quest desde el principio para otra oportunidad.",
    ["If the route requires the Silvery Plate, travel to Outer Ra'Kaznar and examine ??? (C-7)."] = "Si la ruta exige el Silvery Plate, viaja a Outer Ra'Kaznar y examina ??? (C-7).",
    ["If the staging point was just unlocked, return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and use the Runic Portal to reach Nyzul Isle."] = "Si acabas de desbloquear el staging point, vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y usa el Runic Portal para llegar a Nyzul Isle.",
    ["If the yellow Seed Afterglow is not at its usual location, check the circular room around (H-9)/(I-9)."] = "Si el Seed Afterglow amarillo no está en su sitio habitual, revisa la sala circular cerca de (H-9)/(I-9).",
    ["If there is no room for the flag, retrieve it from the reward object near the battlefield exit."] = "Si no tienes espacio para la bandera, recógela del objeto de recompensa cerca de la salida del campo de batalla.",
    ["If there is weather when you attempt the quest, you have to wait for it to clear up to find the ???."] = "Si hay clima cuando intentas la quest, tienes que esperar a que despeje para encontrar la ???.",
    ["If this is not your first Trust quest, you are finished with the quest at this point and receive the Bastok Trust permit."] = "Si no es tu primera quest de Trust, terminas la quest en este punto y recibes el Bastok Trust permit.",
    ["If this is your first AF, do the following steps; otherwise skip them. Go to Port Jeuno and head to the crates near the Auction House and the Jeuno Duty-Free Shop at (H-8), and click on the ??? for a cutscene."] = "Si es tu primer AF, haz los siguientes pasos; si no, sáltatelos. Ve a Port Jeuno y dirígete a las cajas junto a la Auction House y la Jeuno Duty-Free Shop en (H-8), y haz clic en la ??? para una escena.",
    ["If this is your first Magicite mission, speak with Paya-Sabya."] = "Si es tu primera misión de Magicite, habla con Paya-Sabya.",
    ["If this is your first Trust quest, you must use the Trust spell Kupipi in West Sarutabaruta or East Sarutabaruta, then return to Kupipi to receive the Windurst Trust permit."] = "Si es tu primera quest de Trust, debes usar el hechizo de Trust Kupipi en West Sarutabaruta o East Sarutabaruta, y luego volver con Kupipi para recibir el Windurst Trust permit.",
    ["If this is your first Trust quest, you must use the Trust spell Naji in South Gustaberg or North Gustaberg. After that, return to Naji to receive the Bastok Trust permit."] = "Si es tu primera quest de Trust, debes usar el hechizo de Trust Naji en South Gustaberg o North Gustaberg. Después, vuelve con Naji para recibir el Bastok Trust permit.",
    ["If this is your first time heading to Xarcabard, you may use the Unity level 125 warp to Xarcabard."] = "Si es la primera vez que vas a Xarcabard, puedes usar el warp de Unity de nivel 125 a Xarcabard.",
    ["If you activate an incorrect switch you have to start from the beginning. When you try to activate a switch, Salim may appear. If the same character gets captured twice, the quest ends."] = "Si activas un interruptor incorrecto tienes que empezar desde el principio. Al intentar activar un interruptor, puede aparecer Salim. Si el mismo personaje es capturado dos veces, la quest termina.",
    ["If you answer all the questions correctly, you are sent after a Tahrongi Cactus."] = "Si respondes bien todas las preguntas, te envían a buscar un Tahrongi Cactus.",
    ["If you are doing the quest for multiple people, you must wait 4 minutes for the Forger to respawn for another Bomb Steel, and you only need to kill the Treant once."] = "Si haces la quest para varias personas, debes esperar 4 minutos a que reaparezca el Forger para otro Bomb Steel, y solo necesitas matar al Treant una vez.",
    ["If you are doing this quest for a Vana'Bout objective and have already completed it once, you do not need to speak with Tapoh Lihzeh again: just trade her the items."] = "Si haces esta quest para un objetivo de Vana'Bout y ya la completaste una vez, no necesitas hablar de nuevo con Tapoh Lihzeh: solo entrégale los objetos.",
    ["If you are on the mission The Horutoto Ruins Experiment, complete it first. If you are on Saintly Invitation, finish the fight against the Yagudo first, or the quest will not start."] = "Si estás en la misión The Horutoto Ruins Experiment, complétala primero. Si estás en Saintly Invitation, termina primero la pelea contra los Yagudo, o la quest no empezará.",
    ["If you called for help during the battle, wait about one minute and examine the target again."] = "Si pediste ayuda durante la batalla, espera aproximadamente un minuto y examina de nuevo el objetivo.",
    ["If you choose correctly, you are given 500 gil. If you choose incorrectly, you fail the quest."] = "Si eliges bien, te dan 500 gil. Si eliges mal, fallas la quest.",
    ["If you choose correctly, you receive 500 gil. If you choose incorrectly, you fail the quest."] = "Si eliges bien, recibes 500 gil. Si eliges mal, fallas la quest.",
    ["If you chose the wrong earring or want a different one, drop your earring and proceed to the Empyreal Paradox (it must be dropped before you zone into the Empyreal Paradox). The fastest way is the Home Point warp: Lumoria, The Garden of Ru'Hmet, #1, and descend."] = "Si elegiste el pendiente equivocado o quieres uno distinto, suelta tu pendiente y ve al Empyreal Paradox (debe soltarse antes de entrar en la zona Empyreal Paradox). La forma más rápida es el warp del Home Point: Lumoria, The Garden of Ru'Hmet, #1, y descender.",
    ["If you did not originally watch the extra scene for completing An Empty Vessel, you need to speak to him again after zoning. Tell Waoud that you want him to \"Gaze Away\" at your fate and the quest cutscene begins. Wait three in-game days, zone, and speak to Waoud again, choosing the same option. The quest log says you have the quest from Raubahn, even though Waoud acts as your contact."] = "Si no viste originalmente la escena extra al completar An Empty Vessel, tienes que hablar de nuevo con él tras cambiar de zona. Dile a Waoud que quieres que \"Gaze Away\" a tu destino y empieza la escena de la quest. Espera tres días de juego, cambia de zona y habla de nuevo con Waoud, eligiendo la misma opción. El quest log dice que tienes la quest de Raubahn, aunque Waoud actúa como tu contacto.",
    ["If you do not examine the Tiger Bones soon enough after its death, you must examine them again and watch it die naturally once more."] = "Si no examinas los Tiger Bones lo bastante pronto tras su muerte, debes examinarlos de nuevo y mirar cómo muere de forma natural otra vez.",
    ["If you do not have a Delkfutt's Key, climb the tower normally until you reach the 10th floor."] = "Si no tienes una Delkfutt's Key, sube la torre normalmente hasta llegar al piso 10.",
    ["If you do not have a Delkfutt's Key, climb the tower to the tenth floor. Use the teleports and stairways to reach Upper Delkfutt's Tower, then go to (H-7), defeat Mimas if necessary, and enter Porphyrion's room."] = "Si no tienes una Delkfutt's Key, sube la torre hasta el piso diez. Usa los teletransportadores y escaleras para llegar a Upper Delkfutt's Tower, luego ve a (H-7), derrota a Mimas si es necesario y entra en la sala de Porphyrion.",
    ["If you do not have access, speak with Faursel in the Tenshodo in Lower Jeuno and obtain Aht Urhgan access."] = "Si no tienes acceso, habla con Faursel en el Tenshodo de Lower Jeuno y obtén el acceso a Aht Urhgan.",
    ["If you do not read the note: proceed to Zeruhn Mines and locate Zelman at (I-8). He tells you that he is busy and to tell Tami. Return to Tami for your reward of 10 gil. You can then repeat the quest."] = "Si no lees la nota: ve a Zeruhn Mines y localiza a Zelman en (I-8). Te dice que está ocupado y que se lo digas a Tami. Vuelve con Tami por tu recompensa de 10 gil. Después puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["If you drop the Carbuncle's Ruby before completing the quest, you do not lose progress; simply obtain another one."] = "Si sueltas el Carbuncle's Ruby antes de completar la quest, no pierdes progreso; simplemente consigue otro.",
    ["If you drop your Olduum Ring, speak to Dkhaaya to repeat the quest."] = "Si tiras tu Olduum Ring, habla con Dkhaaya para repetir la quest.",
    ["If you entered from La Theine Plateau (H-7) you arrive on map 1 (K-3): head to (I-5), a room with Fly Agaric enemies. If you used the Survival Guide you arrive on map 2 (G-2): go to map 1 (Point A, G-4), then to (I-5)."] = "Si entraste desde La Theine Plateau (H-7) llegas al mapa 1 (K-3): ve a (I-5), una sala con enemigos Fly Agaric. Si usaste la Survival Guide llegas al mapa 2 (G-2): ve al mapa 1 (Point A, G-4) y luego a (I-5).",
    ["If you entered the Hall of the Gods from Ru'Aun Gardens, return to Ro'Maeve and enter the Hall of the Gods again."] = "Si entraste en la Hall of the Gods desde Ru'Aun Gardens, vuelve a Ro'Maeve y entra de nuevo en la Hall of the Gods.",
    ["If you fail, return to the Stone Circle in La Theine Plateau at (G-6) and obtain another Breath of the avatars."] = "Si fallas, vuelve al Stone Circle en La Theine Plateau, en (G-6), y obtén otro Breath of the avatars.",
    ["If you forget how far you are into the quest, simply chat with the Opo-opos on the list. One that has already received the correct item responds and you can bow to it."] = "Si olvidas cuánto llevas de la quest, simplemente habla con los Opo-opos de la lista. Uno que ya haya recibido el objeto correcto responde y puedes hacerle una reverencia.",
    ["If you get a cutscene about a Shikaree tracker, that is for Tango with a Tracker: go talk to Despachiaire at (K-10), behind a Walnut Door, then return to Parelbriaux and talk to him twice more for a cutscene with Chemioue."] = "Si ves una escena sobre un rastreador Shikaree, es de Tango with a Tracker: habla con Despachiaire en (K-10), tras una Walnut Door, y luego vuelve con Parelbriaux y habla con él dos veces más para una escena con Chemioue.",
    ["If you get the message \"Someone has been digging here\", you forgot to speak to Curilla after trading the Velvet Cloth."] = "Si recibes el mensaje \"Someone has been digging here\", olvidaste hablar con Curilla tras entregar la Velvet Cloth.",
    ["If you have a Delkfutt's Key, go to (E-8), pass through the Cermet Door, and continue to the next Cermet Door at (J-8)."] = "Si tienes una Delkfutt's Key, ve a (E-8), atraviesa la Cermet Door y continúa hasta la siguiente Cermet Door en (J-8).",
    ["If you have any other Borghertz's Hands quest active, you must complete that one before you can start this quest."] = "Si tienes activa cualquier otra quest de Borghertz's Hands, debes completarla antes de poder empezar esta quest.",
    ["If you have just completed Blue Ribbon Blues, zone first."] = "Si acabas de completar Blue Ribbon Blues, cambia de zona primero.",
    ["If you have just completed Teak Me to the Stars, you must zone before starting this quest. You need Bastok fame level 4."] = "Si acabas de completar Teak Me to the Stars, debes cambiar de zona antes de empezar esta quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["If you have not yet completed the quest The Rumor, you can speak to Novalmauge a second time to accept it. You no longer need to complete The Rumor before advancing the job quest."] = "Si aún no has completado la quest The Rumor, puedes hablar una segunda vez con Novalmauge para aceptarla. Ya no necesitas completar The Rumor antes de avanzar la quest de trabajo.",
    ["If you have not yet gained access to Aht Urhgan Whitegate through the quest The Road to Aht Urhgan, you may trade your Testimony afterwards under the advanced path option and complete the quest."] = "Si aún no has accedido a Aht Urhgan Whitegate mediante la quest The Road to Aht Urhgan, puedes entregar tu Testimony después en la opción de camino avanzado y completar la quest.",
    ["If you just finished Ghosts of the Past, you must zone before beginning this quest. You must be on Monk."] = "Si acabas de terminar Ghosts of the Past, debes cambiar de zona antes de empezar esta quest. Debes ser Monk.",
    ["If you leave Grauberg (S), you lose any gold dust you have acquired and have to start over."] = "Si sales de Grauberg (S), pierdes el polvo de oro que hayas conseguido y tendrás que empezar de nuevo.",
    ["If you leave the past before opening another Maw, return to the first Maw you used."] = "Si sales del pasado antes de abrir otro Maw, vuelve al primer Maw que usaste.",
    ["If you lose the Purple Ribbon, you must wait until the next Conquest Tally to get it back. If several party members need the quest, wait 5 minutes after the defeat between each spawn."] = "Si pierdes la Purple Ribbon, debes esperar al siguiente Conquest Tally para recuperarla. Si varios miembros del grupo necesitan la quest, espera 5 minutos tras la derrota entre cada aparición.",
    ["If you lose the Well Water, touch the tombstone in King Ranperre's Tomb to receive a Tomb Waterskin, then trade it to the water well in Southern San d'Oria (F-6) to get a new Well Water."] = "Si pierdes el Well Water, toca la tombstone de King Ranperre's Tomb para recibir un Tomb Waterskin y entrégalo al water well de Southern San d'Oria (F-6) para obtener un Well Water nuevo.",
    ["If you lose, speak with Masad twice to try again."] = "Si pierdes, habla con Masad dos veces para intentarlo de nuevo.",
    ["If you need the recipe, speak with Kuroido-Moido (E-7) in Port Windurst, or with Faulpie in Southern San d'Oria or Abd-al-Raziq in Bastok Mines."] = "Si necesitas la receta, habla con Kuroido-Moido (E-7) en Port Windurst, con Faulpie en Southern San d'Oria o con Abd-al-Raziq en Bastok Mines.",
    ["If you need to re-apply the scent for The Opo-opo and I, you can check the three Rafflesia flowers in Yuhtunga Jungle once per game day until you get the scent back."] = "Si necesitas volver a ponerte el olor para The Opo-opo and I, puedes revisar las tres flores Rafflesia de Yuhtunga Jungle una vez por día de juego hasta recuperarlo.",
    ["If you only need to advance the story at high level, one Sap is enough."] = "Si solo necesitas avanzar en la historia a nivel alto, basta con un Sap.",
    ["If you pass through undetected, speak with Yin Pocanakhu in Lower Jeuno (J-8). If you are caught, your airship pass is revoked until midnight Japan time and the quest is failed."] = "Si pasas sin ser detectado, habla con Yin Pocanakhu en Lower Jeuno (J-8). Si te atrapan, tu airship pass se revoca hasta la medianoche, hora de Japan, y la quest fracasa.",
    ["If you progress through the questions, Waoud will not progress the quest until at least one game day later, and you must zone at least once."] = "Si avanzas por las preguntas, Waoud no hará avanzar la quest hasta al menos un día de juego después, y debes cambiar de zona al menos una vez.",
    ["If you read the note: proceed to Zeruhn Mines and locate Zelman at (I-8), then go to the Bat's Lair Inn at (H-5) in Bastok Mines and buy a Meat Jerky from Griselda."] = "Si lees la nota: ve a Zeruhn Mines y localiza a Zelman en (I-8), luego ve al Bat's Lair Inn en (H-5) de Bastok Mines y compra un Meat Jerky a Griselda.",
    ["If you refuse him every time instead, the entire quest resets and you have to start over from the beginning."] = "Si en cambio lo rechazas todas las veces, toda la quest se reinicia y tienes que empezar desde el principio.",
    ["If you say yes, he asks you to get the floor plans back from the Orcs. Orcish Serjeant enemies in Fort Ghelsba and Batallia Downs can drop the Castle Floor Plans."] = "Si dices que sí, te pide recuperar los planos de los Orcs. Los enemigos Orcish Serjeant de Fort Ghelsba y Batallia Downs pueden soltar los Castle Floor Plans.",
    ["If you spoke to Joker during the previous cutscene, return to the House of the Hero for your reward."] = "Si hablaste con Joker durante la escena anterior, vuelve a la House of the Hero por tu recompensa.",
    ["If you still need the Yagudo Torch, speak with Paya-Sabya at (I-8) in Upper Jeuno, then speak with Muckvix at (H-9) in Lower Jeuno."] = "Si aún necesitas la Yagudo Torch, habla con Paya-Sabya en (I-8) en Upper Jeuno, luego habla con Muckvix en (H-9) en Lower Jeuno.",
    ["If you trade her the wrong flower, such as one meant for the other two Mog House exit quests, she keeps it and you will have to get another."] = "Si le entregas la flor equivocada, como una destinada a las otras dos quests de salida del Mog House, se la queda y tendrás que conseguir otra.",
    ["If you trade her the wrong flower, such as one meant for the other two Mog House exit quests, she takes it and you will have to get another."] = "Si le entregas la flor equivocada, como una destinada a las otras dos quests de salida del Mog House, se la queda y tendrás que conseguir otra.",
    ["If your Support Job is not unlocked, the mission awards Gilgamesh's introductory letter instead of a Copper Voucher."] = "Si tu Support Job no está desbloqueado, la misión otorga la Gilgamesh's introductory letter en lugar de un Copper Voucher.",
    ["If your Windurst fame is level 4 or higher, you are assigned Let Sleeping Dogs Lie instead, and you cannot start this quest until you complete that one."] = "Si tu fama de Windurst es nivel 4 o superior, te asignan Let Sleeping Dogs Lie en su lugar, y no puedes empezar esta quest hasta completar aquella.",
    ["In Aydeewa Subterrane, go to the pond room at (H-9) for a cutscene. You do not get the cutscene if you do not have the requested item on you."] = "En Aydeewa Subterrane, ve a la sala del estanque en (H-9) para una escena. No ves la escena si no llevas encima el objeto pedido.",
    ["In Bastok Markets: Horatius (I-9), Arawn (J-10), Harmodios (K-10), Pavel (E-11) and Ken (E-10)."] = "En Bastok Markets: Horatius (I-9), Arawn (J-10), Harmodios (K-10), Pavel (E-11) y Ken (E-10).",
    ["In Castle Zvahl Keep (S), locate Rikke at (G-7) northwest, Rakke at (G-10) southwest, and Rokke at (H-10) southeast."] = "En Castle Zvahl Keep (S), localiza a Rikke en (G-7) al noroeste, a Rakke en (G-10) al suroeste y a Rokke en (H-10) al sureste.",
    ["In Gusgen Mines, get to the third map by taking the ramp down at (F-5) and trade the Pickaxe to the ???."] = "En Gusgen Mines, llega al tercer mapa bajando por la rampa en (F-5) y entrega la Pickaxe a la ???.",
    ["In Korroloka Tunnel, click on the ??? to spawn 3 Korroloka Leech enemies. They link with any Thread Leech enemies nearby. If the leeches do not appear after you click the ???, try relogging."] = "En Korroloka Tunnel, haz clic en la ??? para invocar a 3 enemigos Korroloka Leech. Se enlazan con cualquier Thread Leech cercano. Si las leeches no aparecen tras hacer clic en la ???, prueba a reconectarte.",
    ["In Metalworks: Romualdo (K-9), in the southeastern Cannonry, and Elayne (G-8), at the entrance to the Temple of the Goddess. In Port Bastok: Ehrhard (G-5), in the northeast corner outside Warehouse #1, and Latifah (J-8), north of the drawbridge."] = "En Metalworks: Romualdo (K-9), en el Cannonry sureste, y Elayne (G-8), en la entrada del Temple of the Goddess. En Port Bastok: Ehrhard (G-5), en la esquina noreste fuera del Warehouse #1, y Latifah (J-8), al norte del puente levadizo.",
    ["In Mhaura, speak twice with Koh Lenbalalako (F-9) for a cutscene. She asks you for a Gold Earring."] = "En Mhaura, habla dos veces con Koh Lenbalalako (F-9) para una escena. Te pide un Gold Earring.",
    ["In Palborough Mines, trade a Pickaxe to a Mythril Seam to obtain Mine Gravel."] = "En Palborough Mines, entrega una Pickaxe a una Mythril Seam para obtener Mine Gravel.",
    ["In Port Bastok: Paujean (F-6), Kaede (J-5), Tilian (F-8), Hilda (E-6) and Patient Wheel (F-5). In Metalworks: Manilam (G-7), Invincible Shield (G-8), Ayame (K-7) and Kaela (I-8)."] = "En Port Bastok: Paujean (F-6), Kaede (J-5), Tilian (F-8), Hilda (E-6) y Patient Wheel (F-5). En Metalworks: Manilam (G-7), Invincible Shield (G-8), Ayame (K-7) y Kaela (I-8).",
    ["In Port Windurst, speak with Yujuju (M-6), Choyi Totlihpa (F-6), Yaman-Hachuman (E-7), Kunchichi (E-7) and Three of Clubs (G-7)."] = "En Port Windurst, habla con Yujuju (M-6), Choyi Totlihpa (F-6), Yaman-Hachuman (E-7), Kunchichi (E-7) y Three of Clubs (G-7).",
    ["In Riverne - Site #A01 the ??? is on the island at (E-8) that holds the zone to Monarch Linn. Two Giant Scales are required, and the Home Point warp places you at (I-9)."] = "En Riverne - Site #A01 la ??? está en la isla de (E-8) que contiene la zona a Monarch Linn. Hacen falta dos Giant Scales, y el warp de Home Point te coloca en (I-9).",
    ["In Riverne - Site #B01 the ??? is on the island at (E-7), just before the final Stable Displacement heading toward Monarch Linn. One Giant Scale, or the Home Point warp, is required."] = "En Riverne - Site #B01 la ??? está en la isla de (E-7), justo antes del último Stable Displacement hacia Monarch Linn. Hace falta una Giant Scale, o el warp de Home Point.",
    ["In Upper Jeuno, speak with Baudin at (G-8) and trade him Coeurl Meat for the Crest of Davoi."] = "En Upper Jeuno, habla con Baudin en (G-8) y entrégale Coeurl Meat a cambio del Crest of Davoi.",
    ["In Wajaom Woodlands, kill Aht Urhgan Attercop enemies (spiders) until you get a Frayed Arrow. Three Aht Urhgan Attercops are located at the Giwahb Watchtower."] = "En Wajaom Woodlands, mata enemigos Aht Urhgan Attercop (arañas) hasta conseguir una Frayed Arrow. Hay tres Aht Urhgan Attercops en la Giwahb Watchtower.",
    ["In Wajaom Woodlands, kill Wajaom Tiger enemies until you get a Rusty Medal."] = "En Wajaom Woodlands, mata enemigos Wajaom Tiger hasta conseguir una Rusty Medal.",
    ["In Windurst Walls, speak with Yoriri (J-11), Moan-Maon (J-6), Shantotto (K-7), Chomomo (H-3) and Naih Arihmepp (F-5)."] = "En Windurst Walls, habla con Yoriri (J-11), Moan-Maon (J-6), Shantotto (K-7), Chomomo (H-3) y Naih Arihmepp (F-5).",
    ["In Windurst Waters North, enter the Timbre Timbers tavern (F-10) and speak with Yuli Yaam, then Yung Yaam, then Jatan-Paratan."] = "En Windurst Waters North, entra en la taberna Timbre Timbers (F-10) y habla con Yuli Yaam, luego con Yung Yaam y luego con Jatan-Paratan.",
    ["In Windurst Waters North, speak with Npopo (G-4), Amagusa-Chigurusa (G-9), Funpo-Shipo (F-9), Kyume-Romeh (F-10) and Lago-Charago (F-8)."] = "En Windurst Waters North, habla con Npopo (G-4), Amagusa-Chigurusa (G-9), Funpo-Shipo (F-9), Kyume-Romeh (F-10) y Lago-Charago (F-8).",
    ["In Windurst Woods, speak with Umumu (I-5), Cayu Pensharhumi (I-10), Nanaa Mihgo (J-3), Etsa Rhuyuli (J-13) and Soni-Muni (H-10)."] = "En Windurst Woods, habla con Umumu (I-5), Cayu Pensharhumi (I-10), Nanaa Mihgo (J-3), Etsa Rhuyuli (J-13) y Soni-Muni (H-10).",
    ["In return for a seal you receive either a Smiling stone, Scowling stone, Somber stone or Spirited stone."] = "A cambio de un seal recibes una Smiling stone, Scowling stone, Somber stone o Spirited stone.",
    ["In some cases the quest ends here, with a cutscene and your reward. The exact trigger is unknown; it seems related to your progress in the Windurst missions or to having the key item Old ring."] = "En algunos casos la quest termina aquí, con una escena y tu recompensa. El disparador exacto se desconoce; parece relacionado con tu progreso en las misiones de Windurst o con tener el key item Old ring.",
    ["In the Navukgo Execution Chamber, examine the Decorative Bronze Gate to start a battlefield fight. Up to 18 people can enter, but more people cause more Immortal Flans to spawn. Trust Magic is allowed."] = "En la Navukgo Execution Chamber, examina la Decorative Bronze Gate para empezar un combate en el campo de batalla. Pueden entrar hasta 18 personas, pero más gente hace aparecer más Immortal Flans. La Trust Magic está permitida.",
    ["In the basement, head east to the large room and use the Delkfutt's Key on the Cermet Door at (L-8)."] = "En el sótano, ve al este hasta la sala grande y usa la Delkfutt's Key en la Cermet Door en (L-8).",
    ["In the battle you face Alexander, who can spawn up to three Alexander Images. At low HP, Alexander uses Divine Judgment, dealing high damage to everyone in range."] = "En la batalla te enfrentas a Alexander, que puede invocar hasta tres Alexander Images. Con poco HP, Alexander usa Divine Judgment, causando mucho daño a todos los que estén en rango.",
    ["In the main area of the assault there are many Mamool Ja Trainers (blue mages) and Recruits (orange melees) that must be avoided. Refer to the map for the locations of the treasure coffers."] = "En la zona principal del assault hay muchos Mamool Ja Trainers (magos azules) y Recruits (cuerpo a cuerpo naranjas) que hay que evitar. Consulta el mapa para ver dónde están los cofres del tesoro.",
    ["Inside Ifrit's Cauldron, follow the path to the first junction and go north. The fight there is against Cailleach Bheur, a skeleton."] = "Dentro de Ifrit's Cauldron, sigue el camino hasta la primera bifurcación y ve al norte. La pelea allí es contra Cailleach Bheur, un esqueleto.",
    ["Inside Ro'Maeve, go down the northeastern stairs and turn immediately east. Go through the hallway to the right, turn left, drop down the ledge and go through the door to the northeast. The Ro'Maeve page lists the notorious monster Eldhrimnir, a Magic Pot, for this quest."] = "Dentro de Ro'Maeve, baja por las escaleras del noreste y gira de inmediato al este. Atraviesa el pasillo de la derecha, gira a la izquierda, déjate caer por la cornisa y atraviesa la puerta del noreste. La página de Ro'Maeve indica el notorious monster Eldhrimnir, un Magic Pot, para esta quest.",
    ["Inside there are several chests, and three of them hold coins that depict the constellations. The correct coins are Odin to the north, Alexander to the northeast, Shiva to the east and Garuda to the southeast."] = "Dentro hay varios cofres, y tres de ellos contienen monedas que representan las constelaciones. Las monedas correctas son Odin al norte, Alexander al noreste, Shiva al este y Garuda al sureste.",
    ["Inside, defeat Fallen Evacuee enemies in the small rooms near the entrance until one drops a Garlaige Key."] = "Dentro, derrota a enemigos Fallen Evacuee en las salas pequeñas cerca de la entrada hasta que uno suelte una Garlaige Key.",
    ["Investigate Babbling Brook (F-5)."] = "Investiga el Babbling Brook (F-5).",
    ["Investigate the Goblin Festival Site during the required time."] = "Investiga el Goblin Festival Site durante el tiempo requerido.",
    ["Investigate the Sacred Sapling."] = "Investiga el Sacred Sapling.",
    ["Investigate the amulet's origin and return to Despachiaire for your reward, the Elegant Ribbon."] = "Investiga el origen del amuleto y vuelve con Despachiaire por tu recompensa, el Elegant Ribbon.",
    ["Investigate the cliffs in the northwestern portion of the reef."] = "Investiga los acantilados de la parte noroeste del arrecife.",
    ["Investigate the disturbance from the depths."] = "Investiga la perturbación que viene de las profundidades.",
    ["Investigate the disturbance."] = "Investiga la perturbación.",
    ["Investigate the latest arboreal rumors."] = "Investiga los últimos rumores arbóreos.",
    ["Ipupu accepts it and gives you the key item Note from Ipupu in return."] = "Ipupu la acepta y te da a cambio el key item Note from Ipupu.",
    ["Irmilant repairs the rod and you receive the Lu Shang's Fishing Rod and the title The Immortal Fisher, Lu Shang. You do not need to have completed The Competition or The Rivalry to have your rod fixed. You can repeat the quest."] = "Irmilant repara la caña y recibes la Lu Shang's Fishing Rod y el título The Immortal Fisher, Lu Shang. No hace falta haber completado The Competition ni The Rivalry para que te arreglen la caña. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["It is no longer possible to flag the original quest. Speak to a Synergy Engineer to obtain a Synergy Crucible if you did not activate this quest before March 27, 2012."] = "Ya no es posible activar la quest original. Habla con un Synergy Engineer para obtener un Synergy Crucible si no activaste esta quest antes del 27 de marzo de 2012.",
    ["It takes 6 feeding attempts to complete the quest. The first 2 attempts automatically fail and do not consume a grass."] = "Hacen falta 6 intentos de alimentación para completar la quest. Los 2 primeros intentos fallan automáticamente y no consumen hierba.",
    ["Jack of Hearts (Windurst Waters), Jack of Clubs (Port Windurst), Jack of Spades (Windurst Woods), Jack of Diamonds (Windurst Walls)"] = "Jack of Hearts (Windurst Waters), Jack of Clubs (Port Windurst), Jack of Spades (Windurst Woods), Jack of Diamonds (Windurst Walls)",
    ["Jobs: every job, its unlock quest, and its abilities."] = "Jobs: cada trabajo, su quest de desbloqueo y sus habilidades.",
    ["Join an offensive campaign battle in a territory that the beastmen control."] = "Participa en una batalla de campaña ofensiva en un territorio que controlen las bestias.",
    ["Jugner Forest, Pashhow Marshlands, and Meriphataud Mountains in the mid-teens."] = "Jugner Forest, Pashhow Marshlands y Meriphataud Mountains alrededor del nivel 15.",
    ["Kazham entrance"] = "entrada de Kazham",
    ["Keep Karababa alive throughout the battle."] = "Mantén con vida a Karababa durante toda la batalla.",
    ["Keep Mnejing alive during the battle."] = "Mantén con vida a Mnejing durante la batalla.",
    ["Keep Naja alive throughout the battle."] = "Mantén con vida a Naja durante toda la batalla.",
    ["Keep talking to as many other NPCs as you can: too few gives no credit, and the reward grows with the number you speak to."] = "Sigue hablando con todos los demás NPCs que puedas: demasiado pocos no dan crédito, y la recompensa crece con el número de personas con las que hables.",
    ["Ken engages all enemies that are in his line of sight, and he cannot be stopped like the NPCs used in the three nation escort quests. One way to make the quest easier is to have a higher level friend run slightly ahead of Ken and kill monsters before he attacks them."] = "Ken se enfrenta a todos los enemigos que estén en su línea de visión, y no se le puede detener como a los NPCs de las tres quests de escolta de las naciones. Una forma de facilitar la quest es que un amigo de nivel más alto corra un poco por delante de Ken y mate a los monstruos antes de que los ataque.",
    ["Kenapa-Keppa, Kerutoto, and Ohbiru-Dohbiru, Windurst Waters"] = "Kenapa-Keppa, Kerutoto y Ohbiru-Dohbiru, Windurst Waters",
    ["Kill Aydeewa Diremite enemies until you get a Colorful Hair. You can find them around (I-9) after you take the (I-7) entrance from Bhaflau Thickets and slide down at (H-8). Circle back up to farm the item, then slide back down. The Voidwatch warp, if you have it, is a quick shortcut."] = "Mata enemigos Aydeewa Diremite hasta conseguir un Colorful Hair. Los encuentras cerca de (I-9) tras tomar la entrada (I-7) desde Bhaflau Thickets y deslizarte en (H-8). Da la vuelta hacia arriba para farmear el objeto y vuelve a deslizarte. El warp de Voidwatch, si lo tienes, es un atajo rápido.",
    ["Kill Bahamut for a cutscene."] = "Mata a Bahamut para una escena.",
    ["Kill Goblin Robber enemies to get a Sack of Fish Bait, a common drop."] = "Mata enemigos Goblin Robber para conseguir un Sack of Fish Bait, un drop común.",
    ["Kill monsters on the 7th to 10th floors of Upper Delkfutt's Tower until you get a Delkfutt Chest Key. Alternatively, you can buy one from the Curio Vendor Moogle."] = "Mata monstruos en los pisos 7 a 10 de Upper Delkfutt's Tower hasta conseguir una Delkfutt Chest Key. También puedes comprar una al Curio Vendor Moogle.",
    ["Kill the Rancor Torch, then head back to Kazham and talk to the Chieftainess for your reward, 11,000 gil."] = "Mata al Rancor Torch, vuelve a Kazham y habla con la Chieftainess para recibir tu recompensa, 11,000 gil.",
    ["Killing the Casanova makes all the other frogs disappear and ends the battle. Mikilulu cannot be killed but can be brought down to 1% HP. You only have to fight it once for it to count for the rest of your party if they are at that stage of the quest."] = "Matar al Casanova hace desaparecer a todas las demás ranas y termina la batalla. Mikilulu no se puede matar, pero se le puede bajar hasta el 1% de HP. Solo tienes que luchar una vez para que cuente para el resto de tu grupo si están en ese punto de la quest.",
    ["Kindred's Seals can be acquired from any normal monster of level 50-69 that checks as Easy Prey or higher, or exchanged 3 for 1 (or 2 for 1 during certain campaigns) for other seal types from Shemo."] = "Los Kindred's Seals se obtienen de cualquier monstruo normal de nivel 50-69 que se vea como Easy Prey o superior, o se intercambian 3 por 1 (o 2 por 1 durante ciertas campaigns) por otros tipos de seal en Shemo.",
    ["Lamian Fang Keys drop from Lamia and Drauger enemies in the area, and you can also receive one from a ??? spot in Caedarva Mire (I-7), map 1, once every game day. Use the key on the Iron Gate at (J-10), then go west on the small map to another Iron Gate, which is unlocked."] = "Las Lamian Fang Keys las sueltan los enemigos Lamia y Drauger de la zona, y también puedes recibir una de un lugar ??? en Caedarva Mire (I-7), mapa 1, una vez por día de juego. Usa la llave en la Iron Gate de (J-10), luego ve al oeste en el mapa pequeño hasta otra Iron Gate, que está abierta.",
    ["Lamian Fang Keys drop from Lamia and Drauger enemies in the area. You can also receive one from a ??? spot in Caedarva Mire (I-7), Map 1, once every game day: use the Lamian Fang Key on the Iron Gate at (J-10), then go west on the small map to another Iron Gate, which is unlocked. The Survival Guide in Arrapago Reef is very near to the Iron Gate."] = "Las Lamian Fang Keys las sueltan los enemigos Lamia y Drauger de la zona. También puedes recibir una de un lugar ??? en Caedarva Mire (I-7), Map 1, una vez por día de juego: usa la Lamian Fang Key en la Iron Gate de (J-10), luego ve al oeste en el mapa pequeño hasta otra Iron Gate, que está abierta. La Survival Guide de Arrapago Reef está muy cerca de la Iron Gate.",
    ["Lamian Fang Keys drop from Lamia and Drauger enemies in the area. You can also receive one from a ??? spot in Caedarva Mire (I-7), map 1 (southern part of the block); you can obtain a new key from there once every game day."] = "Las Lamian Fang Keys las sueltan los enemigos Lamia y Drauger de la zona. También puedes recibir una de un lugar ??? en Caedarva Mire (I-7), mapa 1 (parte sur del bloque); puedes obtener una llave nueva allí una vez por día de juego.",
    ["Learn that Shantotto requires a Ripe Starfruit."] = "Descubre que Shantotto necesita un Ripe Starfruit.",
    ["Learn which zone contains the Moldy, worm-eaten chest."] = "Averigua qué zona contiene el Moldy, worm-eaten chest.",
    ["Leave Aht Urhgan Whitegate and return after completing Immortal Sentries."] = "Sal de Aht Urhgan Whitegate y vuelve tras completar Immortal Sentries.",
    ["Leave Aht Urhgan Whitegate and return after the required transition."] = "Sal de Aht Urhgan Whitegate y vuelve tras la transición requerida.",
    ["Leave Bastok Markets (S) for North Gustaberg (S) at (G-4) and obtain the Clump of Animal Hair."] = "Sal de Bastok Markets (S) hacia North Gustaberg (S) en (G-4) y obtén el Clump of Animal Hair.",
    ["Leave Rosel's Armour Shop and head west into Victory Square. Head north through Victory Arch into Northern San d'Oria, then straight north towards Chateau d'Oraguille."] = "Sal de Rosel's Armour Shop y ve al oeste hasta Victory Square. Ve al norte por el Victory Arch hasta Northern San d'Oria y luego sigue recto al norte hacia Chateau d'Oraguille.",
    ["Leave Windurst Woods, then return after one Earth minute and speak with Kororo again."] = "Sal de Windurst Woods, vuelve tras un minuto terrestre y habla de nuevo con Kororo.",
    ["Leave the area after obtaining the requested item."] = "Sal de la zona tras obtener el objeto solicitado.",
    ["Leave the area and return to Louxiard (G-7)."] = "Sal de la zona y vuelve con Louxiard (G-7).",
    ["Leave the area and return to Salaheem's Sentinels after the required transition."] = "Sal de la zona y vuelve con los Salaheem's Sentinels tras la transición requerida.",
    ["Leave the area and return, then speak with Rholont (E-7) again."] = "Sal de la zona y vuelve, luego habla de nuevo con Rholont (E-7).",
    ["Leave the area and speak with Rholont (E-7) again."] = "Sal de la zona y habla de nuevo con Rholont (E-7).",
    ["Leepe-Hoppe needs 3 items, all of which must be farmed in Chains of Promathia areas."] = "Leepe-Hoppe necesita 3 objetos, todos ellos se deben farmear en zonas de Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Legata, Southern San d'Oria"] = "Legata, Southern San d'Oria",
    ["Level 10"] = "Nivel 10",
    ["Level 15"] = "Nivel 15",
    ["Level 18"] = "Nivel 18",
    ["Level 20"] = "Nivel 20",
    ["Level 30"] = "Nivel 30",
    ["Level 50"] = "Nivel 50",
    ["Level Sync is available, so a higher-level player can sync down to join your party. Syncing down more than 10 levels can cost some experience when the server is busy."] = "Level Sync está disponible, así que un jugador de nivel más alto puede sincronizarse hacia abajo para unirse a tu grupo. Sincronizarse más de 10 niveles hacia abajo puede costar algo de experiencia cuando el servidor está ocupado.",
    ["Leveling near Bastok: North Gustaberg and South Gustaberg"] = "Subir de nivel cerca de Bastok: North Gustaberg y South Gustaberg",
    ["Leveling near San d'Oria: West Ronfaure and East Ronfaure"] = "Subir de nivel cerca de San d'Oria: West Ronfaure y East Ronfaure",
    ["Leveling near Windurst: West Sarutabaruta and East Sarutabaruta"] = "Subir de nivel cerca de Windurst: West Sarutabaruta y East Sarutabaruta",
    ["Levels 1-10: the fields outside town"] = "Niveles 1-10: las zonas fuera de la ciudad",
    ["Levels 10-20: your first parties"] = "Niveles 10-20: tus primeros grupos",
    ["Lilisette joins the battle after approximately three minutes."] = "Lilisette se une a la batalla tras unos tres minutos.",
    ["Listen to his instructions and travel to Monastic Cavern via Davoi (H-11)."] = "Escucha sus instrucciones y viaja a Monastic Cavern por Davoi (H-11).",
    ["Locate Hilda at (E-6) and speak with her. You can interact with her through the floor if you stand under her, near the bar, while she is upstairs."] = "Localiza a Hilda en (E-6) y habla con ella. Puedes interactuar con ella a través del suelo si te pones debajo de ella, cerca de la barra, mientras está arriba.",
    ["Locate and defeat Orcish Turret at approximately (H-10) on Map 15 within 30 minutes."] = "Localiza y derrota a Orcish Turret aproximadamente en (H-10) del Map 15 en 30 minutos.",
    ["Locate the Waterfall Base and trade the Brass Canteen to it, not to the ???, to receive Drachenfall Water. A headstone for the quest An Explorer's Footsteps is along the way."] = "Localiza la Waterfall Base y entrégale la Brass Canteen a ella, no a la ???, para recibir Drachenfall Water. Un headstone de la quest An Explorer's Footsteps está por el camino.",
    ["Locate the key item you received during The Stars of Ifrit. You receive it before the end of that quest, so you do not need to complete The Stars of Ifrit before starting this one."] = "Localiza el key item que recibiste durante The Stars of Ifrit. Lo recibes antes del final de esa quest, así que no necesitas completar The Stars of Ifrit antes de empezar esta.",
    ["Look behind the painting and read the letter to get the key item Strange sheet of paper."] = "Mira detrás del cuadro y lee la carta para obtener el key item Strange sheet of paper.",
    ["Look for Andelain in East Ronfaure at (J-11) and give him the peas."] = "Busca a Andelain en East Ronfaure en (J-11) y dale los guisantes.",
    ["Look for a group with /sea all or put up your seeking-party flag."] = "Busca un grupo con /sea all o activa tu marca de búsqueda de grupo.",
    ["Look for the NM Silk Caterpillar. It spawns when an airship goes by, about every 11 to 14 minutes."] = "Busca al NM Silk Caterpillar. Aparece cuando pasa una airship, más o menos cada 11 a 14 minutos.",
    ["Look for the guard Guilerme near the bridge into the Chateau. He takes the receipt but cannot read the intended recipient: tell him which prince it is for, Pieuje or Trion, and he runs into the Chateau to deliver it."] = "Busca al guardia Guilerme cerca del puente que entra al Chateau. Coge el recibo pero no puede leer el destinatario: dile para qué príncipe es, Pieuje o Trion, y corre al Chateau para entregarlo.",
    ["Lower level players may want to bring and use a Reraise item. You will need to run to the Brass Door before it closes, and after that door monsters become more challenging for low level players and dangerous by the fourth floor."] = "Los jugadores de nivel bajo pueden querer llevar y usar un objeto de Reraise. Tendrás que correr hasta la Brass Door antes de que se cierre, y tras esa puerta los monstruos se vuelven más difíciles para jugadores de nivel bajo y peligrosos en el cuarto piso.",
    ["Maat asks for three items. Three key items combine into each required item. Be wary of Explosure's Self-Destruct and Exoray's conal Breath damage attacks."] = "Maat pide tres objetos. Tres key items se combinan en cada objeto requerido. Ten cuidado con el Self-Destruct de los Explosure y con el Breath cónico de los Exoray.",
    ["Make sure Let Sleeping Dogs Lie is not active, and zone first if you have just finished it."] = "Asegúrate de que Let Sleeping Dogs Lie no esté activa, y cambia de zona primero si acabas de terminarla.",
    ["Make sure that you, or someone in your party, has a Paintbrush of Souls. Use it to open the Granite Door at (I-7) and head into the Den of Rancor."] = "Asegúrate de que tú, o alguien de tu grupo, tenga un Paintbrush of Souls. Úsalo para abrir la Granite Door en (I-7) y entrar en el Den of Rancor.",
    ["Make sure you are wearing a body armor piece, or the quest cannot start."] = "Asegúrate de llevar una pieza de armadura de cuerpo, o la quest no puede empezar.",
    ["Make sure you have one free inventory slot. Unequip all weapons and shield in the Main and Sub slots, then examine the ??? and you receive the message that you have obtained a Siren's Tear."] = "Asegúrate de tener un hueco libre en el inventario. Desequipa todas las armas y el escudo de los slots Main y Sub, luego examina la ??? y recibes el mensaje de que has obtenido una Siren's Tear.",
    ["Make sure you pick up a few Pickaxes before leaving, since they can break. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Asegúrate de llevar varios Pickaxes antes de irte, porque se pueden romper. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Make sure your main job is Dragoon, level 40 or higher, when you speak with Miaux in Northern San d'Oria (E-6). She asks you to obtain an Altepa polishing stone. After speaking to her you can change to another job to do the rest of the quest."] = "Asegúrate de que tu trabajo principal sea Dragoon, nivel 40 o superior, cuando hables con Miaux en Northern San d'Oria (E-6). Te pide que obtengas una Altepa polishing stone. Tras hablar con ella puedes cambiar a otro trabajo para hacer el resto de la quest.",
    ["Make your way through Quicksand Caves to the Cloister of Tremors. Home Point #2 is at the entrance. If it is your first visit, enter Quicksand Caves via Eastern Altepa Desert at (K-7); some of the drops on the way are one-way."] = "Abre camino por Quicksand Caves hasta el Cloister of Tremors. El Home Point #2 está en la entrada. Si es tu primera visita, entra en Quicksand Caves por Eastern Altepa Desert en (K-7); algunas de las caídas del camino son de un solo sentido.",
    ["Make your way to Hut Door (G-9) in the large open area."] = "Dirígete a la Hut Door (G-9) en la gran zona abierta.",
    ["Maloquedil, Northern San d'Oria"] = "Maloquedil, Northern San d'Oria",
    ["Mamool Ja Staging Point entrance"] = "entrada del Mamool Ja Staging Point",
    ["Manage the Goblin Effluvial Grenade attacks and poison effects during the battle."] = "Gestiona los ataques de Goblin Effluvial Grenade y los efectos de veneno durante la batalla.",
    ["Marchelute drops a Tavnazia Pass."] = "Marchelute suelta un Tavnazia Pass.",
    ["Match the male Lebros Apkallu up to the female Lebros Apkallu. You only need to match up one pair to win, but you receive reduced points for every pair fewer than 8."] = "Empareja al Lebros Apkallu macho con la Lebros Apkallu hembra. Solo necesitas emparejar una pareja para ganar, pero recibes menos puntos por cada pareja que falte hasta 8.",
    ["Meet Darrcuiln."] = "Reúnete con Darrcuiln.",
    ["Meet Sajj'aka near summit area."] = "Reúnete con Sajj'aka cerca de la cumbre.",
    ["Meet the required imprimatur and fame progression for the mission."] = "Cumple el imprimatur y el progreso de fama que exige la misión.",
    ["Mhaura: choose the first dialogue option, \"You're searching for adventurers?\""] = "Mhaura: elige la primera opción de diálogo, \"You're searching for adventurers?\"",
    ["Mhaura: examine Oaken Door (K-8) in Norg."] = "Mhaura: examina la Oaken Door (K-8) en Norg.",
    ["Mhaura: obtain 3 Mandragora Dewdrops from Pygmaioi in Tahrongi Canyon, or purchase them from the Auction House."] = "Mhaura: obtén 3 Mandragora Dewdrops de los Pygmaioi de Tahrongi Canyon, o cómpralas en la Auction House.",
    ["Mhaura: return to Mhaura and trade all 3 Mandragora Dewdrops to Ekokoko."] = "Mhaura: vuelve a Mhaura y entrega las 3 Mandragora Dewdrops a Ekokoko.",
    ["Mhaura: speak with Numi Adaligo at (F-9) in the Governor's House."] = "Mhaura: habla con Numi Adaligo en (F-9), en la Governor's House.",
    ["Mhaura: speak with Tonasav at (H-9) to travel to Norg."] = "Mhaura: habla con Tonasav en (H-9) para viajar a Norg.",
    ["Michea asks for a Mythril Ingot. Trade it to her, then zone out of Bastok Markets once."] = "Michea pide un Mythril Ingot. Entrégaselo y luego sal de Bastok Markets una vez.",
    ["Milestones"] = "Hitos",
    ["Mine the Ember-encrusted Orichalcum."] = "Extrae el Ember-encrusted Orichalcum.",
    ["Mine up an Orichalcum Ore from the mining points scattered around the map."] = "Extrae un Orichalcum Ore de los puntos de minería repartidos por el mapa.",
    ["Mission orders: become a test subject."] = "Órdenes de la misión: convertirte en sujeto de pruebas.",
    ["Mog House"] = "Mog House",
    ["Monster drops. Sell the materials you collect. Each item page shows where it drops and who sells or buys it."] = "Drops de monstruos. Vende los materiales que recojas. La página de cada objeto muestra dónde cae y quién lo vende o lo compra.",
    ["Moreno-Toeno, Windurst Waters"] = "Moreno-Toeno, Windurst Waters",
    ["Mute is inflicted through the additional effect of the weapon of Eight of Cups in the Outer Horutoto Ruins (enter from (F-11) in West Sarutabaruta), and pays 1,000 gil."] = "Mute se inflige mediante el efecto adicional del arma de Eight of Cups en las Outer Horutoto Ruins (entra desde (F-11) en West Sarutabaruta), y paga 1,000 gil.",
    ["Mutton Tortilla can be bought at the Auction House (Food, Meals, Breads & Rice), or from Taajiji at the Timbre Timbers Tavern in Windurst Waters North if Windurst is at least 2nd place in Conquest."] = "La Mutton Tortilla se puede comprar en la Auction House (Food, Meals, Breads & Rice), o a Taajiji en la Timbre Timbers Tavern de Windurst Waters North si Windurst está al menos en 2nd lugar en Conquest.",
    ["Naiko-Paneiko, Windurst Waters"] = "Naiko-Paneiko, Windurst Waters",
    ["Naja requires you to successfully complete three mini-games. If you fail any portion, wait one real-life minute and speak to Naja again. After each one you may need to wait a game day to find out whether you passed; if you failed, you repeat that mini-game."] = "Naja te exige completar con éxito tres minijuegos. Si fallas alguna parte, espera un minuto real y habla de nuevo con Naja. Tras cada uno puede que tengas que esperar un día de juego para saber si lo superaste; si fallaste, repites ese minijuego.",
    ["Nanaa Mihgo summons either Bopa Greso or Cha Lebagta during the battle."] = "Nanaa Mihgo invoca a Bopa Greso o a Cha Lebagta durante la batalla.",
    ["Nanaa Mihgo, Windurst Woods"] = "Nanaa Mihgo, Windurst Woods",
    ["Nations: city areas, guilds, and leveling areas for each nation."] = "Nations: zonas de la ciudad, gremios y zonas de nivelación de cada nación.",
    ["Nbu Latteh, Bastok Markets"] = "Nbu Latteh, Bastok Markets",
    ["Next, head to Castle Oztroja and kill the monsters to find an Oztroja Chest Key."] = "Después, ve a Castle Oztroja y mata a los monstruos para conseguir una Oztroja Chest Key.",
    ["Next, speak with Esca in West Ronfaure (F-6)."] = "Después, habla con Esca en West Ronfaure (F-6).",
    ["Next, speak with Tehf Kimasnahya at (F-8) on Balrahn Way, who explains the whole thing."] = "Después, habla con Tehf Kimasnahya en (F-8) de Balrahn Way, que lo explica todo.",
    ["Next, travel to Xarcabard and reach (H-7). Examine ??? (H-7) near the clustered trees to receive the Figure of Garuda."] = "Después, viaja a Xarcabard y llega a (H-7). Examina la ??? (H-7) junto a los árboles agrupados para recibir la Figure of Garuda.",
    ["No Records of Eminence, Fields of Valor, Grounds of Valor, or Survival Guides."] = "Sin Records of Eminence, Fields of Valor, Grounds of Valor ni Survival Guides.",
    ["No Trusts. Fighting alongside other players is how you progress."] = "Sin Trusts. Luchar junto a otros jugadores es como se progresa.",
    ["No Wings of the Goddess or later content, including Dancer, Scholar, Geomancer, and Rune Fencer."] = "Sin Wings of the Goddess ni contenido posterior, incluidos Dancer, Scholar, Geomancer y Rune Fencer.",
    ["Nogelle, Port San d'Oria"] = "Nogelle, Port San d'Oria",
    ["Northern Fur x4 pays 1,500 gil and drops from Giant Hunter enemies in Qufim Island, and from Giant Lobber enemies in Lower Delkfutt's Tower or Middle Delkfutt's Tower. Southern Mummy x4 pays 3,000 gil and drops from Lich enemies in Western Altepa Desert."] = "Northern Fur x4 paga 1,500 gil y lo sueltan los enemigos Giant Hunter de Qufim Island y los Giant Lobber de Lower Delkfutt's Tower o Middle Delkfutt's Tower. Southern Mummy x4 paga 3,000 gil y lo sueltan los enemigos Lich de Western Altepa Desert.",
    ["Now you must complete Cook-a-roon? to get a Nashmau Stew. Buying one from the Auction House will not work, and keeping one from a previous repeat of Cook-a-roon? will not work either."] = "Ahora debes completar Cook-a-roon? para conseguir un Nashmau Stew. Comprar uno en la Auction House no sirve, y conservar uno de una repetición anterior de Cook-a-roon? tampoco sirve.",
    ["Nyzul Isle Staging Point entrance"] = "entrada del Nyzul Isle Staging Point",
    ["Objective: allied scholars have determined that an unseen barrier is preventing direct damage to the walls of Castle Zvahl, greatly impeding our siege effort."] = "Objetivo: los eruditos aliados han determinado que una barrera invisible impide dañar directamente los muros de Castle Zvahl, lo que entorpece mucho nuestro asedio.",
    ["Objective: ambush one of the enemy's supply caravans."] = "Objetivo: emboscar una de las caravanas de suministros del enemigo.",
    ["Objective: assist in devising a plan to secure safe supply transport."] = "Objetivo: ayudar a idear un plan para asegurar el transporte seguro de suministros.",
    ["Objective: attack and defeat any suppliers, seize the cargo and return it."] = "Objetivo: atacar y derrotar a cualquier proveedor, capturar la carga y devolverla.",
    ["Objective: bomb an enemy stronghold."] = "Objetivo: bombardear una fortaleza enemiga.",
    ["Objective: bring supplies to a stronghold of your nation."] = "Objetivo: llevar suministros a una fortaleza de tu nación.",
    ["Objective: carry hazardous materials to the stronghold."] = "Objetivo: llevar materiales peligrosos a la fortaleza.",
    ["Objective: escort a Reinforcement to the outpost."] = "Objetivo: escoltar a un Reinforcement hasta el puesto avanzado.",
    ["Objective: fend off a beastman siege against one of your nation's strongholds."] = "Objetivo: rechazar un asedio de las bestias contra una de las fortalezas de tu nación.",
    ["Objective: find a Suspicious Object in Bastok."] = "Objetivo: encontrar un Suspicious Object en Bastok.",
    ["Objective: find a Suspicious Object in San d'Oria."] = "Objetivo: encontrar un Suspicious Object en San d'Oria.",
    ["Objective: find a Suspicious Object in Windurst."] = "Objetivo: encontrar un Suspicious Object en Windurst.",
    ["Objective: fortify strongholds against siege turrets."] = "Objetivo: fortificar las fortalezas contra las torretas de asedio.",
    ["Objective: gather intelligence from an enemy fortress."] = "Objetivo: reunir información de una fortaleza enemiga.",
    ["Objective: give needed supplies to Bastok."] = "Objetivo: entregar los suministros que necesita Bastok.",
    ["Objective: give needed supplies to San d'Oria."] = "Objetivo: entregar los suministros que necesita San d'Oria.",
    ["Objective: give needed supplies to Windurst."] = "Objetivo: entregar los suministros que necesita Windurst.",
    ["Objective: infiltrate an enemy stronghold and gather as much data as possible."] = "Objetivo: infiltrarte en una fortaleza enemiga y reunir todos los datos posibles.",
    ["Objective: join a campaign battle and assist in your nation's siege of a beastman stronghold."] = "Objetivo: unirte a una batalla de campaña y ayudar en el asedio de tu nación a una fortaleza bestia.",
    ["Objective: join a campaign battle and assist in your nation's siege of the Northlands."] = "Objetivo: unirte a una batalla de campaña y ayudar en el asedio de tu nación a las Northlands.",
    ["Objective: lend your crafting knowledge to crafting adepts."] = "Objetivo: poner tu conocimiento de artesanía al servicio de artesanos expertos.",
    ["Objective: lend your crafting knowledge to unskilled crafters."] = "Objetivo: poner tu conocimiento de artesanía al servicio de artesanos sin experiencia.",
    ["Objective: patrol local territories and eliminate any immediate threats."] = "Objetivo: patrullar los territorios locales y eliminar cualquier amenaza inmediata.",
    ["Objective: travel to La Vaule and defeat Darkheir Grradhod."] = "Objetivo: viajar a La Vaule y derrotar a Darkheir Grradhod.",
    ["Objective: travel to Vunkerl Inlet (J-7) and obliterate the beastmen campground in Everbloom Hollow."] = "Objetivo: viajar a Vunkerl Inlet (J-7) y arrasar el campamento de las bestias en Everbloom Hollow.",
    ["Objective: travel to the area named by the operation and obliterate the beastmen campground there."] = "Objetivo: viajar a la zona que indica la operación y arrasar allí el campamento de las bestias.",
    ["Obtain 1 Scream Fungus and 1 Land Crab Meat and trade them to Valgeir."] = "Consigue 1 Scream Fungus y 1 Land Crab Meat y entrégaselos a Valgeir.",
    ["Obtain 10 Rusty Leggings (they are fished up or come from a Goblin Box) and trade them to Heizo. You do not have to trade all 10 at the same time, as he remembers how many you have traded."] = "Consigue 10 Rusty Leggings (se pescan o salen de un Goblin Box) y entrégaselos a Heizo. No hace falta entregar los 10 a la vez, porque él recuerda cuántos le has entregado.",
    ["Obtain 10 Rusty Subligar (they are fished up) and trade them to Heiji. You do not have to trade all 10 at the same time, as he remembers how many you have traded."] = "Consigue 10 Rusty Subligar (se pescan) y entrégaselos a Heiji. No hace falta entregar los 10 a la vez, porque él recuerda cuántos le has entregado.",
    ["Obtain 12 sheets of Vellum."] = "Obtén 12 hojas de Vellum.",
    ["Obtain 2 Cluster Cores, a fairly common drop from Cluster-type monsters."] = "Consigue 2 Cluster Cores, un drop bastante común de los monstruos Cluster-type.",
    ["Obtain 2 Dhalmel Meat and trade them to Rycharde to complete the quest. You receive 1,500 gil and the title Purveyor in Training."] = "Consigue 2 Dhalmel Meat y entrégaselos a Rycharde para completar la quest. Recibes 1,500 gil y el título Purveyor in Training.",
    ["Obtain 2 Hippogryph Tailfeathers and trade them to Ferchinne for your reward, the Mistmelt. You can repeat the quest."] = "Consigue 2 Hippogryph Tailfeathers y entrégaselas a Ferchinne por tu recompensa, el Mistmelt. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Obtain 2 Lufet Salts from River Crabs in West Ronfaure."] = "Obtén 2 Lufet Salts de los River Crabs de West Ronfaure.",
    ["Obtain 3 Black Tiger Hides."] = "Obtén 3 Black Tiger Hides.",
    ["Obtain 3 Lizard Skins. They can be bought from Cletae in Southern San d'Oria (D-8) for 600 gil, but only with Leathercraft Recruit rank or higher."] = "Obtén 3 Lizard Skins. Se pueden comprar a Cletae en Southern San d'Oria (D-8) por 600 gil, pero solo con rango Leathercraft Recruit o superior.",
    ["Obtain 3 Sheepskins."] = "Obtén 3 Sheepskins.",
    ["Obtain 4 Ladybug Wings."] = "Obtén 4 Ladybug Wings.",
    ["Obtain Adaman Ore."] = "Obtén Adaman Ore.",
    ["Obtain Astragalos x4 and trade them to Koru-Moru. Astragalos can be bought from Shih Tayuun at the Bonecraft Guild in Windurst Woods (H-12) for 2,439 gil, but it is only restocked if players sell it to the guild."] = "Obtén Astragalos x4 y entrégalos a Koru-Moru. Los Astragalos se pueden comprar a Shih Tayuun en el Bonecraft Guild de Windurst Woods (H-12) por 2,439 gil, pero solo se reponen si los jugadores se los venden al guild.",
    ["Obtain Bastore Sweeper, Walnut, Dragon Fruit, and Pepperoni."] = "Obtén Bastore Sweeper, Walnut, Dragon Fruit y Pepperoni.",
    ["Obtain Bat Wing x2."] = "Obtén Bat Wing x2.",
    ["Obtain Beehive Chip x3 or Remi Shell x2. Beehive Chip can be bought for 40 gil from Odoba at the Alchemy Guild in Bastok Mines (K-6)."] = "Obtén Beehive Chip x3 o Remi Shell x2. El Beehive Chip se puede comprar por 40 gil a Odoba en el Alchemy Guild de Bastok Mines (K-6).",
    ["Obtain Beeswax x2."] = "Obtén Beeswax x2.",
    ["Obtain Black Tiger Fang x3. It can be found at the Auction House (Materials, Bonecraft) or bought from Retto-Marutto in Windurst Woods (H-13) for 2,000 gil."] = "Obtén Black Tiger Fang x3. Se puede encontrar en la Auction House (Materials, Bonecraft) o comprar a Retto-Marutto en Windurst Woods (H-13) por 2,000 gil.",
    ["Obtain Bone Chip x2 and a Bomb Ash; both can be bought from NPCs."] = "Obtén Bone Chip x2 y un Bomb Ash; ambos se pueden comprar a NPCs.",
    ["Obtain Brand of Twilight and Brand of Dawn."] = "Obtén el Brand of Twilight y el Brand of Dawn.",
    ["Obtain Crawler's Eggs and bring them to Rycharde to complete the quest. You receive 3,000 gil and the title Four-Star Purveyor."] = "Consigue Crawler's Eggs y llévaselos a Rycharde para completar la quest. Recibes 3,000 gil y el título Four-Star Purveyor.",
    ["Obtain Darksteel Ore x2 from the Auction House, Mog Garden, mining or other sources."] = "Obtén Darksteel Ore x2 en la Auction House, en el Mog Garden, minando u otras fuentes.",
    ["Obtain Flint Stone x4. It can be found at the Auction House (Materials, Goldsmithing) or dropped by worm enemies such as Tunnel Worm in East Ronfaure, West Ronfaure, North Gustaberg and South Gustaberg."] = "Obtén Flint Stone x4. Se puede encontrar en la Auction House (Materials, Goldsmithing) o la sueltan enemigos gusano como Tunnel Worm en East Ronfaure, West Ronfaure, North Gustaberg y South Gustaberg.",
    ["Obtain Flint Stone x4. It drops from worm type enemies such as Tunnel Worm, Carrion Worm and Stone Eater, and can also be found at the Auction House (Materials, Goldsmithing)."] = "Obtén Flint Stone x4. La sueltan enemigos de tipo gusano como Tunnel Worm, Carrion Worm y Stone Eater, y también se puede encontrar en la Auction House (Materials, Goldsmithing).",
    ["Obtain Gausebit Grass x4. It drops from Wadi Hare enemies in Dangruf Wadi and Crane Fly enemies in Meriphataud Mountains."] = "Obtén Gausebit Grass x4. La sueltan los enemigos Wadi Hare de Dangruf Wadi y los enemigos Crane Fly de Meriphataud Mountains.",
    ["Obtain Goblin Mess Tin, Goblin Mushpot, and Twinkle Powder."] = "Obtén Goblin Mess Tin, Goblin Mushpot y Twinkle Powder.",
    ["Obtain Gysahl Greens and ride a Chocobo in the assigned zone."] = "Obtén Gysahl Greens y monta un Chocobo en la zona asignada.",
    ["Obtain Hare Meat x5. For low-level players, Wild Rabbit and Forest Hare enemies can be defeated for experience points and have a chance to drop it."] = "Obtén Hare Meat x5. Para jugadores de nivel bajo, los enemigos Wild Rabbit y Forest Hare se pueden derrotar para obtener experiencia y tienen posibilidad de soltarla.",
    ["Obtain Honey x5. It drops from Maneating Hornet enemies in North Gustaberg and South Gustaberg, or can be bought from Chomo Jinjahl in Windurst Waters North (E-8) for 200 gil with Cooking Guild Recruit rank or higher."] = "Obtén Honey x5. Cae de Maneating Hornet en North Gustaberg y South Gustaberg, o se puede comprar a Chomo Jinjahl en Windurst Waters North (E-8) por 200 gil con rango Cooking Guild Recruit o superior.",
    ["Obtain Jody's Acid from Ameretats in Bhaflau Thickets or Wajaom Woodlands."] = "Obtén Jody's Acid de los Ameretats de Bhaflau Thickets o Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Obtain Laminated Ram Leather, Sheep Leather, and Silk Thread and trade them to Kipopo."] = "Obtén Laminated Ram Leather, Sheep Leather y Silk Thread y entrégaselos a Kipopo.",
    ["Obtain Lufet Salt x3."] = "Obtén Lufet Salt x3.",
    ["Obtain Rice Vinegar, Ground Wasabi, and Holy Basil."] = "Obtén Rice Vinegar, Ground Wasabi y Holy Basil.",
    ["Obtain Rock Salt, Gausebit Grass and Lizard Egg. You may need several of each."] = "Obtén Rock Salt, Gausebit Grass y Lizard Egg. Puede que necesites varios de cada uno.",
    ["Obtain Ronfaure Maple Syrup by logging in East Ronfaure (S), Long-life Biscuits from the Tree Hollow behind Rholont (E-7), and a Flask of Kingdom Water from the Well east of Rholont (E-7)."] = "Obtén Ronfaure Maple Syrup talando en East Ronfaure (S), Long-life Biscuits del Tree Hollow detrás de Rholont (E-7) y un Flask of Kingdom Water del Well al este de Rholont (E-7).",
    ["Obtain Shaman Garlic x2, which drops from Orcish Cursemaker enemies."] = "Obtén Shaman Garlic x2, que cae de enemigos Orcish Cursemaker.",
    ["Obtain Shell Bug x3 from Quadav enemies or at the Auction House, and trade them to Ronan. Shell Bug can also be obtained from the Green Thumb Moogle if you have a Baby eft memento."] = "Obtén Shell Bug x3 de enemigos Quadav o en la Auction House y entrégalos a Ronan. El Shell Bug también se puede obtener del Green Thumb Moogle si tienes un Baby eft memento.",
    ["Obtain Silk Thread x3 or Crawler Calculus x3. Both drop from Crawler enemies in East Sarutabaruta and West Sarutabaruta."] = "Obtén Silk Thread x3 o Crawler Calculus x3. Ambos los sueltan enemigos Crawler en East Sarutabaruta y West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Obtain Sleepshroom, Treant Bulb or Wild Onion and trade it to her depending on the time of day. Sleepshroom pays 200 gil from 18:00 to 5:59, Treant Bulb 200 gil from 6:00 to 11:59, and Wild Onion 350 gil from 12:00 to 17:59. If you trade an item that does not match the time of day, you only receive 100 gil."] = "Obtén Sleepshroom, Treant Bulb o Wild Onion y entrégaselo según la hora del día. Sleepshroom paga 200 gil de 18:00 a 5:59, Treant Bulb 200 gil de 6:00 a 11:59 y Wild Onion 350 gil de 12:00 a 17:59. Si entregas un objeto que no corresponde a la hora, solo recibes 100 gil.",
    ["Obtain Stone of Brihaspati."] = "Obtén Stone of Brihaspati.",
    ["Obtain Stone of Budha."] = "Obtén Stone of Budha.",
    ["Obtain Stone of Chandra."] = "Obtén Stone of Chandra.",
    ["Obtain Stone of Ketu."] = "Obtén Stone of Ketu.",
    ["Obtain Stone of Mangala."] = "Obtén Stone of Mangala.",
    ["Obtain Stone of Rahu."] = "Obtén Stone of Rahu.",
    ["Obtain Stone of Shani."] = "Obtén Stone of Shani.",
    ["Obtain Stone of Shukra."] = "Obtén Stone of Shukra.",
    ["Obtain Stone of Surya."] = "Obtén Stone of Surya.",
    ["Obtain Thyme Moss and return it to Amaura, who gives you Cough Medicine."] = "Obtén Thyme Moss y devuélvesela a Amaura, que te da Cough Medicine.",
    ["Obtain Wild Onion x4 and trade them to him."] = "Obtén Wild Onion x4 y entrégaselos.",
    ["Obtain Yagudo Necklace x4."] = "Obtén Yagudo Necklace x4.",
    ["Obtain Zinc Ore x4. It can be bought from Teerth in Bastok Markets for 200 gil, from Celestina in Mhaura for 200 gil, or at the Auction House, or you can mine it from a Mineral Vein."] = "Obtén Zinc Ore x4. Se puede comprar a Teerth en Bastok Markets por 200 gil, a Celestina en Mhaura por 200 gil, o en la Auction House, o minarlo de una Mineral Vein.",
    ["Obtain a Beehive Chip and a Dhalmel Meat and trade them to Rycharde to complete the quest. You receive between 1,000 and 1,500 gil and the title One-Star Purveyor."] = "Consigue un Beehive Chip y un Dhalmel Meat y entrégaselos a Rycharde para completar la quest. Recibes entre 1,000 y 1,500 gil y el título One-Star Purveyor.",
    ["Obtain a Beetle Shell and a Hecteyes Eye."] = "Obtén una Beetle Shell y un Hecteyes Eye.",
    ["Obtain a Bird Feather. It can be bought at the Auction House, or dropped by Carrion Crow enemies outside Windurst."] = "Obtén una Bird Feather. Se puede comprar en la Auction House, o la sueltan enemigos Carrion Crow fuera de Windurst.",
    ["Obtain a Bloody Robe, a Dhalmel Saliva and a Wild Rabbit Tail and bring them to Vera."] = "Consigue un Bloody Robe, un Dhalmel Saliva y un Wild Rabbit Tail y llévaselos a Vera.",
    ["Obtain a Blue Mage's Testimony from Mamool Ja Mimicker enemies."] = "Consigue un Blue Mage's Testimony de los enemigos Mamool Ja Mimicker.",
    ["Obtain a Boarding Permit through The Road to Aht Urhgan or the Rhapsodies of Vana'diel progression."] = "Obtén un Boarding Permit mediante The Road to Aht Urhgan o la progresión de Rhapsodies of Vana'diel.",
    ["Obtain a Bomb Ash from the Auction House, from Tenshodo or Alchemy vendors, or by farming Lantern and Bomb type monsters."] = "Obtén un Bomb Ash de la Auction House, de vendedores de Tenshodo o de Alchemy, o farmeando monstruos de tipo Lantern y Bomb.",
    ["Obtain a Bone Chip from the Auction House or by farming Skeleton type monsters."] = "Obtén un Bone Chip en la Auction House o farmeando monstruos de tipo Skeleton.",
    ["Obtain a Brass Hairpin. It can be bought at the Auction House, or crafted."] = "Obtén una Brass Hairpin. Se puede comprar en la Auction House o fabricar.",
    ["Obtain a Bruised Starfruit, which drops from Cursed Weapon enemies (levels 43-45) in Xarcabard."] = "Obtén una Bruised Starfruit, que sueltan enemigos Cursed Weapon (niveles 43-45) en Xarcabard.",
    ["Obtain a Carbuncle's Ruby from a Leech enemy."] = "Obtén un Carbuncle's Ruby de un enemigo Leech.",
    ["Obtain a Cathedral Tapestry. It drops from Orcish Fighter enemies in Fort Ghelsba or the Yughott Grotto. Trade it to Sobane."] = "Obtén un Cathedral Tapestry. Cae de enemigos Orcish Fighter en Fort Ghelsba o Yughott Grotto. Entrégaselo a Sobane.",
    ["Obtain a Cernunnos Bulb from Wandering Saplings in Jugner Forest [S] if necessary."] = "Obtén un Cernunnos Bulb de los Wandering Saplings en Jugner Forest [S] si es necesario.",
    ["Obtain a Clean Snap Rod. You can speak to Keshab-Menjab again for some additional dialogue."] = "Consigue una Clean Snap Rod. Puedes volver a hablar con Keshab-Menjab para algo de diálogo adicional.",
    ["Obtain a Cold Bone, which can be bought at the Auction House or dropped by Doom Soldier enemies that appear at night in Cape Teriggan."] = "Obtén un Cold Bone, que se puede comprar en la Auction House o que sueltan enemigos Doom Soldier que aparecen de noche en Cape Teriggan.",
    ["Obtain a Copper Ingot from the Auction House, Goldsmithing guild shops, or by crafting it. To buy the Copper Ore for crafting at a guild shop, visit Teerth or Visala in Bastok Markets (H-8), or Yabby Tanmikey or Celestina in Mhaura (G-8)."] = "Obtén un Copper Ingot en la Auction House, en las tiendas del Goldsmithing guild o fabricándolo. Para comprar el Copper Ore para fabricar en una tienda del guild, visita a Teerth o Visala en Bastok Markets (H-8), o a Yabby Tanmikey o Celestina en Mhaura (G-8).",
    ["Obtain a Copper Ring, either at the Auction House, from merchants (Carmelide or Raghd in Bastok Markets) or by crafting it."] = "Obtén un Copper Ring, en la Auction House, de mercaderes (Carmelide o Raghd en Bastok Markets) o fabricándolo.",
    ["Obtain a Damselfly Worm, a Magicked Skull and a Crab Apron and bring them to Isacio."] = "Consigue un Damselfly Worm, un Magicked Skull y un Crab Apron y llévaselos a Isacio.",
    ["Obtain a Darksteel Ingot from the Auction House or by crafting it. One is enough for multiple people doing the quest."] = "Obtén un Darksteel Ingot en la Auction House o fabricándolo. Uno basta para varias personas que hagan la quest.",
    ["Obtain a Derfland Humus. It drops from Doom Scorpion enemies in Crawlers' Nest, and can also be purchased at the Auction House."] = "Obtén un Derfland Humus. Cae de enemigos Doom Scorpion en Crawlers' Nest y también se puede comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Desert Venom, which drops from Doom Scorpion enemies in Eastern Altepa Desert and Tulwar Scorpion enemies in Western Altepa Desert, or buy one at the Auction House."] = "Consigue un Desert Venom, que sueltan los enemigos Doom Scorpion de Eastern Altepa Desert y los Tulwar Scorpion de Western Altepa Desert, o cómpralo en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Dog Collar, either at the Auction House or by farming Black Wolf enemies in North Gustaberg and South Gustaberg at night (game time 20:00 to 04:00)."] = "Obtén un Dog Collar, en la Auction House o farmeando enemigos Black Wolf en North Gustaberg y South Gustaberg de noche (hora del juego 20:00 a 04:00).",
    ["Obtain a Doll Gizmo."] = "Obtén un Doll Gizmo.",
    ["Obtain a Faded Crystal and trade it to Cid (H-8)."] = "Obtén un Faded Crystal y entrégaselo a Cid (H-8).",
    ["Obtain a Fei'Yin Chest Key by defeating Shadow, Underworld Bat and Ore Golem enemies in that area."] = "Obtén una Fei'Yin Chest Key derrotando a enemigos Shadow, Underworld Bat y Ore Golem de esa zona.",
    ["Obtain a Flame Degen. It can be purchased at the Auction House, purchased with Sparks of Eminence, crafted, or it rarely drops from Napalm enemies."] = "Obtén una Flame Degen. Se puede comprar en la Auction House, comprar con Sparks of Eminence, fabricar, o la sueltan raramente los enemigos Napalm.",
    ["Obtain a Garnet."] = "Consigue una Garnet.",
    ["Obtain a Giant Sheep Meat from the Auction House or from Ornery Sheep in South Gustaberg."] = "Obtén una Giant Sheep Meat en la Auction House o de los Ornery Sheep de South Gustaberg.",
    ["Obtain a Ginger Cookie, sold by the Curio Vendor Moogle or by Valeriano in Port Bastok, and trade it to Deidogg. The quest is not flagged in your log until after you trade the Ginger Cookie, and from then on it is active."] = "Obtén una Ginger Cookie, que vende el Curio Vendor Moogle o Valeriano en Port Bastok, y entrégala a Deidogg. La quest no queda marcada en tu log hasta que entregas la Ginger Cookie, y desde entonces está activa.",
    ["Obtain a Gnole Claw."] = "Obtén una Gnole Claw.",
    ["Obtain a Gold Earring. It can be obtained for free by completing the Records of Eminence objective Conflict: Xarcabard for the first time."] = "Obtén un Gold Earring. Se puede conseguir gratis completando por primera vez el objetivo de Records of Eminence Conflict: Xarcabard.",
    ["Obtain a Gusgen Clay from the Gusgen Mines."] = "Consigue un Gusgen Clay de las Gusgen Mines.",
    ["Obtain a Hamsi."] = "Obtén un Hamsi.",
    ["Obtain a Hare Meat."] = "Obtén un Hare Meat.",
    ["Obtain a Heavy Quadav Chestplate and Heavy Quadav Backplate."] = "Obtén un Heavy Quadav Chestplate y un Heavy Quadav Backplate.",
    ["Obtain a Kuftal Coffer Key and use it to open any coffer in Kuftal Tunnel. This gives you the key item Challenge to the Royal Knights."] = "Obtén una Kuftal Coffer Key y úsala para abrir cualquier cofre de Kuftal Tunnel. Esto te da el key item Challenge to the Royal Knights.",
    ["Obtain a Lamian Fang Key. Enter Arrapago Reef from Caedarva Mire at (I-6), use the Lamian Fang Key to pass through the Iron Gate in Arrapago Reef, and continue through Arrapago Reef to exit back into Caedarva Mire."] = "Consigue una Lamian Fang Key. Entra en Arrapago Reef desde Caedarva Mire en (I-6), usa la Lamian Fang Key para atravesar la Iron Gate de Arrapago Reef y sigue por Arrapago Reef para salir de nuevo a Caedarva Mire.",
    ["Obtain a Lamian Fang Key. You can get one from a ??? in Caedarva Mire at (I-7), in a small crevice behind a Jnun, or it can drop from a Reserve Draugar in Caedarva Mire. Otherwise, obtain it from Merrow enemies inside Arrapago Reef."] = "Consigue una Lamian Fang Key. Puedes conseguir una de una ??? en Caedarva Mire en (I-7), en una pequeña grieta detrás de un Jnun, o puede caer de un Reserve Draugar en Caedarva Mire. Si no, consíguela de los enemigos Merrow dentro de Arrapago Reef.",
    ["Obtain a Lilac."] = "Obtén un Lilac.",
    ["Obtain a Lilac. It can be bought at the Auction House, or from Areebah in Upper Jeuno (H-6) for 120 gil."] = "Obtén un Lilac. Se puede comprar en la Auction House, o a Areebah en Upper Jeuno (H-6) por 120 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Lizard Egg."] = "Obtén un Lizard Egg.",
    ["Obtain a Luminicloth, a Revival Tree Root and a Wolf Hide. All three can be found at the Auction House."] = "Obtén una Luminicloth, una Revival Tree Root y una Wolf Hide. Las tres se pueden encontrar en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Marguerite. It can be bought at the Auction House, or from Areebah in Upper Jeuno (H-6) for 120 gil."] = "Obtén una Marguerite. Se puede comprar en la Auction House o a Areebah en Upper Jeuno (H-6) por 120 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Mary's Milk. It drops from Stray Mary in Konschtat Highlands, and can also be bought at the Auction House."] = "Obtén un Mary's Milk. Cae de Stray Mary en Konschtat Highlands y también se puede comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Mythril Sallet from the Auction House (Armor, Head) or for 437 Sparks."] = "Obtén un Mythril Sallet de la Auction House (Armor, Head) o por 437 Sparks.",
    ["Obtain a Palborough Chest Key. It drops from Scimitar Scorpion, Brass Quadav, Copper Quadav and Old Quadav enemies in Palborough Mines, or can be bought from the Curio Vendor Moogle for 2,500 gil if you have the key item Rhapsody in White."] = "Obtén una Palborough Chest Key. La sueltan enemigos Scimitar Scorpion, Brass Quadav, Copper Quadav y Old Quadav en Palborough Mines, o se puede comprar al Curio Vendor Moogle por 2,500 gil si tienes el key item Rhapsody in White.",
    ["Obtain a Papaka Grass."] = "Obtén una Papaka Grass.",
    ["Obtain a Parchment, which Pikini-Mikini sells in Mhaura (G-9) for 2,019 gil, and a Black Ink, which Maymunah sells in Bastok Mines (K-7) for 570 gil."] = "Consigue un Parchment, que vende Pikini-Mikini en Mhaura (G-9) por 2,019 gil, y una Black Ink, que vende Maymunah en Bastok Mines (K-7) por 570 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Philosopher's Stone."] = "Obtén una Philosopher's Stone.",
    ["Obtain a Piece of Rugged Tree Bark through logging."] = "Obtén un Piece of Rugged Tree Bark talando.",
    ["Obtain a Puffball and trade it to Rycharde to complete the quest. You receive 2,100 gil and the title Two-Star Purveyor."] = "Consigue un Puffball y entrégaselo a Rycharde para completar la quest. Recibes 2,100 gil y el título Two-Star Purveyor.",
    ["Obtain a Punch Bug from Lou Carcolhs, Ancient Quadavs, Vajra Quadavs, or Gold Quadavs in Pashhow Marshlands [S] or Beadeaux [S]."] = "Obtén un Punch Bug de Lou Carcolhs, Ancient Quadavs, Vajra Quadavs o Gold Quadavs en Pashhow Marshlands [S] o Beadeaux [S].",
    ["Obtain a Puppetmaster's Testimony (Pup. Testimony). It drops from Troll Surveillant enemies in Bhaflau Thickets (F-8, northern map) and from Troll Engraver enemies in Halvung. It can be used for up to three fight attempts before you need a new one."] = "Obtén un Puppetmaster's Testimony (Pup. Testimony). Lo sueltan enemigos Troll Surveillant en Bhaflau Thickets (F-8, mapa norte) y enemigos Troll Engraver en Halvung. Se puede usar para hasta tres intentos de combate antes de necesitar uno nuevo.",
    ["Obtain a Quadav Backplate, either at the Auction House or by farming Amethyst Quadav enemies in North Gustaberg, South Gustaberg, Palborough Mines or Konschtat Highlands."] = "Obtén un Quadav Backplate, ya sea en la Auction House o farmeando enemigos Amethyst Quadav en North Gustaberg, South Gustaberg, Palborough Mines o Konschtat Highlands.",
    ["Obtain a Quadav Backscale from Quadavs in Palborough Mines."] = "Obtén un Quadav Backscale de los Quadavs de Palborough Mines.",
    ["Obtain a Quadav Helm. It only drops from Old Quadav enemies in Beadeaux; Old Quadav in other areas do not drop the same items. It can also be bought at the Auction House (Others, Beast-made)."] = "Obtén un Quadav Helm. Solo lo sueltan enemigos Old Quadav en Beadeaux; los Old Quadav de otras zonas no sueltan los mismos objetos. También se puede comprar en la Auction House (Others, Beast-made).",
    ["Obtain a Rabbit Hide, a Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud and an Insect Wing."] = "Obtén una Rabbit Hide, un Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud y un Insect Wing.",
    ["Obtain a Rain Lily."] = "Consigue una Rain Lily.",
    ["Obtain a Rampaging Horn and a Lumbering Horn."] = "Obtén un Rampaging Horn y un Lumbering Horn.",
    ["Obtain a Rarab Tail. It can be bought from the Sarutabaruta regional vendor, for example Baehu-Faehu in Windurst Waters North (G-5), for about 22 gil."] = "Obtén una Rarab Tail. Se puede comprar al vendedor regional de Sarutabaruta, por ejemplo Baehu-Faehu en Windurst Waters North (G-5), por unos 22 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Red Oven Mitt from Copper Quadav and Onyx Quadav enemies in Grauberg (S)."] = "Obtén una Red Oven Mitt de enemigos Copper Quadav y Onyx Quadav en Grauberg (S).",
    ["Obtain a Revival Tree Root. It can be bought at the Auction House (Materials, Alchemy) or dropped by Ghost-type enemies, and it does not need to come from King Ranperre's Tomb."] = "Obtén una Revival Tree Root. Se puede comprar en la Auction House (Materials, Alchemy) o la sueltan enemigos Ghost-type, y no tiene que venir de King Ranperre's Tomb.",
    ["Obtain a Rolanberry 874, either at the Auction House (Food, Ingredients) or by defeating the Drone Crawler (G) in Crawlers' Nest (Survival Guide, Derfland Region)."] = "Obtén un Rolanberry 874, en la Auction House (Food, Ingredients) o derrotando al Drone Crawler (G) en Crawlers' Nest (Survival Guide, Derfland Region).",
    ["Obtain a Rose Wand, an Oak Staff and a Mythril Rod. All three can be bought with sparks: the Oak Staff and the Mythril Rod are in the level 30-39 category, the Rose Wand in the level 40-49 category."] = "Obtén una Rose Wand, un Oak Staff y una Mythril Rod. Los tres se pueden comprar con sparks: el Oak Staff y la Mythril Rod están en la categoría de nivel 30-39, la Rose Wand en la de nivel 40-49.",
    ["Obtain a Royal Jelly. Death Jacket enemies are common near the main entrance of Crawlers' Nest."] = "Obtén una Royal Jelly. Los enemigos Death Jacket son comunes cerca de la entrada principal de Crawlers' Nest.",
    ["Obtain a Sahagin Key, which the quest requires."] = "Obtén una Sahagin Key, que la quest requiere.",
    ["Obtain a Sahagin Key."] = "Obtén una Sahagin Key.",
    ["Obtain a Sand Bat Fang. It can be bought at the Auction House (Materials, Bonecraft) or taken from Sand Bat enemies found in the tunnels of Valkurm Dunes. It is also a Records of Eminence objective: Combat (Wide Area), Combat (Spoils) 2, Spoils (Sand Bat Fang)."] = "Obtén un Sand Bat Fang. Se puede comprar en la Auction House (Materials, Bonecraft) o conseguir de enemigos Sand Bat en los túneles de Valkurm Dunes. También es un objetivo de Records of Eminence: Combat (Wide Area), Combat (Spoils) 2, Spoils (Sand Bat Fang).",
    ["Obtain a Sand Charm, which drops from Crossbones on the Ferry between Mhaura and Selbina. Crossbones appear on the ferry only when pirates attack, which is a rare occurrence."] = "Consigue una Sand Charm, que sueltan los Crossbones del Ferry entre Mhaura y Selbina. Los Crossbones aparecen en el ferry solo cuando atacan piratas, algo poco frecuente.",
    ["Obtain a Savory Lamb Roast through harvesting."] = "Obtén un Savory Lamb Roast recolectando.",
    ["Obtain a Scorpion Stinger. It drops from Labyrinth Scorpion and Maze Scorpion enemies in the Maze of Shakhrami, and from Diplopod enemies in Kuftal Tunnel."] = "Obtén un Scorpion Stinger. Lo sueltan enemigos Labyrinth Scorpion y Maze Scorpion en Maze of Shakhrami, y enemigos Diplopod en Kuftal Tunnel.",
    ["Obtain a Shell Shield, either at the Auction House or from Young Quadav enemies in North Gustaberg, South Gustaberg, Palborough Mines or Konschtat Highlands. Only level 7 or higher WAR, RDM, PLD, BST and SAM can equip it."] = "Obtén un Shell Shield, ya sea en la Auction House o de enemigos Young Quadav en North Gustaberg, South Gustaberg, Palborough Mines o Konschtat Highlands. Solo WAR, RDM, PLD, BST y SAM de nivel 7 o superior pueden equiparlo.",
    ["Obtain a Silver Ingot from the Auction House or by crafting it. This quest follows The Elvaan Goldsmith."] = "Obtén un Silver Ingot en la Auction House o fabricándolo. Esta quest sigue a The Elvaan Goldsmith.",
    ["Obtain a Silver Name Tag. It can be bought at the Auction House, or dropped by Onyx Quadav and Greater Quadav enemies in Palborough Mines. Since the tags are rare, you can only turn in one at a time."] = "Obtén una Silver Name Tag. Se puede comprar en la Auction House, o la sueltan enemigos Onyx Quadav y Greater Quadav en Palborough Mines. Como las placas son raras, solo puedes entregar una a la vez.",
    ["Obtain a Slime Oil and a Frost Turnip."] = "Obtén un Slime Oil y un Frost Turnip.",
    ["Obtain a Smooth Stone, which drops from Crawler enemies in East Sarutabaruta and West Sarutabaruta."] = "Obtén una Smooth Stone, que sueltan enemigos Crawler en East Sarutabaruta y West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Obtain a Soiled Letter and trade it to Koblakiq to complete the quest and receive 4,000 gil."] = "Consigue una Soiled Letter y entrégasela a Koblakiq para completar la quest y recibir 4,000 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Star Spinel from Spelunking Sabotender enemies in Quicksand Caves. Enter from Western Altepa Desert at (G-5); they are in the passageway near (F-7), and a couple spawn by Home Point #1. Sneak is required even at level 99. The weight sensors need one Galka or any two of Hume, Elvaan or Mithra."] = "Obtén un Star Spinel de enemigos Spelunking Sabotender en Quicksand Caves. Entra desde Western Altepa Desert en (G-5); están en el pasaje cerca de (F-7), y un par aparecen junto al Home Point #1. Se requiere Sneak incluso a nivel 99. Los sensores de peso necesitan un Galka o dos cualesquiera de Hume, Elvaan o Mithra.",
    ["Obtain a Steam Clock. You can buy one at the Auction House, or defeat Bubbly Bernie: get a Quus (a fish), from the Auction House or by fishing, travel to the lighthouse in South Gustaberg (M-10) and look for a ???, then trade the Quus to the ??? and Bubbly Bernie appears. Defeat him and loot his corpse for a Steam Clock."] = "Obtén un Steam Clock. Puedes comprar uno en la Auction House, o derrotar a Bubbly Bernie: consigue un Quus (un pez), en la Auction House o pescando, viaja al faro de South Gustaberg (M-10) y busca una ???, luego entrega el Quus a la ??? y aparece Bubbly Bernie. Derrótalo y saquea su cadáver para obtener un Steam Clock.",
    ["Obtain a Sturdy Metal Strip through mining."] = "Obtén un Sturdy Metal Strip minando.",
    ["Obtain a Sutlac and head off to Nashmau."] = "Consigue un Sutlac y parte hacia Nashmau.",
    ["Obtain a Tavnazian Liver and bring it to Despachiaire for your reward, 4,000 gil."] = "Consigue un Tavnazian Liver y llévaselo a Despachiaire por tu recompensa, 4,000 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Tonberry Board. It drops from Tonberry Pursuer enemies in the Temple of Uggalepih, Tonberry Shadower enemies in Yhoator Jungle and Tonberry Trailer enemies in the Den of Rancor."] = "Consigue un Tonberry Board. Lo sueltan los enemigos Tonberry Pursuer del Temple of Uggalepih, los Tonberry Shadower de Yhoator Jungle y los Tonberry Trailer del Den of Rancor.",
    ["Obtain a Twinstone Earring. It can be found at the Auction House, or farmed from Hill Lizard enemies in Meriphataud Mountains."] = "Obtén un Twinstone Earring. Se puede encontrar en la Auction House, o farmear de enemigos Hill Lizard en Meriphataud Mountains.",
    ["Obtain a Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud, which only drops from Mandragora enemies such as Tiny Mandragora in East and West Sarutabaruta."] = "Obtén un Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud, que solo sueltan enemigos Mandragora como Tiny Mandragora en East y West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Obtain a Valkurm Sunsand, either at the Auction House or by traveling to Valkurm Dunes."] = "Obtén una Valkurm Sunsand, en la Auction House o viajando a Valkurm Dunes.",
    ["Obtain a Warm Egg, which can be bought at the Auction House or dropped by Anemone enemies in Yhoator Jungle."] = "Obtén un Warm Egg, que se puede comprar en la Auction House o que sueltan enemigos Anemone en Yhoator Jungle.",
    ["Obtain a Wild Pamamas, which drops from Young Opo-opo enemies in Yuhtunga Jungle and can sometimes be found at the Auction House. On later repeats a Wild Melon also works. Despite what the NPC says, you do not need to bring Ice Clusters, as there are no Flame Spouts on the path."] = "Consigue una Wild Pamamas, que suelta los enemigos Young Opo-opo de Yuhtunga Jungle y a veces se encuentra en la Auction House. En repeticiones posteriores también sirve una Wild Melon. Aunque lo diga el NPC, no necesitas llevar Ice Clusters, porque en el camino no hay Flame Spouts.",
    ["Obtain a Yagudo Caulk from Yagudos in Giddeus."] = "Obtén un Yagudo Caulk de los Yagudos de Giddeus.",
    ["Obtain a Yagudo Cherry from a vendor or the Auction House. One is enough for multiple people doing the quest."] = "Obtén una Yagudo Cherry de un vendedor o de la Auction House. Una basta para varias personas que hagan la quest.",
    ["Obtain a Yagudo Headgear. It is crafted with Clothcraft (skill 80)."] = "Consigue un Yagudo Headgear. Se fabrica con Clothcraft (habilidad 80).",
    ["Obtain a Zinc Ore. Monsters in Gustaberg are known to drop it."] = "Obtén un Zinc Ore. Se sabe que los monstruos de Gustaberg lo sueltan.",
    ["Obtain a Zvahl Coffer Key and trade it to a Treasure Coffer in Castle Zvahl Baileys to get the key item Mique's paintbrush. You can buy the key from the Curio Vendor Moogle for 5,000 gil if you have the key item Rhapsody in Umber. It also drops from Ahriman, Abyssal Demon, Arch Demon, Blood Demon and Doom Demon, or a Thief can pick the coffer's lock with Thief's Tools, a Living Key or a Skeleton Key."] = "Obtén una Zvahl Coffer Key y entrégala a un Treasure Coffer de Castle Zvahl Baileys para obtener el key item Mique's paintbrush. Puedes comprar la llave al Curio Vendor Moogle por 5,000 gil si tienes el key item Rhapsody in Umber. También la sueltan Ahriman, Abyssal Demon, Arch Demon, Blood Demon y Doom Demon, o un Thief puede forzar la cerradura del cofre con Thief's Tools, una Living Key o una Skeleton Key.",
    ["Obtain a Zvahl Coffer Key. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells it; alternatively you can farm the key or pick the lock as a Thief."] = "Obtén una Zvahl Coffer Key. El Curio Vendor Moogle la vende; también puedes farmear la llave o forzar la cerradura como Thief.",
    ["Obtain a recommendation letter from the Allied fortress."] = "Obtén una carta de recomendación de la fortaleza Allied.",
    ["Obtain all three lights to gain access to the Tavnazian Archipelago."] = "Obtén las tres luces para acceder al Tavnazian Archipelago.",
    ["Obtain an Ahriman Lens and trade it to Ropunono."] = "Obtén un Ahriman Lens y entrégalo a Ropunono.",
    ["Obtain an Aht Urhgan boarding permit through the Tenshodo."] = "Obtén un Aht Urhgan boarding permit a través del Tenshodo.",
    ["Obtain an Amaryllis. It can be bought at the Auction House, or from Areebah in Upper Jeuno (H-6)."] = "Obtén una Amaryllis. Se puede comprar en la Auction House o a Areebah en Upper Jeuno (H-6).",
    ["Obtain an Animal Glue."] = "Obtén un Animal Glue.",
    ["Obtain an Arnica Root if you have not already."] = "Consigue una Arnica Root si aún no la tienes.",
    ["Obtain an Attohwa Ginseng, which drops from Gallinipper, Ogrefly and Monarch Ogrefly enemies in Attohwa Chasm."] = "Obtén un Attohwa Ginseng, que cae de enemigos Gallinipper, Ogrefly y Monarch Ogrefly en Attohwa Chasm.",
    ["Obtain an Elixir."] = "Obtén un Elixir.",
    ["Obtain an Elshimo Marble, which drops from Ivory Lizard enemies in Yuhtunga Jungle."] = "Consigue un Elshimo Marble, que sueltan los enemigos Ivory Lizard de Yuhtunga Jungle.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Chief Sergeant or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Chief Sergeant o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Corporal or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Corporal o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank First Lieutenant or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango First Lieutenant o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Lance Corporal or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Lance Corporal o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Private First Class or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Private First Class o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Private Second Class or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Private Second Class o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Second Lieutenant or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Second Lieutenant o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Sergeant Major or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Sergeant Major o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Sergeant or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Sergeant o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Superior Private or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Superior Private o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Orcish Armor Plate from Orcs in Yughott Grotto or King Ranperre's Tomb."] = "Obtén un Orcish Armor Plate de los Orcs de Yughott Grotto o King Ranperre's Tomb.",
    ["Obtain an Ordrynite. Enter Pso'Xja from Beaucedine Glacier (G-9) and defeat Cryptonberry Plaguer or Cryptonberry Stalker enemies for it. You can use an Outpost Warp or the Survival Guide to Beaucedine Glacier, then go to (G-9), or use Home Point #1 in Pso'Xja, Escape and go to (G-9). With Rank 10 Chocobo Digging you can probably get 10 in a day, although they are Rare, so you have to turn each one in."] = "Obtén un Ordrynite. Entra en Pso'Xja desde Beaucedine Glacier (G-9) y derrota a enemigos Cryptonberry Plaguer o Cryptonberry Stalker para conseguirlo. Puedes usar un Outpost Warp o la Survival Guide a Beaucedine Glacier y luego ir a (G-9), o usar el Home Point #1 en Pso'Xja, Escape y ir a (G-9). Con Rank 10 de Chocobo Digging probablemente consigas 10 en un día, aunque son Rare, así que tienes que entregar cada uno.",
    ["Obtain an Unlit Lantern unless another player can open the Rancor door for you."] = "Obtén una Unlit Lantern, a menos que otro jugador pueda abrirte la puerta de Rancor.",
    ["Obtain at least one Tablet of Hexes to receive credit for the following battlefield. Collecting all 16 grants the full set of battle enhancements."] = "Obtén al menos una Tablet of Hexes para recibir crédito en el siguiente campo de batalla. Reunir las 16 otorga el conjunto completo de mejoras de combate.",
    ["Obtain four Rancor Flames to pass through the Sacrificial Chamber entrance unless its Home Point is already unlocked."] = "Obtén cuatro Rancor Flames para pasar por la entrada de la Sacrificial Chamber, salvo que su Home Point ya esté desbloqueado.",
    ["Obtain one Giant Scale if necessary."] = "Obtén una Giant Scale si es necesario.",
    ["Obtain one or more Orb Key Items from the required Cardians in Outer Horutoto Ruins."] = "Obtén uno o más Orb Key Items de los Cardians requeridos en Outer Horutoto Ruins.",
    ["Obtain six Fat Worm Meat."] = "Obtén seis Fat Worm Meat.",
    ["Obtain some pickaxes, then go to the third floor of Palborough Mines."] = "Obtén algunas pickaxes y ve al tercer piso de Palborough Mines.",
    ["Obtain the Bowl of bland Goblin salad from Goblins in Batallia Downs."] = "Obtén el Bowl of bland Goblin salad de los Goblins de Batallia Downs.",
    ["Obtain the Chunk of smoked Goblin grub from Goblins in Sauromugue Champaign."] = "Obtén el Chunk of smoked Goblin grub de los Goblins de Sauromugue Champaign.",
    ["Obtain the Curse Wand."] = "Obtén la Curse Wand.",
    ["Obtain the Dark Sap crystal at (F-8), Map 1."] = "Obtén el Dark Sap crystal en (F-8), Map 1.",
    ["Obtain the Earth Sap crystal at (J-8) or (H-7), Map 1."] = "Obtén el Earth Sap crystal en (J-8) o (H-7), Map 1.",
    ["Obtain the Fire Sap crystal at (J-9), Map 1, or (F-10)/(J-8), Map 2."] = "Obtén el Fire Sap crystal en (J-9), Map 1, o en (F-10)/(J-8), Map 2.",
    ["Obtain the Ice Sap crystal at (I-8) or (H-7), Map 2."] = "Obtén el Ice Sap crystal en (I-8) o (H-7), Map 2.",
    ["Obtain the Jug of greasy Goblin juice from Goblins in Rolanberry Fields."] = "Obtén el Jug of greasy Goblin juice de los Goblins de Rolanberry Fields.",
    ["Obtain the Light Sap crystal at (G-8), Map 2; there are two possible positions."] = "Obtén el Light Sap crystal en (G-8), Map 2; hay dos posiciones posibles.",
    ["Obtain the Lightning Sap crystal at (H-7), Map 1, or (G-10/G-11), Map 2."] = "Obtén el Lightning Sap crystal en (H-7), Map 1, o en (G-10/G-11), Map 2.",
    ["Obtain the Loadstone from the Open Sesame quest if entering the weight doors solo."] = "Obtén el Loadstone de la quest Open Sesame si entras solo en las puertas de peso.",
    ["Obtain the Map of the Quicksand Caves."] = "Obtén el Map of the Quicksand Caves.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Agony."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Agony.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Bale."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Bale.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Blight."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Blight.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Death."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Death.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Deceit."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Deceit.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Despair."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Despair.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Dolor."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Dolor.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Envy."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Envy.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Greed."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Greed.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Malice."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Malice.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Penury."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Penury.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Pride."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Pride.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Rage."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Rage.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Rancor."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Rancor.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Regret."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Regret.",
    ["Obtain the Tablet of Hexes - Strife."] = "Obtén la Tablet of Hexes - Strife.",
    ["Obtain the Test Answers, which drop from Wendigo enemies inside Inner Horutoto Ruins and can also be bought at the Auction House."] = "Obtén los Test Answers, que sueltan enemigos Wendigo dentro de Inner Horutoto Ruins y que también se pueden comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain the Vunkerl Herb from the Leafy Patch."] = "Obtén la Vunkerl Herb del Leafy Patch.",
    ["Obtain the Water Sap crystal at (H-7) or (J-9), Map 1."] = "Obtén el Water Sap crystal en (H-7) o (J-9), Map 1.",
    ["Obtain the Wind Sap crystal at (H-9) or (J-9), Map 2."] = "Obtén el Wind Sap crystal en (H-9) o (J-9), Map 2.",
    ["Obtain the five fish he asks for: Ahtapot, Istakoz, Istavrit, Istiridye and Mercanbaligi. You can buy them at the Auction House or fish them up in the Treasures of Aht Urhgan zones."] = "Consigue los cinco pescados que pide: Ahtapot, Istakoz, Istavrit, Istiridye y Mercanbaligi. Puedes comprarlos en la Auction House o pescarlos en las zonas de Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain the requested item."] = "Consigue el objeto solicitado.",
    ["Obtain the requested item: Gold Beastcoin, Lynx Meat, or Nyumomo Doll."] = "Obtén el objeto solicitado: Gold Beastcoin, Lynx Meat o Nyumomo Doll.",
    ["Obtain the requested tomatoes."] = "Consigue los tomates solicitados.",
    ["Obtain the seven items by selecting them as your reward after defeating the seven Prime Avatars in the Trial battles: Bubbly Water, Egil's Torch, Eye of Nept, Desert Light, Elder Branch, Rust 'B' Gone and Ancients' Key."] = "Consigue los siete objetos eligiéndolos como recompensa tras derrotar a los siete Prime Avatars en las batallas de Trial: Bubbly Water, Egil's Torch, Eye of Nept, Desert Light, Elder Branch, Rust 'B' Gone y Ancients' Key.",
    ["Obtain two Coral Crest Keys and a Sealion Crest Key."] = "Obtén dos Coral Crest Keys y una Sealion Crest Key.",
    ["On a Full Moon cycle, at night, board the Jeuno to San d'Oria airship."] = "En un ciclo de Full Moon, de noche, sube a la airship de Jeuno a San d'Oria.",
    ["On the North map, talk to Clais near the bridge to the Rarab's Tail Hostelery (G-10), Kyume-Romeh in the Timbre Timbers Tavern (F-10), Tosuka-Porika in the east Optistery (G-8), Pechiru-Mashiru in the east Aurastery (L-6) and Machitata near the Mog House (L-11)."] = "En el mapa North, habla con Clais cerca del puente al Rarab's Tail Hostelery (G-10), Kyume-Romeh en la Timbre Timbers Tavern (F-10), Tosuka-Porika en el Optistery este (G-8), Pechiru-Mashiru en el Aurastery este (L-6) y Machitata cerca del Mog House (L-11).",
    ["On the first map of the Den of Rancor (Map C), drop down the hole at (J-7) to the sixth map (Map D) and enter the Cloister of Tides at (I-7)."] = "En el primer mapa del Den of Rancor (Map C), déjate caer por el agujero de (J-7) al sexto mapa (Map D) y entra en la Cloister of Tides en (I-7).",
    ["On the isle, follow the path to (H-9), near the center. There is a ??? that spawns 6 to 8 Peerifool enemies (Mandragora). Defeat them, then examine the ??? again."] = "En la isla, sigue el camino hasta (H-9), cerca del centro. Hay una ??? que invoca de 6 a 8 enemigos Peerifool (Mandragora). Derrótalos y luego examina de nuevo la ???.",
    ["On the third floor, trade the Gravel to the Refiner, pull the lever, drop to the second floor, pull the second lever, and obtain Mythril Sand."] = "En el tercer piso, entrega la Gravel al Refiner, tira de la palanca, déjate caer al segundo piso, tira de la segunda palanca y obtén Mythril Sand.",
    ["Once Dark Spark is defeated, examine one of the torches to receive the key item Shadow flames."] = "Cuando Dark Spark sea derrotado, examina una de las antorchas para recibir el key item Shadow flames.",
    ["Once all 10 are traded you receive your reward, the Scroll of Dokumori: Ichi, and the title Looks Good in Leggings."] = "Cuando hayas entregado los 10 recibes tu recompensa, el Scroll of Dokumori: Ichi, y el título Looks Good in Leggings.",
    ["Once all 10 are traded you receive your reward, the Scroll of Kurayami: Ichi, and the title Looks Sublime in a Subligar."] = "Cuando hayas entregado los 10 recibes tu recompensa, el Scroll of Kurayami: Ichi, y el título Looks Sublime in a Subligar.",
    ["Once all 15 Magicmart Flyers have been distributed, return to Regine and speak with her to end the quest."] = "Cuando hayas repartido los 15 Magicmart Flyers, vuelve con Regine y habla con ella para terminar la quest.",
    ["Once all parcels are delivered, speak with Fontoumant again for your reward."] = "Cuando hayas entregado todos los paquetes, vuelve a hablar con Fontoumant para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Once in Davoi you need to locate a Jar that contains the Power Sandals. The jar can spawn at (I-8), (K-9), (J-8), (H-8), (F-6), (J-9), (F-9), (G-9), (H-9) and (F-7)."] = "Una vez en Davoi, debes localizar un Jar que contiene las Power Sandals. La jarra puede aparecer en (I-8), (K-9), (J-8), (H-8), (F-6), (J-9), (F-9), (G-9), (H-9) y (F-7).",
    ["Once in Horlais Peak, go to the Hot Springs and check them to fill the bottle. The name does not change, so to confirm you filled it, read the description of the item under Temporary Items: it should say it is full of water from the hot spring that flows from Horlais Peak."] = "Una vez en Horlais Peak, ve a los Hot Springs y examínalos para llenar la botella. El nombre no cambia, así que para confirmar que la llenaste, lee la descripción del objeto en Temporary Items: debe decir que está llena de agua de la fuente termal que fluye de Horlais Peak.",
    ["Once in Mhaura, take the ferry to Selbina so that you are traveling at nighttime. Suitable ferry departure times for this quest leave Mhaura at 16:00 and 0:00. On the ferry that departs at 16:00, you must wait until night time at 20:00 for the event to appear."] = "Una vez en Mhaura, toma el ferry a Selbina para viajar de noche. Los horarios de salida adecuados desde Mhaura son 16:00 y 0:00. En el ferry que sale a las 16:00, debes esperar a la noche, a las 20:00, para que aparezca el evento.",
    ["Once in the temple, head to (I-10) and defeat the Temple Guardian to open the door."] = "Una vez en el templo, ve a (I-10) y derrota al Temple Guardian para abrir la puerta.",
    ["Once inside Ifrit's Cauldron, take the left path at the fork and continue until you find the Altar of Ashes at (I-9) on map 2, a black pillar near the edge of the path. Alternatively, use the Unity 125 teleport to map 3 and take exit G, then A, then B to reach (I-9) of map 2."] = "Dentro de Ifrit's Cauldron, toma el camino de la izquierda en la bifurcación y sigue hasta encontrar el Altar of Ashes en (I-9) del mapa 2, un pilar negro cerca del borde del camino. También puedes usar el teletransporte de Unity 125 al mapa 3 y tomar la salida G, luego A y luego B para llegar a (I-9) del mapa 2.",
    ["Once inside Sea Serpent Grotto, head to (K-6), where you find a ???. Check the ??? to spawn Glyryvilu."] = "Una vez dentro de Sea Serpent Grotto, ve a (K-6), donde encuentras una ???. Revisa la ??? para invocar a Glyryvilu.",
    ["Once inside, find a Toad's Footprint at (J-7) and click it for another cutscene."] = "Una vez dentro, encuentra una Toad's Footprint en (J-7) y haz clic en ella para otra escena.",
    ["Once inside, go to the point where (I-9) and (J-8) meet and check the mushroom patch to find a mature Scourshroom (a key item). Then check the mushroom patch at (I-9)/(J-9) to plant it. Repeat the process at (E-7)."] = "Una vez dentro, ve al punto donde se juntan (I-9) y (J-8) y revisa la mata de hongos para encontrar un Scourshroom maduro (un key item). Luego revisa la mata de hongos en (I-9)/(J-9) para plantarlo. Repite el proceso en (E-7).",
    ["Once inside, hug the south side until you reach a large room at (G-9), and fall through the grave in the center of the room. To reach the room at (G-9) you need someone to operate the gates for you, or the Magicked astrolabe."] = "Una vez dentro, pégate al lado sur hasta llegar a una sala grande en (G-9) y cae por la tumba del centro de la sala. Para llegar a la sala de (G-9) necesitas que alguien te abra las puertas, o el Magicked astrolabe.",
    ["Once inside, the correct displacement sequence is red, purple, red, purple."] = "Una vez dentro, la secuencia de desplazamiento correcta es rojo, morado, rojo, morado.",
    ["Once prepared, examine the ??? at (I-7), northwest of Bloodlet Spring, to spawn 3 Sahagin NMs: Kappa Akuso (Monk), Kappa Biwa (Bard) and Kappa Bonze (White Mage)."] = "Una vez preparado, examina la ??? de (I-7), al noroeste de Bloodlet Spring, para invocar a 3 NMs Sahagin: Kappa Akuso (Monk), Kappa Biwa (Bard) y Kappa Bonze (White Mage).",
    ["Once the NM is defeated, check the ??? again to receive the key item Whispering conch."] = "Cuando el NM esté derrotado, revisa la ??? de nuevo para recibir el key item Whispering conch.",
    ["Once the Old Sabertooth has died on its own, examine the Tiger Bones to get the key item Old tiger's fang."] = "Cuando el Old Sabertooth haya muerto por sí solo, examina los Tiger Bones para obtener el key item Old tiger's fang.",
    ["Once the chocobo has eaten the Gausebit Grass x4, you are presented with a Chocobo license."] = "Cuando el chocobo haya comido las Gausebit Grass x4, te dan una Chocobo license.",
    ["Once the leeches are defeated and their bodies despawn, click on the ??? to receive the key item Strangely shaped coral. Several players can do this at the same time: have one member spawn the leeches and, after they despawn, have the others select the ??? before the player who spawned them. If the player who spawned them is KO'd, do not raise them until the Korroloka Leeches are defeated, or the leeches respawn immediately."] = "Cuando las leeches estén derrotadas y sus cuerpos desaparezcan, haz clic en la ??? para recibir el key item Strangely shaped coral. Varios jugadores pueden hacerlo a la vez: que un miembro invoque las leeches y, cuando desaparezcan, que los demás seleccionen la ??? antes que quien las invocó. Si quien las invocó queda KO'd, no lo levantes hasta que los Korroloka Leeches estén derrotados, o las leeches reaparecen de inmediato.",
    ["Once the permit is obtained, travel to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Una vez obtenido el permiso, viaja a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Once the quest has started, go to each of the five staging points with Blue Mage as your main job and talk to the Immortal there for a quick cutscene and a key item: Azouph Isle Staging Point, Dvucca Isle Staging Point, Mamool Ja Staging Point, Halvung Staging Point and Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point. You do not need to speak to the guard at Nyzul Isle for this quest."] = "Una vez empezada la quest, ve a cada uno de los cinco staging points con Blue Mage como trabajo principal y habla con el Immortal de allí para una escena breve y un key item: Azouph Isle Staging Point, Dvucca Isle Staging Point, Mamool Ja Staging Point, Halvung Staging Point e Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point. No necesitas hablar con el guardia de Nyzul Isle para esta quest.",
    ["Once the quest is complete, she removes the status ailment from you."] = "Una vez completa la quest, te quita el estado alterado.",
    ["Once the three avatars are defeated, five Carbuncle Primes spawn at once. Defeat all five Carbuncle Primes to win the battle."] = "Cuando los tres avatares estén derrotados, aparecen a la vez cinco Carbuncle Primes. Derrota a los cinco Carbuncle Primes para ganar la batalla.",
    ["Once you accept, obtain Rusty Bucket x5, either by fishing for them or by buying them at the Auction House or from Kahah Hobichai in Al Zahbi."] = "Una vez aceptada, obtén Rusty Bucket x5, pescándolos o comprándolos en la Auction House o a Kahah Hobichai en Al Zahbi.",
    ["Once you bring him the item, you are given the option to choose a Fewell element. He crafts it for you while explaining the crafting process."] = "Cuando le traes el objeto, te dan la opción de elegir un elemento de Fewell. Te lo fabrica mientras te explica el proceso de fabricación.",
    ["Once you get the cutscene in Kuftal Tunnel, return to Datta for your reward, 8,000 gil, and the title Kuftal Tourist. You can watch the cutscene again with the Goblin Footprint after returning to Datta."] = "Cuando veas la escena en Kuftal Tunnel, vuelve con Datta por tu recompensa, 8,000 gil, y el título Kuftal Tourist. Puedes volver a ver la escena con el Goblin Footprint después de volver con Datta.",
    ["Once you have beaten everyone, wait until the next in-game day and talk to Abquhbah to be promoted and receive the FL Wildcat badge, which gives access to FL Assaults."] = "Cuando hayas vencido a todos, espera al siguiente día de juego y habla con Abquhbah para ser ascendido y recibir el FL Wildcat badge, que da acceso a los FL Assaults.",
    ["Once you have finished Even More Gullible's Travels and received the scent, speak with Lulupp in Kazham (G-7) for a cutscene. The Opo-opo in Kazham love your new fragrance: bring them what they want, in the correct order, and they make you their king."] = "Cuando hayas terminado Even More Gullible's Travels y recibido el olor, habla con Lulupp en Kazham (G-7) para una escena. Los Opo-opo de Kazham adoran tu nueva fragancia: tráeles lo que quieren, en el orden correcto, y te harán su rey.",
    ["Once you have finished the battle, return to the Blank Target in The Shrine of Ru'Avitau to choose your reward: the key items Shard of Apathy, Shard of Arrogance, Shard of Cowardice, Shard of Envy and Shard of Rage, and one of the following earrings: Abyssal Earring, Beastly Earring, Bushinomimi, Knight's Earring or Suppanomimi."] = "Cuando termines la batalla, vuelve al Blank Target de The Shrine of Ru'Avitau para elegir tu recompensa: los key items Shard of Apathy, Shard of Arrogance, Shard of Cowardice, Shard of Envy y Shard of Rage, y uno de estos pendientes: Abyssal Earring, Beastly Earring, Bushinomimi, Knight's Earring o Suppanomimi.",
    ["Once you have fished up a Hydrogauge, trade it to Leleroon in Nashmau (G-7)."] = "Cuando hayas pescado un Hydrogauge, entrégaselo a Leleroon en Nashmau (G-7).",
    ["Once you have one, trade it to Yazan for your reward, 350 gil."] = "Cuando tengas uno, entrégalo a Yazan para recibir tu recompensa, 350 gil.",
    ["Once you have spoken to all 20 people, return to Alib-Mufalib. He takes your Blue Sentinel badge and gives you a Blue invitation card."] = "Cuando hayas hablado con las 20 personas, vuelve con Alib-Mufalib. Se queda tu Blue Sentinel badge y te da una Blue invitation card.",
    ["Once you have spoken to all 20 people, return to Amutiyaal, who takes your Red Sentinel badge and gives you a Red invitation card."] = "Cuando hayas hablado con las 20 personas, vuelve con Amutiyaal, que se queda tu Red Sentinel badge y te da una Red invitation card.",
    ["Once you have spoken to all 20 people, return to Ibwam, who takes your Green Sentinel badge and gives you a Green invitation card."] = "Cuando hayas hablado con las 20 personas, vuelve con Ibwam, que se queda tu Green Sentinel badge y te da una Green invitation card.",
    ["Once you have the Cotton Gloves, trade them to Romilda to finish the quest and receive 2,000 gil."] = "Cuando tengas los Cotton Gloves, entrégaselos a Romilda para terminar la quest y recibir 2,000 gil.",
    ["Once you have the Rivernewort, return to Rouva for your reward, a Page from Miratete's Memoirs. Like other Experience Points scroll quests, it can be completed once per Conquest tally."] = "Cuando tengas el Rivernewort, vuelve con Rouva por tu recompensa, un Page from Miratete's Memoirs. Como otras quests de scrolls de Experience Points, se puede completar una vez por Conquest tally.",
    ["Once you have used a Rancor Flame, talk to Jakoh Wahcondalo in Kazham (J-9), who tells you to leave her village. The other NPCs in the room tell you to go to the Den of Rancor and Temple of Uggalepih complex to be cleansed and then come back. You get the title Excommunicate of Kazham as soon as the quest becomes active."] = "Una vez usada una Rancor Flame, habla con Jakoh Wahcondalo en Kazham (J-9), que te dice que abandones su aldea. Los demás NPCs de la sala te dicen que vayas al complejo del Den of Rancor y el Temple of Uggalepih para purificarte y luego vuelvas. Recibes el título Excommunicate of Kazham en cuanto la quest se activa.",
    ["Once you trade the Testimony to Maat, he asks if you are ready."] = "Cuando entregas el Testimony a Maat, te pregunta si estás listo.",
    ["Only at fame level 1"] = "Solo con nivel de fama 1",
    ["Only one character can be logged in per IP address. Households that share a connection can ask staff for an exception."] = "Solo puede haber un personaje conectado por dirección IP. Los hogares que comparten conexión pueden pedir una excepción al personal.",
    ["Only one of them needs to be killed, so a recommended strategy is to zone to Den of Rancor and fight one while the others despawn."] = "Solo hace falta matar a uno, así que una estrategia recomendada es cambiar de zona a Den of Rancor y luchar contra uno mientras los otros desaparecen.",
    ["Only people who have reached this point in the quest, or who have already completed it, may enter the battlefield."] = "Solo las personas que hayan llegado a este punto de la quest, o que ya la hayan completado, pueden entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Open Oaken Door (K-8) and speak with Gilgamesh (L-8) about the Mithra carrying a mysterious crystal."] = "Abre la Oaken Door (K-8) y habla con Gilgamesh (L-8) sobre la Mithra que lleva un cristal misterioso.",
    ["Open a treasure chest using either the key or Thief's Tools to obtain the key item Fei'Yin magic tome."] = "Abre un treasure chest con la llave o con Thief's Tools para obtener el key item Fei'Yin magic tome.",
    ["Open the Door: Prince Regent's Rm in Chateau d'Oraguille at (H-8) to start the quest. You can continue as any job from this point."] = "Abre la Door: Prince Regent's Rm en Chateau d'Oraguille en (H-8) para empezar la quest. Desde este punto puedes continuar con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Open the Iron Gate at (G-8) using a Bronze Key, Skeleton Key, or Thief's Tools."] = "Abre la Iron Gate en (G-8) con una Bronze Key, una Skeleton Key o Thief's Tools.",
    ["Open the way through the Gates of Halvung if necessary."] = "Abre el camino por las Gates of Halvung si es necesario.",
    ["Optional: after completing the quest you may trade Quelveuiat a Sealion Crest Key and a Coral Crest Key to obtain a Temple Knight key, which lets you open the large door to the inner part of Sacrarium at (H-7) solo."] = "Opcional: tras completar la quest puedes entregar a Quelveuiat una Sealion Crest Key y una Coral Crest Key para obtener una Temple Knight key, que te permite abrir tú solo la gran puerta de la parte interior de Sacrarium en (H-7).",
    ["Optional: speak with Ardea again to try to get the stone back."] = "Opcional: habla de nuevo con Ardea para intentar recuperar la piedra.",
    ["Optional: speak with Cha Lebagta and Bopa Greso, just south of Nanaa Mihgo at (J-4), for a couple of clues."] = "Opcional: habla con Cha Lebagta y Bopa Greso, justo al sur de Nanaa Mihgo en (J-4), para un par de pistas.",
    ["Optional: speak with Furakku-Norakku again at Orn's request."] = "Opcional: habla de nuevo con Furakku-Norakku a petición de Orn.",
    ["Optional: speak with Kupipi in Heavens Tower to receive an Earthen Charm."] = "Opcional: habla con Kupipi en Heavens Tower para recibir un Earthen Charm.",
    ["Optional: speak with Kuu Mohzolhi in Northern San d'Oria (F-8). She does not say it at first, but she would like a Marguerite."] = "Opcional: habla con Kuu Mohzolhi en Northern San d'Oria (F-8). Al principio no lo dice, pero le gustaría una Marguerite.",
    ["Optional: speak with Nonterene (I-10) at the Parade Grounds near Victory Arch."] = "Opcional: habla con Nonterene (I-10) en el Parade Grounds cerca del Victory Arch.",
    ["Optional: speak with Offa in Bastok Markets (F-10), on the second floor behind the door on the left, for instructions on how to make the sausage."] = "Opcional: habla con Offa en Bastok Markets (F-10), en el segundo piso tras la puerta de la izquierda, para saber cómo hacer la salchicha.",
    ["Optional: speak with Ojha Rhawash in Windurst Walls (C-13). She does not say it at first, but she would like a Lilac."] = "Opcional: habla con Ojha Rhawash en Windurst Walls (C-13). Al principio no lo dice, pero le gustaría un Lilac.",
    ["Optional: speak with Valah Molkot in Port Bastok (J-12). She does not say it at first, but she would like an Amaryllis."] = "Opcional: habla con Valah Molkot en Port Bastok (J-12). Al principio no lo dice, pero le gustaría una Amaryllis.",
    ["Optional: speak with Yoran-Oran (E-5) about the author of the thesis on alchemy, and with Shantotto (K-7) about alchemy."] = "Opcional: habla con Yoran-Oran (E-5) sobre el autor de la tesis de alquimia y con Shantotto (K-7) sobre alquimia.",
    ["Optional: trade the Torn Epistle to Koru-Moru for 50 gil, although it is not necessary."] = "Opcional: entrega la Torn Epistle a Koru-Moru por 50 gil, aunque no es necesario.",
    ["Other ways to make gil"] = "Otras formas de conseguir gil",
    ["Otherwise, go to the House of the Hero in Windurst Walls (G-3) and try to enter it for a cutscene."] = "Si no, ve a la House of the Hero en Windurst Walls (G-3) e intenta entrar para una escena.",
    ["Outpost warps"] = "Warps de outpost",
    ["Outpost warps to the regions around your nation can be used, once you've unlocked them with a supply run."] = "Se pueden usar los warps de outpost a las regiones alrededor de tu nación, una vez que los has desbloqueado con una supply run.",
    ["Part 1, Counterespionage: a three-part mini-game in which you must find the qiqirn hiding in a crowd of twelve humes. In the first group there are three qiqirn to find."] = "Parte 1, Counterespionage: un minijuego de tres partes en el que debes encontrar a los qiqirn escondidos entre una multitud de doce humes. En el primer grupo hay tres qiqirn que encontrar.",
    ["Part 2, Cipher: talk to Abquhbah to start it, and answer his questions."] = "Parte 2, Cipher: habla con Abquhbah para empezarla y responde a sus preguntas.",
    ["Part 3, BCG Training: a rock-paper-scissors type game against the cadets. An opponent always repeats whatever his first three calls were, and they switch plans after every two or three hit points they lose. The final round is against Drill Sergeant Rongelouts: get him down to four, tie him three times in a row, then win the next round by dealing four points of damage."] = "Parte 3, BCG Training: un juego tipo piedra, papel o tijera contra los cadetes. Un oponente siempre repite lo que fueron sus tres primeras jugadas, y cambian de plan tras perder dos o tres puntos de golpe. La ronda final es contra Drill Sergeant Rongelouts: déjalo en cuatro, empata con él tres veces seguidas y gana la siguiente ronda causando cuatro puntos de daño.",
    ["Participate in a Campaign battle at a stronghold of Bastok. The objective is complete when you receive an Objective Completed message and are told to report back."] = "Participa en una Campaign battle en una fortaleza de Bastok. El objetivo se completa cuando recibes el mensaje Objective Completed y te dicen que informes.",
    ["Participate in a Campaign battle at a stronghold of San d'Oria. The objective is complete when you receive an Objective Completed message and are told to report back."] = "Participa en una Campaign battle en una fortaleza de San d'Oria. El objetivo se completa cuando recibes el mensaje Objective Completed y te dicen que informes.",
    ["Participate in a Campaign battle at a stronghold of Windurst. The objective is complete when you receive an Objective Completed message and are told to report back."] = "Participa en una Campaign battle en una fortaleza de Windurst. El objetivo se completa cuando recibes el mensaje Objective Completed y te dicen que informes.",
    ["Party tips"] = "Consejos para el grupo",
    ["Pass through the Cermet Portal into Empyreal Paradox."] = "Atraviesa el Cermet Portal hacia Empyreal Paradox.",
    ["Pass through the Three Mages Gate and proceed to the small room around (G-7)."] = "Atraviesa la Three Mages Gate y avanza hasta la sala pequeña cerca de (G-7).",
    ["Pass through the colored walls at (H-7) and (I-7) in this order: Red, Black/Purple, Red, Black/Purple."] = "Atraviesa las paredes de colores en (H-7) y (I-7) en este orden: Red, Black/Purple, Red, Black/Purple.",
    ["Pass through the door at (J-10)."] = "Atraviesa la puerta en (J-10).",
    ["Pass through the eastern Cracked Wall and examine the Gate: Magical Gizmo for the event."] = "Atraviesa la Cracked Wall del este y examina la Gate: Magical Gizmo para el evento.",
    ["Pass through the first yellow door at (J-7), then continue west through the second yellow door to reach the room with the two Monoliths at (H-7)."] = "Atraviesa la primera puerta amarilla en (J-7), luego continúa al oeste por la segunda puerta amarilla hasta la sala de los dos Monoliths en (H-7).",
    ["Pass through the gate and continue to the shimmering light at the far end."] = "Atraviesa la puerta y continúa hasta la luz brillante del fondo.",
    ["Pass through the password trap door and reach the Brass Door."] = "Atraviesa la trampilla de contraseña y llega a la Brass Door.",
    ["Pass through the weighted door at (K-8) and continue to the next area."] = "Atraviesa la puerta de peso en (K-8) y continúa hasta la siguiente zona.",
    ["Past Sins: travel to Tavnazian Safehold and speak with Despachiaire (K-10) at (K-10), then travel to Windurst Woods and speak with Perih Vashai at (K-7)."] = "Past Sins: viaja a Tavnazian Safehold y habla con Despachiaire (K-10) en (K-10), luego viaja a Windurst Woods y habla con Perih Vashai en (K-7).",
    ["Past the guardian's door, head north to (I-7) inside the paintings room."] = "Tras la puerta del guardián, ve al norte hasta (I-7), dentro de la sala de los cuadros.",
    ["Pay Shantotto 5,000 gil."] = "Paga 5,000 gil a Shantotto.",
    ["Phoenix follows the level-75 era, so several later systems are not available:"] = "Phoenix sigue la era del nivel 75, así que varios sistemas posteriores no están disponibles:",
    ["Phoenix is a level-75 server. Rise of the Zilart, Chains of Promathia, and Treasures of Aht Urhgan are available. Wings of the Goddess and later expansions are not. See How Phoenix differs from retail for systems that aren't here yet."] = "Phoenix es un servidor de nivel 75. Están disponibles Rise of the Zilart, Chains of Promathia y Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Wings of the Goddess y las expansiones posteriores no lo están. Consulta How Phoenix differs from retail (Diferencias de Phoenix con el juego original) para ver los sistemas que aún no están aquí.",
    ["Pick up the tear from the ??? in North Gustaberg (it moves between spots) with no weapon equipped, then trade it to Wahid"] = "Recoge la lágrima de la ??? en North Gustaberg (se mueve entre varios sitios) sin llevar ningún arma equipada y luego entrégasela a Wahid",
    ["Place Snares at the Cermet Refinery, the Kiln and the Metalworks Replica. The Costume kit only becomes available after you clear each of the first six items and the quest Chameleon Capers is cleared. You must use the Costume kit to get information and to avoid Salim at the switches."] = "Coloca Snares en el Cermet Refinery, el Kiln y el Metalworks Replica. El Costume kit solo está disponible después de despejar cada uno de los primeros seis objetos y de despejar la quest Chameleon Capers. Debes usar el Costume kit para obtener información y evitar a Salim en los interruptores.",
    ["Place a Bronze Bed in your Mog House using the furniture Layout menu. You need Other fame level 3 (home nation fame). Wait one Earth minute, exit your Mog House, re-enter and speak to the Moogle. If you have enough fame, you receive a cutscene."] = "Coloca una Bronze Bed en tu Mog House con el menú Layout de mobiliario. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Other (fama de tu nación de origen). Espera un minuto terrestre, sal de tu Mog House, vuelve a entrar y habla con el Moogle. Si tienes fama suficiente, recibes una escena.",
    ["Place a Mahogany Bed in your Mog House, then speak to the Moogle. You need to have completed Give a Moogle a Break. Zone out of your Mog House and then come back."] = "Coloca una Mahogany Bed en tu Mog House y luego habla con el Moogle. Debes haber completado Give a Moogle a Break. Sal de tu Mog House y vuelve a entrar.",
    ["Place a bed in your Mog House using the furniture Layout menu, exit your Mog House, re-enter it and speak to your Moogle. You need to have completed The Moogle's Picnic! and have Other fame level 7 (home nation fame)."] = "Coloca una cama en tu Mog House con el menú Layout de mobiliario, sal de tu Mog House, vuelve a entrar y habla con tu Moogle. Debes haber completado The Moogle's Picnic! y tener el nivel 7 de fama de Other (fama de tu nación de origen).",
    ["Place the Gravel in the Refiner, operate the levers as required, and obtain Mythril Sand."] = "Coloca la Gravel en el Refiner, acciona las palancas según haga falta y obtén Mythril Sand.",
    ["Place the six Dark Mana Orbs on the corresponding pedestals."] = "Coloca los seis Dark Mana Orbs en los pedestales correspondientes.",
    ["Plague is inflicted by Bloodsucker enemies in Toraimarai Canal, by Deathmaw Orobon enemies in the Ceizak Battlegrounds with Vile Belch (which also inflicts Silence, so use an item or Echo Drops first if you plan to warp back to Ohruru), and by the Devouring Mosquito in Reisenjima with Infected Leech, which lasts 45 seconds."] = "Plague lo infligen los enemigos Bloodsucker en Toraimarai Canal, los enemigos Deathmaw Orobon en Ceizak Battlegrounds con Vile Belch (que también inflige Silence, así que usa un objeto o Echo Drops primero si planeas volver con Ohruru mediante warp), y el Devouring Mosquito en Reisenjima con Infected Leech, que dura 45 segundos.",
    ["Plant the seeds to grow a Deathball or a Sobbing Fungus, or buy one at the Auction House. A Sobbing Fungus can also be bought from Soupox in Leafallia for 60 gil."] = "Planta las semillas para cultivar un Deathball o un Sobbing Fungus, o cómpralo en la Auction House. Un Sobbing Fungus también se puede comprar a Soupox en Leafallia por 60 gil.",
    ["Power-leveling is limited. If a monster keeps attacking a character five or more levels above it, that character counts toward the fight, which cuts the experience the monster gives."] = "El power-leveling está limitado. Si un monstruo sigue atacando a un personaje cinco o más niveles por encima de él, ese personaje cuenta para el combate, lo que reduce la experiencia que da el monstruo.",
    ["Prepare for battle; you must fight without Trusts."] = "Prepárate para la batalla; debes luchar sin Trusts.",
    ["Prepare for the battle and examine Undulating Confluence (G-8)."] = "Prepárate para la batalla y examina el Undulating Confluence (G-8).",
    ["Prepare for the battle and travel to the Nyzul Isle staging point."] = "Prepárate para la batalla y viaja al Nyzul Isle staging point.",
    ["Prepare for the battle. Whenever you are ready, trade the tuning fork to Castilchat to be transported to the arena."] = "Prepárate para la batalla. Cuando estés listo, entrega el tuning fork a Castilchat para ser transportado a la arena.",
    ["Prepare for the battle. Whenever you are ready, trade the tuning fork to Ferrol to be transported to the arena."] = "Prepárate para la batalla. Cuando estés listo, entrega el tuning fork a Ferrol para ser transportado a la arena.",
    ["Present-day Maws surrounding Jeuno can also be used after they have been opened from the past."] = "Los Maws actuales que rodean Jeuno también se pueden usar una vez abiertos desde el pasado.",
    ["Proceed across the bridge to Waterfall Basin (H-6) at (H-6) and examine it."] = "Cruza el puente hasta la Waterfall Basin (H-6) en (H-6) y examínala.",
    ["Proceed down the hallway and examine the Shimmering Circle."] = "Avanza por el pasillo y examina el Shimmering Circle.",
    ["Proceed from Rally Point: Red (F-8) and enter Castle Zvahl Baileys [S]."] = "Sal del Rally Point: Red (F-8) y entra en Castle Zvahl Baileys [S].",
    ["Proceed northwest while keeping to the right-hand wall."] = "Avanza al noroeste pegado a la pared derecha.",
    ["Proceed through the Throne Room and examine the Throne Room door."] = "Avanza por la Throne Room y examina la Throne Room door.",
    ["Proceed through the opened passage and examine Ornate Gate."] = "Atraviesa el pasaje abierto y examina la Ornate Gate.",
    ["Proceed through the required events."] = "Avanza por los eventos requeridos.",
    ["Proceed through the ruins and reach the Nyzul Isle staging point."] = "Avanza por las ruinas y llega al Nyzul Isle staging point.",
    ["Proceed to (H-8) and examine the ??? in the spiral staircase to reach the 10th floor."] = "Ve a (H-8) y examina la ??? de la escalera de caracol para llegar al piso 10.",
    ["Proceed to (J-6) to reach the 12th floor, then head to (F-10) and use the teleporter to enter Stellar Fulcrum at the top of Delkfutt's Tower."] = "Ve a (J-6) para llegar al piso 12, luego ve a (F-10) y usa el teletransportador para entrar en Stellar Fulcrum, en lo alto de Delkfutt's Tower.",
    ["Proceed to Hazhalm Testing Grounds and examine the Entry Gate."] = "Dirígete a Hazhalm Testing Grounds y examina la Entry Gate.",
    ["Proceed to Map 2 and speak with Pecca-Pocca at (G-12) to receive the Sheaf of Handmade Incense."] = "Avanza al Map 2 y habla con Pecca-Pocca en (G-12) para recibir el Sheaf of Handmade Incense.",
    ["Proceed to Qu'Bia Arena and complete the Rank 5 battlefield."] = "Dirígete al Qu'Bia Arena y completa el campo de batalla de Rank 5.",
    ["Proceed to Qufim and enter Delkfutt's Tower. Climb to Floor 7 (Middle Delkfutt's Tower)."] = "Ve a Qufim y entra en Delkfutt's Tower. Sube al Floor 7 (Middle Delkfutt's Tower).",
    ["Proceed to Rally Point: Blue (H-8)."] = "Dirígete al Rally Point: Blue (H-8).",
    ["Proceed to Rally Point: Green (G-9)."] = "Dirígete al Rally Point: Green (G-9).",
    ["Proceed to Rally Point: Red (F-8)."] = "Dirígete al Rally Point: Red (F-8).",
    ["Proceed to Sealion's Den."] = "Dirígete a Sealion's Den.",
    ["Proceed to the Antiquated Sluice Gate and enter the battlefield."] = "Dirígete a la Antiquated Sluice Gate y entra en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Proceed to the Balamor encounter."] = "Avanza hacia el encuentro con Balamor.",
    ["Proceed to the Castle Gates in Eastern Adoulin."] = "Dirígete a las Castle Gates en Eastern Adoulin.",
    ["Proceed to the Cracked Wall at (H-9) and examine it to enter the passage."] = "Dirígete a la Cracked Wall en (H-9) y examínala para entrar en el pasaje.",
    ["Proceed to the Crawlers' Nest to turn your Rolanberries into higher quality Rolanberries."] = "Ve al Crawlers' Nest para convertir tus Rolanberries en Rolanberries de mayor calidad.",
    ["Proceed to the Ergon Locus around (E-9)."] = "Dirígete al Ergon Locus cerca de (E-9).",
    ["Proceed to the Palace."] = "Dirígete al Palace.",
    ["Proceed to the Storeroom Door at (G-7) on the second map."] = "Dirígete a la Storeroom Door en (G-7) del segundo mapa.",
    ["Proceed to the Watery Grave battlefield."] = "Dirígete al campo de batalla Watery Grave.",
    ["Proceed to the World Tree."] = "Dirígete al World Tree.",
    ["Proceed to the designated battlefield and defeat the Young Behemoth encounter."] = "Dirígete al campo de batalla designado y derrota el encuentro con el Young Behemoth.",
    ["Proceed to the next map and examine Final Survey Point (G-10)."] = "Avanza al siguiente mapa y examina el Final Survey Point (G-10).",
    ["Proceed to the required encounter."] = "Avanza hacia el encuentro requerido.",
    ["Proceed to the royal meeting at the Palace."] = "Dirígete a la reunión real en el Palace.",
    ["Proceed to the upper portion of Heavens Tower and speak with Rhy Epocan."] = "Dirígete a la parte superior de Heavens Tower y habla con Rhy Epocan.",
    ["Proceed west to Weighted Door (H-7) at (H-7) and use the second weight pad to pass through."] = "Continúa al oeste hasta la Weighted Door (H-7) en (H-7) y usa la segunda plataforma de peso para pasar.",
    ["Progress Rise of the Zilart through Headstone Pilgrimage."] = "Avanza Rise of the Zilart hasta Headstone Pilgrimage.",
    ["Progress through each Promyvion by defeating Memory Receptacles and following the Memory Stream portals."] = "Avanza por cada Promyvion derrotando a los Memory Receptacles y siguiendo los portales Memory Stream.",
    ["Progress through the Memory Receptacles and Memory Streams."] = "Avanza por los Memory Receptacles y los Memory Streams.",
    ["Progress through the Promyvions by defeating Memory Receptacles and following the Memory Stream portals."] = "Avanza por las Promyvions derrotando a los Memory Receptacles y siguiendo los portales Memory Stream.",
    ["Protect Adelheid through the maze while defeating waves of Quadavs."] = "Protege a Adelheid por el laberinto mientras derrotas oleadas de Quadavs.",
    ["Purchase some Rolanberries."] = "Compra algunas Rolanberries.",
    ["Pygmalion shows you a picture of an NPC that you must memorize."] = "Pygmalion te muestra una imagen de un NPC que debes memorizar.",
    ["Quests and Missions: every quest and storyline mission."] = "Quests and Missions: todas las quests y misiones de la historia.",
    ["Qufim Island, off the coast of Jeuno, around level 20."] = "Qufim Island, frente a la costa de Jeuno, sobre el nivel 20.",
    ["Quu Bokye is in the Treasure Room on the underground map of Giddeus: the northwest room at the end of a U-turn on the map."] = "Quu Bokye está en la Treasure Room del mapa subterráneo de Giddeus: la sala noroeste al final de un U-turn del mapa.",
    ["Rabbits are sending the shanarha grass, unique to Leujaoam Sanctum, to the verge of extinction. Mission orders: protect the vegetation."] = "Los conejos están llevando al borde de la extinción a la shanarha grass, exclusiva de Leujaoam Sanctum. Órdenes de la misión: proteger la vegetación.",
    ["Raimbroy, Southern San d'Oria"] = "Raimbroy, Southern San d'Oria",
    ["Rasdinice sends you to the Quartermaster at (H-9) in Southern San d'Oria (S). Obtain the supplies that he requests, either by gathering them or by buying them at the Auction House, and hand them over."] = "Rasdinice te envía al Quartermaster at (H-9) in Southern San d'Oria (S). Consigue los suministros que pide, ya sea recolectándolos o comprándolos en la Auction House, y entrégaselos.",
    ["Re-enter Bastok Markets (S) from North Gustaberg (S)."] = "Vuelve a entrar en Bastok Markets (S) desde North Gustaberg (S).",
    ["Re-examine the ??? to obtain the Handful of crystal scales."] = "Vuelve a examinar la ??? para obtener el Handful of crystal scales.",
    ["Reach (H-8) and pass through the weighted door."] = "Llega a (H-8) y atraviesa la puerta de peso.",
    ["Reach ??? (H-8) at (H-8)."] = "Llega a la ??? (H-8) en (H-8).",
    ["Reach ??? (J-11) near the Stone Monument and examine it to face Suparna and Suparna Fledgling."] = "Llega a la ??? (J-11) cerca del Stone Monument y examínala para enfrentarte a Suparna y Suparna Fledgling.",
    ["Reach Eschan Portal #15 (H-12)."] = "Llega al Eschan Portal #15 (H-12).",
    ["Reach Jazaratt's Headstone at (E-10)."] = "Llega al Jazaratt's Headstone en (E-10).",
    ["Reach Journey's End (K-10) at (K-10)."] = "Llega a Journey's End (K-10) en (K-10).",
    ["Reach Mamook by entering the cave at (D-12) on the Wajaom Woodlands map, or by using the Mamook Survival Guide warp."] = "Llega a Mamook entrando por la cueva en (D-12) del mapa de Wajaom Woodlands, o usando el warp de la Survival Guide de Mamook.",
    ["Reach Map 2 and continue to the door at (I-10)."] = "Llega al Map 2 y continúa hasta la puerta en (I-10).",
    ["Reach Map 2 around (G-8)."] = "Llega al Map 2 cerca de (G-8).",
    ["Reach Map 2, drop through the hole at (E-11), and continue to Fountain of Kings (G-14)."] = "Llega al Map 2, déjate caer por el agujero en (E-11) y continúa hasta Fountain of Kings (G-14).",
    ["Reach Map 5 and enter the room containing the large tree root."] = "Llega al Map 5 y entra en la sala que contiene la gran raíz de árbol.",
    ["Reach Rank 3 in your home nation."] = "Alcanza el Rank 3 en tu nación de origen.",
    ["Reach Rank 6 in your home nation by completing the required Rank missions through The Shadow Lord."] = "Alcanza el Rank 6 en tu nación de origen completando las Rank missions requeridas hasta The Shadow Lord.",
    ["Reach Rank 6 in your home nation."] = "Alcanza el Rank 6 en tu nación de origen.",
    ["Reach Sluice Gate (C-6) at (C-6)."] = "Llega a la Sluice Gate (C-6) en (C-6).",
    ["Reach Weighted Door (G-8) at (G-8), pass through, and drop into the lower room."] = "Llega a la Weighted Door (G-8) en (G-8), atraviésala y déjate caer a la sala inferior.",
    ["Reach Weighted Door (I-9) at (I-9) and use the weight pad to pass through."] = "Llega a la Weighted Door (I-9) en (I-9) y usa la plataforma de peso para pasar.",
    ["Reach Weighted Door (K-8) at (K-8) and use the pressure plate to pass through."] = "Llega a la Weighted Door (K-8) en (K-8) y usa la placa de presión para pasar.",
    ["Reach Western Adoulin at (K-7)."] = "Llega a Western Adoulin en (K-7).",
    ["Reach all 24 Republic Operatives while maintaining Flee."] = "Llega a los 24 Republic Operatives manteniendo Flee.",
    ["Reach level 10."] = "Alcanza el nivel 10.",
    ["Reach the ??? around (H-7) in the lava and trade the Adaman Ore."] = "Llega a la ??? cerca de (H-7) en la lava y entrega el Adaman Ore.",
    ["Reach the Cheval River target at (H-5)."] = "Llega al objetivo Cheval River en (H-5).",
    ["Reach the Gate of Darkness at (I-7) on Map 4."] = "Llega a la Gate of Darkness en (I-7) del Map 4.",
    ["Reach the Gilded Doors at (H-8) and trigger the cutscene."] = "Llega a las Gilded Doors en (H-8) y activa la escena.",
    ["Reach the Hall of the Gods at (H-5) and examine the Cermet Grate twice."] = "Llega a la Hall of the Gods en (H-5) y examina dos veces la Cermet Grate.",
    ["Reach the Memory Flux around (D-6)."] = "Llega al Memory Flux cerca de (D-6).",
    ["Reach the Memory Flux around (J-8) on the third floor."] = "Llega al Memory Flux cerca de (J-8) en el tercer piso.",
