    ["Reach the Navukgo Execution Chamber."] = "Llega a la Navukgo Execution Chamber.",
    ["Reach the Reinforced Gateway at (F-9)."] = "Llega al Reinforced Gateway en (F-9).",
    ["Reach the Sewer Lid around (E-7/E-8) and speak with the attendant beside it to descend."] = "Llega a la Sewer Lid cerca de (E-7/E-8) y habla con el encargado junto a ella para descender.",
    ["Reach the Spire of Dem and defeat Progenerator. Obtain the Light of Dem."] = "Llega a la Spire of Dem y derrota a Progenerator. Obtén la Light of Dem.",
