    ["Reach the Spire of Vahzl."] = "Llega a la Spire of Vahzl.",
    ["Reach the Stalagmite at (D-9) on Map 1 and examine it."] = "Llega a la Stalagmite en (D-9) del Map 1 y examínala.",
    ["Reach the Wildskeeper Reive area."] = "Llega al área del Wildskeeper Reive.",
    ["Reach the basement around (K/L-9) and examine the Cermet Door."] = "Llega al sótano cerca de (K/L-9) y examina la Cermet Door.",
    ["Reach the bottom of Ra'Kaznar Turris."] = "Llega al fondo de Ra'Kaznar Turris.",
    ["Reach the central elevator and descend to the second floor."] = "Llega al ascensor central y baja al segundo piso.",
    ["Reach the southern chamber at (G-9), fall through the center hole, and enter the northern room at (I-7)."] = "Llega a la cámara sur en (G-9), cae por el agujero central y entra en la sala norte en (I-7).",
    ["Reach the southern room and drop through the center hole at (G-9), then follow the route through Maps 2 and 3 and exit back to Batallia Downs at (J-9)."] = "Llega a la sala sur y déjate caer por el agujero central en (G-9), luego sigue la ruta por los Maps 2 y 3 y sal de nuevo a Batallia Downs en (J-9).",
    ["Reach the top of the stairs and examine Ornate Door."] = "Llega a lo alto de las escaleras y examina la Ornate Door.",
