    ["Receive the Crystal Dowser, then return to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8)."] = "Recibe el Crystal Dowser y luego vuelve con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8).",
    ["Receive the Dimensional Compass."] = "Recibe el Dimensional Compass.",
