    ["Receive the Festival Souvenir Kupon at Flames of Fate (G-8)."] = "Recibe el Festival Souvenir Kupon en las Flames of Fate (G-8).",
    ["Receive the Gauntlet Challenge Kupon."] = "Recibe el Gauntlet Challenge Kupon.",
