    ["Receive the Jeunoan Flag."] = "Recibe la Jeunoan Flag.",
    ["Receive the Mega Bonanza Kupon from the correct Craggy Pillar."] = "Recibe el Mega Bonanza Kupon del Craggy Pillar correcto.",
    ["Receive the Mysterious Amulet."] = "Recibe el Mysterious Amulet.",
    ["Receive the Navaratna Talisman."] = "Recibe el Navaratna Talisman.",
    ["Receive the Piece of Paper after completing the event at the Garden."] = "Recibe la Piece of Paper tras completar el evento en el Garden.",
    ["Receive the Pioneer's Badge, Map of Adoulin, and 1,000 Bayld."] = "Recibe la Pioneer's Badge, el Map of Adoulin y 1,000 Bayld.",
    ["Receive the Red Coral Key and the following event."] = "Recibe la Red Coral Key y el evento siguiente.",
    ["Receive the Republican Silver Medal reward."] = "Recibe la recompensa Republican Silver Medal.",
    ["Receive the Supplies Package."] = "Recibe el Supplies Package.",
    ["Receive the Tiny Memory Fragment and continue the Her Memories chain."] = "Recibe el Tiny Memory Fragment y continúa la cadena de Her Memories.",
    ["Receive the Tiny Memory Fragment."] = "Recibe el Tiny Memory Fragment.",
    ["Receive the Tonberry key after victory."] = "Recibe la Tonberry key tras la victoria.",
    ["Receive the Trainee Knife reward."] = "Recibe la recompensa Trainee Knife.",
    ["Receive the Underpass Hatch Key."] = "Recibe la Underpass Hatch Key.",
    ["Receive the Vial of Chaos's blood."] = "Recibe la Vial of Chaos's blood.",
    ["Receive the mission rewards."] = "Recibe las recompensas de la misión.",
    ["Receive the required pome key items."] = "Recibe los key items de pome necesarios.",
    ["Recently there have been multiple reports of a three-headed beast attacking traders on the way to Al Zahbi. Travel to its rumored lair in Lebros Cavern and slay it. Mission orders: defeat Black Shuck."] = "Últimamente ha habido varios informes de una bestia de tres cabezas que ataca a comerciantes de camino a Al Zahbi. Viaja a su supuesta guarida en Lebros Cavern y mátala. Órdenes de la misión: derrotar a Black Shuck.",
    ["Redeem the Behemoth key for your final reward."] = "Canjea la Behemoth key por tu recompensa final.",
    ["Reduce the Ashu Talif Captain to 20% HP or below to complete the battle."] = "Reduce al Ashu Talif Captain al 20% de HP o menos para completar la batalla.",
    ["Regine, Port San d'Oria"] = "Regine, Port San d'Oria",
    ["Register the Home Point immediately beyond the Stone Gate."] = "Registra el Home Point justo después de la Stone Gate.",
    ["Remain in the Hall of the Gods."] = "Permanece en la Hall of the Gods.",
    ["Remain in the area until all 11 have been defeated, as zoning resets your progress."] = "Permanece en la zona hasta derrotar a los 11, ya que cambiar de zona reinicia tu progreso.",
    ["Remain true to the promise made to Prishe."] = "Mantente fiel a la promesa hecha a Prishe.",
    ["Remove all main-hand and off-hand equipment."] = "Quítate todo el equipo de la mano principal y la secundaria.",
    ["Remove your weapon and shield."] = "Quítate el arma y el escudo.",
    ["Repeat the examination as needed, up to three explosives in your inventory."] = "Repite el examen cuanto haga falta, hasta tener tres explosivos en el inventario.",
    ["Repeatable quests are the steadiest early income. You can turn them in as often as you have the items. Each one also raises your fame with that nation, which unlocks more quests. The rewards below are from Phoenix's game data."] = "Las quests repetibles son el ingreso más estable al principio. Puedes entregarlas tantas veces como tengas los objetos. Cada una además sube tu fama con esa nación, lo que desbloquea más quests. Las recompensas de abajo salen de los datos del juego de Phoenix.",
    ["Repeating this quest several times is the easiest way to improve your reputation in Bastok, San d'Oria, Jeuno, Selbina and Rabao. You can repeat the quest."] = "Repetir esta quest varias veces es la forma más fácil de mejorar tu reputación en Bastok, San d'Oria, Jeuno, Selbina y Rabao. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Report to Lumomo to receive your reward."] = "Informa a Lumomo para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Report to Rongelouts N Distaud in Southern San d'Oria (S) to receive the Behemoth Horn reward."] = "Informa a Rongelouts N Distaud en Southern San d'Oria (S) para recibir la recompensa Behemoth Horn.",
    ["Research August Adoulin's history."] = "Investiga la historia de August Adoulin.",
    ["Research the required history."] = "Investiga la historia requerida.",
    ["Rest and prepare for the battlefield."] = "Descansa y prepárate para el campo de batalla.",
    ["Retrieve the Star ring (indecipherable) by examining the Perennial Snow."] = "Recupera el Star ring (indecipherable) examinando la Perennial Snow.",
    ["Retrieve the six Glowing Mana Orbs from the pedestals."] = "Recoge los seis Glowing Mana Orbs de los pedestales.",
    ["Return again after overcoming seven."] = "Vuelve de nuevo tras superar a siete.",
    ["Return all seven items to Mamaulabion. They must be traded one at a time, and it is not necessary to turn in all seven at once."] = "Devuelve los siete objetos a Mamaulabion. Hay que entregarlos de uno en uno y no es necesario entregar los siete a la vez.",
    ["Return and report the result."] = "Vuelve e informa del resultado.",
    ["Return and speak with Chalvatot for your reward, the Choral Justaucorps, and to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve y habla con Chalvatot para recibir tu recompensa, el Choral Justaucorps, y completar la quest.",
    ["Return in 72 in-game hours (3 real-life hours) to receive your reward: the Mumeito and the ability to become a Samurai, with the title Bushido Blade."] = "Vuelve en 72 horas de juego (3 horas reales) para recibir tu recompensa: la Mumeito y la capacidad de convertirte en Samurai, con el título Bushido Blade.",
    ["Return the Power Sandals to Devean before time runs out. You can also choose to keep the Power Sandals for yourself, but that means you fail the quest."] = "Devuelve las Power Sandals a Devean antes de que se acabe el tiempo. También puedes quedarte las Power Sandals, pero eso significa que fallas la quest.",
    ["Return the blue stone to Kocco Ehllek (H-8)."] = "Devuelve la piedra azul a Kocco Ehllek (H-8).",
    ["Return the book to Furakku-Norakku to complete the quest and receive 2,800 gil."] = "Devuelve el libro a Furakku-Norakku para completar la quest y recibir 2,800 gil.",
    ["Return the repaired cap to Paytah to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Devuelve la gorra reparada a Paytah para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return the rod to Keshab-Menjab to complete the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Devuelve la caña a Keshab-Menjab para completar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
    ["Return the tablets to Abelard. When you finish them all you receive the Map of the Crawlers' Nest. You can repeat the quest."] = "Devuelve las tablillas a Abelard. Cuando las termines todas recibes el Map of the Crawlers' Nest. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Return through the Cavernous Maw."] = "Vuelve por el Cavernous Maw.",
    ["Return to (H-6) and examine ??? near the bridge (H-6) to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve a (H-6) y examina la ??? cerca del puente (H-6) para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to ??? (G-6) with all three Seedspalls."] = "Vuelve a la ??? (G-6) con los tres Seedspalls.",
    ["Return to Abda-Lurabda in Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Vuelve con Abda-Lurabda en Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Return to Abelard."] = "Vuelve con Abelard.",
    ["Return to Abioleget for your reward."] = "Vuelve con Abioleget para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Adelbrecht (E-9) to receive the Large Memory Fragment."] = "Vuelve con Adelbrecht (E-9) para recibir el Large Memory Fragment.",
    ["Return to Adelbrecht (E-9)."] = "Vuelve con Adelbrecht (E-9).",
    ["Return to Agado-Pugado with the whisper and she offers several reward options, including the ability to summon Garuda. You can only select one of the rewards at any time, and you may repeat this quest once per Earth day. You receive the title Heir of the Great Wind. You may also keep the whisper to meet the requirements of The Moonlit Path."] = "Vuelve con Agado-Pugado con el susurro y te ofrece varias opciones de recompensa, incluida la habilidad de invocar a Garuda. Solo puedes elegir una de las recompensas a la vez, y puedes repetir esta quest una vez por día terrestre. Recibes el título Heir of the Great Wind. También puedes guardar el susurro para cumplir los requisitos de The Moonlit Path.",
    ["Return to Agapito and speak to him to complete the quest and receive 2,100 gil."] = "Vuelve con Agapito y habla con él para completar la quest y recibir 2,100 gil.",
    ["Return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and examine Imperial Whitegate for the completion cutscene."] = "Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y examina la Imperial Whitegate para ver la escena de finalización.",
    ["Return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and speak with Lathuya again to receive your reward, the Magus Charuqs."] = "Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla de nuevo con Lathuya para recibir tu recompensa, el Magus Charuqs.",
    ["Return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and speak with Ratihb for the final cutscene with Balajaha to complete the quest and receive your reward, the Random Ring."] = "Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla con Ratihb para la escena final con Balajaha que completa la quest y te da tu recompensa, el Random Ring.",
    ["Return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and speak with Waoud. You are given a Sealed Immortal envelope."] = "Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla con Waoud. Te dan un Sealed Immortal envelope.",
    ["Return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and talk to Maudaal again for the final cutscene and your reward, the Chanoix's Gorget."] = "Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla de nuevo con Maudaal para la escena final y tu recompensa, el Chanoix's Gorget.",
    ["Return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Return to Ailbeche and speak with him again for a cutscene. You receive the Willow Fishing Rod as your reward."] = "Vuelve con Ailbeche y habla de nuevo con él para una escena. Recibes la Willow Fishing Rod como recompensa.",
