    ["Return to Bastok Markets (S) and speak with Engelhart (K-10)."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Markets (S) y habla con Engelhart (K-10).",
    ["Return to Bastok Markets and Bastok Markets (S), speaking to Offa each time. In the longer path you go Bastok Markets, Bastok Markets (S), Bastok Markets, Bastok Markets (S), where you trade Offa the Fish Bones, then Bastok Markets, Bastok Markets (S) and Bastok Markets again; the last time he ends this part of the quest and gives you a Rolanberry. In the shorter path you trade the Fish Bones sooner, with fewer trips between the two zones."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Markets y a Bastok Markets (S), hablando con Offa cada vez. En el camino largo vas a Bastok Markets, Bastok Markets (S), Bastok Markets, Bastok Markets (S), donde entregas a Offa los Fish Bones, luego Bastok Markets, Bastok Markets (S) y de nuevo Bastok Markets; la última vez da por terminada esta parte de la quest y te da una Rolanberry. En el camino corto entregas los Fish Bones antes, con menos viajes entre las dos zonas.",
    ["Return to Bastok Markets and speak to Marin again to finish the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Markets y habla de nuevo con Marin para terminar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
