    ["Return to Kenapa-Keppa before 6:00 to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Kenapa-Keppa antes de las 6:00 para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Kerutoto to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Kerutoto para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Kerutoto with the whisper. She offers several rewards, including the ability to summon Diabolos; you can only select one reward at a time."] = "Vuelve con Kerutoto con el whisper. Ofrece varias recompensas, incluida la capacidad de invocar a Diabolos; solo puedes elegir una recompensa a la vez.",
    ["Return to Khoto Rokkorah for the final cutscene and your reward."] = "Vuelve con Khoto Rokkorah para la escena final y tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Kocco Ehllek (H-8), who asks for a piece of kionite."] = "Vuelve con Kocco Ehllek (H-8), que pide un trozo de kionite.",
    ["Return to Kohlo-Lakolo for your reward, the Promise Badge."] = "Vuelve con Kohlo-Lakolo por tu recompensa, la Promise Badge.",
    ["Return to Kohlo-Lakolo to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Vuelve con Kohlo-Lakolo para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Kohlo-Lakolo, who sends you to the House of the Hero in Windurst Walls (G-3) for your reward. If you take too long to return the ring, the quest ends when you return to him and you do not need to go to the House of the Hero; it still counts as complete."] = "Vuelve con Kohlo-Lakolo, que te envía a la House of the Hero en Windurst Walls (G-3) por tu recompensa. Si tardas demasiado en devolver el anillo, la quest termina al volver con él y no necesitas ir a la House of the Hero; se cuenta igualmente como completa.",
    ["Return to Kororo to complete the quest and receive a Tourmaline Earring."] = "Vuelve con Kororo para completar la quest y recibir un Tourmaline Earring.",
    ["Return to Koru-Moru and trade all three items."] = "Vuelve con Koru-Moru y entrega los tres objetos.",
    ["Return to Koru-Moru for a cutscene."] = "Vuelve con Koru-Moru para una escena.",
    ["Return to Koru-Moru in a few days (after Japanese midnight) to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Vuelve con Koru-Moru en unos días (tras la medianoche japonesa) para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Kupipi after both paths are complete."] = "Vuelve con Kupipi cuando ambos caminos estén completos.",
    ["Return to Kupipi and trade a White Rolanberry or Ripe White Rolanberry."] = "Vuelve con Kupipi y entrega un White Rolanberry o un Ripe White Rolanberry.",
    ["Return to Kupipi in Heavens Tower to complete the mission."] = "Vuelve con Kupipi en Heavens Tower para completar la misión.",
    ["Return to Kurando and trade him the egg to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Kurando y entrégale el huevo para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Kuroido-Moido to complete the quest and receive 6,000 gil."] = "Vuelve con Kuroido-Moido para completar la quest y recibir 6,000 gil.",
    ["Return to La Theine Plateau and speak with Vicorpasse (F-6) to receive the Rescue Training Certificate."] = "Vuelve a La Theine Plateau y habla con Vicorpasse (F-6) para recibir el Rescue Training Certificate.",
    ["Return to La Theine Plateau. Deaufrain (F-6), Equesobillot (F-6), and Galaihaurat (E-6) are the three who may provide the Bronze Sword."] = "Vuelve a La Theine Plateau. Deaufrain (F-6), Equesobillot (F-6) y Galaihaurat (E-6) son los tres que pueden darte la Bronze Sword.",
    ["Return to Laisrean for your reward, the Scroll of Utsusemi: Ichi, and the title Treasure-House Ransacker."] = "Vuelve con Laisrean por tu recompensa, el Scroll of Utsusemi: Ichi, y el título Treasure-House Ransacker.",
    ["Return to Leepe-Hoppe (J-8) on the roof of the Rhinostery."] = "Vuelve con Leepe-Hoppe (J-8) en el tejado del Rhinostery.",
    ["Return to Leepe-Hoppe and turn in the whisper to receive your reward; you can only choose one of the rewards offered."] = "Vuelve con Leepe-Hoppe y entrega el whisper para recibir tu recompensa; solo puedes elegir una de las recompensas ofrecidas.",
    ["Return to Leodarion to complete the quest and receive the Ninja Chainmail and the title Paragon of Ninja Excellence. You can repeat the quest."] = "Vuelve con Leodarion para completar la quest y recibir la Ninja Chainmail y el título Paragon of Ninja Excellence. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Return to Lion Springs Tavern door (K-6) and examine the tavern door again."] = "Vuelve a la Lion Springs Tavern door (K-6) y examina de nuevo la puerta de la taberna.",
    ["Return to Lonely Evergreen (G-7) at (G-7) and exchange the Pocket Mogbomb for the Trivia Challenge Kupon."] = "Vuelve al Lonely Evergreen (G-7) en (G-7) y cambia la Pocket Mogbomb por el Trivia Challenge Kupon.",
    ["Return to Magriffon to finish the quest and receive 3 Rafflesia Nectar."] = "Vuelve con Magriffon para terminar la quest y recibir 3 Rafflesia Nectar.",
    ["Return to Mainchelite (I-9) to receive the Large Memory Fragment."] = "Vuelve con Mainchelite (I-9) para recibir el Large Memory Fragment.",
    ["Return to Mainchelite (I-9)."] = "Vuelve con Mainchelite (I-9).",
    ["Return to Mandragora Warden (F-4) and trade a Watermelon."] = "Vuelve con Mandragora Warden (F-4) y entrega una Watermelon.",
    ["Return to Metalworks and speak with Ayame to receive the Bowyer Ring and end the quest."] = "Vuelve a Metalworks y habla con Ayame para recibir el Bowyer Ring y terminar la quest.",
    ["Return to Metalworks and trade the Mythril Sand to Patt-Pott (I-7)."] = "Vuelve a Metalworks y entrega la Mythril Sand a Patt-Pott (I-7).",
