    ["Return to Milazahn for your reward, an Imperial Mythril Piece."] = "Vuelve con Milazahn por tu recompensa, una Imperial Mythril Piece.",
    ["Return to Mine Shaft #2716 and trade the Gold Key to the Shaft Entrance, then return to Cid (H-8)."] = "Vuelve a la Mine Shaft #2716 y entrega la Gold Key a la Shaft Entrance, luego vuelve con Cid (H-8).",
