    ["Return to Naiko-Paneiko, who asks you to check out a lead in Inner Horutoto Ruins. Enter it from East Sarutabaruta (J-7)."] = "Vuelve con Naiko-Paneiko, que te pide comprobar una pista en Inner Horutoto Ruins. Entra desde East Sarutabaruta (J-7).",
    ["Return to Naja Salaheem (I-10) after changing your equipment."] = "Vuelve con Naja Salaheem (I-10) tras cambiar tu equipo.",
