    ["Return to Pso'Xja through the (H-10) entrance in Beaucedine Glacier, follow the right wall to (I-8), pass through the wall, drop down, take the elevator to the Avatar Gate, and examine it before returning to Cid (H-8)."] = "Vuelve a Pso'Xja por la entrada (H-10) de Beaucedine Glacier, sigue la pared derecha hasta (I-8), atraviesa la pared, déjate caer, toma el ascensor hasta la Avatar Gate y examínala antes de volver con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Return to Pso'Xja through the (H-8) entrance."] = "Vuelve a Pso'Xja por la entrada (H-8).",
    ["Return to Qufim Island and examine Trodden Snow (H-7)."] = "Vuelve a Qufim Island y examina Trodden Snow (H-7).",
    ["Return to Raamimi to complete the quest and receive Mulsum x3."] = "Vuelve con Raamimi para completar la quest y recibir Mulsum x3.",
    ["Return to Rabao and speak with Dancing Wolf at (G-7)."] = "Vuelve a Rabao y habla con Dancing Wolf en (G-7).",
    ["Return to Rabao and speak with Maryoh Comyujah (G-7) again to receive the Cerulean crystal."] = "Vuelve a Rabao y habla otra vez con Maryoh Comyujah (G-7) para recibir el Cerulean crystal.",
