    ["Return to Ranpi-Monpi and speak with him again to complete the quest and receive 400 gil."] = "Vuelve con Ranpi-Monpi y habla de nuevo con él para completar la quest y recibir 400 gil.",
    ["Return to Ranpi-Monpi in Windurst Waters (S), receive the Culinary Knife, and bring it to the present-day Ranpi-Monpi."] = "Vuelve con Ranpi-Monpi en Windurst Waters (S), recibe el Culinary Knife y llévaselo al Ranpi-Monpi actual.",
    ["Return to Rarcasmeult to receive the reward."] = "Vuelve con Rarcasmeult para recibir la recompensa.",
