    ["Return to Savae E. Paleade (I-9) to receive the Kindred Report."] = "Vuelve con Savae E. Paleade (I-9) para recibir el Kindred Report.",
    ["Return to Sealion's Den and speak with Sueleen (H-6)."] = "Vuelve a Sealion's Den y habla con Sueleen (H-6).",
    ["Return to Shantotto (K-7) for instructions concerning the Very Special Cardian in Outer Horutoto Ruins."] = "Vuelve con Shantotto (K-7) para recibir instrucciones sobre el Very Special Cardian de Outer Horutoto Ruins.",
    ["Return to Shantotto in Windurst Walls to receive the Scroll of Warp II."] = "Vuelve con Shantotto en Windurst Walls para recibir el Scroll of Warp II.",
