    ["Return to Tavnazian Safehold and speak with Quelveuiat to complete the quest and receive 2,100 gil."] = "Vuelve a Tavnazian Safehold y habla con Quelveuiat para completar la quest y recibir 2,100 gil.",
    ["Return to Tenshodo Headquarters in Lower Jeuno."] = "Vuelve al Tenshodo Headquarters en Lower Jeuno.",
    ["Return to Thierride (F-8) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Vuelve con Thierride (F-8) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Return to Thunder Hawk for a storytelling scene and your reward, the Map of the Ranguemont Pass and 3,000 gil, and the title Honorary Citizen of Selbina."] = "Vuelve con Thunder Hawk para una escena narrada y tu recompensa, el Map of the Ranguemont Pass y 3,000 gil, y el título Honorary Citizen of Selbina.",
    ["Return to Tosuka-Porika (G-8) to continue the investigation."] = "Vuelve con Tosuka-Porika (G-8) para continuar la investigación.",
    ["Return to Tosuka-Porika (G-8)."] = "Vuelve con Tosuka-Porika (G-8).",
    ["Return to Tressia with what you found for your reward, the Gramary Cape."] = "Vuelve con Tressia con lo que hayas encontrado por tu recompensa, el Gramary Cape.",
    ["Return to Trilok to complete the quest. The first completion gives 10,000 gil and a Page from Miratete's Memoirs."] = "Vuelve con Trilok para completar la quest. La primera finalización da 10,000 gil y un Page from Miratete's Memoirs.",
    ["Return to Tsetseroon for an Imperial Bronze Piece and to complete the quest. If you chose not to look into Wawaroon's bag, you receive the Map of Aydeewa Subterrane from Tsetseroon instead, and you do not get the Imperial Bronze Piece."] = "Vuelve con Tsetseroon por una Imperial Bronze Piece y para completar la quest. Si elegiste no mirar en la bolsa de Wawaroon, recibes el Map of Aydeewa Subterrane de Tsetseroon en su lugar, y no consigues la Imperial Bronze Piece.",
    ["Return to Tsetseroon to officially begin the quest."] = "Vuelve con Tsetseroon para empezar oficialmente la quest.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and examine Inconspicuous Door (H-8) with the Moldy, worm-eaten chest."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y examina la Inconspicuous Door (H-8) con el Moldy, worm-eaten chest.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and examine Inconspicuous Door (H-8)."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y examina la Inconspicuous Door (H-8).",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak to Brutus (G-7) again."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla de nuevo con Brutus (G-7).",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam inside the Durable Shields shop."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam dentro de la tienda Durable Shields.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam. After the cutscene, the quest is complete."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam. Tras la escena, la quest está completa.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam. He informs you that he is unable to repair the gauntlets."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam. Te informa de que no puede reparar los guantes.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam. If this is your first AF, there are additional steps first."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam. Si es tu primer AF, antes hay pasos adicionales.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam. If this is your first time completing a Borghertz's Hands quest for any job, there are additional steps first."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam. Si es la primera vez que completas una quest de Borghertz's Hands con cualquier trabajo, antes hay pasos adicionales.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam. If you have completed the AF hands quest on another job, you do not need to view this cutscene or pay gil."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam. Si has completado la quest de los guantes AF con otro trabajo, no necesitas ver esta escena ni pagar gil.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam. Then click on the ???."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam. Luego haz clic en la ???.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam. Then head to Lower Jeuno, inside the Tenshodo area."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam. Luego ve a Lower Jeuno, dentro de la zona del Tenshodo.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Monberaux (G-10) again. Enter Batallia Downs and examine the ??? near (K-8) twice to obtain the Delkfutt Recognition Device."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla de nuevo con Monberaux (G-10). Entra en Batallia Downs y examina dos veces la ??? cerca de (K-8) para obtener el Delkfutt Recognition Device.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Monberaux (G-10)."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Monberaux (G-10).",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno.",
    ["Return to Veridical Conflux (F-5)."] = "Vuelve al Veridical Conflux (F-5).",
    ["Return to Washu to receive your reward, the Scroll of Hojo: Ichi, and the title Apprentice Sommelier."] = "Vuelve con Washu para recibir tu recompensa, el Scroll of Hojo: Ichi, y el título Apprentice Sommelier.",
    ["Return to Wazyih at (F-11) in Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Vuelve con Wazyih en (F-11) en Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Return to Wazyih."] = "Vuelve con Wazyih.",
    ["Return to Western Altepa Desert and enter Quicksand Caves from the entrance around (C/D-11)."] = "Vuelve a Western Altepa Desert y entra en Quicksand Caves por la entrada cerca de (C/D-11).",
    ["Return to Windurst Walls and speak with Koru-Moru to obtain the key item Daze-breaker charm."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Walls y habla con Koru-Moru para obtener el key item Daze-breaker charm.",
    ["Return to Windurst Walls and speak with Koru-Moru to receive your Evoker's Horn and complete the quest. You can toss the Lightning Pendulum and the Wind Pendulum afterwards, as they serve no further purpose."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Walls y habla con Koru-Moru para recibir tu Evoker's Horn y completar la quest. Puedes tirar el Lightning Pendulum y el Wind Pendulum después, ya que no tienen más utilidad.",
    ["Return to Windurst Walls and speak with Shantotto (K-7)."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Walls y habla con Shantotto (K-7).",
    ["Return to Windurst Waters and speak with Tosuka-Porika (G-8)."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Waters y habla con Tosuka-Porika (G-8).",
    ["Return to Windurst Woods and speak with Mourices (F/G-10) to receive the Kindred Report."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Woods y habla con Mourices (F/G-10) para recibir el Kindred Report.",
    ["Return to Windurst Woods and speak with Perih Vashai for the final cutscene and your reward: Hunter's Socks and Ice Arrow x99."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Woods y habla con Perih Vashai para la escena final y tu recompensa: Hunter's Socks e Ice Arrow x99.",
    ["Return to Yggdrasil."] = "Vuelve a Yggdrasil.",
    ["Return to Yoran-Oran (E-5) at (E-5) to complete the Windurst path."] = "Vuelve con Yoran-Oran (E-5) en (E-5) para completar el camino de Windurst.",
    ["Return to Yoran-Oran (E-5), then speak with Yujuju (M-6) at (M-6) in Port Windurst and Tosuka-Porika (G-8) at (G-8) in Windurst Waters."] = "Vuelve con Yoran-Oran (E-5), luego habla con Yujuju (M-6) en (M-6) en Port Windurst y con Tosuka-Porika (G-8) en (G-8) en Windurst Waters.",
    ["Return to Zantaviat to receive the Temple Knights' Davoi Report."] = "Vuelve con Zantaviat para recibir el Temple Knights' Davoi Report.",
    ["Return to Zon-Fobun to complete the quest and receive your Poison Cesti."] = "Vuelve con Zon-Fobun para completar la quest y recibir tu Poison Cesti.",
    ["Return to Zubaba."] = "Vuelve con Zubaba.",
    ["Return to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria to receive the mission."] = "Vuelve con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria para recibir la misión.",
    ["Return to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8) to receive the mission."] = "Vuelve con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8) para recibir la misión.",
    ["Return to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria."] = "Vuelve con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria.",
    ["Return to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8)."] = "Vuelve con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8).",
    ["Return to dead-end target (J-7) and pass through the opened route."] = "Vuelve al objetivo del callejón sin salida (J-7) y atraviesa la ruta abierta.",
    ["Return to green switch (H-7/I-7 area) and activate the switch."] = "Vuelve al interruptor verde (zona H-7/I-7) y actívalo.",
    ["Return to her while you are under the effect of Bane, Mute or Plague."] = "Vuelve con ella mientras estés bajo el efecto de Bane, Mute o Plague.",
    ["Return to the ??? in Arrapago Reef (H-10), map 1, for your reward, the Corsair's Culotte."] = "Vuelve a la ??? en Arrapago Reef (H-10), mapa 1, por tu recompensa, el Corsair's Culotte.",
    ["Return to the ??? in Caedarva Mire."] = "Vuelve a la ??? en Caedarva Mire.",
    ["Return to the ??? near the Augural Conveyor at (C-6)/(B-6)."] = "Vuelve a la ??? cerca del Augural Conveyor en (C-6)/(B-6).",
    ["Return to the Acid-eaten Door in Mount Zhayolm."] = "Vuelve a la Acid-eaten Door en Mount Zhayolm.",
    ["Return to the Altar Room while wearing your Yagudo Headgear for a cutscene. You receive the key item Vault quipus."] = "Vuelve a la Altar Room llevando puesto tu Yagudo Headgear para una escena. Recibes el key item Vault quipus.",
    ["Return to the Audience Chamber after obtaining all three Magicites."] = "Vuelve a la Audience Chamber tras obtener las tres Magicites.",
    ["Return to the Audience Chamber and obtain the Letter to Jeuno."] = "Vuelve a la Audience Chamber y obtén la Letter to Jeuno.",
    ["Return to the Bastokan Embassy and examine the Audience Chamber."] = "Vuelve a la Bastokan Embassy y examina la Audience Chamber.",
    ["Return to the Bastokan Embassy in Ru'Lude Gardens."] = "Vuelve a la Bastokan Embassy en Ru'Lude Gardens.",
    ["Return to the Castle Adoulin gates and report to Ploh Trishbahk (K-9)."] = "Vuelve a las puertas de Castle Adoulin e informa a Ploh Trishbahk (K-9).",
    ["Return to the Castle Gates in Eastern Adoulin."] = "Vuelve a las Castle Gates en Eastern Adoulin.",
    ["Return to the Celennia Memorial Library."] = "Vuelve a la Celennia Memorial Library.",
    ["Return to the Gates of Castle Adoulin at (K-9)."] = "Vuelve a las Gates of Castle Adoulin en (K-9).",
    ["Return to the Gates of Castle Adoulin in Eastern Adoulin."] = "Vuelve a las Gates of Castle Adoulin en Eastern Adoulin.",
    ["Return to the Hall of the Gods and examine Cermet Gate in the Hall of the Gods again."] = "Vuelve a la Hall of the Gods y examina de nuevo la Cermet Gate de la Hall of the Gods.",
    ["Return to the Palace in Ru'Lude Gardens for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives you the key item Whisper of the Wyrmking."] = "Vuelve al Palace de Ru'Lude Gardens para una escena que completa la quest y te da el key item Whisper of the Wyrmking.",
    ["Return to the Pioneers' Coalition and speak with Brenton (E-8)."] = "Vuelve al Pioneers' Coalition y habla con Brenton (E-8).",
    ["Return to the Pioneers' Coalition and speak with Levil (E-8)."] = "Vuelve al Pioneers' Coalition y habla con Levil (E-8).",
    ["Return to the Reisenjima Sanctorium through a Dimensional Portal at the Crag of Holla, Dem, or Mea."] = "Vuelve al Reisenjima Sanctorium por un Dimensional Portal en el Crag of Holla, Dem o Mea.",
    ["Return to the Reisenjima Sanctorium."] = "Vuelve al Reisenjima Sanctorium.",
    ["Return to the Rhinostery and speak with Leepe-Hoppe (J-8)."] = "Vuelve al Rhinostery y habla con Leepe-Hoppe (J-8).",
    ["Return to the Rhinostery door in Windurst Waters (S)."] = "Vuelve a la puerta del Rhinostery en Windurst Waters (S).",
    ["Return to the San d'Orian Embassy in Ru'Lude Gardens and examine the Embassy door to complete the mission."] = "Vuelve a la San d'Orian Embassy en Ru'Lude Gardens y examina la puerta de la Embassy para completar la misión.",
    ["Return to the Shattered Telepoint at the Crag of Holla, Dem, or Mea."] = "Vuelve al Shattered Telepoint del Crag of Holla, Dem o Mea.",
    ["Return to the Silver Knife and continue the investigation."] = "Vuelve al Silver Knife y continúa la investigación.",
    ["Return to the Steaming Sheep restaurant and speak with Hilda to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve al restaurante Steaming Sheep y habla con Hilda para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to the Tavnazian Safehold and talk to Frescheque for your reward, the Yinyang Lorgnette. Talk to Equette again for an additional cutscene."] = "Vuelve a Tavnazian Safehold y habla con Frescheque por tu recompensa, el Yinyang Lorgnette. Habla otra vez con Equette para una escena adicional.",
    ["Return to the Vestal Chamber."] = "Vuelve a la Vestal Chamber.",
    ["Return to the fountain and speak with Enu. The quest now appears in your log."] = "Vuelve a la fuente y habla con Enu. La quest ya aparece en tu log.",
    ["Return to the furniture shop and speak with Morunaude twice."] = "Vuelve a la tienda de muebles y habla dos veces con Morunaude.",
    ["Return to the issuing NPC."] = "Vuelve con el NPC que te dio la misión.",
    ["Return to the mission area after the required transition."] = "Vuelve al área de la misión tras la transición requerida.",
    ["Return to the past and speak with Engelhart (K-10) again."] = "Vuelve al pasado y habla de nuevo con Engelhart (K-10).",
    ["Return to the required area of Pashhow Marshlands and complete the event."] = "Vuelve al área requerida de Pashhow Marshlands y completa el evento.",
    ["Return to the stone circle in La Theine Plateau."] = "Vuelve al stone circle de La Theine Plateau.",
    ["Return to the teahouse and speak with Fari-Wari again to learn Trust: Zazarg."] = "Vuelve a la casa de té y habla de nuevo con Fari-Wari para aprender Trust: Zazarg.",
    ["Return to the top floor of Tavnazian Safehold."] = "Vuelve al piso superior de Tavnazian Safehold.",
    ["Return to town and trade the Steam Clock to Malene to complete the quest and receive 500 gil."] = "Vuelve a la ciudad y entrega el Steam Clock a Malene para completar la quest y recibir 500 gil.",
    ["Return to your home nation Mog House and trade all three items to Moogle at once."] = "Vuelve al Mog House de tu nación de origen y entrega los tres objetos a la vez al Moogle.",
    ["Revisit Powhatan and select the second option, \"Where am I supposed to meet your guest?\"."] = "Vuelve a Powhatan y elige la segunda opción, \"Where am I supposed to meet your guest?\".",
    ["Ring the tuning fork upon the Lightning Protocrystal in the Boyahda Tree. Up to 6 party members can enter the arena, and the time limit is 30 minutes."] = "Haz sonar el tuning fork sobre el Lightning Protocrystal en el Boyahda Tree. Pueden entrar hasta 6 miembros del grupo en la arena, y el límite de tiempo es de 30 minutos.",
    ["Rolanberry Fields: Cavernous Maw (H-6)."] = "Rolanberry Fields: Cavernous Maw (H-6).",
    ["Rumor has it that the golden figurehead from the Black Coffin, the ship of Luzaf the pirate, can be found somewhere within Ilrusi Atoll. Mission orders: recover the figurehead."] = "Se rumorea que el mascarón dorado del Black Coffin, el barco del pirata Luzaf, puede encontrarse en algún lugar de Ilrusi Atoll. Órdenes de la misión: recuperar el mascarón.",
    ["Rycharde offers to buy you a ticket for the next Ferry between Mhaura and Selbina, but you can travel to Selbina any way you choose."] = "Rycharde se ofrece a comprarte un billete del próximo Ferry entre Mhaura y Selbina, pero puedes viajar a Selbina como prefieras.",
    ["Rycharde pays your fare for the next Ferry between Mhaura and Selbina if you choose to take it."] = "Rycharde te paga el pasaje del próximo Ferry entre Mhaura y Selbina si decides tomarlo.",
    ["Sagelord Molaal Ja is visiting the training grounds to oversee the progress of the soldiers. His elimination would sow chaos and confusion in the Mamool Ja ranks. Mission orders: defeat Sagelord Molaal Ja. The recommended level is 60."] = "Sagelord Molaal Ja visita los terrenos de entrenamiento para supervisar el progreso de los soldados. Eliminarlo sembraría el caos y la confusión en las filas Mamool Ja. Órdenes de la misión: derrotar a Sagelord Molaal Ja. El nivel recomendado es 60.",
    ["San d'Oria"] = "San d'Oria",
    ["San d'Oria Path:"] = "San d'Oria Path:",
    ["San d'Oria Path: enter Northern San d'Oria and speak with Arnau (M-6) at (M-6), then speak with Chasalvige (L-6) in the Cathedral's Manuscript Room."] = "San d'Oria Path: entra en Northern San d'Oria y habla con Arnau (M-6) en (M-6), luego habla con Chasalvige (L-6) en el Cathedral's Manuscript Room.",
    ["San d'Oria first: travel to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Baraka at the Bastokan Consulate."] = "Primero San d'Oria: viaja a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Baraka en el Bastokan Consulate.",
    ["San d'Oria: Southern San d'Oria (H-8), Northern San d'Oria (J-10), or Port San d'Oria (H-9)."] = "San d'Oria: Southern San d'Oria (H-8), Northern San d'Oria (J-10) o Port San d'Oria (H-9).",
    ["San d'Oria: complete Boy and the Beast and Wrath of the Griffon."] = "San d'Oria: completa Boy and the Beast y Wrath of the Griffon.",
    ["San d'Oria: complete Perils of the Griffon and In a Haze of Glory."] = "San d'Oria: completa Perils of the Griffon y In a Haze of Glory.",
    ["San d'Oria: complete The Shadow Lord."] = "San d'Oria: completa The Shadow Lord.",
    ["San d'Oria: speak with Mainchelite (I-9) in Southern San d'Oria [S] and complete Gifts of the Griffon and Claws of the Griffon."] = "San d'Oria: habla con Mainchelite (I-9) en Southern San d'Oria [S] y completa Gifts of the Griffon y Claws of the Griffon.",
    ["Saruta Cotton can be bought from Kuzah Hpirohpon (79 gil) or Meriri (500 gil, Clothcraft Guild Recruit rank or higher) in Windurst Woods (F-12), or found at the Auction House under Materials, Clothcraft."] = "La Saruta Cotton se puede comprar a Kuzah Hpirohpon (79 gil) o a Meriri (500 gil, rango Clothcraft Guild Recruit o superior) en Windurst Woods (F-12), o encontrar en la Auction House en Materials, Clothcraft.",
    ["Sauromugue Champaign: Cavernous Maw (J-10), beyond Banishing Gate #3 in Garlaige Citadel."] = "Sauromugue Champaign: Cavernous Maw (J-10), tras la Banishing Gate #3 en Garlaige Citadel.",
    ["Sauromugue Champaign: Cavernous Maw (J-10)."] = "Sauromugue Champaign: Cavernous Maw (J-10).",
    ["Scouts report that the new Mamool Ja soldiers have received supplies from their families. Destroy their morale by stealing these supplies while being careful to remain undetected."] = "Los exploradores informan de que los nuevos soldados Mamool Ja han recibido suministros de sus familias. Destruye su moral robando esos suministros con cuidado de no ser detectado.",
    ["Search for an abnormal ???, which only appears during this specific time frame, and touch it to receive the key item Carrier pigeon letter."] = "Busca una ??? anormal, que solo aparece en esta franja de tiempo, y tócala para recibir el key item Carrier pigeon letter.",
    ["Search the city for a clickable point called Suspicious Object and examine it."] = "Busca por la ciudad un punto seleccionable llamado Suspicious Object y examínalo.",
    ["Search the marked ??? in the Quicksand Caves and obtain the nine stones."] = "Busca las ??? marcadas en Quicksand Caves y obtén las nueve piedras.",
    ["Search the six Ancient Magical Gizmos until one yields the Cracked Mana Orb."] = "Busca en los seis Ancient Magical Gizmos hasta que uno te dé el Cracked Mana Orb.",
    ["Search the six classrooms for the active ???."] = "Busca la ??? activa en las seis aulas.",
    ["Second Rubious Crystal:"] = "Segundo Rubious Crystal:",
    ["See Game Terms for common abbreviations such as AF and RSE. Fame explains quest reputation and where to check it, and Inventory lists Phoenix's Mog Wardrobe unlocks."] = "Consulta Game Terms para ver las abreviaturas habituales como AF y RSE. Fame explica la reputación de las quests y dónde consultarla, e Inventory enumera los desbloqueos del Mog Wardrobe de Phoenix.",
    ["Seek Stone Circle ??? (G-6) between 18:00 and 05:00."] = "Busca la ??? del Stone Circle (G-6) entre las 18:00 y las 05:00.",
    ["Seek Transcendental Radiance (F-7)."] = "Busca la Transcendental Radiance (F-7).",
    ["Seek the Transcendental Radiance in Abyssea - Empyreal Paradox."] = "Busca la Transcendental Radiance en Abyssea - Empyreal Paradox.",
    ["Selbina: choose the first dialogue option, \"You wanted an adventurer?\""] = "Selbina: elige la primera opción de diálogo, \"You wanted an adventurer?\"",
    ["Selbina: examine Oaken Door (K-8) in Norg."] = "Selbina: examina la Oaken Door (K-8) en Norg.",
    ["Selbina: obtain 3 Bee Pollen from Huge Wasps in La Theine Plateau or Konschtat Highlands, or purchase them from the Auction House."] = "Selbina: obtén 3 Bee Pollen de las Huge Wasps de La Theine Plateau o Konschtat Highlands, o cómpralas en la Auction House.",
    ["Selbina: return to Selbina and trade all 3 Bee Pollen to Abelard."] = "Selbina: vuelve a Selbina y entrega los 3 Bee Pollen a Abelard.",
    ["Selbina: speak with Naillina at (F-9) in the Mayor's Residence."] = "Selbina: habla con Naillina en (F-9), en la Mayor's Residence.",
    ["Selbina: speak with Pacomart at (H-10) to travel to Norg."] = "Selbina: habla con Pacomart en (H-10) para viajar a Norg.",
    ["Select the ??? near the entrance and erase your memories (\"I've already forgotten them\" and \"Yes, erase my memories\"), then complete Shadows of the Departed and Apocalypse Nigh again to obtain an earring of your choice."] = "Selecciona la ??? cerca de la entrada y borra tus memorias (\"I've already forgotten them\" y \"Yes, erase my memories\"), luego completa de nuevo Shadows of the Departed y Apocalypse Nigh para obtener un pendiente a tu elección.",
    ["Select the Memento Circle and pick Waking Dreams."] = "Selecciona el Memento Circle y elige Waking Dreams.",
    ["Set the Records of Eminence objective Conflict: South Gustaberg (or similar) to help you keep track of the kills."] = "Configura el objetivo de Records of Eminence Conflict: South Gustaberg (o similar) para llevar la cuenta de las muertes.",
    ["Set your home point"] = "Fija tu home point",
    ["Several NPCs that look very similar to the one Eddy showed you appear on the ship."] = "Varios NPCs muy parecidos al que Eddy te mostró aparecen en el barco.",
    ["Several NPCs that look very similar to the one Grin showed you appear on the ship."] = "Varios NPCs muy parecidos al que Grin te mostró aparecen en el barco.",
    ["Several NPCs that look very similar to the one in the picture appear on the ship."] = "Varios NPCs muy parecidos al de la imagen aparecen en el barco.",
    ["She makes you the Invisible man sticker you need, but only if you first bring her Shoalweed. Shoalweed drops from Recluse Spider enemies in Kuftal Tunnel."] = "Te hace el Invisible man sticker que necesitas, pero solo si antes le traes Shoalweed. El Shoalweed lo sueltan enemigos Recluse Spider en Kuftal Tunnel.",
    ["She sends you to Ranguemont Pass to look for Semih Lafihna. Semih Lafihna is not there, so speak with Perchond at (F-10); Semih Lafihna was searching for Glittersand around the pond at (E-5)."] = "Te envía a Ranguemont Pass a buscar a Semih Lafihna. Semih Lafihna no está allí, así que habla con Perchond en (F-10); Semih Lafihna estaba buscando Glittersand alrededor del estanque en (E-5).",
    ["Silk Thread can also be bought from Meriri (only for Clothcraft Apprentices or higher) or from Kuzah Hpirohpon at the nearby Clothcrafting Guild (Home Point #5)."] = "La Silk Thread también se puede comprar a Meriri (solo para Clothcraft Apprentices o superior) o a Kuzah Hpirohpon en el Clothcrafting Guild cercano (Home Point #5).",
    ["Solo in the areas right outside your city. The table on your nation page lists nearby areas from easiest to hardest, with the typical level of the monsters in each:"] = "En solitario, en las zonas justo fuera de tu ciudad. La tabla de la página de tu nación enumera las zonas cercanas de la más fácil a la más difícil, con el nivel habitual de los monstruos de cada una:",
    ["Some monsters inside Promyvion drop items called Recollections. Trade Harith one of these Recollections plus 2,000 gil to receive an Anima: Recollection of Pain gives Hysteroanima (negates special attacks), Recollection of Fear gives Psychoanima (negates normal attacks) and Recollection of Guilt gives Terroanima (causes the monster to flee)."] = "Algunos monstruos dentro de Promyvion sueltan objetos llamados Recollections. Entrega a Harith una de estas Recollections más 2,000 gil para recibir una Anima: Recollection of Pain da Hysteroanima (anula los ataques especiales), Recollection of Fear da Psychoanima (anula los ataques normales) y Recollection of Guilt da Terroanima (hace huir al monstruo).",
    ["Some pieces are job-specific armor that needs a matching subligar dropped by a Fomor enemy: for example Aikido Gi (MNK) needs an Aquarius Subligar from Fomor Monk, Gaudy Harness (BRD/BST) an Ophiuchus Subligar from Fomor Beastmaster, Gloom Breastplate (DRK) a Sagittarius Subligar from Fomor Dark Knight, Nokizaru Gi (NIN) a Taurus Subligar from Fomor Ninja, and Wyvern Mail (DRG) a Leo Subligar from Fomor Dragoon."] = "Algunas piezas son armaduras específicas de trabajo que necesitan un subligar a juego que sueltan los enemigos Fomor: por ejemplo Aikido Gi (MNK) necesita un Aquarius Subligar de Fomor Monk, Gaudy Harness (BRD/BST) un Ophiuchus Subligar de Fomor Beastmaster, Gloom Breastplate (DRK) un Sagittarius Subligar de Fomor Dark Knight, Nokizaru Gi (NIN) un Taurus Subligar de Fomor Ninja y Wyvern Mail (DRG) un Leo Subligar de Fomor Dragoon.",
    ["Speak to Arawn again once you have collected all the stamps to complete the quest and receive a Leather Gorget."] = "Habla de nuevo con Arawn cuando hayas reunido todos los sellos para completar la quest y recibir un Leather Gorget.",
    ["Speak to Brutus (G-7) after one game day to receive a chocobo egg. You must change zones and return to Upper Jeuno after the day change."] = "Habla con Brutus (G-7) tras un día de juego para recibir un huevo de chocobo. Debes cambiar de zona y volver a Upper Jeuno tras el cambio de día.",
    ["Speak to Fari-Wari after the day changes to receive a Mercenary Camp Entry Slip."] = "Habla con Fari-Wari tras el cambio de día para recibir una Mercenary Camp Entry Slip.",
    ["Speak to him two more times to start the correct quest, and choose \"Nope, never!\"."] = "Habla con él dos veces más para empezar la quest correcta, y elige \"Nope, never!\".",
    ["Speak to the NPCs to get the option of returning the key item Dropped item to them. You only have one chance to get it right."] = "Habla con los NPCs para tener la opción de devolverles el key item Dropped item. Solo tienes una oportunidad de acertar.",
    ["Speak to the following 7 guards to obtain the stamps. In Bastok Markets: Pavel (D-11), at the gate to Gustaberg. In Bastok Mines: Deadly Spider (G-8), on the 2nd floor of the Depot, and Tall Mountain (J-7), by going down the ramp toward the Alchemist Guild and turning right at the no-entrance area."] = "Habla con los siguientes 7 guardias para obtener los sellos. En Bastok Markets: Pavel (D-11), en la puerta de Gustaberg. En Bastok Mines: Deadly Spider (G-8), en el 2º piso del Depot, y Tall Mountain (J-7), bajando la rampa hacia el Alchemist Guild y girando a la derecha en la zona sin entrada.",
    ["Speak with 20 people around the kingdom's cities; for example Daggao in Southern San d'Oria (K-5), Rouva in Southern San d'Oria (I-8), Giaunne in Northern San d'Oria (I-9) and Perdiouvilet in Port San d'Oria (G-7)."] = "Habla con 20 personas de las ciudades del reino; por ejemplo Daggao en Southern San d'Oria (K-5), Rouva en Southern San d'Oria (I-8), Giaunne en Northern San d'Oria (I-9) y Perdiouvilet en Port San d'Oria (G-7).",
    ["Speak with Abda-Lurabda in the Automaton Workshop in Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Habla con Abda-Lurabda en el Automaton Workshop de Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Speak with Abeaule in Northern San d'Oria (F-8)."] = "Habla con Abeaule en Northern San d'Oria (F-8).",
    ["Speak with Abeaule in Northern San d'Oria (F-8); he needs someone to fill an order. Accept the task and he gives you a Supplies Order."] = "Habla con Abeaule en Northern San d'Oria (F-8); necesita a alguien que cumpla un pedido. Acepta la tarea y te da un Supplies Order.",
    ["Speak with Abioleget in Northern San d'Oria (M-7); he needs you to deliver Blue Peas."] = "Habla con Abioleget en Northern San d'Oria (M-7); necesita que entregues Blue Peas.",
    ["Speak with Abioleget in the Cathedral in Northern San d'Oria at (M-7)."] = "Habla con Abioleget en la Cathedral de Northern San d'Oria en (M-7).",
    ["Speak with Abquhbah after the event to receive Cipher: Abquhbah."] = "Habla con Abquhbah tras el evento para recibir Cipher: Abquhbah.",
    ["Speak with Adelbrecht (E-9) in Bastok Markets (S) and turn in the Blue Recommendation Letter to receive Battle Rations."] = "Habla con Adelbrecht (E-9) en Bastok Markets (S) y entrega la Blue Recommendation Letter para recibir Battle Rations.",
    ["Speak with Adelbrecht (E-9)."] = "Habla con Adelbrecht (E-9).",
    ["Speak with Aeka at (I-8) to receive the first material."] = "Habla con Aeka en (I-8) para recibir el primer material.",
    ["Speak with Agado-Pugado in Rabao (G-9) to obtain the quest. You need Rabao fame level 6 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Once you have the key item Tuning fork of wind, you can safely undertake the quest. Each party member must have their own Tuning fork of wind."] = "Habla con Agado-Pugado en Rabao (G-9) para obtener la quest. Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Rabao y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Cuando tengas el key item Tuning fork of wind, ya puedes emprender la quest con seguridad. Cada miembro del grupo debe tener su propio Tuning fork of wind.",
    ["Speak with Agapito in Port Bastok (G-6) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Agapito en Port Bastok (G-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Ahaadah in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-6), in Philosopher's Alley near the Alchemists' Guild, to begin the quest. Alcander and Ahaadah want you to help Tinga-Matonga become a respectable citizen."] = "Habla con Ahaadah en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-6), en Philosopher's Alley cerca del Alchemists' Guild, para empezar la quest. Alcander y Ahaadah quieren que ayudes a Tinga-Matonga a convertirse en un ciudadano respetable.",
    ["Speak with Ahkk Jharcham in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10). You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1. She wants a Parchment and a Black Ink so she can write down her secret."] = "Habla con Ahkk Jharcham en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10). Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan. Quiere un Parchment y una Black Ink para poder escribir su secreto.",
    ["Speak with Ailbeche in Northern San d'Oria (J-8)."] = "Habla con Ailbeche en Northern San d'Oria (J-8).",
    ["Speak with Ailbeche in Northern San d'Oria (J-9) for a cutscene that starts the quest. You must be level 10 or higher."] = "Habla con Ailbeche en Northern San d'Oria (J-9) para una escena que inicia la quest. Debes ser nivel 10 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Ailbeche near Home Point #2 in Northern San d'Oria (J-8) to begin the quest; he asks you for an Ordelle whetstone."] = "Habla con Ailbeche cerca del Home Point #2 en Northern San d'Oria (J-8) para empezar la quest; te pide una Ordelle whetstone.",
    ["Speak with Aldo (J-8) at (J-8)."] = "Habla con Aldo (J-8) en (J-8).",
    ["Speak with Aldo (J-8) in Neptune's Spire."] = "Habla con Aldo (J-8) en Neptune's Spire.",
    ["Speak with Alfesar in Rabao (H-7), who asks you to help him find an Ancient tablet fragment. You need Rabao fame level 4 and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Habla con Alfesar en Rabao (H-7), que te pide ayuda para encontrar un Ancient tablet fragment. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Rabao y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["Speak with Alib-Mufalib in Port Bastok (K-7) to receive a Blue Sentinel badge and begin the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Alib-Mufalib en Port Bastok (K-7) para recibir una Blue Sentinel badge y empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Speak with Alois (J-8)."] = "Habla con Alois (J-8).",
    ["Speak with Altiret, who asks you to retrieve the stolen item."] = "Habla con Altiret, que te pide que recuperes el objeto robado.",
    ["Speak with Amaura (G-6) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Amaura (G-6) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Amaura (G-6), who asks for Thyme Moss."] = "Habla con Amaura (G-6), que pide Thyme Moss.",
    ["Speak with Amaura again to receive the Bottle of Treant Tonic."] = "Habla de nuevo con Amaura para recibir la Bottle of Treant Tonic.",
    ["Speak with Ambrosius in Windurst Walls (J-12) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Ambrosius en Windurst Walls (J-12) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Amutiyaal in Southern San d'Oria (L-6) to receive a Red Sentinel badge and begin the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Amutiyaal en Southern San d'Oria (L-6) para recibir una Red Sentinel badge y empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Speak with Andecia, in the middle house on the first floor of Squire's Alley in Southern San d'Oria (M-7), once to trigger the story text. Speak with her again to receive the Well Water."] = "Habla con Andecia, en la casa del medio de la primera planta de Squire's Alley en Southern San d'Oria (M-7), una vez para activar el texto de la historia. Vuelve a hablar con ella para recibir el Well Water.",
    ["Speak with Andrause (I-8) to receive the Black Book."] = "Habla con Andrause (I-8) para recibir el Black Book.",
    ["Speak with Andreine in the Celennia Memorial Library."] = "Habla con Andreine en la Celennia Memorial Library.",
    ["Speak with Angelica in Windurst Waters (F-10); she asks for a piece of body armor that depends on your job."] = "Habla con Angelica en Windurst Waters (F-10); pide una pieza de armadura de cuerpo que depende de tu trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Anguenet (J-10) and trade him the Attohwa Ginseng."] = "Habla con Anguenet (J-10) y entrégale el Attohwa Ginseng.",
    ["Speak with Anteurephiaux (J-8, 3rd floor) to officially begin the quest."] = "Habla con Anteurephiaux (J-8, 3.er piso) para empezar oficialmente la quest.",
    ["Speak with Antje at Excavated Snow."] = "Habla con Antje en la Excavated Snow.",
    ["Speak with Antreneau and then Thierride, both in the Rusty Anchor Pub (G-7) in Port San d'Oria, to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Antreneau y luego con Thierride, ambos en el Rusty Anchor Pub (G-7) de Port San d'Oria, para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Antreneau in Port San d'Oria (G-7) to flag the quest."] = "Habla con Antreneau en Port San d'Oria (G-7) para activar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Apururu (H-9) in Windurst Woods."] = "Habla con Apururu (H-9) en Windurst Woods.",
    ["Speak with Apururu in Windurst Woods (H-9)."] = "Habla con Apururu en Windurst Woods (H-9).",
    ["Speak with Aquillina in Bastok Markets (K-9); she asks for Flint Stones."] = "Habla con Aquillina en Bastok Markets (K-9); pide Flint Stones.",
    ["Speak with Aramu-Paramu."] = "Habla con Aramu-Paramu.",
    ["Speak with Arawn in Bastok Markets (J-10) to start the quest. You receive the Stamp sheet to collect stamps."] = "Habla con Arawn en Bastok Markets (J-10) para empezar la quest. Recibes la Stamp sheet para coleccionar sellos.",
    ["Speak with Arciela and follow her request."] = "Habla con Arciela y sigue su petición.",
    ["Speak with Arciela."] = "Habla con Arciela.",
    ["Speak with Ardea in Bastok Markets (H-8), in front of the Goldsmithing Guild next to Home Point #4. If you have started the quest Rock Racketeer, you must finish it before Ardea lets you continue."] = "Habla con Ardea en Bastok Markets (H-8), delante del Goldsmithing Guild junto al Home Point #4. Si has empezado la quest Rock Racketeer, debes terminarla antes de que Ardea te deje continuar.",
    ["Speak with Ardea in Bastok Markets (H-8), near Home Point #4, and sell her the stone for 10 gil."] = "Habla con Ardea en Bastok Markets (H-8), cerca del Home Point #4, y véndele la piedra por 10 gil.",
    ["Speak with Arminibit and Ceraulian inside Cargo Room A in Port San d'Oria (I-9). You must be level 30 or higher and have the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Habla con Arminibit y Ceraulian dentro de la Cargo Room A de Port San d'Oria (I-9). Debes ser nivel 30 o superior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["Speak with Atelloune in Southern San d'Oria (L-6) for a cutscene that starts the quest. This quest requires the Wings of the Goddess pack and follows Seeing Spots."] = "Habla con Atelloune en Southern San d'Oria (L-6) para una escena que inicia la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Wings of the Goddess y sigue a Seeing Spots.",
    ["Speak with Aurege in Northern San d'Oria (F-3), near Home Point #4 outside the Carpenter's Guild, to start the quest."] = "Habla con Aurege en Northern San d'Oria (F-3), cerca del Home Point #4 fuera del Carpenter's Guild, para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Ayame (K-7)."] = "Habla con Ayame (K-7).",
    ["Speak with Ayame at (K-7), in the other Cannonry."] = "Habla con Ayame en (K-7), en el otro Cannonry.",
    ["Speak with Ayame in Metalworks (K-7) for a cutscene and agree twice to start the quest. You need Bastok fame level 3 and the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Ayame en Metalworks (K-7) para una escena y acepta dos veces para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok y el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Ayame in Metalworks (K-7) for a cutscene that starts the quest. You need Bastok fame level 4 and the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Ayame en Metalworks (K-7) para una escena que inicia la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Bastok y el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Ayame in Metalworks (K-7) for a cutscene that starts the quest. You need Bastok fame level 5 and the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Ayame en Metalworks (K-7) para una escena que inicia la quest. Necesitas el nivel 5 de fama de Bastok y el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Ayame in Metalworks (K-7), as a Monk of level 50 or higher. If you have finished the Treasures of Aht Urhgan missions, you may need to speak with her twice. Once you have talked to Ayame, the quest shows up in your quest log and you may switch to another job to complete it."] = "Habla con Ayame en Metalworks (K-7), siendo Monk de nivel 50 o superior. Si has terminado las misiones de Treasures of Aht Urhgan, puede que tengas que hablar con ella dos veces. Cuando hayas hablado con Ayame, la quest aparece en tu quest log y puedes cambiar a otro trabajo para completarla.",
    ["Speak with Balasiel in Southern San d'Oria (F-7) to receive the key item Weapons Training Guide and the Spear of Trials."] = "Habla con Balasiel en Southern San d'Oria (F-7) para recibir el key item Weapons Training Guide y la Spear of Trials.",
    ["Speak with Balasiel in Southern San d'Oria (F-7) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Balasiel en Southern San d'Oria (F-7) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Balasiel in Southern San d'Oria (F-7), who gives you the Book of Tasks with hints on how to proceed. You must be level 30."] = "Habla con Balasiel en Southern San d'Oria (F-7), que te da el Book of Tasks con pistas para continuar. Debes ser nivel 30.",
    ["Speak with Balasiel in Southern San d'Oria (F-7)."] = "Habla con Balasiel en Southern San d'Oria (F-7).",
    ["Speak with Balasiel on the upper walkways of Southern San d'Oria (F-7); he asks you for a Revival Tree Root. You must be level 10 or higher."] = "Habla con Balasiel en los pasillos altos de Southern San d'Oria (F-7); te pide una Revival Tree Root. Debes ser nivel 10 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Balasiel to complete the quest."] = "Habla con Balasiel para completar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Baldric inside the Darksteel Forge on the first floor of Metalworks (G-9) to begin the quest. You need Bastok fame level 2."] = "Habla con Baldric dentro de la Darksteel Forge en el primer piso de Metalworks (G-9) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 2 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Baren-Moren in the hat shop in Windurst Waters South (H-7) to start the quest and receive the New Model Hat."] = "Habla con Baren-Moren en la tienda de sombreros de Windurst Waters South (H-7) para empezar la quest y recibir el New Model Hat.",
    ["Speak with Baren-Moren in the hat shop in Windurst Waters South (H-7); he asks you to bring him Giant Bird Feather x3."] = "Habla con Baren-Moren en la tienda de sombreros de Windurst Waters South (H-7); te pide que le traigas Giant Bird Feather x3.",
    ["Speak with Bartolomeo in Port Bastok (F-7), inside the Air Travel Agency."] = "Habla con Bartolomeo en Port Bastok (F-7), dentro de la Air Travel Agency.",
    ["Speak with Bartolomeo in Port Bastok (F-7), one of the clerks inside the air travel agency."] = "Habla con Bartolomeo en Port Bastok (F-7), uno de los empleados dentro de la air travel agency.",
    ["Speak with Baunise (H-9), reached from (F-8) in the tower above the West Gate, to receive the Book of the West."] = "Habla con Baunise (H-9), al que se llega desde (F-8) en la torre sobre la West Gate, para recibir el Book of the West.",
    ["Speak with Belgidiveau in Northern San d'Oria (G-8) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Belgidiveau en Northern San d'Oria (G-8) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Benita in Port Bastok (J-6) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Benita en Port Bastok (J-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Bertenont (E-4) in Northern San d'Oria."] = "Habla con Bertenont (E-4) en Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Apkallu Seizure. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Apkallu Seizure. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Bellerophon's Bliss. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Bellerophon's Bliss. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Demolition Duty. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Demolition Duty. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Deserter. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Deserter. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Desperately Seeking Cephalopods. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Desperately Seeking Cephalopods. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Extermination. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Extermination. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Golden Salvage. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Golden Salvage. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Lamia No. 13. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Lamia No. 13. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Lost and Found. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Lost and Found. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Searat Salvation. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Searat Salvation. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Black Mud in Bastok Mines (J-7) to begin the quest. You receive a Brass Canteen. If you drop it, you can speak to him again to get another one."] = "Habla con Black Mud en Bastok Mines (J-7) para empezar la quest. Recibes una Brass Canteen. Si la tiras, puedes hablar de nuevo con él para conseguir otra.",
    ["Speak with Blandine in Mhaura (I-9) to begin the quest. You need Windurst fame level 4."] = "Habla con Blandine en Mhaura (I-9) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Windurst.",
    ["Speak with Blatherix (F-8) in Bastok Markets (S) to receive the Goblin Belt."] = "Habla con Blatherix (F-8) en Bastok Markets (S) para recibir el Goblin Belt.",
    ["Speak with Blatherix (F-8) to receive the reward."] = "Habla con Blatherix (F-8) para recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Speak with Brenton (E-8)."] = "Habla con Brenton (E-8).",
    ["Speak with Brutus in Upper Jeuno (G-7) as a Beastmaster of level 40 or higher. From this point on you can complete the quest on any job."] = "Habla con Brutus en Upper Jeuno (G-7) como Beastmaster de nivel 40 o superior. A partir de aquí puedes completar la quest con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Brutus in Upper Jeuno (G-7) as a Beastmaster of level 50 or higher; he gives you three Aquaflora key items. From here on you can be on any job."] = "Habla con Brutus en Upper Jeuno (G-7) como Beastmaster de nivel 50 o superior; te da tres key items Aquaflora. A partir de aquí puedes ir con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Brutus in Upper Jeuno (G-7) for a cutscene. You may have to talk to him multiple times to get the cutscene."] = "Habla con Brutus en Upper Jeuno (G-7) para una escena. Puede que tengas que hablarle varias veces para obtener la escena.",
    ["Speak with Brutus in Upper Jeuno (G-7) to receive the key item Weapons Training Guide and the Pick of Trials. You need to break the latent on the Pick of Trials before completing the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Brutus en Upper Jeuno (G-7) para recibir el key item Weapons Training Guide y el Pick of Trials. Debes romper el latent del Pick of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest.",
    ["Speak with Brygid again to complete the quest and receive the Gloves. Completing it later unlocks Brygid the Stylist Returns."] = "Habla de nuevo con Brygid para completar la quest y recibir los Gloves. Completarla desbloquea más adelante Brygid the Stylist Returns.",
    ["Speak with Brygid in Bastok Markets (K-9). She tells you how bad your fashion sense is and wants you to come back wearing a Robe and a Bronze Subligar."] = "Habla con Brygid en Bastok Markets (K-9). Te dice lo mal que está tu sentido de la moda y quiere que vuelvas llevando un Robe y un Bronze Subligar.",
    ["Speak with Cacaroon (G-11) for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Cacaroon (G-11) para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Cacaroon in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-11) and trade him one Imperial Bronze Piece."] = "Habla con Cacaroon en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-11) y entrégale una Imperial Bronze Piece.",
    ["Speak with Cahaurme (J-9), reached from (L-8) in the tower above the East Gate, to receive the Book of the East."] = "Habla con Cahaurme (J-9), al que se llega desde (L-8) en la torre sobre la East Gate, para recibir el Book of the East.",
    ["Speak with Calovour in the Cathedral (M-6)."] = "Habla con Calovour en la Cathedral (M-6).",
    ["Speak with Carbuncle at the ??? in La Theine Plateau (G-6). You must first have obtained spirit pacts with the 6 summonable Celestial avatars before you are presented with the Rainbow resonator."] = "Habla con Carbuncle en la ??? de La Theine Plateau (G-6). Primero debes haber obtenido los pactos espirituales de los 6 avatares Celestial invocables antes de que te den el Rainbow resonator.",
    ["Speak with Carmelo in Port Bastok (E-6) to begin the quest and receive the key item Chanson de Liberte."] = "Habla con Carmelo en Port Bastok (E-6) para empezar la quest y recibir el key item Chanson de Liberte.",
    ["Speak with Carmelo in Port Bastok (E-6) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Carmelo en Port Bastok (E-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Carmelo inside the Steaming Sheep in Port Bastok (E-6) to receive the actual quest and Carmelo's song sheet. If you have The Siren's Tear active, you get a prompt to ask him about the Siren's Tear instead. You need Bastok fame level 5."] = "Habla con Carmelo dentro del Steaming Sheep en Port Bastok (E-6) para recibir la quest real y la Carmelo's song sheet. Si tienes The Siren's Tear activa, te sale una opción para preguntarle por la Siren's Tear. Necesitas el nivel 5 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Celestina in the nearby Goldsmithing Guild. The quest now shows in your log."] = "Habla con Celestina en el Goldsmithing Guild cercano. La quest aparece ahora en tu registro.",
    ["Speak with Ceraulian in Port San d'Oria (I-10), inside Cargo Room A, for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Ceraulian en Port San d'Oria (I-10), dentro de la Cargo Room A, para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Ceraulian inside Cargo Room A in Port San d'Oria (I-10) to begin the quest; you must be a Dragoon of level 50 or higher. Agree to help him obtain a Gold Hairpin. From this point on you can change to any other job."] = "Habla con Ceraulian dentro de la Cargo Room A de Port San d'Oria (I-10) para empezar la quest; debes ser Dragoon de nivel 50 o superior. Acepta ayudarlo a obtener una Gold Hairpin. A partir de este punto puedes cambiar a cualquier otro trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Ceraulian once more after the cutscene."] = "Habla una vez más con Ceraulian tras la escena.",
    ["Speak with Chalvatot (F-7)."] = "Habla con Chalvatot (F-7).",
    ["Speak with Chalvatot in Chateau d'Oraguille (F-7) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Chalvatot en Chateau d'Oraguille (F-7) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Chamama in Windurst Waters (F-10) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Chamama en Windurst Waters (F-10) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Chamama in Windurst Waters (F-10)."] = "Habla con Chamama en Windurst Waters (F-10).",
    ["Speak with Charlaimagnat in Northern San d'Oria (M-7)."] = "Habla con Charlaimagnat en Northern San d'Oria (M-7).",
    ["Speak with Chemioue on the top floor of Tavnazian Safehold (J-6), slightly north of Home Point #3, for a cutscene. You need to have completed Promathia Mission 3-5 and have the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Chemioue en el piso superior de Tavnazian Safehold (J-6), un poco al norte del Home Point #3, para una escena. Debes haber completado la Promathia Mission 3-5 y tener el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Chipmy-Popmy in Port Windurst (C-8) to start the quest. This quest requires the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Chipmy-Popmy en Port Windurst (C-8) para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Chumimi in the basement of Heavens Tower (the bottom floor). You must be on Black Mage, level 40 or higher, to start this quest."] = "Habla con Chumimi en el sótano de Heavens Tower (el piso de abajo). Debes ser Black Mage de nivel 40 o superior para empezar esta quest.",
    ["Speak with Chumimi in the basement of Heavens Tower to start the quest. You must be a Black Mage, level 50 or higher."] = "Habla con Chumimi en el sótano de Heavens Tower para empezar la quest. Debes ser Black Mage de nivel 50 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Chumimi in the basement of Heavens Tower to start the quest. You must be on Black Mage."] = "Habla con Chumimi en el sótano de Heavens Tower para empezar la quest. Debes ser Black Mage.",
    ["Speak with Churano-Shurano on the roof of the Optistery in Windurst Waters (F-8), in front of the telescope."] = "Habla con Churano-Shurano en el tejado del Optistery de Windurst Waters (F-8), delante del telescopio.",
    ["Speak with Cid (H-8) again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Speak with Cid (H-8) in Bastok Metalworks and complete the San d'Oria and Windurst paths in either order."] = "Habla con Cid (H-8) en Bastok Metalworks y completa los caminos de San d'Oria y Windurst en cualquier orden.",
    ["Speak with Cid (H-8) in Metalworks."] = "Habla con Cid (H-8) en Metalworks.",
    ["Speak with Cid (H-8)."] = "Habla con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Speak with Cid in Metalworks (G-8) as a Dark Knight of level 50 or higher to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Cid en Metalworks (G-8) siendo Dark Knight de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Cid in Metalworks (H-8) to begin the quest. You need Bastok fame level 4."] = "Habla con Cid en Metalworks (H-8) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Cid in Metalworks (H-8) to receive the Gun of Trials. You need to break the latent on the Gun of Trials before completing the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Cid en Metalworks (H-8) para recibir la Gun of Trials. Debes romper el latent de la Gun of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest.",
    ["Speak with Clarion Star in Port Bastok, near Home Point #1 at (K-7); he gives you the Blue institute card."] = "Habla con Clarion Star en Port Bastok, cerca del Home Point #1 en (K-7); te da la Blue institute card.",
    ["Speak with Corann in Port Bastok (K-6), inside the northmost house, to start the quest."] = "Habla con Corann en Port Bastok (K-6), dentro de la casa más al norte, para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Curilla again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Curilla.",
    ["Speak with Curilla in Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) and agree to help her; you receive the key item Curilla's bottle."] = "Habla con Curilla en Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) y acepta ayudarla; recibes el key item Curilla's bottle.",
    ["Speak with Curilla in Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) to receive the Sapara of Trials. You need to break the latent on the Sapara of Trials before completing the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Curilla en Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) para recibir el Sapara of Trials. Debes romper el latent del Sapara of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest.",
    ["Speak with Curilla in Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) to start the quest; you must be a Red Mage of level 50 or higher and able to enter Chateau d'Oraguille."] = "Habla con Curilla en Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) para empezar la quest; debes ser Red Mage de nivel 50 o superior y poder entrar en Chateau d'Oraguille.",
    ["Speak with Dabhuh in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-11), near The Pit, to begin the quest. He wants you to bring him a Merrow Scale. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Dabhuh en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-11), cerca de The Pit, para empezar la quest. Quiere que le traigas una Merrow Scale. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Speak with Daigraffeaux (I-11) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Daigraffeaux (I-11) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Dancing Wolf in Rabao."] = "Habla con Dancing Wolf en Rabao.",
    ["Speak with Darcia (H-7) to receive the Geomagnetron and the list of possible attunement sites."] = "Habla con Darcia (H-7) para recibir el Geomagnetron y la lista de posibles puntos de sintonización.",
    ["Speak with Darcia in Lower Jeuno."] = "Habla con Darcia en Lower Jeuno.",
    ["Speak with Datta in Rabao (F-7) to begin the quest. You need to be level 40 or lower and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. You have been asked to join a tour planned by Datta: travel to the cliff inside the entrance to Kuftal Tunnel with a party of two or more people of level forty or lower, and meet Datta's partner, Hawk Nose."] = "Habla con Datta en Rabao (F-7) para empezar la quest. Debes ser nivel 40 o inferior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart. Te han pedido que participes en una excursión organizada por Datta: viaja al acantilado de la entrada de Kuftal Tunnel con un grupo de dos o más personas de nivel cuarenta o inferior, y reúnete con Hawk Nose, el socio de Datta.",
    ["Speak with Dauperiat in Northern San d'Oria (I-10) to obtain a Suspicious envelope, and deliver it to Halver in Chateau d'Oraguille."] = "Habla con Dauperiat en Northern San d'Oria (I-10) para obtener un Suspicious envelope y entrégalo a Halver en Chateau d'Oraguille.",
    ["Speak with Davyad (K-6)."] = "Habla con Davyad (K-6).",
    ["Speak with Degenhard in Bastok Markets (I-10) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Degenhard en Bastok Markets (I-10) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Dehn Harzhapan in Port Windurst (G-6) to start the quest. Only one Escort for Hire quest can be active at a time, and only one can be completed each Conquest Tally."] = "Habla con Dehn Harzhapan en Port Windurst (G-6) para empezar la quest. Solo puede haber una quest Escort for Hire activa a la vez, y solo se puede completar una por Conquest Tally.",
    ["Speak with Deidogg in Bastok Mines (H-6) twice; he is at the bottom of the ramp that leads to the guild. After this point the quest can be completed on any job."] = "Habla dos veces con Deidogg en Bastok Mines (H-6); está al pie de la rampa que lleva al gremio. A partir de este punto la quest se puede completar con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Deidogg in Bastok Mines (H-6)."] = "Habla con Deidogg en Bastok Mines (H-6).",
    ["Speak with Deraquien again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Deraquien.",
    ["Speak with Deraquien in Southern San d'Oria (G-8) for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Deraquien en Southern San d'Oria (G-8) para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Despachiaire (K-10)."] = "Habla con Despachiaire (K-10).",
    ["Speak with Despachiaire in Tavnazian Safehold (K-10) to obtain the Letter from Shikaree X. The letter has arrived in the safehold, and she wants to gauge your battle prowess in Boneyard Gully."] = "Habla con Despachiaire en Tavnazian Safehold (K-10) para obtener la Letter from Shikaree X. La carta ha llegado al safehold, y ella quiere medir tu capacidad de combate en Boneyard Gully.",
    ["Speak with Detzo in Bastok Mines (I-6) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Detzo en Bastok Mines (I-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Detzo in Bastok Mines (I-6), in the alleyway around the corner from Deidogg."] = "Habla con Detzo en Bastok Mines (I-6), en el callejón a la vuelta de la esquina de Deidogg.",
    ["Speak with Devean in Selbina (I-8). He asks you to bet on how long it takes you to get a pair of Power Sandals from Davoi. Find the pair of Power Sandals hidden in a jar somewhere in Davoi and bring them back before time runs out for a cash prize."] = "Habla con Devean en Selbina (I-8). Te pide que apuestes cuánto tardas en conseguir un par de Power Sandals de Davoi. Encuentra el par de Power Sandals escondido en una jarra en algún lugar de Davoi y tráelo antes de que se acabe el tiempo para un premio en metálico.",
    ["Speak with Dhea Prandoleh (H-10) in Windurst Waters (S)."] = "Habla con Dhea Prandoleh (H-10) en Windurst Waters (S).",
    ["Speak with Diordinne at (I-6) in Garlaige Citadel (S) Map 1 and receive the Number Eight Shelter Key."] = "Habla con Diordinne en (I-6) en el Map 1 de Garlaige Citadel (S) y recibe la Number Eight Shelter Key.",
    ["Speak with Dkhaaya in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-9) for a cutscene and to obtain Dkhaaya's research journal."] = "Habla con Dkhaaya en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-9) para una escena y para obtener el Dkhaaya's research journal.",
    ["Speak with Drake Fang (H-6)."] = "Habla con Drake Fang (H-6).",
    ["Speak with Drangord (D-7) near the entrance to Zeruhn Mines."] = "Habla con Drangord (D-7) cerca de la entrada de Zeruhn Mines.",
    ["Speak with Edal-Tahdal in Norg (H-9) to obtain the quest. You need Norg fame level 4 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Once you have the key item Tuning fork of water, you can safely undertake the quest. Each party member must have their own Tuning fork of water."] = "Habla con Edal-Tahdal en Norg (H-9) para obtener la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Norg y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Cuando tengas el key item Tuning fork of water, ya puedes emprender la quest con seguridad. Cada miembro del grupo debe tener su propio Tuning fork of water.",
    ["Speak with Eddy in Port San d'Oria (H-6) and accept the quest."] = "Habla con Eddy en Port San d'Oria (H-6) y acepta la quest.",
    ["Speak with Edigey in Rabao (F-9) to begin the quest. You need Rabao fame level 4 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. He wants sand scorpion poison so he can make an antidote, an essential item for the desert caravans."] = "Habla con Edigey en Rabao (F-9) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Rabao y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Quiere veneno de escorpión de arena para hacer un antídoto, un objeto esencial para las caravanas del desierto.",
    ["Speak with Ekhu Pesshyadha (H-6) for a cutscene with Yadhiwa. You can pick any option to proceed; you may choose to gamble with her, but she always wins."] = "Habla con Ekhu Pesshyadha (H-6) para una escena con Yadhiwa. Puedes elegir cualquier opción para avanzar; puedes apostar con ella, pero siempre gana.",
    ["Speak with Ekhu Pesshyadha in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (H-6)."] = "Habla con Ekhu Pesshyadha en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (H-6).",
    ["Speak with Ekhu Pesshyadha to receive the Vial of luminous water."] = "Habla con Ekhu Pesshyadha para recibir el Vial of luminous water.",
    ["Speak with Elijah after the final events to begin the remaining Prime Weapon progression."] = "Habla con Elijah tras los eventos finales para comenzar la progresión restante de la Prime Weapon.",
    ["Speak with Elki in Bastok Mines (H-5) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Elki en Bastok Mines (H-5) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Elki in the Bat's Lair Inn in Bastok Mines (H-5) to trigger a cutscene and start the quest. When the cutscene ends you have a Bouquet for the pioneers."] = "Habla con Elki en el Bat's Lair Inn de Bastok Mines (H-5) para activar una escena y empezar la quest. Cuando termina la escena tienes un Bouquet para los pioneros.",
    ["Speak with Elmric (K-7) at Frontier Station."] = "Habla con Elmric (K-7) en la Frontier Station.",
    ["Speak with Elysia on the first floor of Tavnazian Safehold (G-10) to begin the quest. She dropped her hairpin while doing her shopping."] = "Habla con Elysia en el primer piso de Tavnazian Safehold (G-10) para empezar la quest. Perdió su horquilla mientras hacía la compra.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category defensive operations and sign up for Aegis Scream I."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de operaciones defensivas y apúntate a Aegis Scream I.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category defensive operations and sign up for Aegis Scream II."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de operaciones defensivas y apúntate a Aegis Scream II.",
