    ["Speak with Engelhart (K-10) in Bastok Markets (S)."] = "Habla con Engelhart (K-10) en Bastok Markets (S).",
    ["Speak with Eperdur again for your reward. You must zone before you can be offered the follow-up quest, Sorcery of the North."] = "Habla de nuevo con Eperdur para recibir tu recompensa. Debes cambiar de zona antes de que te ofrezcan la quest siguiente, Sorcery of the North.",
    ["Speak with Eperdur at (M-7) in Northern San d'Oria. He gives you the Seal of banishing, which you must place on a ??? target. You must be level 10 or higher."] = "Habla con Eperdur en (M-7) de Northern San d'Oria. Te da el Seal of banishing, que debes colocar en un objetivo ???. Debes ser nivel 10 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Eperdur in Northern San d'Oria (M-7), on the second level of the Cathedral."] = "Habla con Eperdur en Northern San d'Oria (M-7), en el segundo nivel de la Cathedral.",
    ["Speak with Epinolle in Tavnazian Safehold (F-8) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Epinolle en Tavnazian Safehold (F-8) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Equette (I-9, 2nd floor)."] = "Habla con Equette (I-9, 2.º piso).",
    ["Speak with Erlene (J-8) and Ulbrecht (J-8) in The Eldieme Necropolis (S)."] = "Habla con Erlene (J-8) y Ulbrecht (J-8) en The Eldieme Necropolis (S).",
    ["Speak with Erlene (J-8) in The Eldieme Necropolis (S) while on a level 30+ job."] = "Habla con Erlene (J-8) en The Eldieme Necropolis (S) con un trabajo de nivel 30+.",
    ["Speak with Erlene (J-8) in The Eldieme Necropolis (S)."] = "Habla con Erlene (J-8) en The Eldieme Necropolis (S).",
    ["Speak with Erminold (J-10) to obtain the Weather vane wings."] = "Habla con Erminold (J-10) para obtener las Weather vane wings.",
    ["Speak with Famad at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Apkallu Breeding. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Famad en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Apkallu Breeding. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Famad at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Better Than One. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Famad en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Better Than One. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Famad at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Egg Conservation. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Famad en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Egg Conservation. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Famad at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Evade and Escape. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Famad en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Evade and Escape. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Famad at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Excavation Duty. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Famad en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Excavation Duty. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Famad at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Lebros Supplies. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Famad en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Lebros Supplies. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Famad at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Operation: Black Pearl. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Famad en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Operation: Black Pearl. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Famad at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Siegemaster Assassination. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Famad en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Siegemaster Assassination. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Famad at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Troll Fugitives. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Famad en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Troll Fugitives. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Famad at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Wamoura Farm Raid. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Famad en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Wamoura Farm Raid. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Fari-Wari at the Shararat Teahouse in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) for a cutscene that begins the quest. General Rughadjeen must be present in Al Zahbi, or you will not get the cutscenes in Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Habla con Fari-Wari en la Shararat Teahouse de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) para una escena que empieza la quest. General Rughadjeen debe estar presente en Al Zahbi, o no verás las escenas en Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Speak with Fari-Wari in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) for a cutscene that begins the quest. You need to have completed When the Bow Breaks and Fist of the People, or complete them during this quest."] = "Habla con Fari-Wari en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) para una escena que empieza la quest. Debes haber completado When the Bow Breaks y Fist of the People, o completarlas durante esta quest.",
    ["Speak with Fari-Wari in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12)."] = "Habla con Fari-Wari en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12).",
    ["Speak with Fari-Wari to complete the quest and receive an Imperial Gold Piece."] = "Habla con Fari-Wari para completar la quest y recibir una Imperial Gold Piece.",
    ["Speak with Fari-Wari."] = "Habla con Fari-Wari.",
    ["Speak with Faurbellant, who gives you the Scripture of Water."] = "Habla con Faurbellant, que te da el Scripture of Water.",
    ["Speak with Femitte in Southern San d'Oria (I-8), who needs a goldsmithing order fulfilled and asks for an Elvaan specifically. She gives you a Goldsmithing order."] = "Habla con Femitte en Southern San d'Oria (I-8), que necesita un pedido de orfebrería y pide específicamente a un Elvaan. Te da un Goldsmithing order.",
    ["Speak with Ferchinne in Tavnazian Safehold (G-9) to begin the quest. You need to be on or past Promathia Mission 4-2 and have the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Ferchinne en Tavnazian Safehold (G-9) para empezar la quest. Debes estar en la Promathia Mission 4-2 o más allá y tener el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Ferghus in the Craftsmen's Eatery in Metalworks (G-9), south of Cid's workshop, for a cutscene. Metalworks Home Point #1 is the closest. You need Bastok fame level 5 and the Wings of the Goddess pack."] = "Habla con Ferghus en el Craftsmen's Eatery de Metalworks (G-9), al sur del taller de Cid, para una escena. El Home Point #1 de Metalworks es el más cercano. Necesitas el nivel 5 de fama de Bastok y el pack Wings of the Goddess.",
    ["Speak with Fhe Maksojha again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Fhe Maksojha.",
    ["Speak with Fhe Maksojha in Nashmau (H-6). Wadayra wants you to look for her son Ahgdeen, who ran away from home and was last sighted in the northern part of Caedarva Mire."] = "Habla con Fhe Maksojha en Nashmau (H-6). Wadayra quiere que busques a su hijo Ahgdeen, que se escapó de casa y fue visto por última vez en la parte norte de Caedarva Mire.",
    ["Speak with Fochacha at (I-9)."] = "Habla con Fochacha en (I-9).",
    ["Speak with Fochacha in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-9), in Serpentking Square, for a cutscene that starts the quest. Her cooking supplies have been stolen and her son has gone to retrieve them. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Fochacha en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-9), en Serpentking Square, para una escena que empieza la quest. Le han robado los suministros de cocina y su hijo ha ido a recuperarlos. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Speak with Fondactiont in Garlaige Citadel (S) at (I-6)."] = "Habla con Fondactiont en Garlaige Citadel (S) en (I-6).",
    ["Speak with Fontoumant in Port San d'Oria (H-9). He asks you to deliver parcels to various NPCs in Port San d'Oria. You can only hold one parcel at a time, so deliver it and then return to him for another."] = "Habla con Fontoumant en Port San d'Oria (H-9). Te pide que entregues paquetes a varios NPCs de Port San d'Oria. Solo puedes llevar un paquete a la vez, así que entrégalo y vuelve con él para otro.",
    ["Speak with Fuepepe in Windurst Waters North (L-6)."] = "Habla con Fuepepe en Windurst Waters North (L-6).",
    ["Speak with Fuepepe in the Aurastery in Windurst Waters North (L-6); the students' exam answer sheets have been stolen."] = "Habla con Fuepepe en el Aurastery de Windurst Waters North (L-6); han robado las hojas de respuestas del examen de los estudiantes.",
    ["Speak with Furakku-Norakku behind the counter in the same room. He says that Hae Jakkya at the Windurst Woods Auction House has an overdue romance novel, \"A Song of Love\", and gives you an Overdue book notification."] = "Habla con Furakku-Norakku detrás del mostrador de la misma sala. Dice que Hae Jakkya, de la Auction House de Windurst Woods, tiene una novela romántica atrasada, \"A Song of Love\", y te da una Overdue book notification.",
    ["Speak with Furakku-Norakku with the key item to complete the quest."] = "Habla con Furakku-Norakku con el key item para completar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Fyi Chalmwoh in the Goldsmithing shop in Mhaura (G-8) to begin the quest, then speak to her again. You need Windurst fame level 4. She wants to build a mannequin that rivals those of times past, and it is your job to gather information on how to make one."] = "Habla con Fyi Chalmwoh en la Goldsmithing shop de Mhaura (G-8) para empezar la quest y luego habla otra vez con ella. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Windurst. Quiere construir un mannequin que rivalice con los de tiempos pasados, y te toca reunir información sobre cómo hacerlo.",
    ["Speak with Gantineux on the second floor of the Rarab Tail Hostelry in Windurst Waters (E-10); Home Point #4 is the closest. He gives you the key item Spirit incense and asks you to go to The Eldieme Necropolis."] = "Habla con Gantineux en el segundo piso del Rarab Tail Hostelry de Windurst Waters (E-10); el Home Point #4 es el más cercano. Te da el key item Spirit incense y te pide ir a The Eldieme Necropolis.",
    ["Speak with Gate Guard."] = "Habla con el Gate Guard.",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard: Argus (Port Bastok L-7), Cleades (Bastok Markets D-11), Malduc (Metalworks J-8) or Rashid (Bastok Mines H-10)."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard: Argus (Port Bastok L-7), Cleades (Bastok Markets D-11), Malduc (Metalworks J-8) o Rashid (Bastok Mines H-10).",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard in Windurst: Mokyokyo (Windurst Waters F-5), Janshura-Rashura (Port Windurst B-5), Rakoh Buuma (Windurst Woods K-10) or Zokima-Rokima (Windurst Walls H-7)."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard de Windurst: Mokyokyo (Windurst Waters F-5), Janshura-Rashura (Port Windurst B-5), Rakoh Buuma (Windurst Woods K-10) o Zokima-Rokima (Windurst Walls H-7).",
    ["Speak with Gatih Mijurabi in Kazham (I-8) to begin the quest to remove the scent. The Mithra of Kazham are having a hard time holding in their lunches, and the only way to get clean is a long dip in a hot spring deep beneath the sea."] = "Habla con Gatih Mijurabi en Kazham (I-8) para empezar la quest de quitarte el olor. A los Mithra de Kazham les cuesta aguantar el almuerzo, y la única forma de quedar limpio es un largo baño en una fuente termal en lo profundo del mar.",
    ["Speak with Gentle Tiger (H-6) and answer the three questions correctly."] = "Habla con Gentle Tiger (H-6) y responde correctamente las tres preguntas.",
    ["Speak with Gentle Tiger (H-6) at the Metalworks entrance in Bastok Markets (S)."] = "Habla con Gentle Tiger (H-6) en la entrada de Metalworks, en Bastok Markets (S).",
    ["Speak with Gentle Tiger (H-6) in Bastok Markets (S) and receive the Sack of Victuals key item."] = "Habla con Gentle Tiger (H-6) en Bastok Markets (S) y recibe el key item Sack of Victuals.",
    ["Speak with Gentle Tiger (H-6) in Bastok Markets (S) to complete the quest and receive the Excelsis Ring."] = "Habla con Gentle Tiger (H-6) en Bastok Markets (S) para completar la quest y recibir el Excelsis Ring.",
    ["Speak with Gentle Tiger (H-6) in Bastok Markets (S)."] = "Habla con Gentle Tiger (H-6) en Bastok Markets (S).",
    ["Speak with Gentle Tiger (H-6)."] = "Habla con Gentle Tiger (H-6).",
    ["Speak with Gerbaum in Bastok Mines (F-8); he asks you to exterminate the pests that roam inside Zeruhn Mines."] = "Habla con Gerbaum en Bastok Mines (F-8); te pide exterminar las plagas que merodean por Zeruhn Mines.",
    ["Speak with Ghatsad in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-7), inside the Automaton Workshop."] = "Habla con Ghatsad en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-7), dentro del Automaton Workshop.",
