    ["Speak with Gilgamesh (L-8)."] = "Habla con Gilgamesh (L-8).",
    ["Speak with Gioh Ajihri in Windurst Woods (K-5) to start the quest; she asks for a Twinstone Earring."] = "Habla con Gioh Ajihri en Windurst Woods (K-5) para empezar la quest; pide un Twinstone Earring.",
    ["Speak with Glenne in Southern San d'Oria (F-8) to receive an Ointment."] = "Habla con Glenne en Southern San d'Oria (F-8) para recibir un Ointment.",
    ["Speak with Goblin Geologist to mark nine locations on your map."] = "Habla con el Goblin Geologist para marcar nueve ubicaciones en tu mapa.",
    ["Speak with Goggehn at the Bastokan Embassy."] = "Habla con Goggehn en la Bastokan Embassy.",
    ["Speak with Goggehn."] = "Habla con Goggehn.",
    ["Speak with Goraow in Bastok Mines (I-6), in the upper stairway of Ore Street, to begin the quest. It is close to Bastok Mines Home Point #3."] = "Habla con Goraow en Bastok Mines (I-6), en la escalera alta de Ore Street, para empezar la quest. Está cerca del Home Point #3 de Bastok Mines.",
    ["Speak with Grin in Port Bastok (G-7) and accept the quest."] = "Habla con Grin en Port Bastok (G-7) y acepta la quest.",
    ["Speak with Gudav in Port Bastok (H-5) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Gudav en Port Bastok (H-5) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Gulemont in Port San d'Oria (G-7) to begin the quest. This quest follows A Taste For Meat."] = "Habla con Gulemont en Port San d'Oria (G-7) para empezar la quest. Esta quest sigue a A Taste For Meat.",
    ["Speak with Gulmama in Northern San d'Oria (E-7) to get the quest. If you are sure you have the required fame but she does not offer it, keep speaking with her until her text changes. Once you receive the key item Tuning fork of ice you can safely undertake the quest."] = "Habla con Gulmama en Northern San d'Oria (E-7) para obtener la quest. Si estás seguro de tener la fama necesaria pero no te la ofrece, sigue hablando con ella hasta que cambie su texto. Cuando recibas el key item Tuning fork of ice puedes emprender la quest con seguridad.",
    ["Speak with Gulmama in Northern San d'Oria (E-7) to receive an Ice Pendulum."] = "Habla con Gulmama en Northern San d'Oria (E-7) para recibir un Ice Pendulum.",
    ["Speak with Gumbah (J-7) and complete the letter event."] = "Habla con Gumbah (J-7) y completa el evento de la carta.",
    ["Speak with Gumbah (J-7) in Bastok Mines."] = "Habla con Gumbah (J-7) en Bastok Mines.",
    ["Speak with Gumbah in Bastok Mines (J-7) to receive the key item Letter from Zeid. You need Bastok fame level 3."] = "Habla con Gumbah en Bastok Mines (J-7) para recibir el key item Letter from Zeid. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Gumbah in Bastok Mines (J-7) to receive the key item Weapon training guide and the Sword of Trials. You need to break the latent on the Sword of Trials before completing the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Gumbah en Bastok Mines (J-7) para recibir el key item Weapon training guide y la Sword of Trials. Debes romper el latent de la Sword of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest.",
    ["Speak with Gwill in Bastok Markets (E-11) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Gwill en Bastok Markets (E-11) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Hadahda in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-10), above the Mog House. He wants paper pieces with letters written on them: one each of M, U and T, and two each of A and D."] = "Habla con Hadahda en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-10), encima del Mog House. Quiere trozos de papel con letras escritas: uno de cada M, U y T, y dos de cada A y D.",
    ["Speak with Hakkuru-Rinkuru in the Orastery in Port Windurst (E-7) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Hakkuru-Rinkuru en el Orastery de Port Windurst (E-7) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Hakkuru-Rinkuru in the Orastery in Port Windurst (E-7); he needs glue to patch Minister Ajido-Marujido's broken wand."] = "Habla con Hakkuru-Rinkuru en el Orastery de Port Windurst (E-7); necesita pegamento para arreglar la varita rota del Minister Ajido-Marujido.",
    ["Speak with Hakkuru-Rinkuru in the Orastery."] = "Habla con Hakkuru-Rinkuru en el Orastery.",
    ["Speak with Hakkuru-Rinkuru."] = "Habla con Hakkuru-Rinkuru.",
    ["Speak with Halver (I-9) again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Halver (I-9).",
