    ["Speak with Hieronymus in Bastok Markets (S) (E-8), select the category supply transport and sign up for Vanguard-X IV."] = "Habla con Hieronymus en Bastok Markets (S) (E-8), elige la categoría de transporte de suministros y apúntate a Vanguard-X IV.",
    ["Speak with High Bear in Metalworks (I-8) to begin the quest. You need Bastok fame level 4. He needs a sample of polluted dirt from Beadeaux."] = "Habla con High Bear en Metalworks (I-8) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Bastok. Necesita una muestra de tierra contaminada de Beadeaux.",
    ["Speak with Hilda (E-6)."] = "Habla con Hilda (E-6).",
    ["Speak with Hilda in Port Bastok (E-6) to begin the quest. You need Bastok fame level 5."] = "Habla con Hilda en Port Bastok (E-6) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 5 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Hildolf in Metalworks (F-8) to learn how to create your own Fewell."] = "Habla con Hildolf en Metalworks (F-8) para aprender a crear tu propio Fewell.",
    ["Speak with Hiwon-Biwon by Shantotto's house in Windurst Walls (K-8) to get the key item Windurst Walls scoop."] = "Habla con Hiwon-Biwon junto a la casa de Shantotto en Windurst Walls (K-8) para obtener el key item Windurst Walls scoop.",
    ["Speak with Honoi-Gomoi (E-7) at (E-7) to obtain the Cracked Mimeo Mirror, then return to Yoran-Oran (E-5) at (E-5)."] = "Habla con Honoi-Gomoi (E-7) en (E-7) para obtener el Cracked Mimeo Mirror y vuelve con Yoran-Oran (E-5) en (E-5).",
    ["Speak with Honoi-Gomoi in Windurst Waters South (E-7) to start the quest. He is upstairs in his house, reached by a back stairway."] = "Habla con Honoi-Gomoi en Windurst Waters South (E-7) para empezar la quest. Está arriba en su casa, a la que se llega por una escalera trasera.",
    ["Speak with Horatius inside the Trader's Home at (I-9) in Bastok Markets, who sends you to Dangruf Wadi. You need Bastok fame level 2."] = "Habla con Horatius dentro del Trader's Home en (I-9) de Bastok Markets, que te envía a Dangruf Wadi. Necesitas el nivel 2 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Hungry Wolf inside the Craftmen's Eatery in Metalworks (G-9) to start the quest; Home Point #1 is close. He wants a Galkan Sausage."] = "Habla con Hungry Wolf dentro del Craftmen's Eatery en Metalworks (G-9) para empezar la quest; el Home Point #1 está cerca. Quiere un Galkan Sausage.",
    ["Speak with Hunting Bear to complete the quest and receive 500 gil."] = "Habla con Hunting Bear para completar la quest y recibir 500 gil.",
    ["Speak with Ibwam in Windurst Woods (G-11) to receive a Green Sentinel badge and start the quest."] = "Habla con Ibwam en Windurst Woods (G-11) para recibir una Green Sentinel badge y empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Illu Bohjaa in Windurst Woods (I-6) to start the quest. When asked, you must answer \"Yup!\" for the quest to begin the first time."] = "Habla con Illu Bohjaa en Windurst Woods (I-6) para empezar la quest. Cuando te pregunten, debes responder \"Yup!\" para que la quest empiece la primera vez.",
    ["Speak with Imasuke in Port Jeuno (E-6) to begin the quest. You need Jeuno fame level 2."] = "Habla con Imasuke en Port Jeuno (E-6) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 2 de fama de Jeuno.",
    ["Speak with Imasuke in Port Jeuno (E-6). You must have your current job set to Bard to receive the cutscene; after speaking with him you may change to any job."] = "Habla con Imasuke en Port Jeuno (E-6). Debes tener tu trabajo actual en Bard para recibir la escena; tras hablar con él puedes cambiar a cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Incantrix and continue to Aspirant's Grounds (K-7)."] = "Habla con Incantrix y continúa hacia Aspirant's Grounds (K-7).",
    ["Speak with Irmilant in Rabao (G-7). He asks you to bring the two base materials required to craft a legendary fishing rod, which seem to have found their way into the bellies of sea creatures that still elude the finest fishermen."] = "Habla con Irmilant en Rabao (G-7). Te pide que le traigas los dos materiales base necesarios para fabricar una caña de pescar legendaria, que parecen haber acabado en el vientre de criaturas marinas que aún eluden a los mejores pescadores.",
    ["Speak with Iron Eater (J-8) and enter Palborough Mines."] = "Habla con Iron Eater (J-8) y entra en Palborough Mines.",
    ["Speak with Iron Eater (J-8)."] = "Habla con Iron Eater (J-8).",
    ["Speak with Iron Eater in Metalworks (J-8) to receive the Axe of Trials. You need to break the latent on the Axe of Trials before completing the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Iron Eater en Metalworks (J-8) para recibir el Axe of Trials. Debes romper el latent del Axe of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest.",
    ["Speak with Iruki-Waraki (K-9, top floor) in Aht Urhgan Whitegate to complete the quest and receive your Animator."] = "Habla con Iruki-Waraki (K-9, piso superior) en Aht Urhgan Whitegate para completar la quest y recibir tu Animator.",
    ["Speak with Iruki-Waraki in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-9). You need to be a Puppetmaster of level 40 or higher, and this quest follows No Strings Attached. He wants to recover his stolen automaton, which you can tell is his because of its very unique personality."] = "Habla con Iruki-Waraki en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-9). Debes ser Puppetmaster de nivel 40 o superior, y esta quest sigue a No Strings Attached. Quiere recuperar su autómata robado, que sabes que es suyo por su personalidad muy peculiar.",
    ["Speak with Iruki-Waraki in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-9). You need to be a Puppetmaster of level 50 or higher and have the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack; this quest follows Operation Teatime. In a cutscene he wonders why Shamarhaan picked him to be a Puppetmaster and asks you to inquire with his mentor about the situation."] = "Habla con Iruki-Waraki en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-9). Debes ser Puppetmaster de nivel 50 o superior y tener el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan; esta quest sigue a Operation Teatime. En una escena se pregunta por qué Shamarhaan lo eligió como Puppetmaster y te pide que consultes a su mentor sobre la situación.",
    ["Speak with Isacio in Selbina (G-10). You need to be level 18 or higher. You must prove yourself worthy before you can learn his fighting techniques."] = "Habla con Isacio en Selbina (G-10). Debes ser nivel 18 o superior. Debes demostrar que eres digno antes de aprender sus técnicas de combate.",
    ["Speak with Isdebaaq at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Azure Ailments. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Isdebaaq en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Azure Ailments. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Isdebaaq at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Blitzkrieg. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Isdebaaq en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Blitzkrieg. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Isdebaaq at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Breaking Morale. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Isdebaaq en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Breaking Morale. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Isdebaaq at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Imperial Agent Rescue. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Isdebaaq en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Imperial Agent Rescue. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Isdebaaq at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Imperial Treasure Retrieval. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Isdebaaq en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Imperial Treasure Retrieval. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Isdebaaq at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Marids in the Mist. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Isdebaaq en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Marids in the Mist. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Isdebaaq at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Preemptive Strike. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Isdebaaq en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Preemptive Strike. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Isdebaaq at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Sagelord Elimination. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Isdebaaq en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Sagelord Elimination. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Isdebaaq at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select The Double Agent. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Isdebaaq en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige The Double Agent. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Isdebaaq at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select The Susanoo Shuffle. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Isdebaaq en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige The Susanoo Shuffle. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Izabele in Metalworks (G-8) to begin the quest. You must form a party with two or more people, all of level 15 or below."] = "Habla con Izabele en Metalworks (G-8) para empezar la quest. Debes formar un grupo con dos o más personas, todas de nivel 15 o inferior.",
    ["Speak with Jakoh Wahcondalo (J-9) at (J-9) to receive the Sacrificial Chamber key."] = "Habla con Jakoh Wahcondalo (J-9) en (J-9) para recibir la Sacrificial Chamber key.",
    ["Speak with Jakoh Wahcondalo in Kazham (J-9)."] = "Habla con Jakoh Wahcondalo en Kazham (J-9).",
    ["Speak with Jaucribaix again to receive your reward, the Myochin Sune-Ate."] = "Habla de nuevo con Jaucribaix para recibir tu recompensa, el Myochin Sune-Ate.",
    ["Speak with Jaucribaix again; he requests a Gold Thread. Trade a Gold Thread to Jaucribaix."] = "Habla de nuevo con Jaucribaix; te pide un Gold Thread. Entrégale un Gold Thread.",
    ["Speak with Jaucribaix in Norg (K-8), near the Captain's Chamber, to begin the quest. You need to be level 30 or higher on any job and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. A lump of bomb steel and a sacred branch are required to make a new katana, and Jaucribaix's pupils can tell you where to get them."] = "Habla con Jaucribaix en Norg (K-8), cerca de la Captain's Chamber, para empezar la quest. Debes ser nivel 30 o superior con cualquier trabajo y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart. Se necesitan un lingote de bomb steel y una sacred branch para hacer una katana nueva, y los discípulos de Jaucribaix pueden decirte dónde conseguirlos.",
    ["Speak with Jaucribaix in Norg (K-8). He grants you the key item Weapons Training Guide as well as the Tachi of Trials. Wield the katana to find your true potential; when the blade has lost its power, you will know you have been accepted."] = "Habla con Jaucribaix en Norg (K-8). Te concede el key item Weapons Training Guide y la Tachi of Trials. Empuña la katana para encontrar tu verdadero potencial; cuando la hoja haya perdido su poder, sabrás que te han aceptado.",
    ["Speak with Jaucribaix in Norg to receive a Banishing Charm."] = "Habla con Jaucribaix en Norg para recibir un Banishing Charm.",
    ["Speak with Joachim (H-8) and take a Traverser Stone."] = "Habla con Joachim (H-8) y toma una Traverser Stone.",
    ["Speak with Joachim (H-8)."] = "Habla con Joachim (H-8).",
    ["Speak with Juroro in Port Bastok (I-8), near Home Point #1. Ildy-Goldy gives you an Earth Pendulum."] = "Habla con Juroro en Port Bastok (I-8), cerca del Home Point #1. Ildy-Goldy te da un Earth Pendulum.",
    ["Speak with Juroro in Port Bastok (I-8); Home Point #1 is the closest. You need Bastok fame level 6. Once you have received the key item Tuning fork of earth, you can safely undertake the quest."] = "Habla con Juroro en Port Bastok (I-8); el Home Point #1 es el más cercano. Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Bastok. Cuando recibas el key item Tuning fork of earth, puedes emprender la quest con seguridad.",
    ["Speak with Justinius (J-6) at (J-6) for additional information about Ulmia."] = "Habla con Justinius (J-6) en (J-6) para obtener más información sobre Ulmia.",
    ["Speak with Justinius (J-6) for additional information."] = "Habla con Justinius (J-6) para obtener más información.",
    ["Speak with Justinius (J-6) in Tavnazian Safehold."] = "Habla con Justinius (J-6) en Tavnazian Safehold.",
    ["Speak with Justinius on the second floor of Tavnazian Safehold (J-6) to activate the quest and receive a Monarch Linn Patrol Permit. You need Other fame level 1, and the Chains of Promathia mission The Savage must be complete."] = "Habla con Justinius en el segundo piso de Tavnazian Safehold (J-6) para activar la quest y recibir un Monarch Linn Patrol Permit. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Other, y la misión de Chains of Promathia The Savage debe estar completa.",
    ["Speak with Kaa Toru the Just."] = "Habla con Kaa Toru the Just.",
    ["Speak with Kaede in Port Bastok (J-5) to start the quest. You must have a job at level 30 or higher and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Ensetsu wants his item back from the Tenshodo, who will only trade it for a strangely shaped coral from Korroloka Tunnel."] = "Habla con Kaede en Port Bastok (J-5) para empezar la quest. Debes tener un trabajo de nivel 30 o superior y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Ensetsu quiere recuperar su objeto del Tenshodo, que solo lo cambiará por un coral de forma extraña de Korroloka Tunnel.",
    ["Speak with Kagetora inside Warehouse #2 at (F-6) in Port Bastok (near Port Bastok Home Point #3)."] = "Habla con Kagetora dentro del Warehouse #2 en (F-6) de Port Bastok (cerca del Port Bastok Home Point #3).",
    ["Speak with Kakkaroon in Nashmau (H-8). He is afraid of children, and young Rapipi adores the Qiqirn and wants to make friends with the beastmen in Nashmau."] = "Habla con Kakkaroon en Nashmau (H-8). Tiene miedo a los niños, y el joven Rapipi adora a los Qiqirn y quiere hacerse amigo de los beastmen de Nashmau.",
    ["Speak with Kakkaroon to complete the quest and receive 2 Imperial Gold Pieces, 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces and 3 Imperial Silver Pieces."] = "Habla con Kakkaroon para completar la quest y recibir 2 Imperial Gold Pieces, 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces y 3 Imperial Silver Pieces.",
    ["Speak with Karst."] = "Habla con Karst.",
    ["Speak with Keal in Norg (H-8) to begin the quest. He walks around by the Survival Guide. You need to be level 5 or higher, Outlands fame level 3 and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. He wants you to bring back a sealed iron box from the Sahagin-infested Norg vault."] = "Habla con Keal en Norg (H-8) para empezar la quest. Anda por la zona de la Survival Guide. Debes ser nivel 5 o superior, tener el nivel 3 de fama de Outlands y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Quiere que le traigas una sealed iron box de la bóveda de Norg (Sahagin-infested).",
    ["Speak with Kenapa-Keppa in Windurst Waters South (J-9) after 7:00 Vana'diel time; you need to speak with him four times to officially begin the quest."] = "Habla con Kenapa-Keppa en Windurst Waters South (J-9) después de las 7:00 hora de Vana'diel; tienes que hablar con él cuatro veces para empezar oficialmente la quest.",
    ["Speak with Kerutoto in Windurst Waters South (J-8), near Home Point #3, for a cutscene that starts the quest and gives you the key item Vial of dream incense."] = "Habla con Kerutoto en Windurst Waters South (J-8), cerca del Home Point #3, para una escena que inicia la quest y te da el key item Vial of dream incense.",
    ["Speak with Kerutoto in the northern Rhinostery building."] = "Habla con Kerutoto en el edificio norte del Rhinostery.",
    ["Speak with Keshab-Menjab at the lower level of Mhaura (H-9) to begin the quest. You need Other fame level 1. You have been asked to help bring in cleanly snapped rods for recycling; the recycled rods are supposedly sold somewhere around Bibiki Bay."] = "Habla con Keshab-Menjab en el nivel inferior de Mhaura (H-9) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Other. Te han pedido ayuda para reunir cañas partidas limpiamente para reciclar; las cañas recicladas supuestamente se venden por la zona de Bibiki Bay.",
    ["Speak with Khoto Rokkorah in Windurst Waters North (H-10) for a cutscene that starts the quest."] = "Habla con Khoto Rokkorah en Windurst Waters North (H-10) para una escena que inicia la quest.",
    ["Speak with Koblakiq in Oldton Movalpolos (H-11) to begin the quest. Make sure you have zoned after completing For the Birds. To save time, you can bring a Demon Pen with you when you travel to start this quest."] = "Habla con Koblakiq en Oldton Movalpolos (H-11) para empezar la quest. Asegúrate de haber cambiado de zona tras completar For the Birds. Para ahorrar tiempo, puedes llevar una Demon Pen cuando viajes para empezar esta quest.",
    ["Speak with Koblakiq in Oldton Movalpolos (H-11) to begin the quest. This quest requires the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Koblakiq en Oldton Movalpolos (H-11) para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Kocco Ehllek (H-8) in Windurst Waters (S)."] = "Habla con Kocco Ehllek (H-8) en Windurst Waters (S).",
    ["Speak with Koh Lenbalalako inside the Blacksmiths' Guild in Mhaura (F-9)."] = "Habla con Koh Lenbalalako dentro del Blacksmiths' Guild de Mhaura (F-9).",
    ["Speak with Kohlo-Lakolo behind the warehouse at (G-5) in Port Windurst."] = "Habla con Kohlo-Lakolo detrás del warehouse en (G-5) de Port Windurst.",
    ["Speak with Kohlo-Lakolo behind warehouse #1 at (G-5) in Port Windurst for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Kohlo-Lakolo detrás del warehouse #1 en (G-5) de Port Windurst para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Kohlo-Lakolo for a cutscene, then speak with Honoi-Gomoi again for a cutscene that completes the quest."] = "Habla con Kohlo-Lakolo para una escena y luego habla de nuevo con Honoi-Gomoi para una escena que completa la quest.",
    ["Speak with Kohlo-Lakolo in Port Windurst (G-5) for a cutscene that starts the quest."] = "Habla con Kohlo-Lakolo en Port Windurst (G-5) para una escena que inicia la quest.",
    ["Speak with Kohlo-Lakolo in Port Windurst (G-5) for a story cutscene that starts the quest. If you already have the key item Old ring, you skip ahead to the final cutscene."] = "Habla con Kohlo-Lakolo en Port Windurst (G-5) para una escena de historia que inicia la quest. Si ya tienes el key item Old ring, pasas directamente a la escena final.",
    ["Speak with Kohlo-Lakolo in Port Windurst (G-5) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Kohlo-Lakolo en Port Windurst (G-5) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Kohlo-Lakolo in Port Windurst (G-5)."] = "Habla con Kohlo-Lakolo en Port Windurst (G-5).",
    ["Speak with Kohlo-Lakolo in Port Windurst for a cutscene, then speak with Pichichi near him, who sends you to her mother."] = "Habla con Kohlo-Lakolo en Port Windurst para una escena y luego habla con Pichichi, que está cerca de él y te envía con su madre.",
    ["Speak with Kopuro-Popuro in Windurst Woods (H-10) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Kopuro-Popuro en Windurst Woods (H-10) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Kororo in the Manustery in Windurst Woods (H-9)."] = "Habla con Kororo en el Manustery de Windurst Woods (H-9).",
    ["Speak with Koru-Moru (E-7). His reference to a Rhinostery Researcher means Ripapa."] = "Habla con Koru-Moru (E-7). Su referencia a un Rhinostery Researcher se refiere a Ripapa.",
    ["Speak with Koru-Moru and obtain Luminicloth, Spectral Goldenrod, and Spectral Crimson."] = "Habla con Koru-Moru y obtén Luminicloth, Spectral Goldenrod y Spectral Crimson.",
    ["Speak with Koru-Moru in Windurst Walls (E-7) to complete the quest and receive your reward. You can drop the Earth Pendulum afterwards, as it serves no further purpose."] = "Habla con Koru-Moru en Windurst Walls (E-7) para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa. Puedes tirar el Earth Pendulum después, ya que no tiene más utilidad.",
    ["Speak with Koru-Moru in Windurst Walls (E-7) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Koru-Moru en Windurst Walls (E-7) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Koru-Moru in Windurst Walls (E-7) while the Torn Epistle is in your inventory."] = "Habla con Koru-Moru en Windurst Walls (E-7) mientras tienes la Torn Epistle en el inventario.",
    ["Speak with Koru-Moru in Windurst Walls (E-7)."] = "Habla con Koru-Moru en Windurst Walls (E-7).",
    ["Speak with Kubhe Ijyuhla in Serpentking Square, Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-8), to begin the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack and follows Got It All. The rest of the quest involves running around Aht Urhgan Whitegate and watching cutscenes."] = "Habla con Kubhe Ijyuhla en Serpentking Square, Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-8), para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan y sigue a Got It All. El resto de la quest consiste en recorrer Aht Urhgan Whitegate y ver escenas.",
    ["Speak with Kuoh Rhel again to complete the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Habla de nuevo con Kuoh Rhel para completar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
    ["Speak with Kuoh Rhel in Windurst Woods (K-12) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Kuoh Rhel en Windurst Woods (K-12) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Kuoh Rhel inside the corral at the Chocobo Stables in Windurst Woods (K-12) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Kuoh Rhel dentro del corral de los Chocobo Stables de Windurst Woods (K-12) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Kuoh Rhel to complete the quest and receive 900 gil."] = "Habla con Kuoh Rhel para completar la quest y recibir 900 gil.",
    ["Speak with Kupipi and continue to Tosuka-Porika (G-8)."] = "Habla con Kupipi y continúa hacia Tosuka-Porika (G-8).",
    ["Speak with Kupipi in Heavens Tower."] = "Habla con Kupipi en Heavens Tower.",
    ["Speak with Kupipi."] = "Habla con Kupipi.",
    ["Speak with Kurando in Port Bastok (H-6) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Kurando en Port Bastok (H-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Kuroido-Moido in Port Windurst (E-7) to receive the key item Weapons Training Guide and the Club of Trials."] = "Habla con Kuroido-Moido en Port Windurst (E-7) para recibir el key item Weapons Training Guide y el Club of Trials.",
    ["Speak with Kuroido-Moido in Port Windurst (E-7) to start the quest; zone first if you have just completed Making Amends."] = "Habla con Kuroido-Moido en Port Windurst (E-7) para empezar la quest; cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar Making Amends.",
    ["Speak with Kyume-Romeh in the Timbre Timbers Tavern in Northern Windurst Waters (F-10) to get the key item Windurst Waters scoop."] = "Habla con Kyume-Romeh en la Timbre Timbers Tavern de Northern Windurst Waters (F-10) para obtener el key item Windurst Waters scoop.",
    ["Speak with Lageegee at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Building Bridges. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Lageegee en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Building Bridges. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Lageegee at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Defuse the Threat. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Lageegee en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Defuse the Threat. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Lageegee at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Operation: Snake Eyes. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Lageegee en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Operation: Snake Eyes. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Lageegee at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Requiem. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Lageegee en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Requiem. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Lageegee at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Saving Private Ryaaf. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Lageegee en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Saving Private Ryaaf. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Lageegee at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Seagull Grounded. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Lageegee en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Seagull Grounded. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Lageegee at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Shooting Down the Baron. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Lageegee en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Shooting Down the Baron. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Lageegee at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Stop the Bloodshed. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Lageegee en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Stop the Bloodshed. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Lageegee at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select The Price Is Right. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Lageegee en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige The Price Is Right. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Lageegee at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Wake the Puppet. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Lageegee en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Wake the Puppet. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Laisrean in Norg (H-7) to begin the quest. You need Norg fame level 4 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. He wants something from the Sahagins' storage area in the Sea Serpent Grotto; anything will do."] = "Habla con Laisrean en Norg (H-7) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Norg y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Quiere algo del almacén de los Sahagins en la Sea Serpent Grotto; cualquier cosa sirve.",
    ["Speak with Leepe-Hoppe (J-8) on the roof of the Rhinostery in Windurst Waters."] = "Habla con Leepe-Hoppe (J-8) en el tejado del Rhinostery en Windurst Waters.",
    ["Speak with Leepe-Hoppe in Windurst Waters South (J-9) to start the quest. If the quest Tuning In is offered instead (cutscene with Shikaree Y), zone and speak with Leepe-Hoppe again to get the right cutscene."] = "Habla con Leepe-Hoppe en Windurst Waters South (J-9) para empezar la quest. Si en su lugar te ofrecen la quest Tuning In (escena con Shikaree Y), cambia de zona y habla de nuevo con Leepe-Hoppe para obtener la escena correcta.",
    ["Speak with Leepe-Hoppe in Windurst Waters South (J-9) to start the quest. You must wait one Earth minute after completing Tuning In."] = "Habla con Leepe-Hoppe en Windurst Waters South (J-9) para empezar la quest. Debes esperar un minuto terrestre tras completar Tuning In.",
    ["Speak with Leepe-Hoppe on top of the Rhinostery in Windurst Waters South (J-9) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Leepe-Hoppe en lo alto del Rhinostery en Windurst Waters South (J-9) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Legata in the Lion Spring's Tavern in Southern San d'Oria (K-6) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Legata en la Lion Spring's Tavern de Southern San d'Oria (K-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Leonhardt for another cutscene."] = "Habla con Leonhardt para otra escena.",
    ["Speak with Leporaitceau in Tavnazian Safehold (J-8, 3rd floor)."] = "Habla con Leporaitceau en Tavnazian Safehold (J-8, 3.er piso).",
    ["Speak with Levil (E-8) at the Pioneers' Coalition."] = "Habla con Levil (E-8) en el Pioneers' Coalition.",
    ["Speak with Levil (E-8) in the Pioneers' Coalition at (E-8)."] = "Habla con Levil (E-8) en el Pioneers' Coalition, en (E-8).",
    ["Speak with Levil (E-8) in the Pioneers' Coalition."] = "Habla con Levil (E-8) en el Pioneers' Coalition.",
    ["Speak with Lokpix in Eastern Altepa Desert (G-7). You need the Rise of the Zilart pack. He requests a Tremorstone in addition to one of the following: 1 Meteorite, 1 Soil Gem or 12 Soil Geode."] = "Habla con Lokpix en Eastern Altepa Desert (G-7). Necesitas el pack Rise of the Zilart. Pide un Tremorstone además de una de estas opciones: 1 Meteorite, 1 Soil Gem o 12 Soil Geode.",
    ["Speak with Louxiard (G-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Louxiard (G-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Lucius (J-9) to receive Trust: Volker."] = "Habla con Lucius (J-9) para recibir Trust: Volker.",
    ["Speak with Lucius (J-9)."] = "Habla con Lucius (J-9).",
    ["Speak with Lumomo in the Timbre Timbers Tavern in Windurst Waters (F-10). You must be level 25 or higher."] = "Habla con Lumomo en la Timbre Timbers Tavern de Windurst Waters (F-10). Debes ser nivel 25 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Maabu-Sonbu in Port Windurst (E-7), near Home Point #1."] = "Habla con Maabu-Sonbu en Port Windurst (E-7), cerca del Home Point #1.",
    ["Speak with Maat in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) on a level 50 job. You need Jeuno fame level 1."] = "Habla con Maat en Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) con un trabajo de nivel 50. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Jeuno.",
    ["Speak with Maat in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) on a level 51 job. You need Jeuno fame level 1. He asks you for three key items guarded by monsters in Xarcabard."] = "Habla con Maat en Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) con un trabajo de nivel 51. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Jeuno. Te pide tres key items custodiados por monstruos en Xarcabard.",
    ["Speak with Maat in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) on a level 61 or higher job. You need Jeuno fame level 1. He gives you four clues and wants you to trade a Kindred's Seal to each of the people described in the clues."] = "Habla con Maat en Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) con un trabajo de nivel 61 o superior. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Jeuno. Te da cuatro pistas y quiere que entregues un Kindred's Seal a cada una de las personas descritas en las pistas.",
    ["Speak with Maat in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) on any level 66-70 job. You need Jeuno fame level 1. This limit break applies to the jobs that existed before the Treasures of Aht Urhgan expansion, and it needs the Testimony item for the job you want to fight Maat with."] = "Habla con Maat en Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) con cualquier trabajo de nivel 66-70. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Jeuno. Este limit break se aplica a los trabajos que existían antes de la expansión Treasures of Aht Urhgan, y necesita el Testimony del trabajo con el que quieras luchar contra Maat.",
    ["Speak with Maat in Ru'Lude Gardens on a level 56 or higher job. You need Jeuno fame level 1. He asks for three crests, each found in a different place."] = "Habla con Maat en Ru'Lude Gardens con un trabajo de nivel 56 o superior. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Jeuno. Te pide tres emblemas, cada uno en un lugar distinto.",
    ["Speak with Maat in Ru'Lude Gardens."] = "Habla con Maat en Ru'Lude Gardens.",
    ["Speak with Maat once you have all four stones to complete the quest, which raises your level cap to 70."] = "Habla con Maat cuando tengas las cuatro piedras para completar la quest, que sube tu límite de nivel a 70.",
    ["Speak with Maat once you have all three key items to complete the quest, which raises your level cap to 60."] = "Habla con Maat cuando tengas los tres key items para completar la quest, que sube tu límite de nivel a 60.",
    ["Speak with Maat once you have all three key items to complete the quest, which raises your level cap to 65."] = "Habla con Maat cuando tengas los tres key items para completar la quest, que sube tu límite de nivel a 65.",
    ["Speak with Mafwahb at the Palace Door in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-9) for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Mafwahb en la Palace Door de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-9) para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Magephaud in Norg (I-8) to begin the quest. You need Outlands fame level 2 and the Rise of the Zilart pack, and you must have defeated a Tonberry before you can start it. He asks for three gold beastcoins if you want to learn how to rid yourself of the Tonberries' rancor."] = "Habla con Magephaud en Norg (I-8) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 2 de fama de Outlands y el pack Rise of the Zilart, y debes haber derrotado antes a un Tonberry para poder empezarla. Pide tres gold beastcoins si quieres aprender a librarte del rencor de los Tonberries.",
    ["Speak with Magriffon in Kazham (I-7) and trade him the gil he asks for."] = "Habla con Magriffon en Kazham (I-7) y entrégale el gil que te pide.",
    ["Speak with Magriffon in Kazham (I-7), inside Celodekhi's B&B. You need Kazham fame level 6 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. He has given all his worldly possessions to save a pack of Opo-opos from starvation, and needs someone to save him from getting kicked out before he completes his top-secret mission."] = "Habla con Magriffon en Kazham (I-7), dentro del Celodekhi's B&B. Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Kazham y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Ha regalado todas sus posesiones para salvar de la inanición a una manada de Opo-opos, y necesita que alguien lo salve de que lo echen antes de completar su misión ultrasecreta.",
    ["Speak with Mainchelite (I-9) in Southern San d'Oria (S) and turn in the Red Recommendation Letter."] = "Habla con Mainchelite (I-9) en Southern San d'Oria (S) y entrega la Red Recommendation Letter.",
    ["Speak with Mainchelite (I-9) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Mainchelite (I-9) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Makarim (H-11) at (H-11) to receive the Zeruhn Report."] = "Habla con Makarim (H-11) en (H-11) para recibir el Zeruhn Report.",
    ["Speak with Malene (I-5), more popularly known as the Steam Clock and Bubbly Bernie quest giver."] = "Habla con Malene (I-5), más conocida como la que da las quests de Steam Clock y Bubbly Bernie.",
    ["Speak with Malene in Bastok Markets (I-5) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Malene en Bastok Markets (I-5) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Maloquedil in Northern San d'Oria (J-8) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Maloquedil en Northern San d'Oria (J-8) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Mamaulabion in Norg (G-6) to activate the quest. You need Norg fame level 4 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. This does not need to be done before obtaining the seven items. He would like any \"thuper-dee-duper\" special power items you come across, but cannot tell you where to find them."] = "Habla con Mamaulabion en Norg (G-6) para activar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Norg y el pack Rise of the Zilart. No hace falta hacerlo antes de conseguir los siete objetos. Quiere cualquier objeto \"thuper-dee-duper\" de poder especial que encuentres, pero no puede decirte dónde hallarlos.",
    ["Speak with Mandragora Warden (F-4) and trade Acidic Humus."] = "Habla con Mandragora Warden (F-4) y entrega Acidic Humus.",
    ["Speak with Marin in Bastok Markets (E-10) and accept the quest. You need Bastok fame level 2. She wants you to watch over her little brother Ken during his military academy exam."] = "Habla con Marin en Bastok Markets (E-10) y acepta la quest. Necesitas el nivel 2 de fama de Bastok. Quiere que cuides de su hermano pequeño Ken durante su examen de la academia militar.",
    ["Speak with Marjoirelle in Western Adoulin."] = "Habla con Marjoirelle en Western Adoulin.",
    ["Speak with Maryoh Comyujah (G-7) at (G-7) and choose the top dialogue option."] = "Habla con Maryoh Comyujah (G-7) en (G-7) y elige la primera opción de diálogo.",
    ["Speak with Masad."] = "Habla con Masad.",
    ["Speak with Mashira, who hands you a Broken wand."] = "Habla con Mashira, que te entrega una Broken wand.",
    ["Speak with Mashuu-Ajuu (K-6) and then Paku-Nakku to start the quest."] = "Habla con Mashuu-Ajuu (K-6) y luego con Paku-Nakku para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Mashuu-Ajuu in Windurst Waters North (K-6); he gives you a bag of Herb Seeds and asks you to plant them."] = "Habla con Mashuu-Ajuu en Windurst Waters North (K-6); te da una bolsa de Herb Seeds y te pide que las plantes.",
    ["Speak with Matata (K-12)."] = "Habla con Matata (K-12).",
    ["Speak with Mathilde (H-9) at (H-9) in the Weaver's Guild."] = "Habla con Mathilde (H-9) en (H-9), en el Weaver's Guild.",
    ["Speak with Maugie again after cleaning them to receive your reward, 1,500 gil."] = "Habla de nuevo con Maugie tras limpiarlos para recibir tu recompensa, 1,500 gil.",
    ["Speak with Maugie in Southern San d'Oria (L-9) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Maugie en Southern San d'Oria (L-9) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Medicine Eagle (G/H-6)."] = "Habla con Medicine Eagle (G/H-6).",
    ["Speak with Melvien de Malecroix."] = "Habla con Melvien de Malecroix.",
    ["Speak with Melyon in Selbina (I-9). You need Other fame level 1. He will pay premium prices for any of the following: five heads of La Theine Cabbage, three ears of Millioncorn, or one clump of Boyahda Moss."] = "Habla con Melyon en Selbina (I-9). Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Other. Pagará precios superiores por cualquiera de estos: cinco cabezas de La Theine Cabbage, tres mazorcas de Millioncorn o un manojo de Boyahda Moss.",
    ["Speak with Mertaire in Lower Jeuno, who tells you to take the Star ring (tarnished) to an antique collector. You must be a Bard of level 50 or higher, and the quest does not appear in your log yet. This quest requires the Rise of the Zilart pack and follows The Requiem."] = "Habla con Mertaire en Lower Jeuno, que te dice que lleves el Star ring (tarnished) a un coleccionista de antigüedades. Debes ser Bard de nivel 50 o superior, y la quest aún no aparece en tu log. Esta quest requiere el pack Rise of the Zilart y sigue a The Requiem.",
    ["Speak with Mevreauche in Northern San d'Oria (E-6)."] = "Habla con Mevreauche en Northern San d'Oria (E-6).",
    ["Speak with Mhasbaf in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-8) to begin the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. Galiwao and his colleagues need help locating their employer."] = "Habla con Mhasbaf en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-8) para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Galiwao y sus colegas necesitan ayuda para localizar a su empleador.",
    ["Speak with Miageau at (L-7) in Northern San d'Oria, just past the entrance to the Cathedral."] = "Habla con Miageau en (L-7) de Northern San d'Oria, justo pasada la entrada a la Cathedral.",
    ["Speak with Miah Riyuh (H-9) in Windurst Waters (S) and exchange the Green Recommendation Letter for putty."] = "Habla con Miah Riyuh (H-9) en Windurst Waters (S) y cambia la Green Recommendation Letter por masilla.",
    ["Speak with Miaux again to receive your reward."] = "Habla de nuevo con Miaux para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Speak with Miaux in Northern San d'Oria (E-6) to receive a Shiny earring."] = "Habla con Miaux en Northern San d'Oria (E-6) para recibir un Shiny earring.",
    ["Speak with Michea in Bastok Markets (F-10) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Michea en Bastok Markets (F-10) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Miene again to obtain a clue, an Eagle Button."] = "Habla de nuevo con Miene para obtener una pista, un Eagle Button.",
    ["Speak with Miene by the water in Port San d'Oria (I-8); a cutscene reveals a burglary in progress."] = "Habla con Miene junto al agua en Port San d'Oria (I-8); una escena revela un robo en curso.",
    ["Speak with Mighty Fist in Metalworks (G-9), on the lower level inside the Darksteel Forge, to receive the key item Letter from the Darksteel Forge."] = "Habla con Mighty Fist en Metalworks (G-9), en el nivel inferior dentro de la Darksteel Forge, para recibir el key item Letter from the Darksteel Forge.",
    ["Speak with Mighty Fist on the first floor of Metalworks (Home Point #2, G-9) to begin the quest. You need Bastok fame level 3."] = "Habla con Mighty Fist en el primer piso de Metalworks (Home Point #2, G-9) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Miladi-Nildi in Lower Jeuno."] = "Habla con Miladi-Nildi en Lower Jeuno.",
    ["Speak with Milazahn in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-8) for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Milazahn en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-8) para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Mishhar in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (H-8) to begin the quest. He wants you to find out what Isween is doing in Wajaom Woodlands at night."] = "Habla con Mishhar en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (H-8) para empezar la quest. Quiere que averigües qué hace Isween en Wajaom Woodlands por la noche.",
    ["Speak with Mishhar in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (H-8), near Home Point #1. This requires waiting until after Japanese midnight following Give Peace a Chance."] = "Habla con Mishhar en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (H-8), cerca del Home Point #1. Esto requiere esperar hasta después de la medianoche japonesa tras Give Peace a Chance.",
    ["Speak with Moari-Kaaori in Windurst Waters South (C-9) to start the quest. Home Point #3 is the closest."] = "Habla con Moari-Kaaori en Windurst Waters South (C-9) para empezar la quest. El Home Point #3 es el más cercano.",
    ["Speak with Monberaux (G-10) in Upper Jeuno."] = "Habla con Monberaux (G-10) en Upper Jeuno.",
    ["Speak with Monberaux (G-10) in the Infirmary at (G-10)."] = "Habla con Monberaux (G-10) en la Infirmary, en (G-10).",
    ["Speak with Moogle in your home nation Mog House."] = "Habla con el Moogle en tu Mog House de la nación de origen.",
    ["Speak with Moreno-Toeno (L-6) in the Aurastery at (L-6)."] = "Habla con Moreno-Toeno (L-6) en el Aurastery, en (L-6).",
    ["Speak with Moreno-Toeno in the east Aurastery in Windurst Waters North (L-6). You may need to speak with him twice."] = "Habla con Moreno-Toeno en el Aurastery este de Windurst Waters North (L-6). Puede que tengas que hablar con él dos veces.",
    ["Speak with Muckvis."] = "Habla con Muckvis.",
    ["Speak with Muckvix in Lower Jeuno at (H-9)."] = "Habla con Muckvix en Lower Jeuno, en (H-9).",
    ["Speak with Muckvix in Lower Jeuno."] = "Habla con Muckvix en Lower Jeuno.",
    ["Speak with Muzaffar in Norg (I-8) to begin the quest. You need Outlands fame level 1 (the page is unsure) and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Habla con Muzaffar en Norg (I-8) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Outlands (la página no está segura) y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["Speak with Nadee Periyaha in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (H-9)."] = "Habla con Nadee Periyaha en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (H-9).",
    ["Speak with Naiko-Paneiko (L-8) in Crawlers' Nest (S) and receive the Scoop-Dedicated Linkpearl."] = "Habla con Naiko-Paneiko (L-8) en Crawlers' Nest (S) y recibe el Scoop-Dedicated Linkpearl.",
    ["Speak with Naiko-Paneiko at The Tarutaru Times Company in Southern Windurst Waters (C-11) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Naiko-Paneiko en The Tarutaru Times Company de Southern Windurst Waters (C-11) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Naiko-Paneiko in Windurst Waters South (C-11) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Naiko-Paneiko en Windurst Waters South (C-11) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Naja Salaheem (I-10) and prepare for the palace visit."] = "Habla con Naja Salaheem (I-10) y prepárate para la visita al palacio.",
    ["Speak with Naja Salaheem (I-10) and receive the Supplies Package."] = "Habla con Naja Salaheem (I-10) y recibe el Supplies Package.",
    ["Speak with Naja Salaheem (I-10) in Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Habla con Naja Salaheem (I-10) en Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Speak with Naja Salaheem (I-10) to complete the mission."] = "Habla con Naja Salaheem (I-10) para completar la misión.",
    ["Speak with Naja Salaheem (I-10) to continue the mercenary storyline."] = "Habla con Naja Salaheem (I-10) para continuar la historia de mercenarios.",
    ["Speak with Naja Salaheem (I-10)."] = "Habla con Naja Salaheem (I-10).",
    ["Speak with Naja Salaheem to choose your reward. You can repeat the quest."] = "Habla con Naja Salaheem para elegir tu recompensa. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Speak with Naja Salaheem to choose your reward: an Imperial Gold Piece and one of Pact with Alexander, Colossus's Torque, Colossus's Mantle, Colossus's Earring or 10,000 gil."] = "Habla con Naja Salaheem para elegir tu recompensa: una Imperial Gold Piece y una de entre Pact with Alexander, Colossus's Torque, Colossus's Mantle, Colossus's Earring o 10,000 gil.",
    ["Speak with Naji (J-8) to begin the embassy mission."] = "Habla con Naji (J-8) para comenzar la misión de la embajada.",
    ["Speak with Naji (J-8)."] = "Habla con Naji (J-8).",
    ["Speak with Naji outside the President's Office in Metalworks (J-8) for a cutscene that finishes the quest, and receive your Razor Axe."] = "Habla con Naji fuera de la President's Office en Metalworks (J-8) para una escena que termina la quest, y recibe tu Razor Axe.",
    ["Speak with Nanaa Mihgo (J-3)."] = "Habla con Nanaa Mihgo (J-3).",
    ["Speak with Nanaa Mihgo in Windurst Woods (J-3) as a Thief, level 40 or higher; she gives you the key item Letter from the Tenshodo. You must have the Tenshodo Membership to continue."] = "Habla con Nanaa Mihgo en Windurst Woods (J-3) siendo Thief de nivel 40 o superior; te da el key item Letter from the Tenshodo. Debes tener la Tenshodo Membership para continuar.",
    ["Speak with Nanaa Mihgo in Windurst Woods (J-3) several times until the quest is flagged."] = "Habla con Nanaa Mihgo en Windurst Woods (J-3) varias veces hasta que se active la quest.",
    ["Speak with Nanaa Mihgo in Windurst Woods (J-3) to receive the key item Cat Burglar's note."] = "Habla con Nanaa Mihgo en Windurst Woods (J-3) para recibir el key item Cat Burglar's note.",
    ["Speak with Nanaa Mihgo in Windurst Woods (J-3) to receive the key item Sharp gray stone."] = "Habla con Nanaa Mihgo en Windurst Woods (J-3) para recibir el key item Sharp gray stone.",
    ["Speak with Nanaa Mihgo in Windurst Woods (J-3) to start the quest. She asks what the last signature on the key item Signed envelope was: the correct answer is V, although it likely does not matter what you answer."] = "Habla con Nanaa Mihgo en Windurst Woods (J-3) para empezar la quest. Te pregunta cuál era la última firma del key item Signed envelope: la respuesta correcta es V, aunque probablemente no importe qué respondas.",
    ["Speak with Nbu Latteh in Bastok Markets (J-9) to begin the quest. You need Bastok fame level 2 and to have completed Mom, the Adventurer?."] = "Habla con Nbu Latteh en Bastok Markets (J-9) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 2 de fama de Bastok y haber completado Mom, the Adventurer?.",
    ["Speak with Nbu Latteh on Gold Street in Bastok Markets (J-9) to start the quest. She gives you a Fire Crystal that you can use to craft your Copper Ring if you choose."] = "Habla con Nbu Latteh en Gold Street de Bastok Markets (J-9) para empezar la quest. Te da un Fire Crystal que puedes usar para fabricar tu Copper Ring si quieres.",
    ["Speak with Nelcabrit (H-9) and enter the San d'Orian Embassy door in Ru'Lude Gardens."] = "Habla con Nelcabrit (H-9) y entra por la San d'Orian Embassy door en Ru'Lude Gardens.",
    ["Speak with Nenne in Southern San d'Oria (F-6). The quest does not appear in your quest log until the item hunt part has been activated."] = "Habla con Nenne en Southern San d'Oria (F-6). La quest no aparece en tu quest log hasta que se activa la parte de búsqueda de objetos.",
    ["Speak with Nenne, who gives you a Scroll of Treasure as your reward."] = "Habla con Nenne, que te da un Scroll of Treasure como recompensa.",
    ["Speak with Nereus in Mhaura (I-8), near the Proto-Waypoint, to begin the quest. You need Windurst fame level 5. Nereus seeks a dish of Gusgen clay from the depths of the Gusgen Mines."] = "Habla con Nereus en Mhaura (I-8), cerca del Proto-Waypoint, para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 5 de fama de Windurst. Nereus busca un plato de Gusgen clay de lo más profundo de las Gusgen Mines.",
    ["Speak with Nivorajean in Tavnazian Safehold (I-9), on the surface level. You need to be level 50 or higher, have the Chains of Promathia pack, and have Promathia Mission 4-3 flagged for Sacrarium access. To complete a map of the Sacrarium, she needs you to find a piece of the old floorplans."] = "Habla con Nivorajean en Tavnazian Safehold (I-9), en el nivel de la superficie. Debes ser nivel 50 o superior, tener el pack Chains of Promathia y tener la Promathia Mission 4-3 activada para acceder a Sacrarium. Para completar un mapa de Sacrarium, necesita que encuentres un trozo de los planos antiguos.",
    ["Speak with Nogelle in Port San d'Oria (G-7) to start the quest; she wants three chunks of salt from Lufet's Lake."] = "Habla con Nogelle en Port San d'Oria (G-7) para empezar la quest; quiere tres trozos de sal del Lufet's Lake.",
    ["Speak with Norejaie in Southern San d'Oria (K-6) to begin the quest. You must be level 25 or higher, and you cannot get it while the quest Eco-Warrior (Bastok) or Eco-Warrior (Windurst) is active."] = "Habla con Norejaie en Southern San d'Oria (K-6) para empezar la quest. Debes ser nivel 25 o superior, y no puedes obtenerla mientras la quest Eco-Warrior (Bastok) o Eco-Warrior (Windurst) esté activa.",
    ["Speak with Novalmauge in Bostaunieux Oubliette (G-8) to begin the quest. You must be level 10 or higher."] = "Habla con Novalmauge en Bostaunieux Oubliette (G-8) para empezar la quest. Debes ser nivel 10 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Novalmauge in Bostaunieux Oubliette (G-8) to receive the key item Weapons Training Guide and the Scythe of Trials. You need to break the latent on the Scythe of Trials before completing the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Novalmauge en Bostaunieux Oubliette (G-8) para recibir el key item Weapons Training Guide y la Scythe of Trials. Debes romper el latent de la Scythe of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest.",
    ["Speak with Novalmauge in Bostaunieux Oubliette (G-8)."] = "Habla con Novalmauge en Bostaunieux Oubliette (G-8).",
    ["Speak with Offa in Bastok Markets (F-10) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Offa en Bastok Markets (F-10) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Oggbi in Port Bastok (E-6) to receive the key item Weapon training guide and the Knuckles of Trials. You need to break the latent on the Knuckles of Trials before completing the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Oggbi en Port Bastok (E-6) para recibir el key item Weapon training guide y los Knuckles of Trials. Debes romper el latent de los Knuckles of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest.",
    ["Speak with Oggbi inside the Steaming Sheep Restaurant in Port Bastok (E-6) for a cutscene, as a Monk of level 40 or higher. Once the quest is active you can complete it on any job."] = "Habla con Oggbi dentro del Steaming Sheep Restaurant en Port Bastok (E-6) para una escena, como Monk de nivel 40 o superior. Una vez activa la quest, puedes completarla con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Oggbi inside the Steaming Sheep Restaurant in Port Bastok (E-6) for a cutscene. Once the quest is active you can complete it on any job."] = "Habla con Oggbi dentro del Steaming Sheep Restaurant en Port Bastok (E-6) para una escena. Una vez activa la quest, puedes completarla con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Ohbiru-Dohbiru and Kenapa-Keppa again to get their food orders."] = "Habla de nuevo con Ohbiru-Dohbiru y Kenapa-Keppa para obtener sus pedidos de comida.",
    ["Speak with Ohbiru-Dohbiru in Windurst Waters South (J-9) for a cutscene. You receive the key item Rhinostery certificate, which gives access to Toraimarai Canal through Windurst Walls (H-3)."] = "Habla con Ohbiru-Dohbiru en Windurst Waters South (J-9) para una escena. Recibes el key item Rhinostery certificate, que da acceso a Toraimarai Canal por Windurst Walls (H-3).",
    ["Speak with Ohbiru-Dohbiru in Windurst Waters South (J-9) to receive a Rhinostery Canteen."] = "Habla con Ohbiru-Dohbiru en Windurst Waters South (J-9) para recibir una Rhinostery Canteen.",
    ["Speak with Ohruru in Port Windurst (E-7) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Ohruru en Port Windurst (E-7) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Olbergieut in the Cathedral in Northern San d'Oria (L-7) to begin the quest; you receive the Scripture of Wind."] = "Habla con Olbergieut en la Cathedral de Northern San d'Oria (L-7) para empezar la quest; recibes el Scripture of Wind.",
    ["Speak with Ondieulix at (I-7) to receive your reward, the Powerful Rope."] = "Habla con Ondieulix en (I-7) para recibir tu recompensa, el Powerful Rope.",
    ["Speak with Orlando in Mhaura (G-9) to begin the quest. Find where the Goblins bury their junk: he is interested in the items that Goblin Diggers tend to bury if left undisturbed."] = "Habla con Orlando en Mhaura (G-9) para empezar la quest. Averigua dónde entierran los Goblins su chatarra: le interesan los objetos que los Goblin Diggers suelen enterrar si se les deja tranquilos.",
    ["Speak with Oscairn at (G-7) in Eastern Adoulin, northeast of the Peacekeepers' Coalition."] = "Habla con Oscairn en (G-7), en Eastern Adoulin, al noreste de la Peacekeepers' Coalition.",
    ["Speak with Oswald in Selbina (I-9). This quest involves a Fat Greedie, a fish that can be caught in the sea at Selbina, and an Etched ring."] = "Habla con Oswald en Selbina (I-9). Esta quest incluye un Fat Greedie, un pez que se puede pescar en el mar de Selbina, y un Etched ring.",
    ["Speak with Pagdako (H-9)."] = "Habla con Pagdako (H-9).",
    ["Speak with Pagisalis in Northern San d'Oria (M-6) to start the quest; he wants two lumps of beeswax to make candles."] = "Habla con Pagisalis en Northern San d'Oria (M-6) para empezar la quest; quiere dos trozos de cera de abeja para hacer velas.",
    ["Speak with Pakh-Jatalfih (I-9) in the Windurstian Embassy and enter the Ambassador's room."] = "Habla con Pakh-Jatalfih (I-9) en la Windurstian Embassy y entra en la sala del Ambassador.",
    ["Speak with Pakh-Jatalfih (I-9)."] = "Habla con Pakh-Jatalfih (I-9).",
    ["Speak with Paouala in Southern San d'Oria (M-8); she asks for Mary's Milk."] = "Habla con Paouala en Southern San d'Oria (M-8); pide Mary's Milk.",
    ["Speak with Parraggoh in the house on the bottom level in Bastok Mines (H-5) to complete the quest and receive a Bronze Knife. You may need to speak with him twice."] = "Habla con Parraggoh en la casa del nivel inferior de Bastok Mines (H-5) para completar la quest y recibir un Bronze Knife. Puede que tengas que hablar con él dos veces.",
    ["Speak with Parvipon, the tanner, in Southern San d'Oria (E-8) outside the Leathercraft Guild to begin the quest. The first time you must answer \"I shall help.\" before you can proceed; speaking to him again is not needed for later trade-ins."] = "Habla con Parvipon, el curtidor, en Southern San d'Oria (E-8), fuera del Leathercraft Guild, para empezar la quest. La primera vez debes responder \"I shall help.\" antes de continuar; no hace falta volver a hablar con él para las entregas posteriores.",
    ["Speak with Paujean in Port Bastok (F-6) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Paujean en Port Bastok (F-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Pavvke in Bastok Mines (I-7), who asks you to bring back name tags."] = "Habla con Pavvke en Bastok Mines (I-7), que te pide que traigas placas de identificación.",
    ["Speak with Paya-Sabya in Upper Jeuno at (I-8)."] = "Habla con Paya-Sabya en Upper Jeuno, en (I-8).",
    ["Speak with Paytah at the pier near the shopping piers in Port Windurst (I-7)."] = "Habla con Paytah en el muelle cerca de los shopping piers de Port Windurst (I-7).",
    ["Speak with Perih Vashai in Windurst Woods (K-7) as a Ranger, level 40 or higher, to receive the temporary key item Chieftainness's twinstone earring."] = "Habla con Perih Vashai en Windurst Woods (K-7) siendo Ranger de nivel 40 o superior para recibir el key item temporal Chieftainness's twinstone earring.",
    ["Speak with Perih Vashai in Windurst Woods (K-7) for a cutscene in which she sends you to Mhaura."] = "Habla con Perih Vashai en Windurst Woods (K-7) para una escena en la que te envía a Mhaura.",
    ["Speak with Perih Vashai in Windurst Woods (K-7) to receive the key item Weapons Training Guide and the Bow of Trials."] = "Habla con Perih Vashai en Windurst Woods (K-7) para recibir el key item Weapons Training Guide y el Bow of Trials.",
    ["Speak with Perih Vashai in Windurst Woods (K-7). She may say something about Trusts the first time you talk to her after zoning in; keep talking to her until her dialogue is about this quest."] = "Habla con Perih Vashai en Windurst Woods (K-7). Puede decir algo sobre Trusts la primera vez que hables con ella tras entrar en la zona; sigue hablando con ella hasta que su diálogo trate de esta quest.",
    ["Speak with Perih Vashai in Windurst Woods (K-7); she sends you to the Blacksmiths' Guild in Mhaura."] = "Habla con Perih Vashai en Windurst Woods (K-7); te envía al Blacksmiths' Guild de Mhaura.",
    ["Speak with Pesoso inside to begin the three-wave battle."] = "Habla con Pesoso dentro para comenzar la batalla de tres oleadas.",
    ["Speak with Phara again to receive Yasin's sword."] = "Habla de nuevo con Phara para recibir la Yasin's sword.",
    ["Speak with Phara in Bastok Mines (J-9), a Warrior of level 40 or higher; she is right beside the Gobbie Mystery Box at Home Point #2. She needs sword grip material to repair her son's sword, which can be found in a tent in Davoi."] = "Habla con Phara en Bastok Mines (J-9), siendo Warrior de nivel 40 o superior; está junto al Gobbie Mystery Box en el Home Point #2. Necesita material de empuñadura para reparar la espada de su hijo, que se puede encontrar en una tienda de campaña en Davoi.",
    ["Speak with Phara in Bastok Mines (J-9), a Warrior of level 50 or higher."] = "Habla con Phara en Bastok Mines (J-9), siendo Warrior de nivel 50 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Phara, then wait a game day (until the clock rolls past 00:00)."] = "Habla con Phara y luego espera un día de juego (hasta que el reloj pase de las 00:00).",
    ["Speak with Pherimociel at (G-6)."] = "Habla con Pherimociel en (G-6).",
    ["Speak with Pherimociel."] = "Habla con Pherimociel.",
    ["Speak with Phillone (D-7)."] = "Habla con Phillone (D-7).",
    ["Speak with Phoochuchu in Mhaura (H-8), on the ground level under the bridge."] = "Habla con Phoochuchu en Mhaura (H-8), en la planta baja bajo el puente.",
    ["Speak with Pius at (J-8), then Grohm at (G-9)."] = "Habla con Pius en (J-8) y luego con Grohm en (G-9).",
    ["Speak with Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) again afterward to obtain Trust: Arciela."] = "Después, habla de nuevo con Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) para obtener Trust: Arciela.",
    ["Speak with Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) and complete the final sequence."] = "Habla con Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) y completa la secuencia final.",
    ["Speak with Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) at (K-9) between 15:00 and 22:00."] = "Habla con Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) en (K-9) entre las 15:00 y las 22:00.",
    ["Speak with Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) at the Castle Adoulin gates in Eastern Adoulin at (K-9)."] = "Habla con Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) en las puertas de Castle Adoulin, en Eastern Adoulin, en (K-9).",
    ["Speak with Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) at the Castle Adoulin gates."] = "Habla con Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) en las puertas de Castle Adoulin.",
    ["Speak with Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) at the Gates of Castle Adoulin."] = "Habla con Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) en las Gates of Castle Adoulin.",
    ["Speak with Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) at the gates of Castle Adoulin."] = "Habla con Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) en las puertas de Castle Adoulin.",
    ["Speak with Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) for the final reward sequence."] = "Habla con Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) para la secuencia de recompensa final.",
    ["Speak with Ploh Trishbahk (K-9)."] = "Habla con Ploh Trishbahk (K-9).",
    ["Speak with Portaure in Cargo Room B, near Home Point #1 in Port San d'Oria (H-9), to accept the quest and obtain the Brugaire goods. Nighttime is the safest option."] = "Habla con Portaure en la Cargo Room B, cerca del Home Point #1 de Port San d'Oria (H-9), para aceptar la quest y obtener los Brugaire goods. De noche es la opción más segura.",
    ["Speak with Powhatan in Port Bastok (E-6) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Powhatan en Port Bastok (E-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Pygmalion in Port Windurst (M-7) and accept the quest."] = "Habla con Pygmalion en Port Windurst (M-7) y acepta la quest.",
    ["Speak with Qiji in Port Bastok (I-7); he wants to give his wife, Romilda, a Brass Hairpin."] = "Habla con Qiji en Port Bastok (I-7); quiere regalarle a su esposa, Romilda, una Brass Hairpin.",
    ["Speak with Qiji to receive your reward, 300 gil."] = "Habla con Qiji para recibir tu recompensa, 300 gil.",
    ["Speak with Ququroon in Nashmau (H-6) for a cutscene that starts the quest. He wants to practice cooking so he can open a restaurant one day. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Ququroon en Nashmau (H-6) para una escena que empieza la quest. Quiere practicar cocina para abrir algún día un restaurante. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Speak with Qutiba in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) for a cutscene. You may have to talk to her several times and agree to listen to a recipe before the cutscene plays."] = "Habla con Qutiba en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) para una escena. Puede que tengas que hablar con ella varias veces y aceptar escuchar una receta antes de que se vea la escena.",
    ["Speak with Raamimi in Windurst Walls (F-7) to receive Honey."] = "Habla con Raamimi en Windurst Walls (F-7) para recibir Honey.",
    ["Speak with Radeivepart in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-9). He requests that you bring him a Flame Degen. You need Jeuno fame level 4."] = "Habla con Radeivepart en Ru'Lude Gardens (H-9). Te pide que le traigas una Flame Degen. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Jeuno.",
    ["Speak with Radford near the Metalworks."] = "Habla con Radford cerca de Metalworks.",
    ["Speak with Rahal (H-9) at (H-9) to receive the Crystal Dowser and instructions."] = "Habla con Rahal (H-9) en (H-9) para recibir el Crystal Dowser y las instrucciones.",
    ["Speak with Rahal again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Rahal.",
    ["Speak with Rahal in Chateau d'Oraguille (H-9), inside the Royal Knight Quarters, as a Dragoon of level 50 or higher to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Rahal en Chateau d'Oraguille (H-9), dentro de los Royal Knight Quarters, como Dragoon de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Rahal in the Royal Knights' Quarters."] = "Habla con Rahal en los Royal Knights' Quarters.",
    ["Speak with Raibaht in Cid's lab in Metalworks (G-8) to begin the quest. You need Bastok fame level 3."] = "Habla con Raibaht en el Cid's lab de Metalworks (G-8) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Raibaht in Metalworks (G-8) to begin the quest. You need Bastok fame level 5."] = "Habla con Raibaht en Metalworks (G-8) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 5 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Raibaht in Metalworks (G-8) to begin the quest. You receive a Molybdenum box."] = "Habla con Raibaht en Metalworks (G-8) para empezar la quest. Recibes una Molybdenum box.",
    ["Speak with Raibaht, Cid's assistant, in Cid's Lab in Metalworks (G-8) as a Dark Knight of level 40 or higher. After this point the rest of the quest can be completed on any job."] = "Habla con Raibaht, ayudante de Cid, en el Cid's Lab de Metalworks (G-8) siendo Dark Knight de nivel 40 o superior. A partir de este punto el resto de la quest se puede completar con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Raifa (D-6) in the Steaming Sheep Restaurant in Port Bastok to begin the quest. You must be level 25 or higher. You can only have one Eco-Warrior quest active at a time, and they cannot be deactivated."] = "Habla con Raifa (D-6) en el Steaming Sheep Restaurant de Port Bastok para empezar la quest. Debes ser nivel 25 o superior. Solo puedes tener una quest Eco-Warrior activa a la vez, y no se pueden desactivar.",
