    ["Speak with Rasdinice in Southern San d'Oria (S) (I-9), select the category supply transport and sign up for Vanguard-X IV."] = "Habla con Rasdinice en Southern San d'Oria (S) (I-9), elige la categoría de transporte de suministros y apúntate a Vanguard-X IV.",
    ["Speak with Ratihb in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12) for your reward, the Trump Gun. You may have to speak to him twice."] = "Habla con Ratihb en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12) por tu recompensa, el Trump Gun. Puede que tengas que hablar con él dos veces.",
    ["Speak with Ratihb in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12) to start this quest. The correct cutscene is the one about Balajaha, Yadhiwa and a game of dice, not the one for Luck of the Draw. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Ratihb en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12) para empezar esta quest. La escena correcta es la de Balajaha, Yadhiwa y una partida de dados, no la de Luck of the Draw. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Speak with Ratihb in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12), at the Shararat Teahouse. If his response is to welcome you and revitalize you with tea, you probably already did the optional last step of the previous quest. You need to be a Corsair of level 40 or higher."] = "Habla con Ratihb en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12), en la Shararat Teahouse. Si su respuesta es darte la bienvenida y reanimarte con té, probablemente ya hiciste el último paso opcional de la quest anterior. Debes ser Corsair de nivel 40 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Ratihb inside the Shararat Teahouse (J-12). If the cutscene does not involve Foudeel and Wahboud, speak to him again for the correct cutscene."] = "Habla con Ratihb dentro de la Shararat Teahouse (J-12). Si la escena no incluye a Foudeel y Wahboud, vuelve a hablar con él para la escena correcta.",
    ["Speak with Raustigne (I-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S) to receive the Large Memory Fragment."] = "Habla con Raustigne (I-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S) para recibir el Large Memory Fragment.",
    ["Speak with Raustigne (I-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Raustigne (I-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Raustigne (I-7)."] = "Habla con Raustigne (I-7).",
    ["Speak with Rauteinot in Kazham (G-9), who asks for a slab of Elshimo Marble. You need Kazham fame level 3 and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Habla con Rauteinot en Kazham (G-9), que pide una losa de Elshimo Marble. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Kazham y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["Speak with Red Axe (I-8) in The Eldieme Necropolis (S)."] = "Habla con Red Axe (I-8) en The Eldieme Necropolis (S).",
    ["Speak with Regine in Port San d'Oria (J-8) to begin the quest, and choose the option to look for work."] = "Habla con Regine en Port San d'Oria (J-8) para empezar la quest, y elige la opción de buscar trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Reikuu (K-8) and consult Incantrix."] = "Habla con Reikuu (K-8) y consulta a Incantrix.",
    ["Speak with Reikuu (K-8) and continue to Incantrix."] = "Habla con Reikuu (K-8) y continúa hacia Incantrix.",
    ["Speak with Reikuu (K-8)."] = "Habla con Reikuu (K-8).",
    ["Speak with Reinberta in Bastok Markets (I-8)."] = "Habla con Reinberta en Bastok Markets (I-8).",
    ["Speak with Rholont (E-7) again to receive Biscuit a la Rholont."] = "Habla de nuevo con Rholont (E-7) para recibir Biscuit a la Rholont.",
    ["Speak with Rholont (E-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S) and bring the Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls to obtain Trust: Excenmille (S)."] = "Habla con Rholont (E-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S) y lleva el Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls para obtener Trust: Excenmille (S).",
    ["Speak with Rholont (E-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S) and receive the Letter to Count Aurchiat."] = "Habla con Rholont (E-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S) y recibe la Letter to Count Aurchiat.",
    ["Speak with Rholont (E-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Rholont (E-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Rholont (E-7) to complete the quest and receive the Fullmetal Bullet."] = "Habla con Rholont (E-7) para completar la quest y recibir la Fullmetal Bullet.",
    ["Speak with Rholont (E-7)."] = "Habla con Rholont (E-7).",
    ["Speak with Rigobertine (J-7) at (J-7)."] = "Habla con Rigobertine (J-7) en (J-7).",
    ["Speak with Ripapa in Mhaura (I-9) to obtain the quest. You need Mhaura fame level 6. Warning: Trust Magic cannot be used in this battlefield. Once you have the key item Tuning fork of lightning, you can safely undertake the quest, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Ripapa en Mhaura (I-9) para obtener la quest. Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Mhaura. Aviso: no se puede usar Trust Magic en este campo de batalla. Cuando tengas el key item Tuning fork of lightning, ya puedes emprender la quest con seguridad, y cada miembro del grupo necesita el suyo.",
    ["Speak with Roderich (E-11) at the Benedikt Watchtower."] = "Habla con Roderich (E-11) en la Benedikt Watchtower.",
    ["Speak with Rodeupansat (J-7) in Crawlers' Nest (S) and receive the Evil Warding Seal."] = "Habla con Rodeupansat (J-7) en Crawlers' Nest (S) y recibe el Evil Warding Seal.",
    ["Speak with Rodin-Comidin (I-7) outside the Automaton Workshop at (I-7)."] = "Habla con Rodin-Comidin (I-7) fuera del Automaton Workshop, en (I-7).",
    ["Speak with Rohn Ehlbalna (G-9)."] = "Habla con Rohn Ehlbalna (G-9).",
    ["Speak with Rojaireaut (G-3) to have your level capped at 25. Everyone in your party or alliance needs the level cap applied to them, and it has no timer."] = "Habla con Rojaireaut (G-3) para que tu nivel quede limitado a 25. Todos los de tu grupo o alianza necesitan que se les aplique el límite de nivel, y no tiene temporizador.",
    ["Speak with Romaa Mihgo in Kazham (H-11)."] = "Habla con Romaa Mihgo en Kazham (H-11).",
    ["Speak with Romeo in Selbina (H-9). You need Other fame level 1. Donate five pieces of onion equipment to help new recruits everywhere; donors may receive an award."] = "Habla con Romeo en Selbina (H-9). Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Other. Dona cinco piezas de equipo onion para ayudar a los nuevos reclutas de todas partes; los donantes pueden recibir un premio.",
    ["Speak with Romilda in Port Bastok (I-7), who wants to give her husband, Qiji, a pair of Cotton Gloves."] = "Habla con Romilda en Port Bastok (I-7), que quiere regalarle a su marido, Qiji, unos Cotton Gloves.",
    ["Speak with Romualdo (I-7) in Batallia Downs (S)."] = "Habla con Romualdo (I-7) en Batallia Downs (S).",
    ["Speak with Ronan in Port Bastok (K-6) to activate the quest."] = "Habla con Ronan en Port Bastok (K-6) para activar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Rondipur in Northern San d'Oria (F-6) to begin the quest. Only one Escort for Hire quest can be active at a time, and only one can be completed each Conquest Tally."] = "Habla con Rondipur en Northern San d'Oria (F-6) para empezar la quest. Solo puede haber una quest Escort for Hire activa a la vez, y solo se puede completar una por Conquest Tally.",
    ["Speak with Rongelouts N Distaud in Southern San d'Oria (S) at (I-9)."] = "Habla con Rongelouts N Distaud en Southern San d'Oria (S) en (I-9).",
    ["Speak with Ronta-Onta in Kazham (J-9) to obtain the quest. You need Kazham fame level 6 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Once you have the key item Tuning fork of fire, you can safely undertake the quest. Each party member must have their own Tuning fork of fire."] = "Habla con Ronta-Onta en Kazham (J-9) para obtener la quest. Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Kazham y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Cuando tengas el key item Tuning fork of fire, ya puedes emprender la quest con seguridad. Cada miembro del grupo debe tener su propio Tuning fork of fire.",
    ["Speak with Ropunono in Windurst Waters (F-7) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Ropunono en Windurst Waters (F-7) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Rosel in Southern San d'Oria (K-8) to start the quest; you receive the receipt for the prince's cloak to deliver to the Chateau guards."] = "Habla con Rosel en Southern San d'Oria (K-8) para empezar la quest; recibes el recibo de la capa del príncipe para entregarlo a los guardias del Chateau.",
    ["Speak with Rouva on the west side of Victory Square in Southern San d'Oria (I-8) to begin the quest. She asks you to bring her a sprig of Rivernewort. This quest requires the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Rouva en el lado oeste de Victory Square en Southern San d'Oria (I-8) para empezar la quest. Te pide que le traigas una ramita de Rivernewort. Esta quest requiere el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Rycharde in Mhaura (H-8). This quest follows Expertise. He seeks an ingredient known as Crawler's Eggs."] = "Habla con Rycharde en Mhaura (H-8). Esta quest sigue a Expertise. Busca un ingrediente conocido como Crawler's Eggs.",
    ["Speak with Rycharde in Mhaura (I-8) to begin the quest. He needs your help to find some dhalmel meat."] = "Habla con Rycharde en Mhaura (I-8) para empezar la quest. Necesita tu ayuda para encontrar algo de carne de dhalmel.",
    ["Speak with Ryoma in Norg (H-8) to begin the quest. You need to be a Ninja of level 50 or higher and have the Rise of the Zilart pack; this quest follows I'll Take the Big Box. The Sahagin have stolen Mitsunari's treasure and hidden it somewhere in the jungle on Elshimo Island."] = "Habla con Ryoma en Norg (H-8) para empezar la quest. Debes ser Ninja de nivel 50 o superior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart; esta quest sigue a I'll Take the Big Box. Los Sahagin han robado el tesoro de Mitsunari y lo han escondido en algún lugar de la jungla de Elshimo Island.",
    ["Speak with Ryoma in Norg (H-8). He grants you the key item Weapons Training Guide as well as the Kodachi of Trials."] = "Habla con Ryoma en Norg (H-8). Te concede el key item Weapons Training Guide y el Kodachi of Trials.",
    ["Speak with Salaheem's Sentinels."] = "Habla con los Salaheem's Sentinels.",
    ["Speak with Salim in Metalworks (G-7) to start the quest; he wants you to help get rid of someone. You need Bastok fame level 3."] = "Habla con Salim en Metalworks (G-7) para empezar la quest; quiere que le ayudes a deshacerse de alguien. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Salimah in Bastok Markets (L-8) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Salimah en Bastok Markets (L-8) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Sanosuke in Port Jeuno (H-8), inside the Duty Free Shop."] = "Habla con Sanosuke en Port Jeuno (H-8), dentro de la Duty Free Shop.",
    ["Speak with Sassa-Kotassa and follow his instructions."] = "Habla con Sassa-Kotassa y sigue sus instrucciones.",
    ["Speak with Sattal-Mansal at (J-8) and obtain the required Quadav key items."] = "Habla con Sattal-Mansal en (J-8) y obtén los key items de Quadav requeridos.",
    ["Speak with Sattal-Mansal at (J-8): trade a Quadav Charm for the Coruscant Rosary, then trade a Quadav Augury Shell for the Black Matinee Necklace."] = "Habla con Sattal-Mansal en (J-8): entrega un Quadav Charm a cambio del Coruscant Rosary, y luego un Quadav Augury Shell a cambio del Black Matinee Necklace.",
    ["Speak with Sattal-Mansal in Lower Jeuno and obtain the required key items."] = "Habla con Sattal-Mansal en Lower Jeuno y obtén los key items requeridos.",
    ["Speak with Scarred Shark (G-5) in Bastok Markets (S)."] = "Habla con Scarred Shark (G-5) en Bastok Markets (S).",
    ["Speak with Secodiand in Northern San d'Oria (F-6) to start the quest; he wants two bat wings."] = "Habla con Secodiand en Northern San d'Oria (F-6) para empezar la quest; quiere dos alas de murciélago.",
    ["Speak with Selliste in Bastok Mines (K-7) to begin the quest. You need a Synergy skill of 5 or higher."] = "Habla con Selliste en Bastok Mines (K-7) para empezar la quest. Necesitas una habilidad de Synergy de 5 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Shalott in Upper Jeuno (G-7), outside the Chocobo Stables, for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Shalott en Upper Jeuno (G-7), fuera de los Chocobo Stables, para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Shami in Port Jeuno."] = "Habla con Shami en Port Jeuno.",
    ["Speak with Shantotto (K-7) and continue to Kupipi."] = "Habla con Shantotto (K-7) y continúa hacia Kupipi.",
    ["Speak with Shantotto (K-7) at Shantotto's Manor."] = "Habla con Shantotto (K-7) en Shantotto's Manor.",
    ["Speak with Shantotto (K-7)."] = "Habla con Shantotto (K-7).",
    ["Speak with Shantotto at her manor in Windurst Walls (K-7)."] = "Habla con Shantotto en su manor de Windurst Walls (K-7).",
    ["Speak with Shantotto in Windurst Walls (K-7) to receive the key item Weapons Training Guide and the Pole of Trials."] = "Habla con Shantotto en Windurst Walls (K-7) para recibir el key item Weapons Training Guide y la Pole of Trials.",
    ["Speak with Shantotto in Windurst Walls (K-7) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Shantotto en Windurst Walls (K-7) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Shantotto in Windurst Walls (K-7) to start the quest. The quest Blood and Glory may prevent you from starting it: come back with a job that does not meet the prerequisites for Blood and Glory."] = "Habla con Shantotto en Windurst Walls (K-7) para empezar la quest. La quest Blood and Glory puede impedirte empezarla: vuelve con un trabajo que no cumpla los requisitos de Blood and Glory.",
    ["Speak with Sharzalion in the Lion Springs Tavern in Southern San d'Oria (K-6) with Red Mage as your main job, level 40 or higher. You only have to be on Red Mage to start the quest, and you must answer \"Yes\" for it to start."] = "Habla con Sharzalion en la Lion Springs Tavern de Southern San d'Oria (K-6) con Red Mage como trabajo principal, nivel 40 o superior. Solo tienes que ser Red Mage para empezar la quest, y debes responder \"Yes\" para que empiece.",
    ["Speak with Sigismund on top of the Orastery in Port Windurst (E-7); he tells you about the elusive Starfall Tear."] = "Habla con Sigismund en lo alto del Orastery de Port Windurst (E-7); te habla de la esquiva Starfall Tear.",
    ["Speak with Sobane in Southern San d'Oria (D-6) to begin the quest. You must zone after finishing Signed in Blood."] = "Habla con Sobane en Southern San d'Oria (D-6) para empezar la quest. Debes cambiar de zona tras terminar Signed in Blood.",
    ["Speak with Sobane in Southern San d'Oria (D-6). Be sure to speak with her twice if you get a cutscene the first time."] = "Habla con Sobane en Southern San d'Oria (D-6). Habla con ella dos veces si la primera vez ves una escena.",
    ["Speak with Sobane in Southern San d'Oria (D-6); she asks you to bring her a Cathedral Tapestry."] = "Habla con Sobane en Southern San d'Oria (D-6); te pide que le traigas un Cathedral Tapestry.",
    ["Speak with Sobane to complete the quest."] = "Habla con Sobane para completar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Soni-Muni in Windurst Woods (H-10) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Soni-Muni en Windurst Woods (H-10) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Sorrowful Sage at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Nyzul Isle Investigation. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Sorrowful Sage en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Nyzul Isle Investigation. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Sorrowful Sage at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Nyzul Isle Uncharted Area Survey. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Sorrowful Sage en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Nyzul Isle Uncharted Area Survey. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Steel Bones in Port Bastok (D-8)."] = "Habla con Steel Bones en Port Bastok (D-8).",
    ["Speak with Stray Cloud in Norg (H-9) for a cutscene. You need Outlands fame level 4 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Find Stray Cloud's friend Gubokka in the Sea Serpent Grotto."] = "Habla con Stray Cloud en Norg (H-9) para una escena. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Outlands y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Encuentra a Gubokka, amigo de Stray Cloud, en la Sea Serpent Grotto.",
    ["Speak with Sueleen (H-6)."] = "Habla con Sueleen (H-6).",
    ["Speak with Suldiran in Al Zahbi (J-10), on the upper level, to begin the quest. He asks for 2 Imp Wings."] = "Habla con Suldiran en Al Zahbi (J-10), en el nivel superior, para empezar la quest. Pide 2 Imp Wings.",
    ["Speak with Talib in Port Bastok (F-6) to start the quest. After the cutscene, accept the quest to proceed to the next portion. If you declined it the first time, you can restart it by speaking with Parraggoh in Bastok Mines (H-5), who is on the lower level."] = "Habla con Talib en Port Bastok (F-6) para empezar la quest. Tras la escena, acepta la quest para pasar a la siguiente parte. Si la rechazaste la primera vez, puedes reiniciarla hablando con Parraggoh en Bastok Mines (H-5), que está en el nivel inferior.",
    ["Speak with Talib in Port Bastok (F-6) to start the quest. This quest follows Beauty and the Galka."] = "Habla con Talib en Port Bastok (F-6) para empezar la quest. Esta quest sigue a Beauty and the Galka.",
    ["Speak with Tami in Bastok Mines (J-8) to begin the quest. She gives you the key item Tami's note. If you open and read the key item, you can no longer repeat the quest."] = "Habla con Tami en Bastok Mines (J-8) para empezar la quest. Te da el key item Tami's note. Si abres y lees el key item, ya no podrás repetir la quest.",
    ["Speak with Tapoh Lihzeh at the medicine shop at (I-8), past the Dhalmel farm, and trade her one Papaka Grass."] = "Habla con Tapoh Lihzeh en la tienda de medicinas en (I-8), pasada la granja de Dhalmel, y entrégale una Papaka Grass.",
    ["Speak with Tapoh Lihzeh in Windurst Woods (I-8). The quest will not start while Chocobilious is active."] = "Habla con Tapoh Lihzeh en Windurst Woods (I-8). La quest no empezará mientras Chocobilious esté activa.",
    ["Speak with Tarnotik (K-10) and continue to Mine Shaft #2716."] = "Habla con Tarnotik (K-10) y continúa hacia la Mine Shaft #2716.",
    ["Speak with Tataroon in Nashmau (G-8) to complete the quest and receive an Imperial Silver Piece."] = "Habla con Tataroon en Nashmau (G-8) para completar la quest y recibir una Imperial Silver Piece.",
    ["Speak with Tateeya in the Automaton Workshop in Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Habla con Tateeya en el Automaton Workshop de Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Speak with Tehf Kimasnahya again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Tehf Kimasnahya.",
    ["Speak with Tehf Kimasnahya in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-8). You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. He wants you to get a vial of luminous water from Ekhu Pesshyadha."] = "Habla con Tehf Kimasnahya en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-8). Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Quiere que consigas un vial de agua luminosa de Ekhu Pesshyadha.",
    ["Speak with Tehf Kimasnahya."] = "Habla con Tehf Kimasnahya.",
    ["Speak with Tete at (I-5) in Port Bastok."] = "Habla con Tete en (I-5) en Port Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Thierride (F-8) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Thierride (F-8) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Thierride (F-8) in the Rusty Anchor Pub in Port San d'Oria."] = "Habla con Thierride (F-8) en el Rusty Anchor Pub de Port San d'Oria.",
    ["Speak with Thorben (J-10) again to complete the quest and receive the reward."] = "Habla de nuevo con Thorben (J-10) para completar la quest y recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Speak with Thorben (J-10) in Batallia Downs (S)."] = "Habla con Thorben (J-10) en Batallia Downs (S).",
    ["Speak with Thunder Hawk in Selbina (G-9) to begin the quest. He wants you to rescue two merchants from captivity; they should be somewhere in the Quadav camp in Beadeaux."] = "Habla con Thunder Hawk en Selbina (G-9) para empezar la quest. Quiere que rescates a dos mercaderes cautivos; deberían estar en algún lugar del campamento Quadav de Beadeaux.",
    ["Speak with Titus again for a cutscene and to receive your reward."] = "Habla de nuevo con Titus para una escena y para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Speak with Titus on the second floor of the Alchemy Guild in Bastok Mines (L-7) for a cutscene that begins the quest. You receive the key item Corked ampoule."] = "Habla con Titus en el segundo piso del Alchemy Guild de Bastok Mines (L-7) para una escena que inicia la quest. Recibes el key item Corked ampoule.",
    ["Speak with Tohka Telposkha at (I-8) for a cutscene. You must tell the Galka to go to Port Ephramad; if you choose any other option, you must select again until you pick Port Ephramad."] = "Habla con Tohka Telposkha en (I-8) para una escena. Debes decirle al Galka que vaya a Port Ephramad; si eliges cualquier otra opción, debes volver a elegir hasta que escojas Port Ephramad.",
    ["Speak with Tohopka, who stands right next to Sigismund (E-7). Tohopka explains how to collect the tears and that you need Pugil Scales. Pugil enemies drop them, or you can find them at the Auction House under Bonecrafting."] = "Habla con Tohopka, que está justo junto a Sigismund (E-7). Tohopka explica cómo recoger las lágrimas y que necesitas Pugil Scales. Los enemigos Pugil las sueltan, o puedes encontrarlas en la Auction House en Bonecrafting.",
    ["Speak with Tokaka in Port Windurst (C-8) to start the quest. Home Point #1 in Port Windurst is extremely close to her."] = "Habla con Tokaka en Port Windurst (C-8) para empezar la quest. El Home Point #1 de Port Windurst está muy cerca de ella.",
    ["Speak with Torino-Samarino in Beaucedine Glacier to obtain the temporary key item Shantotto's new spell."] = "Habla con Torino-Samarino en Beaucedine Glacier para obtener el key item temporal Shantotto's new spell.",
    ["Speak with Tosuka-Porika in Windurst Waters (G-8)."] = "Habla con Tosuka-Porika en Windurst Waters (G-8).",
    ["Speak with Tosuka-Porika in Windurst Waters North (G-8) to start the quest; you are sent to Furakku-Norakku, who gives you the Overdue book notification for Orn."] = "Habla con Tosuka-Porika en Windurst Waters North (G-8) para empezar la quest; te envían con Furakku-Norakku, que te da el Overdue book notification para Orn.",
    ["Speak with Tosuka-Porika (G-8) for the next part of the doll investigation."] = "Habla con Tosuka-Porika (G-8) para la siguiente parte de la investigación de la muñeca.",
    ["Speak with Tosuka-Porika (G-8) in Windurst Waters."] = "Habla con Tosuka-Porika (G-8) en Windurst Waters.",
    ["Speak with Tosuka-Porika (G-8) in the Optistery."] = "Habla con Tosuka-Porika (G-8) en el Optistery.",
    ["Speak with Tressia in Tavnazian Safehold (J-6). You need to have completed Darkness Named and have the Chains of Promathia pack. Search for information regarding what happened on the day Wazozo's treasure was stolen."] = "Habla con Tressia en Tavnazian Safehold (J-6). Debes haber completado Darkness Named y tener el pack Chains of Promathia. Busca información sobre lo que pasó el día que robaron el tesoro de Wazozo.",
    ["Speak with Trilok in Port Bastok (D-6) to begin the quest. Only one Escort for Hire quest can be active at a time, and only one can be completed each Conquest Tally."] = "Habla con Trilok en Port Bastok (D-6) para empezar la quest. Solo puede haber una quest Escort for Hire activa a la vez, y solo se puede completar una por Conquest Tally.",
    ["Speak with Tsetseroon in Nashmau (G-6) to begin the quest. There is no cutscene to start it. He needs a cobalt jellyfish and a chunk of tin ore to make his special stew. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Tsetseroon en Nashmau (G-6) para empezar la quest. No hay escena al empezarla. Necesita una medusa cobalto y un trozo de mineral de estaño para hacer su estofado especial. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Speak with Turlough (G-7) in Upper Jeuno."] = "Habla con Turlough (G-7) en Upper Jeuno.",
    ["Speak with Ulamaal for your reward, an Imperial Silver Piece."] = "Habla con Ulamaal por tu recompensa, una Imperial Silver Piece.",
    ["Speak with Umberto in Bastok Markets, near Harmodio's Music Shop (L-10), for a cutscene and your reward."] = "Habla con Umberto en Bastok Markets, cerca de Harmodio's Music Shop (L-10), para una escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Speak with Umumu near the Dhalmel Farm in Windurst Woods (I-6) to get the key item Windurst Woods scoop."] = "Habla con Umumu cerca de la Dhalmel Farm en Windurst Woods (I-6) para obtener el key item Windurst Woods scoop.",
    ["Speak with Unlucky Rat on the first floor of the Cermet Refinery in Metalworks (G-7). You need Bastok fame level 2. He is having a machine problem."] = "Habla con Unlucky Rat en el primer piso del Cermet Refinery de Metalworks (G-7). Necesitas el nivel 2 de fama de Bastok. Tiene un problema con una máquina.",
    ["Speak with Vah Keshura at (H-9)."] = "Habla con Vah Keshura en (H-9).",
    ["Speak with Valaineral in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Valaineral en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Valgeir in Selbina (I-9), inside the Shepherd's Muster."] = "Habla con Valgeir en Selbina (I-9), dentro del Shepherd's Muster.",
    ["Speak with Vamorcote in Northern San d'Oria (F-5) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Vamorcote en Northern San d'Oria (F-5) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Varun in Windurst Woods (H-9)."] = "Habla con Varun en Windurst Woods (H-9).",
    ["Speak with Vera in Mhaura (G-10). You need to be level 18 or higher. Fulfill her request if you want the promised rewards."] = "Habla con Vera en Mhaura (G-10). Debes ser nivel 18 o superior. Cumple su petición si quieres las recompensas prometidas.",
    ["Speak with Vounebariont in Port San d'Oria (I-10) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Vounebariont en Port San d'Oria (I-10) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Wahid in Bastok Mines (I-8), near Home Point #1; he asks for a Siren's Tear."] = "Habla con Wahid en Bastok Mines (I-8), cerca del Home Point #1; pide una Siren's Tear.",
    ["Speak with Waoud in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) as a Blue Mage of level 50 or higher."] = "Habla con Waoud en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) como Blue Mage de nivel 50 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Waoud in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) to begin the quest. Raubahn directs you to find and kill a Flan in the Navukgo Execution Chamber."] = "Habla con Waoud en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) para empezar la quest. Raubahn te manda a encontrar y matar un Flan en la Navukgo Execution Chamber.",
    ["Speak with Waoud in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) to flag the quest. You need to be a Blue Mage of level 66 or higher and have the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. Remember to set the Records of Eminence objective Level Cap Increase: 75 (BLU) under Objective, Tutorial, Level Cap Increase. Waoud may offer an optional 1,000-gil divination afterwards, which is not required."] = "Habla con Waoud en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) para marcar la quest. Debes ser Blue Mage de nivel 66 o superior y tener el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Recuerda activar el objetivo de Records of Eminence Level Cap Increase: 75 (BLU) en Objective, Tutorial, Level Cap Increase. Waoud puede ofrecerte después una adivinación opcional de 1,000 gil, que no es necesaria.",
    ["Speak with Waoud in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10), on the top floor. You need to be level 30 or higher."] = "Habla con Waoud en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10), en el piso superior. Debes ser nivel 30 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Washu at (J-8)."] = "Habla con Washu en (J-8).",
    ["Speak with Wazyih again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Wazyih.",
    ["Speak with Wazyih in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-11) to begin the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. His failure to deliver a package has caused a rift between him and Saliyahf, and the self-proclaimed Defenders of Aht Urhgan need your help."] = "Habla con Wazyih en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-11) para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Su fallo al entregar un paquete ha provocado una ruptura entre él y Saliyahf, y los autoproclamados Defenders of Aht Urhgan necesitan tu ayuda.",
    ["Speak with Wetata in Windurst Woods (G-10); you receive the key item Green institute card."] = "Habla con Wetata en Windurst Woods (G-10); recibes el key item Green institute card.",
    ["Speak with Wyatt (L-6) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Wyatt (L-6) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Azure Experiments. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Azure Experiments. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Bloody Rondo. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Bloody Rondo. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Counting Sheep. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Counting Sheep. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Escort Professor Chanoix. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Escort Professor Chanoix. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Imperial Code. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Imperial Code. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Leujaoam Cleansing. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Leujaoam Cleansing. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Orichalcum Survey. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Orichalcum Survey. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Red Versus Blue. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Red Versus Blue. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Shanarha Grass Conservation. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Shanarha Grass Conservation. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Supplies Recovery. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Supplies Recovery. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yazan in Port Bastok (H-6), who asks you to exterminate Sand Bats in Valkurm Dunes."] = "Habla con Yazan en Port Bastok (H-6), que te pide exterminar Sand Bats en Valkurm Dunes.",
    ["Speak with Yeggah Dolashi (M-6)."] = "Habla con Yeggah Dolashi (M-6).",
    ["Speak with Yoran-Oran in Windurst Walls (E-5); he asks for one of several items."] = "Habla con Yoran-Oran en Windurst Walls (E-5); pide uno de varios objetos.",
    ["Speak with Yujuju by the Air Travel Agency in Port Windurst (M-6) to get the key item Port Windurst scoop."] = "Habla con Yujuju junto a la Air Travel Agency en Port Windurst (M-6) para obtener el key item Port Windurst scoop.",
    ["Speak with Zabahf in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-8)."] = "Habla con Zabahf en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-8).",
    ["Speak with Zacc in Bastok Markets (G-9), who is standing next to Enu. You need Bastok fame level 5."] = "Habla con Zacc en Bastok Markets (G-9), que está junto a Enu. Necesitas el nivel 5 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Zaldon in Selbina (H-9). This quest follows The Real Gift. You need a Fishing skill of 30 or higher; you can use gear and Advanced Synthesis Image Support to reach it. Some fish in Vana'diel like to eat shiny objects, and Zaldon will cut open any you catch."] = "Habla con Zaldon en Selbina (H-9). Esta quest sigue a The Real Gift. Necesitas habilidad de Fishing de 30 o más; puedes usar equipo y Advanced Synthesis Image Support para llegar a ella. A algunos peces de Vana'diel les gusta comer objetos brillantes, y Zaldon abrirá los que pesques.",
    ["Speak with Zexu."] = "Habla con Zexu.",
    ["Speak with Zon-Fobun in Bastok Markets (G-5) to begin the quest. You receive the key item Cursepaper. You need Bastok fame level 4."] = "Habla con Zon-Fobun en Bastok Markets (G-5) para empezar la quest. Recibes el key item Cursepaper. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Zubaba."] = "Habla con Zubaba.",
    ["Speak with all three imps and determine which one is honest."] = "Habla con los tres imps y determina cuál es el honesto.",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard in San d'Oria and accept the mission."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria y acepta la misión.",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8) and accept the mission."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8) y acepta la misión.",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard in San d'Oria to accept the mission."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria para aceptar la misión.",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8) to accept the mission."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8) para aceptar la misión.",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard in San d'Oria."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria.",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8)."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8).",
    ["Speak with the Cardian that Kororo mentions and choose any greeting; the choice does not matter."] = "Habla con el Cardian que menciona Kororo y elige cualquier saludo; la elección no importa.",
    ["Speak with the Gate Guard three times about the book; after the guard says it will take time to decipher, return later and speak with the guard again."] = "Habla tres veces con el Gate Guard sobre el libro; cuando el guardia diga que tardará en descifrarlo, vuelve más tarde y habla de nuevo con el guardia.",
    ["Speak with the NPC Ken to initiate the escort. Buffs remain active, but you cannot cast anything on Ken before starting the quest."] = "Habla con el NPC Ken para iniciar la escolta. Los buffs siguen activos, pero no puedes lanzarle nada a Ken antes de empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with the War Warlock Captains in the Orastery: Ohruru, just south of Hakkuru-Rinkuru on the stage; Goltata, against the west wall; and Yaman-Hachuman, against the wall to the northeast."] = "Habla con los War Warlock Captains del Orastery: Ohruru, justo al sur de Hakkuru-Rinkuru en el escenario; Goltata, contra la pared oeste; y Yaman-Hachuman, contra la pared del noreste.",
    ["Speak with the individuals involved in Skokkr Undrborn's scheme."] = "Habla con los implicados en el plan de Skokkr Undrborn.",
    ["Speak with the people around Bastok. In Bastok Mines: Deidogg (H-6), Echo Hawk (I-7), Griselda (H-5), Goraow (I-6) and Vaghron (H-9)."] = "Habla con la gente de Bastok. En Bastok Mines: Deidogg (H-6), Echo Hawk (I-7), Griselda (H-5), Goraow (I-6) y Vaghron (H-9).",
    ["Speak with the relevant coalition representative to continue the Teodor sequence."] = "Habla con el representante de la coalición correspondiente para continuar la secuencia de Teodor.",
    ["Speak with the starting NPC at the Chocobo stables in Bastok Mines (J-9): Azette, Eulaphe or Quelle. You must be level 20 or higher, and you are asked to deliver a Chocobo to a distant stable."] = "Habla con el NPC inicial en los establos de Chocobos de Bastok Mines (J-9): Azette, Eulaphe o Quelle. Debes ser nivel 20 o superior, y te piden entregar un Chocobo en un establo lejano.",
    ["Speak with the starting NPC at the Chocobo stables in Windurst Woods (K-12); you are asked to deliver a Chocobo to a distant stable."] = "Habla con el NPC inicial en los establos de Chocobos de Windurst Woods (K-12); te piden entregar un Chocobo en un establo lejano.",
    ["Speak with them again until you find the one carrying the Bronze Sword, then trade it to Ruillont (G-3) in Ordelle's Caves."] = "Habla con ellos de nuevo hasta encontrar al que lleva la Bronze Sword, y entrégasela a Ruillont (G-3) en Ordelle's Caves.",
    ["Speak with your Mog House Moogle."] = "Habla con el Moogle de tu Mog House.",
    ["Speaking to Hildolf in Metalworks (F-8) still triggers a quest under the same title. This time he asks for a vial of Slime Oil."] = "Hablar con Hildolf en Metalworks (F-8) todavía activa una quest con el mismo título. Esta vez te pide un vial de Slime Oil.",
    ["Speaking to either brother tells you how many carp he has been traded by all players since the last server maintenance."] = "Al hablar con cualquiera de los hermanos te dice cuántos carp le han entregado todos los jugadores desde el último mantenimiento del servidor.",
    ["Starmite Shell drops from Starmite enemies. Get Starmite Shell x3."] = "La Starmite Shell la sueltan enemigos Starmite. Consigue Starmite Shell x3.",
    ["Start the quest by speaking with Foss in Bastok Markets (F-7)."] = "Empieza la quest hablando con Foss en Bastok Markets (F-7).",
    ["Start the quest by talking to Yurim in Tavnazian Safehold (J-8), on the top floor. This quest requires the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Empieza la quest hablando con Yurim en Tavnazian Safehold (J-8), en el piso superior. Esta quest requiere el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Stay in Windurst Waters until the quest is finished, and show the hat off by talking to the townsfolk."] = "Permanece en Windurst Waters hasta que termine la quest, y presume del sombrero hablando con los habitantes.",
    ["Stink Bat enemies link to Hognosed Bat enemies."] = "Los enemigos Stink Bat se enlazan con los enemigos Hognosed Bat.",
    ["Strength training: trade a Beef Stewpot."] = "Entrenamiento de Strength: entrega un Beef Stewpot.",
    ["Style training: trade 30 Spicy Crackers."] = "Entrenamiento de Style: entrega 30 Spicy Crackers.",
    ["Supply manufacture operations are done with the Adjutant at (D-8) in Southern San d'Oria (S). They take place inside your city, with no battle outside, and any job and level can do them: you only need the knowledge of the craft."] = "Las operaciones de fabricación de suministros se hacen con el Adjutant at (D-8) in Southern San d'Oria (S). Ocurren dentro de tu ciudad, sin combate fuera, y sirve cualquier trabajo y nivel: solo hace falta conocer el oficio.",
    ["Supply manufacture operations are done with the Adjutant at (F-9) in Windurst Waters (S). They take place inside your city, with no battle outside, and any job and level can do them: you only need the knowledge of the craft."] = "Las operaciones de fabricación de suministros se hacen con el Adjutant at (F-9) in Windurst Waters (S). Ocurren dentro de tu ciudad, sin combate fuera, y sirve cualquier trabajo y nivel: solo hace falta conocer el oficio.",
    ["Supply manufacture operations are done with the Adjutant at (J-9) in Bastok Markets (S). They take place inside your city, with no battle outside, and any job and level can do them: you only need the knowledge of the craft."] = "Las operaciones de fabricación de suministros se hacen con el Adjutant at (J-9) in Bastok Markets (S). Ocurren dentro de tu ciudad, sin combate fuera, y sirve cualquier trabajo y nivel: solo hace falta conocer el oficio.",
    ["Support job quest items"] = "Objetos de las quests de support job",
    ["Synergize the stones into Astral Matter in a Synergy Furnace, then trade the result to Selliste for your reward, a Portafurnace."] = "Sintetiza las piedras en Astral Matter en un Synergy Furnace y luego entrega el resultado a Selliste por tu recompensa, un Portafurnace.",
    ["Take Silent Oil and Prism Powder to the Labyrinth of Onzozo. Inside, follow the path to (H-9) and take the eastern tunnel, continue northeast through the large room and take the tunnel at (J-8). In the next large room, curve around the eastern wall to the tunnel at (H-7), head north at the next intersection, and continue north to the border of (I-5)/(I-6), where the ??? spawns the NM."] = "Lleva Silent Oil y Prism Powder al Labyrinth of Onzozo. Dentro, sigue el camino hasta (H-9) y toma el túnel del este, continúa al noreste por la sala grande y toma el túnel de (J-8). En la siguiente sala grande, rodea la pared este hasta el túnel de (H-7), ve al norte en la siguiente intersección y sigue al norte hasta el límite de (I-5)/(I-6), donde la ??? invoca al NM.",
    ["Take a Mythril Beastcoin to Quu Bokye in Giddeus and trade it for the Leather-bound Book."] = "Lleva una Mythril Beastcoin a Quu Bokye en Giddeus y cámbiala por el Leather-bound Book.",
    ["Take a left at the T intersection, then head north. Go west until another split."] = "Gira a la izquierda en la intersección en T y ve al norte. Ve al oeste hasta otra bifurcación.",
    ["Take another Traverser Stone from Joachim (H-8) when one is available."] = "Toma otra Traverser Stone de Joachim (H-8) cuando haya una disponible.",
    ["Take care while triggering the lever, as the single bomb that wanders nearby is aggressive by sight and by magic."] = "Ten cuidado al activar la palanca, ya que la única bomba que merodea cerca es agresiva por vista y por magia.",
    ["Take the Batagreens back to Abeaule for your reward."] = "Lleva el Batagreens a Abeaule para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Take the Bruised Starfruit to Apururu."] = "Lleva la Bruised Starfruit a Apururu.",
    ["Take the Glowstone that drops from the Chaos Elemental and return to Chumimi to complete the quest and receive a Casting Wand."] = "Toma el Glowstone que suelta el Chaos Elemental y vuelve con Chumimi para completar la quest y recibir un Casting Wand.",
    ["Take the Ifrit's Cauldron Home Point #1 to map 7. Run south, then north, to fall off the lip at (J-4). Enter Ifrit's Cauldron directly to the north."] = "Toma el Home Point #1 de Ifrit's Cauldron al mapa 7. Corre al sur, luego al norte, para caer por el borde en (J-4). Entra directamente en Ifrit's Cauldron al norte.",
    ["Take the Moccasins and the Yagudo Holy Water to Narcheral (M-6) in Northern San d'Oria to complete the quest and obtain your Healer's Duckbills."] = "Lleva los Moccasins y el Yagudo Holy Water a Narcheral (M-6) en Northern San d'Oria para completar la quest y obtener tus Healer's Duckbills.",
    ["Take the Ripped Cap to Baren-Moren in Windurst Waters South (H-7)."] = "Lleva la Ripped Cap a Baren-Moren en Windurst Waters South (H-7).",
    ["Take the Selbina Clay to the Stone Monuments around the world and copy their writings. Repeat for the remaining Stone Monuments; the quest does not complete until you finish all the tablets."] = "Lleva el Selbina Clay a los Stone Monuments de todo el mundo y copia sus escritos. Repite con los Stone Monuments restantes; la quest no se completa hasta que termines todas las tablillas.",
    ["Take the Starfall Tear back to Sigismund to complete the quest and receive a Fish Scale Shield."] = "Lleva la Starfall Tear de vuelta a Sigismund para completar la quest y recibir un Fish Scale Shield.",
    ["Take the Supplies Order to the tower at (I-11) in West Ronfaure and trade it to Phairet to receive the Batagreens. Trading him 50 gil also gets you the Batagreens, as long as the quest has been flagged."] = "Lleva el Supplies Order a la torre en (I-11) de West Ronfaure y entrégalo a Phairet para recibir el Batagreens. Darle 50 gil también te consigue el Batagreens, siempre que la quest esté activada.",
    ["Take the Tavnazia Pass back to Narcheral to complete the quest and receive your Blessed Hammer."] = "Lleva el Tavnazia Pass a Narcheral para completar la quest y recibir tu Blessed Hammer.",
    ["Take the elevator at (H-8) to the bottom level."] = "Toma el ascensor en (H-8) hasta el nivel inferior.",
    ["Take the elevator to the bottom level."] = "Toma el ascensor hasta el nivel inferior.",
    ["Take the ferry between Mhaura and Selbina and fish up Ocean Crab; they drop the Bronze Box you need."] = "Toma el ferry entre Mhaura y Selbina y pesca Ocean Crab; sueltan el Bronze Box que necesitas.",
    ["Take the first left and walk toward (I-6) on map 2 to use exit B, which puts you on map 1."] = "Toma la primera a la izquierda y camina hacia (I-6) en el mapa 2 para usar la salida B, que te deja en el mapa 1.",
    ["Take the letter to Windurst Waters and talk to Angelica at the Rarab Tail Hostelry. You receive the key items Angelica's letter and the painting \"Final Fantasy\", which she wants you to hang in the Temple of Uggalepih."] = "Lleva la carta a Windurst Waters y habla con Angelica en el Rarab Tail Hostelry. Recibes los key items Angelica's letter y el cuadro \"Final Fantasy\", que quiere que cuelgues en el Temple of Uggalepih.",
    ["Take the next airship to Jeuno. You must go through Jeuno's Air Travel Agency before delivering to the Tenshodo, or the package will be damaged and the quest failed."] = "Toma la siguiente airship a Jeuno. Debes pasar por la Air Travel Agency de Jeuno antes de entregar al Tenshodo, o el paquete se dañará y la quest fallará.",
    ["Take the northern Port Ephramad ferry to Nashmau and go through the North Gate to Caedarva Mire. Head northeast or northwest to the (I-6) zone line to Arrapago Reef."] = "Toma el ferry norte de Port Ephramad a Nashmau y atraviesa la North Gate hasta Caedarva Mire. Ve al noreste o noroeste hasta la línea de zona (I-6) a Arrapago Reef.",
    ["Take the note to Ipupu in West Sarutabaruta (I-8/J-8), near the entrance to Windurst Waters."] = "Lleva la nota a Ipupu en West Sarutabaruta (I-8/J-8), cerca de la entrada a Windurst Waters.",
    ["Take the package to any Imperial staging point except Nyzul Isle."] = "Lleva el paquete a cualquier Imperial staging point excepto Nyzul Isle.",
    ["Take the permit to Monarch Linn and complete the task there."] = "Lleva el permiso a Monarch Linn y completa allí la tarea.",
    ["Take the scroll to Horlais Peak (hot springs side) and trade it to the hot springs there. This transforms the scroll into a Scroll of Jubaku: Ichi and gives you the title Cracker of the Secret Code."] = "Lleva el pergamino a Horlais Peak (lado de las fuentes termales) y entrégalo a las fuentes termales de allí. Esto transforma el pergamino en un Scroll of Jubaku: Ichi y te da el título Cracker of the Secret Code.",
    ["Take the seals to their corresponding protocrystals and defeat the avatars."] = "Lleva los sellos a sus protocrystals correspondientes y derrota a los avatares.",
    ["Take the transport device at (H-9), then use the eastern transport device to enter the Alzadaal Undersea Ruins."] = "Toma el transport device en (H-9) y luego usa el transport device del este para entrar en las Alzadaal Undersea Ruins.",
    ["Talk to Abelard in Selbina (G-9) to receive some Selbina Clay. You need to be level 15 or higher. The mayor wants you to find the stone monuments left by a certain adventurer and copy their writings to clay."] = "Habla con Abelard en Selbina (G-9) para recibir algo de Selbina Clay. Debes ser nivel 15 o superior. El alcalde quiere que encuentres los monumentos de piedra que dejó cierto aventurero y copies sus escritos en arcilla.",
    ["Talk to Abquhbah to start the first trial. The quest is split into three parts, and you must wait until the next in-game day between each part."] = "Habla con Abquhbah para empezar la primera prueba. La quest se divide en tres partes, y debes esperar al siguiente día de juego entre cada parte.",
    ["Talk to Angelica again; she tells you to wear your item."] = "Habla de nuevo con Angelica; te dice que te pongas tu objeto.",
    ["Talk to Angelica and stand still for 10 seconds."] = "Habla con Angelica y quédate quieto durante 10 segundos.",
    ["Talk to Angelica one last time to complete the quest and receive Ancient Blood and Angelica's autograph."] = "Habla con Angelica una última vez para completar la quest y recibir Ancient Blood y el Angelica's autograph.",
    ["Talk to Bondada in the hat shop, Honoi-Gomoi in Gingerberry Grove (E-7) and Kenapa-Keppa in the Rhinostery (South map), since they react to the hat."] = "Habla con Bondada en la tienda de sombreros, Honoi-Gomoi en Gingerberry Grove (E-7) y Kenapa-Keppa en el Rhinostery (mapa sur), ya que reaccionan al sombrero.",
    ["Talk to Chemioue (J-6). If you have not done Petals for Parelbriaux and you are at Promathia Mission 3-5 or later, you may get that cutscene first."] = "Habla con Chemioue (J-6). Si no has hecho Petals for Parelbriaux y estás en la Promathia Mission 3-5 o posterior, puede que veas esa escena primero.",
    ["Talk to Despachiaire in Tavnazian Safehold (K-10), on the top floor. This quest follows Spice Gals and requires the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Despachiaire en Tavnazian Safehold (K-10), en el piso superior. Esta quest sigue a Spice Gals y requiere el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Talk to Despachiaire in Tavnazian Safehold (K-10, upper level), behind the Walnut Door at (K-9), to start the quest."] = "Habla con Despachiaire en Tavnazian Safehold (K-10, nivel superior), tras la Walnut Door en (K-9), para empezar la quest.",
    ["Talk to Enaremand in Tavnazian Safehold (J-7, Home Point #3), on the upper level. This quest follows It's Raining Mannequins and requires the Chains of Promathia pack. One last material is required to complete his final masterpiece, and the mannequin craftswoman in Mhaura may have clues."] = "Habla con Enaremand en Tavnazian Safehold (J-7, Home Point #3), en el nivel superior. Esta quest sigue a It's Raining Mannequins y requiere el pack Chains of Promathia. Falta un último material para completar su obra maestra final, y la artesana de mannequins de Mhaura puede tener pistas.",
    ["Talk to Equette (I-9, 2nd floor)."] = "Habla con Equette (I-9, 2.º piso).",
    ["Talk to Etteh Sulaej in Kazham (J-9). You need Kazham fame level 6 and the Rise of the Zilart pack, and this quest follows A Pose by Any Other Name. You receive the key item Letter to Angelica."] = "Habla con Etteh Sulaej en Kazham (J-9). Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Kazham y el pack Rise of the Zilart, y esta quest sigue a A Pose by Any Other Name. Recibes el key item Letter to Angelica.",
    ["Talk to Fari-Wari at the Shararat Teahouse in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) for a cutscene that begins the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack, and Gadalar must be present in Al Zahbi."] = "Habla con Fari-Wari en la Shararat Teahouse de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) para una escena que empieza la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan, y Gadalar debe estar presente en Al Zahbi.",
    ["Talk to Frescheque in Tavnazian Safehold (H-8, 3rd floor) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Frescheque en Tavnazian Safehold (H-8, 3.er piso) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Talk to Hagakoff, then go back to Abquhbah, then Hagakoff once more. Through these cutscenes you learn that Naja Salaheem's mace is rusty and needs to be cleaned, and that the best way is with Scourshrooms, found in Aydeewa Subterrane."] = "Habla con Hagakoff, luego vuelve con Abquhbah y otra vez con Hagakoff. Con estas escenas te enteras de que la maza de Naja Salaheem está oxidada y hay que limpiarla, y de que la mejor forma es con Scourshrooms, que se encuentran en Aydeewa Subterrane.",
    ["Talk to Jaucribaix in Norg (K-8), near the Captain's Chamber, while on Samurai to initiate the quest. You need to be a Samurai of level 40 or higher and have the Rise of the Zilart pack; this quest follows Forge Your Destiny. You may change to a different job to complete the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Jaucribaix en Norg (K-8), cerca de la Captain's Chamber, siendo Samurai para iniciar la quest. Debes ser Samurai de nivel 40 o superior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart; esta quest sigue a Forge Your Destiny. Puedes cambiar a otro trabajo para completar el resto de la quest.",
    ["Talk to Jonette on the middle floor, near the stream at (G-9)."] = "Habla con Jonette en el piso intermedio, cerca del arroyo en (G-9).",
    ["Talk to Maudaal in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (E-9) to start the quest. You receive a lengthy cutscene. You have been hired by Professor Clavauert B Chanoix to accompany him and his guinea toad, Salwa-Molwa, to Mamook to research the elusive Poroggo."] = "Habla con Maudaal en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (E-9) para empezar la quest. Recibes una escena larga. Te ha contratado el Professor Clavauert B Chanoix para acompañarle a él y a su cobaya sapo, Salwa-Molwa, a Mamook para investigar al esquivo Poroggo.",
    ["Talk to Mihli Aliapoh in Al Zahbi (H-7), who tells you to obtain a Colorful Hair."] = "Habla con Mihli Aliapoh en Al Zahbi (H-7), que te dice que consigas un Colorful Hair.",
    ["Talk to Nadeey at (K-7) inside the Walahra Temple. You may get a cutscene upon entry for The Rider Cometh."] = "Habla con Nadeey en (K-7) dentro del Walahra Temple. Puede que veas una escena al entrar por The Rider Cometh.",
    ["Talk to Naja Salaheem in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) to receive the Quartz transmitter."] = "Habla con Naja Salaheem en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para recibir el Quartz transmitter.",
    ["Talk to Naja Salaheem in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10). When presented an option, choose \"Balrahn Way\"."] = "Habla con Naja Salaheem en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10). Cuando te den una opción, elige \"Balrahn Way\".",
    ["Talk to Quelveuiat in Tavnazian Safehold (I-10, middle floor)."] = "Habla con Quelveuiat en Tavnazian Safehold (I-10, piso intermedio).",
    ["Talk to Raminey (J-7, 3rd floor)."] = "Habla con Raminey (J-7, 3.er piso).",
    ["Talk to Rubahah at (F-9) and repeat this process, and then do the same with Cacaroon at (G-11)."] = "Habla con Rubahah en (F-9) y repite este proceso, y luego haz lo mismo con Cacaroon en (G-11).",
    ["Talk to Ryoma in Norg (H-8), at Home Point #1, to begin the quest, then head to Port Bastok. You need to be a Ninja of level 40 or higher, Outlands fame level 1 and the Rise of the Zilart pack; this quest follows Ayame and Kaede. Norg has begun investigating an ancient scroll that was rediscovered recently."] = "Habla con Ryoma en Norg (H-8), junto al Home Point #1, para empezar la quest y luego ve a Port Bastok. Debes ser Ninja de nivel 40 o superior, tener el nivel 1 de fama de Outlands y el pack Rise of the Zilart; esta quest sigue a Ayame and Kaede. Norg ha empezado a investigar un pergamino antiguo que se redescubrió hace poco.",
    ["Talk to Saliyahf at (G-7)."] = "Habla con Saliyahf en (G-7).",
    ["Talk to Shamarhaan in Bastok Markets (F-9). You need to be level 30 or higher and have the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Shamarhaan en Bastok Markets (F-9). Debes ser nivel 30 o superior y tener el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Talk to Vuntar in Selbina (H-9). He will pay a premium price for rolanberries, but only for those that are thoroughly aged and can serve as food for long voyages."] = "Habla con Vuntar en Selbina (H-9). Pagará un precio superior por rolanberries, pero solo por las que estén completamente maduradas y sirvan de comida para viajes largos.",
    ["Talk to Washu. He gives you an Empty Barrel, which you need to fill with Opo-opo brew found in a Yhoator Jungle tree."] = "Habla con Washu. Te da un Empty Barrel, que debes llenar con Opo-opo brew que se encuentra en un árbol de Yhoator Jungle.",
    ["Talk to Zoriboh in Rabao (F-6)."] = "Habla con Zoriboh en Rabao (F-6).",
    ["Talk to one of your nation's gate guards at the city exits. Their names end in T.K. in San d'Oria, I.M. in Bastok, and W.W. in Windurst. Signet lets monsters drop crystals and earns you conquest points while you fight in the regions around the nations and Jeuno. It lasts a few hours at low rank, so renew it whenever you pass a guard."] = "Habla con uno de los guardias de puerta de tu nación en las salidas de la ciudad. Sus nombres terminan en T.K. en San d'Oria, I.M. en Bastok y W.W. en Windurst. Signet hace que los monstruos suelten cristales y te da puntos de conquest mientras luchas en las regiones alrededor de las naciones y Jeuno. Dura unas horas con rango bajo, así que renuévalo cada vez que pases junto a un guardia.",
    ["Talk to your Moogle. He says he found something and gives you a Small teacup. If he does not give it to you, you may not have waited long enough."] = "Habla con tu Moogle. Dice que encontró algo y te da una Small teacup. Si no te la da, puede que no hayas esperado lo suficiente.",
    ["Tapoh Lihzeh, Windurst Woods"] = "Tapoh Lihzeh, Windurst Woods",
    ["Teilsa (Port San d'Oria), Matildie (Northern San d'Oria), Ailevia (Southern San d'Oria)"] = "Teilsa (Port San d'Oria), Matildie (Northern San d'Oria), Ailevia (Southern San d'Oria)",
    ["Teleport to Bastok Mines Home Point #1, go inside the house (upper floor) at (J-7) and speak with Gumbah. Speak to him repeatedly until you get the cutscene that begins the quest. You must be level 30 or higher."] = "Teletranspórtate al Home Point #1 de Bastok Mines, entra en la casa (piso superior) en (J-7) y habla con Gumbah. Háblale repetidamente hasta que veas la escena que inicia la quest. Debes ser nivel 30 o superior.",
    ["Test tube #1 goes to Wajaom Woodlands (H-11), #2 to Wajaom Woodlands (G-11), #3 to Wajaom Woodlands (I-7), #4 to Wajaom Woodlands (J-8) and #5 to Bhaflau Thickets (G-7), on map 1."] = "El Test tube #1 va a Wajaom Woodlands (H-11), el #2 a Wajaom Woodlands (G-11), el #3 a Wajaom Woodlands (I-7), el #4 a Wajaom Woodlands (J-8) y el #5 a Bhaflau Thickets (G-7), en el mapa 1.",
    ["Thanks to the enemy destroying a bridge along the path of the attack, the unit assaulting Periqia is at an impasse. Mission orders: activate the bridge."] = "Como el enemigo destruyó un puente en la ruta del ataque, la unidad que asalta Periqia está en un punto muerto. Órdenes de la misión: activar el puente.",
    ["The ??? spot is always present at the far end of the cave, and you receive the key item once you touch it, so you do not need to defeat the Notorious Monsters: you can simply hold them while examining the spots. They no longer use draw-in according to the page, although a note says the Coeurl did use it several times when tested in 2024."] = "El lugar ??? siempre está presente al fondo de la cueva, y recibes el key item al tocarlo, así que no necesitas derrotar a los Notorious Monsters: puedes simplemente retenerlos mientras examinas los lugares. Según la página ya no usan draw-in, aunque una nota dice que el Coeurl lo usó varias veces al probarlo en 2024.",
    ["The ??? you are looking for is in the room at (C-5). Examine it to get the key item Sealed iron box."] = "La ??? que buscas está en la sala de (C-5). Examínala para obtener el key item Sealed iron box.",
    ["The Ancient tablet fragment is found by checking one of 5 ???s in the Quicksand Caves: (H-6), (H-10) and (E-9) on map 1, and (D-9) and (L-11) on map 2. As soon as the ??? is found, it instantly respawns in one of those 5 locations."] = "El Ancient tablet fragment se encuentra revisando una de 5 ???s en las Quicksand Caves: (H-6), (H-10) y (E-9) en el mapa 1, y (D-9) y (L-11) en el mapa 2. En cuanto se encuentra la ???, reaparece al instante en uno de esos 5 lugares.",
    ["The Bottled Punch Bug is consumed upon entry."] = "El Bottled Punch Bug se consume al entrar.",
    ["The Cardian you are looking for is the Five of Spades, at the outpost in Buburimu Peninsula. Go there and speak with Five of Spades."] = "El Cardian que buscas es el Five of Spades, en el outpost de Buburimu Peninsula. Ve allí y habla con Five of Spades.",
    ["The Cloister is at (F-5) in Cape Teriggan. Defeat Ogmios, who is a Manticore."] = "El Cloister está en (F-5) de Cape Teriggan. Derrota a Ogmios, que es un Manticore.",
    ["The Ding Bats and tombstone can be handled in either order."] = "Los Ding Bats y la tombstone se pueden resolver en cualquier orden.",
    ["The Immortals have captured a member of the Seagull Phratrie, a rebel organization. Escort the prisoner safely to a holding area."] = "Los Immortals han capturado a un miembro de la Seagull Phratrie, una organización rebelde. Escolta al prisionero hasta una zona de retención.",
    ["The Imperial Army on the eastern front is being hit by a peculiar cold wave, and warm uniforms are in short supply. Mission orders: buy black sheep."] = "El Imperial Army del frente oriental sufre una ola de frío peculiar y escasean los uniformes de abrigo. Órdenes de la misión: comprar ovejas negras.",
    ["The Lamiae are preparing to release swarms of chigoes in Al Zahbi to collect blood samples. Destroy the chigoes and thwart their plan. Mission orders: exterminate the chigoes."] = "Los Lamiae se preparan para soltar enjambres de chigoes en Al Zahbi para recoger muestras de sangre. Destruye los chigoes y frustra su plan. Órdenes de la misión: exterminar a los chigoes.",
    ["The Lamiae have hired Qiqirn demolition experts to set land mines in Periqia. Mission orders: clear the mine fields. The recommended level is 60."] = "Los Lamiae han contratado a expertos en demolición Qiqirn para colocar minas terrestres en Periqia. Órdenes de la misión: limpiar los campos de minas. El nivel recomendado es 60.",
    ["The Last Verse is recorded after completing Apocalypse Nigh."] = "The Last Verse se registra tras completar Apocalypse Nigh.",
    ["The Last Verse is recorded after completing Dawn."] = "The Last Verse se registra tras completar Dawn.",
    ["The Lumbering Horn comes from defeating Lumbering Lambert or Bloodtear Baldurf in La Theine Plateau; Bloodtear Baldurf is also a Records of Eminence objective under Combat: Region (Original Areas 1). It also comes from various battlefields."] = "El Lumbering Horn se consigue derrotando a Lumbering Lambert o Bloodtear Baldurf en La Theine Plateau; Bloodtear Baldurf también es un objetivo de Records of Eminence en Combat: Region (Original Areas 1). También se consigue en varios campos de batalla.",
    ["The Magicked astrolabe lets you open the doors in The Eldieme Necropolis by yourself."] = "El Magicked astrolabe te permite abrir tú solo las puertas de The Eldieme Necropolis.",
    ["The Mamool Ja Trainees are aggressive and link. Sagelord Molaal Ja himself does not aggro."] = "Los Mamool Ja Trainees son agresivos y se enlazan. Sagelord Molaal Ja en sí no ataca por aggro.",
    ["The Mamool Ja move around very frequently, which makes it difficult to avoid aggro."] = "Los Mamool Ja se mueven con mucha frecuencia, lo que dificulta evitar el aggro.",
    ["The Mega Bonanza Kupon is consumed upon entry when the battle is used to obtain these keys."] = "El Mega Bonanza Kupon se consume al entrar cuando la batalla se usa para obtener estas llaves.",
    ["The Mumeito is required for the Samurai artifact quest The Sacred Katana, so hold on to it. If you lose it, you have to pay Ranemaud 30,000 gil for a replacement."] = "La Mumeito es necesaria para la quest de artifact de Samurai The Sacred Katana, así que guárdala. Si la pierdes, tienes que pagar 30,000 gil a Ranemaud por una de reemplazo.",
    ["The NPC you are sent to requests a Velvet Cloth. Trade him a Velvet Cloth."] = "El NPC al que te envían pide una Velvet Cloth. Entrégale una Velvet Cloth.",
    ["The NPCs can be put to sleep while they are charmed, and can be healed and given non-party buffs while they are not under the control of Lamia No. 13."] = "Los NPCs pueden dormirse mientras están hechizados, y se les puede curar y dar buffs de fuera del grupo mientras no estén bajo el control de Lamia No. 13.",
    ["The Notorious Monsters stand guard in caves, have a fairly large aggro range, and respawn within about 5 minutes after being defeated."] = "Los Notorious Monsters vigilan en cuevas, tienen un rango de aggro bastante grande y reaparecen unos 5 minutos tras ser derrotados.",
    ["The Odontotyrannus monster is fished up; defeat it and it drops Odontotyrannus."] = "Se pesca el monstruo Odontotyrannus; derrótalo y suelta Odontotyrannus.",
    ["The Old Lady: Wild Rabbit Tail, Dhalmel Saliva, and Bloody Robe."] = "The Old Lady: Wild Rabbit Tail, Dhalmel Saliva y Bloody Robe.",
    ["The Oxblood Key can be used at the same coffer for its separate reward."] = "La Oxblood Key se puede usar en el mismo cofre para obtener su recompensa aparte.",
    ["The Periqia Pugils are scattered around the middle of the map and detect by sound. The Black Baron appears at random in one of several places (the middle area or one of the corner tunnels) and does not show on Widescan."] = "Los Periqia Pugils están repartidos por el centro del mapa y detectan por sonido. El Black Baron aparece al azar en uno de varios lugares (la zona central o uno de los túneles de las esquinas) y no sale en el Widescan.",
    ["The Pursuit of Paradise: travel to La Theine Plateau and examine ??? (G-6) at (G-6)."] = "The Pursuit of Paradise: viaja a La Theine Plateau y examina la ??? (G-6) en (G-6).",
    ["The Qiqirn Miners become hostile after an Orichalcum Ore has been mined, so it is recommended to use Invisible and run back to the starting NPC."] = "Los Qiqirn Miners se vuelven hostiles después de extraer un Orichalcum Ore, así que se recomienda usar Invisible y volver corriendo al NPC del inicio.",
    ["The Rampaging Horn comes from defeating Rampaging Ram or Steelfleece Baldarich in Konschtat Highlands, or from various battlefields."] = "El Rampaging Horn se consigue derrotando a Rampaging Ram o Steelfleece Baldarich en Konschtat Highlands, o en varios campos de batalla.",
    ["The Ronfaure dawndrop is obtained automatically."] = "La Ronfaure dawndrop se obtiene automáticamente.",
    ["The Sand Charm must be completed before you are offered this quest. Speak with Oswald in Selbina (I-9) to begin it."] = "Debes haber completado The Sand Charm antes de que se te ofrezca esta quest. Habla con Oswald en Selbina (I-9) para empezarla.",
    ["The Seed Afterglows periodically move within their general areas."] = "Los Seed Afterglows se desplazan periódicamente dentro de sus zonas generales.",
    ["The Tonberry key (Shantotto) from the A Shantotto Ascension missions is a temporary key item and does not do this. If you are having trouble resetting Tonberry Hate, you may have the wrong key item; check with Magephaud to see if he still requests the 3 beastcoins."] = "La Tonberry key (Shantotto) de las misiones A Shantotto Ascension es un key item temporal y no sirve para esto. Si tienes problemas para reiniciar el Tonberry Hate, puede que tengas el key item equivocado; consulta con Magephaud si aún pide las 3 beastcoins.",
    ["The Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud is exclusive and can be found by defeating most Mandragora-type enemies, including Tiny Mandragora in East Sarutabaruta and West Sarutabaruta."] = "El Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud es exclusivo y se puede conseguir derrotando a la mayoría de enemigos Mandragora-type, incluidos los Tiny Mandragora de East Sarutabaruta y West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["The Wandering Ghost that appears drops a Miner's Pendant, and the Pickaxe is still in your inventory."] = "El Wandering Ghost que aparece suelta un Miner's Pendant, y la Pickaxe sigue en tu inventario.",
    ["The available Orbs are Orb of Batons, Orb of Cups, Orb of Coins, and Orb of Swords."] = "Los Orbs disponibles son Orb of Batons, Orb of Cups, Orb of Coins y Orb of Swords.",
    ["The available staging points are Azouph Isle, Dvucca Isle, Mamool Ja, Halvung, and Ilrusi Atoll."] = "Los staging points disponibles son Azouph Isle, Dvucca Isle, Mamool Ja, Halvung e Ilrusi Atoll.",
    ["The battlefield has a 30-minute time limit."] = "El campo de batalla tiene un límite de 30 minutos.",
    ["The chest changes location when you leave the zone."] = "El cofre cambia de lugar cuando sales de la zona.",
    ["The corresponding [S] Cavernous Maw locations can also be used."] = "También se pueden usar las ubicaciones [S] correspondientes de los Cavernous Maws.",
    ["The corresponding [S] locations can also be used."] = "También se pueden usar las ubicaciones [S] correspondientes.",
    ["The curse dramatically lowers your maximum HP and MP."] = "La maldición reduce drásticamente tu HP y MP máximos.",
    ["The eight Sap types weaken the corresponding elemental Astral Flow abilities in the next battlefield."] = "Los ocho tipos de Sap debilitan las habilidades Astral Flow elementales correspondientes en el siguiente campo de batalla.",
    ["The enemies of this assault are Carrion monsters (Carrion Crabs, Carrion Leeches, Carrion Slimes and Carrion Toads), which detect by sound."] = "Los enemigos de este assault son monstruos Carrion (Carrion Crabs, Carrion Leeches, Carrion Slimes y Carrion Toads), que detectan por sonido.",
    ["The enemy of this assault is Lamia No. 13, who detects by sight and links."] = "El enemigo de este assault es Lamia No. 13, que detecta por vista y se enlaza.",
    ["The final reward also unlocks the ability to purchase Atma of Ambition."] = "La recompensa final también desbloquea la posibilidad de comprar Atma of Ambition.",
    ["The first Maw you examine carries you to the past."] = "El primer Maw que examines te lleva al pasado.",
    ["The first and easiest set of machines: go straight in when entering Beadeaux, then turn left (north) when you reach the wall at (F-7). Go north to the wall in (F-6), then due east to (H-6)."] = "El primer y más fácil conjunto de máquinas: ve recto al entrar en Beadeaux, luego gira a la izquierda (norte) al llegar a la pared en (F-7). Ve al norte hasta la pared en (F-6), luego directo al este hasta (H-6).",
    ["The goal is to find an NPC who tells you the switch order without talking to other NPCs who would call the guards to capture the Mithra and the Tarutaru friend. The following NPCs give clues about the switch order: Darha (ground floor, Galka near Home Point #2), Helmut (ground floor, Hume old man near Home Point #2), Hungry Wolf (upper floor, Craftsmen's Eatery, south of Cid's Lab) and Striking Snake (upper floor, Gunpowder Room, north of Cid's Lab)."] = "El objetivo es encontrar a un NPC que te diga el orden de los interruptores sin hablar con otros NPCs que llamarían a los guardias para capturar a la Mithra y al amigo Tarutaru. Los siguientes NPCs dan pistas sobre el orden de los interruptores: Darha (planta baja, Galka cerca del Home Point #2), Helmut (planta baja, anciano Hume cerca del Home Point #2), Hungry Wolf (piso superior, Craftsmen's Eatery, al sur del Cid's Lab) y Striking Snake (piso superior, Gunpowder Room, al norte del Cid's Lab).",
    ["The goal is to rescue the NPC Brujeel by tricking the Mamool Ja into breaking the impassable gates."] = "El objetivo es rescatar al NPC Brujeel engañando a los Mamool Ja para que rompan las puertas infranqueables.",
    ["The hot spring is in Korroloka Tunnel (G-9) on map 4."] = "La fuente termal está en Korroloka Tunnel (G-9) del mapa 4.",
    ["The key item Rivernewort is found at a ??? in either Riverne - Site #B01 or Riverne - Site #A01. To reach either you need Giant Scale(s), or the Home Point warps, to teleport through the Unstable Displacements."] = "El key item Rivernewort se encuentra en una ??? en Riverne - Site #B01 o en Riverne - Site #A01. Para llegar a cualquiera de ellos necesitas Giant Scale(s), o los warps de Home Point, para teletransportarte por los Unstable Displacements.",
    ["The key items are the Brand of the Springserpent, the Brand of the Galeserpent, the Brand of the Flameserpent, the Brand of the Skyserpent and the Brand of the Stoneserpent. They are permanent."] = "Los key items son el Brand of the Springserpent, el Brand of the Galeserpent, el Brand of the Flameserpent, el Brand of the Skyserpent y el Brand of the Stoneserpent. Son permanentes.",
    ["The key items are: Orcish crest in Monastic Cavern (J-6), Quadav crest in Qulun Dome (J-7) and Yagudo crest in Castle Oztroja (H-6). A ??? spot appears in each of these areas, close to True-Sight or True-Sound Notorious Monsters."] = "Los key items son: Orcish crest en Monastic Cavern (J-6), Quadav crest en Qulun Dome (J-7) y Yagudo crest en Castle Oztroja (H-6). En cada una de estas zonas aparece un lugar ???, cerca de Notorious Monsters con True-Sight o True-Sound.",
    ["The key items are: Round frigicite from Boreal Tiger at (I-5), Square frigicite from Boreal Coeurl at (J-6) and Triangular frigicite from Boreal Hound at (G-10)."] = "Los key items son: Round frigicite de Boreal Tiger en (I-5), Square frigicite de Boreal Coeurl en (J-6) y Triangular frigicite de Boreal Hound en (G-10).",
    ["The latent is broken when the elemental resistances listed in the Club of Trials description disappear from the elemental resistances shown under the equipped gear grid in the equipment window."] = "El latent está roto cuando las resistencias elementales indicadas en la descripción del Club of Trials desaparecen de las resistencias elementales que se muestran bajo la cuadrícula de equipo en la ventana de equipo.",
    ["The latent is broken when the elemental resistances listed in the Pole of Trials description disappear from the elemental resistances shown under the equipped gear grid in the equipment window."] = "El latent está roto cuando las resistencias elementales indicadas en la descripción de la Pole of Trials desaparecen de las resistencias elementales que se muestran bajo la cuadrícula de equipo en la ventana de equipo.",
    ["The level required to fight Maat is at least level 66."] = "El nivel requerido para luchar contra Maat es al menos el nivel 66.",
    ["The next part of the cutscene takes you to Nashmau Port, where you see Iruki's plan in action. You are then presented with 3 options."] = "La siguiente parte de la escena te lleva al Nashmau Port, donde ves el plan de Iruki en acción. Después te presentan 3 opciones.",
    ["The next part of this quest is long and leaves you stuck in a remote area, so bring either a Warp Ring or a Scroll of Instant Warp."] = "La siguiente parte de esta quest es larga y te deja atascado en una zona remota, así que lleva un Warp Ring o un Scroll of Instant Warp.",
    ["The opening cutscene gives you an Adventurer Coupon. Trade it to one of these NPCs for 50 gil. It can't be replaced if you lose it, so don't drop or sell it."] = "La escena inicial te da un Adventurer Coupon. Entrégalo a uno de estos NPCs por 50 gil. No se puede reemplazar si lo pierdes, así que no lo sueltes ni lo vendas.",
    ["The page gives these directions for the next part: follow the path to the T-intersection and head north, follow the path and exit the Temple, and once inside follow the path south to the ???."] = "La página da estas indicaciones para la siguiente parte: sigue el camino hasta la T-intersection y ve al norte, sigue el camino y sal del Temple, y una vez dentro sigue el camino al sur hasta la ???.",
    ["The party must choose a single leader by talking to the Imperial Guard at the Staging Point. 50 Imperial Standing can be exchanged for an Assault Armband, which is needed to lead the mission."] = "El grupo debe elegir un único líder hablando con el Imperial Guard del Staging Point. Se pueden cambiar 50 Imperial Standing por un Assault Armband, que hace falta para liderar la misión.",
    ["The prerequisite key items are shared between the three nations' Magicite missions, so only missing items need to be obtained."] = "Los key items previos se comparten entre las misiones de Magicite de las tres naciones, así que solo hay que obtener los que falten.",
    ["The quest Cook's Pride must be active."] = "La quest Cook's Pride debe estar activa.",
    ["The quest begins with either Joulet (for The Competition) or Gallijaux (for The Rivalry) in Port San d'Oria (H-8)."] = "La quest empieza con Joulet (para The Competition) o con Gallijaux (para The Rivalry) en Port San d'Oria (H-8).",
    ["The quest can also be completed without the Blazing Pepper: trade Paku-Nakku a remedy, go back to Maabu-Sonbu, who points you to Pechiru-Mashiru for advice, then go back to Paku-Nakku, choose \"The automaton butler did it!\" and get the reward from Pechiru-Mashiru. Trading the remedy locks you out of trading the Blazing Pepper."] = "La quest también se puede completar sin el Blazing Pepper: entrega un remedy a Paku-Nakku, vuelve con Maabu-Sonbu, que te remite a Pechiru-Mashiru para pedir consejo, luego vuelve con Paku-Nakku, elige \"The automaton butler did it!\" y recibe la recompensa de Pechiru-Mashiru. Entregar el remedy te impide entregar el Blazing Pepper.",
    ["The quest can be abandoned and re-accepted every minute without zoning. To be given a different female description, you must accept and then cancel the quest. It resets every minute at XX:XX:00 Earth time, not when you actually cancel it."] = "La quest se puede abandonar y volver a aceptar cada minuto sin cambiar de zona. Para que te den una descripción femenina distinta, debes aceptarla y luego cancelarla. Se reinicia cada minuto en XX:XX:00 hora terrestre, no cuando realmente la cancelas.",
    ["The quest can be repeated as many times as you want, but it requires zoning between each trade."] = "La quest se puede repetir tantas veces como quieras, pero requiere cambiar de zona entre cada entrega.",
    ["The quest can be repeated."] = "La quest se puede repetir.",
    ["The quest completes automatically once the final order is traded, so you do not need to speak with Kerutoto again."] = "La quest se completa automáticamente cuando se entrega el último pedido, así que no necesitas hablar de nuevo con Kerutoto.",
    ["The quest is marked complete after the cutscene. Speak with Leepe-Hoppe afterwards to receive a Cache-nez."] = "La quest se marca como completa tras la escena. Habla después con Leepe-Hoppe para recibir un Cache-nez.",
    ["The quest is only repeatable if the Evoker's Ring is dropped."] = "La quest solo se puede repetir si se tira el Evoker's Ring.",
    ["The quest is started by entering the Salaheem's Sentinels office in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10). Trade Abquhbah 5 Imperial Gold Pieces."] = "La quest se empieza entrando en la oficina de Salaheem's Sentinels en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10). Entrega a Abquhbah 5 Imperial Gold Pieces.",
    ["The quest is timed: if you take too long to return dressed in the requested item, it ends without success. You can try again by zoning out and back in."] = "La quest tiene límite de tiempo: si tardas demasiado en volver vestido con el objeto pedido, termina sin éxito. Puedes intentarlo de nuevo saliendo de la zona y volviendo a entrar.",
    ["The quest now shows up in your quests tab. Go to the Maze of Shakhrami and trade a Pickaxe to an Excavation Point to receive a Wyvern Egg."] = "La quest ya aparece en tu pestaña de quests. Ve a Maze of Shakhrami y entrega una Pickaxe a un Excavation Point para recibir un Wyvern Egg.",
    ["The quest's ??? is at (K-10), at the water's edge on map 2. Cast your buffs before you click it, as the NM Bukki that spawns uses Deafening Tantara (area Silence) immediately and often."] = "La ??? de la quest está en (K-10), en la orilla del agua en el mapa 2. Lanza tus buffs antes de hacer clic, ya que el NM Bukki que aparece usa Deafening Tantara (Silence de área) de inmediato y con frecuencia.",
    ["The quicker you return, the more money you get back. The time is measured in game hours, not Earth hours."] = "Cuanto antes vuelvas, más dinero recuperas. El tiempo se mide en horas de juego, no en horas terrestres.",
    ["The quickest way is the Home Point in the part of Mount Zhayolm just outside the chamber, or the Mount Zhayolm Unity warps (level 128 or 135)."] = "La forma más rápida es el Home Point de la parte de Mount Zhayolm justo fuera de la cámara, o los warps de Unity de Mount Zhayolm (nivel 128 o 135).",
    ["The recommended level is 99. The Nyzul Isle Uncharted Area is a 100-floor tower, with boss floors yielding increasingly powerful armor every 20 floors."] = "El nivel recomendado es 99. La Nyzul Isle Uncharted Area es una torre de 100 pisos, con pisos de jefe que dan armaduras cada vez más potentes cada 20 pisos.",
    ["The rest of this quest may be completed on any job. If you lose the battle, you may return to get another key item after one real life day (midnight JST)."] = "El resto de esta quest se puede completar con cualquier trabajo. Si pierdes el combate, puedes volver para obtener otro key item tras un día real (medianoche JST).",
    ["The rings can be synthesized with a Wind Crystal, and can also be signed with a Cyclone Crystal. Doing so with either removes the Rare and Exclusive attributes, and the rings can then be traded to another person, acting like a Wedding Ring."] = "Los anillos se pueden sintetizar con un Wind Crystal, y también se pueden firmar con un Cyclone Crystal. Hacerlo con cualquiera de los dos quita los atributos Rare y Exclusive, y los anillos pueden entregarse a otra persona, funcionando como un Wedding Ring.",
    ["The same rules apply as in the original quest: for example, weapon skill kills do not count."] = "Se aplican las mismas reglas que en la quest original: por ejemplo, las muertes con weapon skill no cuentan.",
    ["The small switch is at the Cermet Refinery (G-7). The medium switch is at the Replica (G-8) near the Metalworks entrance, next to the NPC Quasim. The large switch is at the kiln (F-8), just outside of the Blacksmithing Guild."] = "El interruptor pequeño está en el Cermet Refinery (G-7). El mediano está en el Replica (G-8) cerca de la entrada de Metalworks, junto al NPC Quasim. El grande está en el kiln (F-8), justo fuera del Blacksmithing Guild.",
    ["The standard riding time limit for a Chocobo is 30 minutes, which is not enough time to ride to Windurst unless you have equipped Orange Race Silks and/or a Chocobo Wand."] = "El límite de tiempo estándar de monta de un Chocobo es de 30 minutos, que no es suficiente para llegar a Windurst salvo que lleves equipadas Orange Race Silks y/o una Chocobo Wand.",
    ["The target is King Goldemar. He uses the regular dvergr weapon skills, among them Cackle, an area attack that lowers magic attack, magic defense and magic accuracy."] = "El objetivo es King Goldemar. Usa las weapon skills normales de los dvergr, entre ellas Cackle, un ataque de área que reduce el ataque mágico, la defensa mágica y la precisión mágica.",
    ["The three Magicite locations can be completed in any order."] = "Las tres ubicaciones de Magicite se pueden completar en cualquier orden.",
    ["The three Tiny Memory Fragments combine into the Large Memory Fragment and complete the quest."] = "Los tres Tiny Memory Fragments se combinan en el Large Memory Fragment y completan la quest.",
    ["The three objectives must be completed in order. Before entering Eldieme Necropolis alone, obtain a Magicked Astrolabe from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8) to open the required doors."] = "Los tres objetivos deben completarse en orden. Antes de entrar solo en Eldieme Necropolis, obtén un Magicked Astrolabe de Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8) para abrir las puertas necesarias.",
    ["The town you choose determines which path you will follow in Emissary from the Seas."] = "La ciudad que elijas determina qué camino seguirás en Emissary from the Seas.",
    ["The western door opens once the correct pair has been activated."] = "La puerta del oeste se abre cuando se activa el par correcto.",
    ["There are 3 gates, as marked on the map, and Brujeel is trapped in a pot beyond one of them."] = "Hay 3 puertas, como indica el mapa, y Brujeel está atrapado en una vasija tras una de ellas.",
    ["There are two ??? around the stronghold: one is used for Hawk Eye and the other for Slaughterhouse."] = "Hay dos ??? alrededor de la fortaleza: una se usa para Hawk Eye y la otra para Slaughterhouse.",
    ["There have been reports that Qiqirn hunters have been collecting the eggs of the army's messenger apkallus. Mission orders: drive out the hunters."] = "Se ha informado de que unos cazadores Qiqirn han estado recogiendo los huevos de los apkallus mensajeros del ejército. Órdenes de la misión: expulsar a los cazadores.",
    ["There is a rumor that orichalcum ore has been discovered in Leujaoam Sanctum. Mission orders: discover orichalcum ore. The recommended level is 50."] = "Se rumorea que se ha descubierto mineral de orichalcum en Leujaoam Sanctum. Órdenes de la misión: descubrir mineral de orichalcum. El nivel recomendado es 50.",
    ["Third Rubious Crystal:"] = "Tercer Rubious Crystal:",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Allied Ribbon of Glory or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Allied Ribbon of Glory o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Brass Ribbon of Service or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Brass Ribbon of Service o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Brass Wings of Service or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Brass Wings of Service o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Bronze Ribbon of Service or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Bronze Ribbon of Service o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Golden Star or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Golden Star o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Iron Emblem of Service or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Iron Emblem of Service o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Mythril Wings of Service or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Mythril Wings of Service o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Sterling Star or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Sterling Star o superior.",
    ["This quest cannot be completed while you are on Windurst Mission 8-1 or the quest Orastery Woes, so finish those first."] = "Esta quest no se puede completar mientras estás en la Windurst Mission 8-1 o en la quest Orastery Woes, así que termínalas primero.",
    ["This quest cannot be started if you have started Say It with Flowers or the mission The Price of Peace."] = "Esta quest no se puede empezar si has empezado Say It with Flowers o la misión The Price of Peace.",
    ["This quest cannot be started while you have the quests The Tenshodo Showdown, As Thick as Thieves, Hitting the Marquisate or Rock Racketeer, or Windurst Mission 2-1, active."] = "Esta quest no se puede empezar mientras tengas activas las quests The Tenshodo Showdown, As Thick as Thieves, Hitting the Marquisate o Rock Racketeer, o la Windurst Mission 2-1.",
    ["This quest does not appear in your quest list until it is completed."] = "Esta quest no aparece en tu lista de quests hasta que se completa.",
    ["This quest does not show up in your quest log until it is completed."] = "Esta quest no aparece en tu quest log hasta que se completa.",
    ["This quest follows Secrets of Ovens Lost and requires the Chains of Promathia pack. Speak with Despachiaire in Tavnazian Safehold (K-10). He has asked you to investigate the origin of his late wife's amulet."] = "Esta quest sigue a Secrets of Ovens Lost y requiere el pack Chains of Promathia. Habla con Despachiaire en Tavnazian Safehold (K-10). Te ha pedido que investigues el origen del amuleto de su difunta esposa.",
    ["This quest follows Tango with a Tracker and requires the Chains of Promathia pack. Speak with Despachiaire in Tavnazian Safehold (K-10)."] = "Esta quest sigue a Tango with a Tracker y requiere el pack Chains of Promathia. Habla con Despachiaire en Tavnazian Safehold (K-10).",
    ["This quest is repeatable, but it cannot be repeated if you have activated the quest Curses, Foiled A-Golem!?."] = "Esta quest es repetible, pero no se puede repetir si has activado la quest Curses, Foiled A-Golem!?.",
    ["This quest requires the Rise of the Zilart pack. Talk to Maat at (H-5) in Ru'Lude Gardens on each of the 15 jobs that existed before Treasures of Aht Urhgan, and defeat him with each one."] = "Esta quest requiere el pack Rise of the Zilart. Habla con Maat en (H-5) de Ru'Lude Gardens con cada uno de los 15 trabajos que existían antes de Treasures of Aht Urhgan, y derrótalo con cada uno.",
    ["Three more monuments exist in the Shadowreign: Vunkerl Inlet (S) at (E-12), Grauberg (S) at (F-5) and Fort Karugo-Narugo (S) at (E-7), outside the map. You can copy them with the Selbina Clay, but when you trade them there is no response from Abelard."] = "Existen tres monumentos más en la Shadowreign: Vunkerl Inlet (S) en (E-12), Grauberg (S) en (F-5) y Fort Karugo-Narugo (S) en (E-7), fuera del mapa. Puedes copiarlos con el Selbina Clay, pero al entregarlos no hay respuesta de Abelard.",
    ["To Bastok: Miratete's Memoirs at 31:00 to 32:29, a Chocobo Ticket at 32:30 to 34:43, Gysahl Greens at 34:44 or more."] = "A Bastok: Miratete's Memoirs entre 31:00 y 32:29, un Chocobo Ticket entre 32:30 y 34:43, Gysahl Greens a 34:44 o más.",
    ["To Jeuno: a Windurst Woods Glyph at 14:00 to 15:29, Gysahl Greens at 15:30 or more."] = "A Jeuno: un Windurst Woods Glyph entre 14:00 y 15:29, Gysahl Greens a 15:30 o más.",
    ["To Windurst: Miratete's Memoirs at 31:00 to 32:29, a Chocobo Ticket at 32:30 to 34:43, Gysahl Greens at 34:44 or more. To Jeuno: a Bastok Mines Glyph at 16:00 to 18:49, Gysahl Greens at 18:50 or more."] = "A Windurst: Miratete's Memoirs entre 31:00 y 32:29, un Chocobo Ticket entre 32:30 y 34:43, Gysahl Greens a 34:44 o más. A Jeuno: un Bastok Mines Glyph entre 16:00 y 18:49, Gysahl Greens a 18:50 o más.",
    ["To activate the Paladin quest Sharpening the Sword, trade the fishing rod back to Ailbeche. Doing so also changes your title to Family Counselor."] = "Para activar la quest de Paladin Sharpening the Sword, entrega la caña de pescar de vuelta a Ailbeche. Al hacerlo, tu título cambia a Family Counselor.",
    ["To activate this quest you must be on or past Promathia Mission 4-2 and have zoned into Riverne - Site B01. You need the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Para activar esta quest debes estar en la Promathia Mission 4-2 o más allá y haber entrado en Riverne - Site B01. Necesitas el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["To begin this quest in your log, you need the key item Serpent Rumors. It can be bought from Fennella in Port Windurst (C-8) for 95,000 Guild Points with Fishing rank Adept or higher. You can still obtain the other items needed for this quest before initiating it. You need the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Para empezar esta quest en tu registro, necesitas el key item Serpent Rumors. Se puede comprar a Fennella en Port Windurst (C-8) por 95,000 Guild Points con rango de Fishing Adept o superior. Aún puedes conseguir los demás objetos necesarios para esta quest antes de iniciarla. Necesitas el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["To begin this quest you first need a Damp Scroll. It can be fished up in Sea Serpent Grotto or bought at the Auction House. You need level 10 or higher, Outlands fame level 3 and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Para empezar esta quest primero necesitas una Damp Scroll. Se puede pescar en Sea Serpent Grotto o comprar en la Auction House. Necesitas nivel 10 o superior, el nivel 3 de fama de Outlands y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["To begin this quest you must have traded an Unlit Lantern to the Altar of Rancor and received a Rancor Flame at some point before; it helps to have a Rancor Flame on you. This quest follows A Question of Taste and requires the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Para empezar esta quest debes haber entregado antes una Unlit Lantern al Altar of Rancor y haber recibido una Rancor Flame; ayuda llevar una Rancor Flame encima. Esta quest sigue a A Question of Taste y requiere el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["To begin, speak with Brutus in Upper Jeuno (G-7) on any job at level 20 or higher. This starts the quest Chocobo on the Loose! first, and this quest follows it."] = "Para empezar, habla con Brutus en Upper Jeuno (G-7) con cualquier trabajo de nivel 20 o superior. Esto empieza primero la quest Chocobo on the Loose!, y esta quest la sigue.",
    ["To check which jobs you have beaten Maat with, enter the Feretory and speak with Teyrnon. Instincts associated with the jobs on which you have defeated Maat cost 5,000 Infamy instead of 10,000."] = "Para comprobar con qué trabajos has vencido a Maat, entra en el Feretory y habla con Teyrnon. Los Instincts asociados a los trabajos con los que has derrotado a Maat cuestan 5,000 Infamy en lugar de 10,000.",
    ["To collect it in its natural environment, locate the ??? on an overturned boat on the easternmost beach in Valkurm Dunes, called Siren Sands (H-9). You must first wait for dusty weather for the ??? to appear. Click it and you receive a Valkurm Sunsand."] = "Para recogerla en su entorno natural, localiza la ??? en un bote volcado en la playa más oriental de Valkurm Dunes, llamada Siren Sands (H-9). Primero debes esperar clima polvoriento para que aparezca la ???. Haz clic en ella y recibes una Valkurm Sunsand.",
    ["To craft the ingot, use a Fire Crystal with 4 Copper Ores."] = "Para fabricar el lingote, usa un Fire Crystal con 4 Copper Ores.",
    ["To face all five Ark Angels at once, examine Blank target (H-11) twice, then obtain an Ark Pentasphere."] = "Para enfrentarte a los cinco Ark Angels a la vez, examina dos veces el Blank target (H-11) y luego obtén una Ark Pentasphere.",
    ["To fight the Nepionic Soulflayer, gather your party and make sure everyone has an Imperial Silver Piece. Go to Nashmau, take the western exit to Caedarva Mire, head west to (E-11) and enter the Alzadaal Undersea Ruins by trading your Imperial Silver Piece to the guard."] = "Para luchar contra el Nepionic Soulflayer, reúne a tu grupo y asegúrate de que todos tengan una Imperial Silver Piece. Ve a Nashmau, toma la salida oeste a Caedarva Mire, ve al oeste hasta (E-11) y entra en las Alzadaal Undersea Ruins entregando tu Imperial Silver Piece al guardia.",
    ["To find Starmites, enter Toraimarai Canal by speaking with Seven of Diamonds in Windurst Walls (H-3). Go up the stairs at (I-9), then head west to (G-9), where the Starmites spawn."] = "Para encontrar Starmites, entra en Toraimarai Canal hablando con Seven of Diamonds en Windurst Walls (H-3). Sube las escaleras en (I-9) y ve al oeste hasta (G-9), donde aparecen los Starmites.",
    ["To get a Purple Ribbon, first speak with Roberta in the Nchaa's Good Goods shop in Windurst Woods (I-13)."] = "Para conseguir una Purple Ribbon, habla primero con Roberta en la tienda Nchaa's Good Goods de Windurst Woods (I-13).",
    ["To increase production of special nighttime camouflage, the Imperial marines need large quantities of a secretion from a rare cephalopod known as the ahtapot, found on Ilrusi Atoll. Mission orders: collect ahtapot."] = "Para aumentar la producción de camuflaje nocturno especial, los marines Imperial necesitan grandes cantidades de una secreción de un cefalópodo raro conocido como ahtapot, que se encuentra en Ilrusi Atoll. Órdenes de la misión: recoger ahtapot.",
    ["To pass the Banishing Gates alone, take a Pouch of weighted stones from the ??? on the ground on map 1 (G-8)."] = "Para pasar las Banishing Gates en solitario, toma una Pouch of weighted stones de la ??? del suelo del mapa 1 (G-8).",
    ["To progress further you need a Mutton Tortilla, Habaneros and a serving of Black Curry."] = "Para avanzar necesitas una Mutton Tortilla, Habaneros y una ración de Black Curry.",
    ["To repeat it, you must zone each time you finish before the quest is offered to you again."] = "Para repetirla, debes cambiar de zona cada vez que termines antes de que te vuelvan a ofrecer la quest.",
    ["To repeat the quest you must trade a Sobbing Fungus."] = "Para repetir la quest debes entregar un Sobbing Fungus.",
    ["To repeat the quest you must wait until the next Conquest update."] = "Para repetir la quest debes esperar hasta la siguiente actualización de Conquest.",
    ["To repeat the quest, drop your current earring and receive the quest again at the unmarked target (G/H-11) in the main entrance of The Shrine of Ru'Avitau. It appears as a second Divine Might quest in your quest log with a different description."] = "Para repetir la quest, tira tu pendiente actual y recibe la quest de nuevo en el unmarked target de (G/H-11) en la entrada principal de The Shrine of Ru'Avitau. Aparece como una segunda quest Divine Might en tu registro de quests con una descripción distinta.",
    ["To save travel time to the Cloister of Frost, you can use the Mini tuning fork of ice from the quest Trial-Size Trial by Ice. You must be on Summoner as your main job: get the Mini tuning fork from Castilchat, trade the fork back to Castilchat, and enter the Protocrystal normally. As long as you do not clear the level 20 version, you may warp to the Cloister as many times as you like."] = "Para ahorrar tiempo de viaje al Cloister of Frost, puedes usar el Mini tuning fork of ice de la quest Trial-Size Trial by Ice. Debes tener Summoner como trabajo principal: consigue el Mini tuning fork de Castilchat, entrégalo de vuelta a Castilchat y entra en el Protocrystal con normalidad. Mientras no completes la versión de nivel 20, puedes teletransportarte al Cloister tantas veces como quieras.",
    ["To save travel time to the Cloister of Tremors, you can use the Mini tuning fork of earth from the quest Trial-Size Trial by Earth. You must be on Summoner as your main job: get the Mini tuning fork from Ferrol, trade the fork back to Ferrol, and enter the Protocrystal normally. As long as you do not clear the level 20 version of the battlefield, you may warp to the Cloister as many times as you wish."] = "Para ahorrar tiempo de viaje al Cloister of Tremors, puedes usar el Mini tuning fork of earth de la quest Trial-Size Trial by Earth. Debes tener Summoner como trabajo principal: consigue el Mini tuning fork de Ferrol, entrégalo de vuelta a Ferrol y entra en el Protocrystal con normalidad. Mientras no completes la versión de nivel 20 del campo de batalla, puedes teletransportarte al Cloister tantas veces como quieras.",
    ["To save travel time to the Cloister, use the Mini Fork of Fire from Trial-Size Trial by Fire: be on Summoner as your main job, get the Mini Tuning Fork from Dodmos, trade it back to Dodmos, and enter the Protocrystal normally. As long as you do not clear the level 20 version of the battlefield, you may warp to the Cloister as many times as you wish."] = "Para ahorrar viaje hasta la Cloister, usa el Mini Fork of Fire de Trial-Size Trial by Fire: ten Summoner como trabajo principal, consigue el Mini Tuning Fork de Dodmos, entrégaselo de vuelta a Dodmos y entra al Protocrystal con normalidad. Mientras no completes la versión de nivel 20 del campo de batalla, puedes teletransportarte a la Cloister las veces que quieras.",
    ["To save travel time to the Cloister, use the Mini Fork of Ltn given by Trial-Size Trial by Lightning: be on Summoner as your main job, get the Mini Tuning Fork from Lacia, trade it back to her, and enter the Protocrystal normally."] = "Para ahorrar viaje hasta la Cloister, usa el Mini Fork of Ltn que da Trial-Size Trial by Lightning: ten Summoner como trabajo principal, consigue el Mini Tuning Fork de Lacia, entrégaselo de vuelta y entra al Protocrystal con normalidad.",
    ["To save travel time to the Cloister, use the Mini Fork of Wind from Trial-Size Trial by Wind: be on Summoner as your main job, get the Mini Tuning Fork from Rahi Fohlatti, trade it back to her, and enter the Protocrystal normally. As long as you do not clear the level 20 version of the battlefield, you may warp to the Cloister as many times as you wish."] = "Para ahorrar viaje hasta la Cloister, usa el Mini Fork of Wind de Trial-Size Trial by Wind: ten Summoner como trabajo principal, consigue el Mini Tuning Fork de Rahi Fohlatti, entrégaselo de vuelta y entra al Protocrystal con normalidad. Mientras no completes la versión de nivel 20 del campo de batalla, puedes teletransportarte a la Cloister las veces que quieras.",
    ["To save travel time to the Cloister, use the Mini Tuning Fork given by the quest Trial-Size Trial by Water. As long as you do not clear the level 20 version of the battlefield, you may warp to the Cloister as many times as you wish."] = "Para ahorrar viaje hasta la Cloister, usa el Mini Tuning Fork que da la quest Trial-Size Trial by Water. Mientras no completes la versión de nivel 20 del campo de batalla, puedes teletransportarte a la Cloister las veces que quieras.",
    ["To start this quest you must first trade the fishing rod from Father and Son back to Ailbeche. You need to be a Paladin of level 40 or higher, and to have completed A Knight's Test."] = "Para empezar esta quest debes entregar antes a Ailbeche la caña de pescar de Father and Son. Debes ser Paladin de nivel 40 o superior y haber completado A Knight's Test.",
    ["To synergize Astral Matter you must gather six stones from ??? spots in the matching cloisters: Flamestone from the Cloister of Flames, Froststone from the Cloister of Frost, Galestone from the Cloister of Gales, Tremorstone from the Cloister of Tremors, Stormstone from the Cloister of Storms and Tidestone from the Cloister of Tides."] = "Para sintetizar Astral Matter debes reunir seis piedras de lugares ??? en los cloisters correspondientes: Flamestone del Cloister of Flames, Froststone del Cloister of Frost, Galestone del Cloister of Gales, Tremorstone del Cloister of Tremors, Stormstone del Cloister of Storms y Tidestone del Cloister of Tides.",
    ["To take part in Campaign Ops you must have joined your nation's campaign faction and have an Op Credit. One Op Credit is granted per Vana'diel day and the NPC can store up to 7. Below level 10 you earn Allied Notes but no experience points."] = "Para participar en las Campaign Ops debes haberte unido a la facción de campaña de tu nación y tener un Op Credit. Se concede un Op Credit por día de Vana'diel y el NPC puede guardar hasta 7. Por debajo del nivel 10 ganas Allied Notes pero no puntos de experiencia.",
    ["To win this assault, subdue at least one Lamia or Merrow by breaking its weapon."] = "Para ganar este assault, somete al menos a una Lamia o Merrow rompiéndole el arma.",
    ["Together with your party, travel to North Gustaberg and locate the Galka Hunting Bear at (F-8), near the waterfalls."] = "Junto con tu grupo, viaja a North Gustaberg y localiza al Galka Hunting Bear en (F-8), cerca de las cascadas.",
    ["Touch another Peculiar Rootprints in North Gustaberg (S) at (E-11), close to where Campaign Arbiters teleport you."] = "Toca otras Peculiar Rootprints en North Gustaberg (S) en (E-11), cerca de donde te teletransportan los Campaign Arbiters.",
    ["Touch the ??? between 16:00 and 18:00 in-game time to complete the quest."] = "Toca la ??? entre las 16:00 y las 18:00 hora del juego para completar la quest.",
    ["Touch the ??? to obtain Gulemont's document."] = "Toca la ??? para obtener el Gulemont's document.",
    ["Touch the Cermet Headstone in The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (I-7) with the key item from that mission in your possession."] = "Toca el Cermet Headstone de The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (I-7) con el key item de esa misión en tu poder.",
    ["Touch the Peculiar Rootprints in Rolanberry Fields (S) at (H-14). The Rolanberry Fields (S) Survival Guide is the fastest way; second best is to teleport to the stronghold in Pashhow Marshlands (S) and zone into Rolanberry Fields (S)."] = "Toca las Peculiar Rootprints en Rolanberry Fields (S) en (H-14). La Survival Guide de Rolanberry Fields (S) es la forma más rápida; la segunda mejor es teletransportarte a la fortaleza de Pashhow Marshlands (S) y entrar en Rolanberry Fields (S).",
    ["Touch the monument for an event."] = "Toca el monument para ver un evento.",
    ["Touch the third and final Peculiar Rootprints in Meriphataud Mountains (S) at (L-4), near the zone line to The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah. The Meriphataud Mountains (S) Survival Guide and Recall-Meriph are both good ways to get there."] = "Toca las terceras y últimas Peculiar Rootprints en Meriphataud Mountains (S) en (L-4), cerca de la línea de zona a The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah. La Survival Guide de Meriphataud Mountains (S) y Recall-Meriph son buenas formas de llegar.",
    ["Trade 10 gil to Nouveil nearby to receive a Blessed Waterskin."] = "Entrega 10 gil a Nouveil, cerca, para recibir un Blessed Waterskin.",
    ["Trade 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces to Abquhbah to start the first trial. Trial 1, Memory: you are shown a scene for a short period of time and then asked questions about it. Get them all right to pass. In scene 1 you are asked what kind of critters were shown to you."] = "Entrega 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces a Abquhbah para empezar la primera prueba. Prueba 1, Memory: te muestran una escena durante un breve tiempo y luego te hacen preguntas sobre ella. Acierta todas para superarla. En la escena 1 te preguntan qué tipo de bichos te mostraron.",
    ["Trade 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces to Abquhbah to start the second trial. Trial 2, Proof of competence: any unwearable Aht Urhgan beastmen weapon or armor will work."] = "Entrega 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces a Abquhbah para empezar la segunda prueba. Prueba 2, Proof of competence: cualquier arma o armadura de beastmen de Aht Urhgan que no se pueda equipar sirve.",
    ["Trade 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces to Abquhbah to start the third trial. Trial 3, Trivia."] = "Entrega 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces a Abquhbah para empezar la tercera prueba. Prueba 3, Trivia.",
    ["Trade 2 Shaman Garlic (needs fame level 3)"] = "Entrega 2 Shaman Garlic (requiere nivel de fama 3)",
    ["Trade 3 Beehive Chips (150 gil) or 2 Remi Shells (200 gil)"] = "Entrega 3 Beehive Chips (150 gil) o 2 Remi Shells (200 gil)",
    ["Trade 3 Imperial Gold Pieces to Abquhbah, who gives you the Officer Academy manual."] = "Entrega 3 Imperial Gold Pieces a Abquhbah, que te da el Officer Academy manual.",
    ["Trade 3 Lufet Salt"] = "Entrega 3 Lufet Salt",
    ["Trade 3 Zeruhn Soot"] = "Entrega 3 Zeruhn Soot",
    ["Trade 4 Flint Stones"] = "Entrega 4 Flint Stones",
    ["Trade 4 Yagudo Necklaces from the Yagudo in Giddeus"] = "Entrega 4 Yagudo Necklaces de los Yagudo de Giddeus",
    ["Trade 4 more Honey, one at a time, to Zayhi-Bauhi."] = "Entrega 4 Honey más, una a una, a Zayhi-Bauhi.",
    ["Trade 5 Rusty Buckets, a common fishing catch"] = "Entrega 5 Rusty Buckets, una captura común al pescar",
    ["Trade 5 pots of honey (needs fame level 2)"] = "Entrega 5 tarros de miel (requiere nivel de fama 2)",
    ["Trade Ailbeche a Giant Shell Bug. You can buy one at the Auction House, or go to Crawlers' Nest and defeat Dreadbug through the ???. Dreadbug can be spawned again once per game day while the quest is active."] = "Entrega a Ailbeche un Giant Shell Bug. Puedes comprar uno en la Auction House, o ir a Crawlers' Nest y derrotar a Dreadbug a través de la ???. Dreadbug puede aparecer de nuevo una vez por día de juego mientras la quest esté activa.",
    ["Trade Beehive Chip x3 for 150 gil or Remi Shell x2 for 200 gil to Tapoh Lihzeh to complete the quest."] = "Entrega Beehive Chip x3 por 150 gil o Remi Shell x2 por 200 gil a Tapoh Lihzeh para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade Cacaroon 1,000 gil for another cutscene."] = "Entrega a Cacaroon 1,000 gil para otra escena.",
    ["Trade Coeurl Meat to Baudin in Upper Jeuno to obtain the Crest of Davoi."] = "Entrega Coeurl Meat a Baudin en Upper Jeuno para obtener el Crest of Davoi.",
    ["Trade Gerwitz's Axe to the ??? at (H-8) on map 3 to spawn Gerwitz's Sword (NM). Defeat it and it drops Gerwitz's Sword."] = "Entrega Gerwitz's Axe a la ??? en (H-8) del mapa 3 para invocar a Gerwitz's Sword (NM). Derrótalo y suelta Gerwitz's Sword.",
    ["Trade Giant Bird Feather x3 to Baren-Moren in a single trade to complete the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Entrega Giant Bird Feather x3 a Baren-Moren en una sola entrega para completar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
    ["Trade Irmilant in Rabao (G-7) the Broken Lu Shang's Rod, a Piece of Ancient Lumber and 2 Light Crystals."] = "Entrega a Irmilant en Rabao (G-7) la Broken Lu Shang's Rod, un Piece of Ancient Lumber y 2 Light Crystals.",
    ["Trade Iruki-Waraki 1 Sleeping Potion and 1 Chai."] = "Entrega a Iruki-Waraki 1 Sleeping Potion y 1 Chai.",
    ["Trade Jody's Acid to Pyopyoroon (H-7)."] = "Entrega Jody's Acid a Pyopyoroon (H-7).",
    ["Trade Lokpix the Tremorstone and one of the options to receive the key item Loadstone. The Loadstone lets you open the weighted doors in Quicksand Caves solo, without needing multiple players."] = "Entrega a Lokpix el Tremorstone y una de las opciones para recibir el key item Loadstone. La Loadstone te permite abrir las puertas de peso de Quicksand Caves tú solo, sin necesitar a varios jugadores.",
    ["Trade Melyon any one of those sets to complete the quest and receive between 100 and 600 gil. If you have already completed the quest at least once, you do not need to speak to him again to start it; you can simply trade the items again."] = "Entrega a Melyon cualquiera de esos lotes para completar la quest y recibir entre 100 y 600 gil. Si ya has completado la quest al menos una vez, no hace falta hablar de nuevo con él para empezarla; basta con entregar otra vez los objetos.",
    ["Trade Mhebi Juhbily in Kazham (I-10) a Sandfish. You need Kazham fame level 6 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. When asked, tell her you give it to her. Then check the shed behind her for a cutscene."] = "Entrega un Sandfish a Mhebi Juhbily en Kazham (I-10). Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Kazham y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Cuando te pregunten, dile que se lo das. Luego revisa el cobertizo que hay tras ella para una escena.",
    ["Trade Novalmauge a Dahlia to receive a Neutralizer."] = "Entrega una Dahlia a Novalmauge para recibir un Neutralizer.",
    ["Trade Novalmauge a vial of Beastman Blood to complete the quest."] = "Entrega a Novalmauge un vial de Beastman Blood para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade Orlando eight of any one of the items to complete the quest and receive 100 to 900 gil, depending on the item. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega a Orlando ocho de cualquiera de los objetos para completar la quest y recibir de 100 a 900 gil, según el objeto. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade Oswald a Danceshroom to complete the quest and receive the Sleep Dagger. Danceshrooms can be bought at the Auction House under Food, Ingredients."] = "Entrega a Oswald una Danceshroom para completar la quest y recibir la Sleep Dagger. Las Danceshrooms se pueden comprar en la Auction House en Food, Ingredients.",
    ["Trade Oswald a Shall Shell to complete the quest. You receive the Glass Fiber Fishing Rod and the title The Love Doctor."] = "Entrega a Oswald un Shall Shell para completar la quest. Recibes la Glass Fiber Fishing Rod y el título The Love Doctor.",
    ["Trade Plumes d'Or to Machionage (C-6), Louxiard (G-7), Illeuse (H-9), Rongelouts N Distaud (I-9), Sabiliont (I-11), Elnonde (K-9), and Loillie (K-9 via the stairs at L-8)."] = "Entrega Plumes d'Or a Machionage (C-6), Louxiard (G-7), Illeuse (H-9), Rongelouts N Distaud (I-9), Sabiliont (I-11), Elnonde (K-9) y Loillie (K-9 por las escaleras en L-8).",
    ["Trade Quake Grenade x4 to the NPC who asks for them, to get a clue. You can skip this part and get the key item Bomb incense to fight the Chandelier, but you must turn in the Quake Grenades to clear the key item from Nanaa Mihgo so that she lets you complete the quest."] = "Entrega Quake Grenade x4 al NPC que los pide, para obtener una pista. Puedes saltarte esta parte y conseguir el key item Bomb incense para luchar contra el Chandelier, pero debes entregar las Quake Grenades para quitar el key item de Nanaa Mihgo y que te deje completar la quest.",
    ["Trade Qutiba three pots of White Honey for another cutscene and your reward, the Irmik Helvasi and additional recipes."] = "Entrega a Qutiba tres botes de White Honey para otra escena y tu recompensa, el Irmik Helvasi y recetas adicionales.",
    ["Trade Rabbit Hide x3 to Parvipon for your reward. Rabbit Hide is sold upstairs in the Leathercraft guild by Cletae (D-8)."] = "Entrega Rabbit Hide x3 a Parvipon para recibir tu recompensa. La Rabbit Hide se vende arriba en el Leathercraft guild por Cletae (D-8).",
    ["Trade Red Grass Cloth to Sassa-Kotassa."] = "Entrega Red Grass Cloth a Sassa-Kotassa.",
    ["Trade Suldiran 2 Imp Wings to complete the quest and receive 200 gil. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega 2 Imp Wings a Suldiran para completar la quest y recibir 200 gil. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade Taillegeas the items he requests to receive your reward, 4,000 gil. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega a Taillegeas los objetos que pide para recibir tu recompensa, 4,000 gil. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade Tokaka a Bastore Sardine to complete the quest and receive 70 gil."] = "Entrega a Tokaka una Bastore Sardine para completar la quest y recibir 70 gil.",
    ["Trade Tsetseroon a Tin Ore and a Cobalt Jellyfish. He gives you a Pot of Tsetseroon's stew."] = "Entrega a Tsetseroon un Tin Ore y una Cobalt Jellyfish. Te da un Pot of Tsetseroon's stew.",
    ["Trade Vounebariont 5 Beetle Shells to complete the quest and receive 750 gil. About 5 to 6 stacks of Beetle Shells raise your fame from around 1 up to the maximum of 9."] = "Entrega 5 Beetle Shells a Vounebariont para completar la quest y recibir 750 gil. Unas 5 o 6 pilas de Beetle Shells suben tu fama desde aproximadamente 1 hasta el máximo de 9.",
    ["Trade Washu a Bastore Sardine, a Frost Turnip, a piece of Giant Sheep Meat and a Hecteyes Eye to receive the key item Washu's tasty wurst."] = "Entrega a Washu un Bastore Sardine, un Frost Turnip, un trozo de Giant Sheep Meat y un Hecteyes Eye para recibir el key item Washu's tasty wurst.",
    ["Trade Zaldon certain fish and he will gut them for you. What you receive depends on the fish, and some of them earn a title. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega a Zaldon ciertos peces y te los destripará. Lo que recibes depende del pez, y algunos dan un título. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade a Bird Feather and a Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud"] = "Entrega una Bird Feather y un Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud",
    ["Trade a Copper Ring to Roh Latteh in Bastok Mines and bring back the letter unopened"] = "Entrega un Copper Ring a Roh Latteh en Bastok Mines y devuelve la carta sin abrir",
    ["Trade a Cornette for 200 gil. It drops from the Mandragora and Pygmaioi enemies above, and can also be bought for 50 sparks from the Records of Eminence NPCs, or from Harmodios in Bastok Markets (K-10) when Bastok is 1st or 2nd in Conquest."] = "Entrega una Cornette por 200 gil. La sueltan los enemigos Mandragora y Pygmaioi anteriores, y también se puede comprar por 50 sparks a los NPCs de Records of Eminence, o a Harmodios en Bastok Markets (K-10) cuando Bastok está en 1st o 2nd en Conquest.",
    ["Trade a Deathball to Mashuu-Ajuu to receive a Stationery Set and 700 gil, or a Sobbing Fungus to receive a Stationery Set and 500 gil."] = "Entrega un Deathball a Mashuu-Ajuu para recibir un Stationery Set y 700 gil, o un Sobbing Fungus para recibir un Stationery Set y 500 gil.",
    ["Trade a Dream Flower Petal to Habida-Jubida."] = "Entrega un Dream Flower Petal a Habida-Jubida.",
    ["Trade a Flint Stone to Charred Firewood two levels above and north of the (I-7) tower."] = "Entrega una Flint Stone a Charred Firewood, dos niveles por encima y al norte de la torre (I-7).",
    ["Trade a Four-Leaf Mandragora Bud for 120 gil. It drops from Mandragora enemies in West Sarutabaruta, Pygmaioi enemies in Tahrongi Canyon and Sylvestre enemies in Buburimu Peninsula."] = "Entrega un Four-Leaf Mandragora Bud por 120 gil. Lo sueltan enemigos Mandragora en West Sarutabaruta, enemigos Pygmaioi en Tahrongi Canyon y enemigos Sylvestre en Buburimu Peninsula.",
    ["Trade a Galkan Sausage"] = "Entrega una Galkan Sausage",
    ["Trade a Hydrangea to Fari-Wari."] = "Entrega una Hydrangea a Fari-Wari.",
    ["Trade a King Truffle to Hilda to receive the Steaming Sheep invitation. King Truffle can be found at the Auction House, in Voidwatch, or dropped by some Funguar enemies in Crawlers' Nest."] = "Entrega un King Truffle a Hilda para recibir la Steaming Sheep invitation. El King Truffle se puede encontrar en la Auction House, en Voidwatch o lo sueltan algunos enemigos Funguar en Crawlers' Nest.",
    ["Trade a Lilac to Weathered Gravestone (I-10)."] = "Entrega un Lilac a la Weathered Gravestone (I-10).",
    ["Trade a Mythril Pick to the same unnamed target for the final cutscene and your reward: the Map of Mount Zhayolm (if you do not already own it), 2,000 experience points and 2,000 gil."] = "Entrega un Mythril Pick al mismo objetivo sin nombre para la escena final y tu recompensa: el Map of Mount Zhayolm (si aún no lo tienes), 2,000 puntos de experiencia y 2,000 gil.",
    ["Trade a Pickaxe to the same unnamed target for another cutscene."] = "Entrega un Pickaxe al mismo objetivo sin nombre para otra escena.",
    ["Trade a Quadav Helm to Goraow to complete the quest and receive 900 gil. You can repeat it without zoning."] = "Entrega un Quadav Helm a Goraow para completar la quest y recibir 900 gil. Puedes repetirla sin cambiar de zona.",
    ["Trade a Stygian Ash to the Odyssean Passage."] = "Entrega un Stygian Ash al Odyssean Passage.",
    ["Trade a Sutlac to Totoroon."] = "Entrega un Sutlac a Totoroon.",
    ["Trade a Three-Leaf Mandragora Bud for 1,200 gil. It drops from Yuhtunga Mandragora enemies in Yuhtunga Jungle."] = "Entrega un Three-Leaf Mandragora Bud por 1,200 gil. Lo sueltan enemigos Yuhtunga Mandragora en Yuhtunga Jungle.",
    ["Trade a Yagudo Drink to Sheelala."] = "Entrega un Yagudo Drink a Sheelala.",
    ["Trade a Yuhtunga Sulfur for 250 gil. It drops from the same enemies as the Four-Leaf Mandragora Bud."] = "Entrega un Yuhtunga Sulfur por 250 gil. Lo sueltan los mismos enemigos que el Four-Leaf Mandragora Bud.",
    ["Trade a piece of Rosewood Lumber to Jatan-Paratan to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Entrega una pieza de Rosewood Lumber a Jatan-Paratan para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade all 12 Vellum to Erlene (J-8)."] = "Entrega los 12 Vellum a Erlene (J-8).",
    ["Trade all 3 items to Leepe-Hoppe at once to complete the quest and receive 4,000 gil. Speak with Leepe-Hoppe again to start the quest Tuning Out."] = "Entrega los 3 objetos a Leepe-Hoppe a la vez para completar la quest y recibir 4,000 gil. Habla de nuevo con Leepe-Hoppe para empezar la quest Tuning Out.",
    ["Trade all five fish to Ququroon to complete the quest and receive a Nashmau Stew. There is a small chance that he fails to make the stew: the quest still counts as completed, but you do not receive the reward. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega los cinco pescados a Ququroon para completar la quest y recibir un Nashmau Stew. Hay una pequeña probabilidad de que no consiga hacer el estofado: la quest cuenta igualmente como completada, pero no recibes la recompensa. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade all four ingredients to Ranpi-Monpi and wait one Vana'diel day."] = "Entrega los cuatro ingredientes a Ranpi-Monpi y espera un día de Vana'diel.",
    ["Trade all six pieces to Hedrov (H-7)."] = "Entrega las seis piezas a Hedrov (H-7).",
    ["Trade all three Seedspalls to ??? (G-6)."] = "Entrega los tres Seedspalls a la ??? (G-6).",
    ["Trade an Imp Wing to Naja Salaheem in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) to complete the quest and receive the key item PFC Wildcat badge, which gives access to PFC Assaults."] = "Entrega un Imp Wing a Naja Salaheem en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para completar la quest y recibir el key item PFC Wildcat badge, que da acceso a los PFC Assaults.",
    ["Trade both armor pieces to Scarred Shark (G-5)."] = "Entrega ambas piezas de armadura a Scarred Shark (G-5).",
    ["Trade both horns to Paujean to complete the quest."] = "Entrega ambos cuernos a Paujean para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade either Silk Thread x3 or Crawler Calculus x3 to Illu Bohjaa to complete the quest and receive 600 gil."] = "Entrega Silk Thread x3 o Crawler Calculus x3 a Illu Bohjaa para completar la quest y recibir 600 gil.",
    ["Trade her a Ladybug Wing for a cutscene and to receive your reward."] = "Entrégale un Ladybug Wing para una escena y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade him 70 gil to receive the Blue Peas."] = "Dale 70 gil para recibir el Blue Peas.",
    ["Trade him a Gold Hairpin for a cutscene. A Gold Hairpin +1 will not work."] = "Entrégale una Gold Hairpin para una escena. Una Gold Hairpin +1 no sirve.",
    ["Trade him a Merrow Scale to complete the quest and receive Merrow No.17's Locket."] = "Entrégale una Merrow Scale para completar la quest y recibir el Merrow No.17's Locket.",
    ["Trade him five pieces of the same type of onion equipment to complete the quest. You receive a Wastebasket and the title Ecologist."] = "Entrégale cinco piezas del mismo tipo de equipo onion para completar la quest. Recibes una Wastebasket y el título Ecologist.",
    ["Trade him the 2 Shaman Garlic to complete the quest and receive 900 gil."] = "Entrégale los 2 Shaman Garlic para completar la quest y recibir 900 gil.",
    ["Trade him the Bone Chip to complete the quest and receive the Map of the Dangruf Wadi."] = "Entrégale el Bone Chip para completar la quest y recibir el Map of the Dangruf Wadi.",
    ["Trade him the gil he asks for, between 10,000 and 30,000 gil. This earns you the title Gullible's Travels."] = "Entrégale el gil que te pide, entre 10,000 y 30,000 gil. Esto te da el título Gullible's Travels.",
    ["Trade him the item and he tells you to go to Aydeewa Subterrane."] = "Entrégale el objeto y te dice que vayas a Aydeewa Subterrane.",
    ["Trade him the two Cluster Cores to receive your reward, the Shu'Meyo Salt. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrégale los dos Cluster Cores para recibir tu recompensa, el Shu'Meyo Salt. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade him the two ores to end the quest and receive 8,000 gil. You may immediately repeat the quest."] = "Entrégale los dos minerales para terminar la quest y recibir 8,000 gil. Puedes repetir la quest de inmediato.",
    ["Trade in your Adventurer Coupon"] = "Entrega tu Adventurer Coupon",
    ["Trade one Giant Scale to Unstable Displacement (G-10) at (G-10)."] = "Entrega una Giant Scale al Unstable Displacement (G-10) en (G-10).",
    ["Trade one Lufet Salt, then another, to complete the required sequence."] = "Entrega una Lufet Salt y luego otra para completar la secuencia requerida.",
    ["Trade one to four of these items to Ambrosius in a single trade to complete the quest: 1 gives 50 gil, 2 give 150 gil, 3 give 250 gil and 4 give 500 gil."] = "Entrega de uno a cuatro de estos objetos a Ambrosius en una sola entrega para completar la quest: 1 da 50 gil, 2 dan 150 gil, 3 dan 250 gil y 4 dan 500 gil.",
    ["Trade the 108-Knot Quipu to Bulwark Gate (F-6)."] = "Entrega la 108-Knot Quipu a la Bulwark Gate (F-6).",
    ["Trade the 3 Zeruhn Soot to Gerbaum for your reward, 150 gil."] = "Entrega las 3 Zeruhn Soot a Gerbaum para recibir tu recompensa, 150 gil.",
    ["Trade the 4 Flint Stones to Legata for your reward."] = "Entrega las 4 Flint Stones a Legata para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the 4 Ladybug Wings to Wyatt (L-6) to receive the reward."] = "Entrega las 4 Ladybug Wings a Wyatt (L-6) para recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Trade the 5 Hare Meat to Thierride to complete the quest."] = "Entrega los 5 Hare Meat a Thierride para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the 5 Rusty Buckets to Foss for your reward, 300 gil."] = "Entrega los 5 Rusty Buckets a Foss por tu recompensa, 300 gil.",
    ["Trade the Amaryllis to Valah Molkot to complete the quest."] = "Entrega la Amaryllis a Valah Molkot para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Animal Glue to Hakkuru-Rinkuru to complete the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Entrega el Animal Glue a Hakkuru-Rinkuru para completar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
    ["Trade the Antique Coin to the Dry Fountain at (H-8) for a cutscene."] = "Entrega la Antique Coin a la Dry Fountain en (H-8) para una escena.",
    ["Trade the Aspir Knife to Uu Zhoumo."] = "Entrega el Aspir Knife a Uu Zhoumo.",
    ["Trade the Bat Wing x2 to Secodiand to complete the quest and receive 200 gil."] = "Entrega la Bat Wing x2 a Secodiand para completar la quest y recibir 200 gil.",
    ["Trade the Beeswax x2 to Pagisalis for your reward."] = "Entrega la Beeswax x2 a Pagisalis para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the Beetle Shell and the Hecteyes Eye to Kopuro-Popuro to complete the quest and receive 600 gil."] = "Entrega la Beetle Shell y el Hecteyes Eye a Kopuro-Popuro para completar la quest y recibir 600 gil.",
    ["Trade the Bird Feather and the Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud to Moreno-Toeno to complete the quest and receive 250 gil."] = "Entrega la Bird Feather y el Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud a Moreno-Toeno para completar la quest y recibir 250 gil.",
    ["Trade the Black Tiger Fang x3 to Taumila in Southern San d'Oria (E-9) to complete the quest and receive 2,100 gil."] = "Entrega la Black Tiger Fang x3 a Taumila en Southern San d'Oria (E-9) para completar la quest y recibir 2,100 gil.",
    ["Trade the Blazing Pepper to Paku-Nakku, then speak with Paku-Nakku again."] = "Entrega el Blazing Pepper a Paku-Nakku y luego habla de nuevo con Paku-Nakku.",
    ["Trade the Blessed Waterskin to the Cheval River to obtain Cheval Water."] = "Entrega el Blessed Waterskin al Cheval River para obtener Cheval Water.",
    ["Trade the Bomb Ash to Benita to complete the quest."] = "Entrega el Bomb Ash a Benita para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Bomb Steel and the Sacred Branch to Jaucribaix."] = "Entrega el Bomb Steel y la Sacred Branch a Jaucribaix.",
    ["Trade the Bone Chip x2 and the Bomb Ash to Shantotto to complete the quest and receive a Brass Rod."] = "Entrega el Bone Chip x2 y el Bomb Ash a Shantotto para completar la quest y recibir una Brass Rod.",
    ["Trade the Bow of Trials back to Perih Vashai."] = "Entrega el Bow of Trials de vuelta a Perih Vashai.",
    ["Trade the Brass Hairpin to Romilda, who is standing next to Qiji."] = "Entrega la Brass Hairpin a Romilda, que está junto a Qiji.",
    ["Trade the Bronze Box to Naiko-Paneiko to complete the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Entrega el Bronze Box a Naiko-Paneiko para completar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
    ["Trade the Burnite Shell to Koru-Moru to complete the quest."] = "Entrega la Burnite Shell a Koru-Moru para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Castle Floor Plans back to Dauperiat for your reward."] = "Entrega los Castle Floor Plans a Dauperiat para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the Cernunnos Bulb to Amaura."] = "Entrega el Cernunnos Bulb a Amaura.",
    ["Trade the Cheval Water to Miageau to receive the Wing Pendant."] = "Entrega el Cheval Water a Miageau para recibir el Wing Pendant.",
    ["Trade the Cold Bone and Warm Egg to Koru-Moru for a cutscene."] = "Entrega el Cold Bone y el Warm Egg a Koru-Moru para una escena.",
    ["Trade the Copper Ingot to Michea to complete the quest and receive 180 gil. You can repeat it by zoning out of the area, but it is no longer repeatable once you reach Bastok fame level 2."] = "Entrega el Copper Ingot a Michea para completar la quest y recibir 180 gil. Puedes repetirla saliendo de la zona, pero ya no es repetible una vez alcanzas el nivel 2 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Trade the Copper Ring to Roh Latteh in Bastok Mines (H-7), in the first-floor house on Ore Street. When her dialogue ends, you obtain the key item Letter from Roh Latteh. If you check (read) the letter from your key item menu, you get a penalty and only half of the actual reward."] = "Entrega el Copper Ring a Roh Latteh en Bastok Mines (H-7), en la casa de la planta baja de Ore Street. Cuando termina su diálogo, obtienes el key item Letter from Roh Latteh. Si compruebas (lees) la carta desde tu menú de key items, recibes una penalización y solo la mitad de la recompensa real.",
    ["Trade the Corsair's Testimony to the Rock Slab to enter the battlefield. This quest does not need to be completed for the level limit increase if you have already completed New Worlds Await or better."] = "Entrega el Corsair's Testimony a la Rock Slab para entrar en el campo de batalla. Esta quest no hace falta completarla para el aumento de límite de nivel si ya completaste New Worlds Await o superior.",
    ["Trade the Crystal Bass to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria."] = "Entrega el Crystal Bass a cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria.",
    ["Trade the Crystal Bass to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8)."] = "Entrega el Crystal Bass a cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8).",
    ["Trade the Curse Wand to Sedal-Godjal (J-8)."] = "Entrega la Curse Wand a Sedal-Godjal (J-8).",
    ["Trade the Cursed Key to Granite Door (J-6)."] = "Entrega la Cursed Key a la Granite Door (J-6).",
    ["Trade the Darksteel Ingot to the ??? at (I-8) on map 1 to spawn Gerwitz's Axe (NM). If you zoned in from La Theine Plateau or used the Survival Guide, take the east path (B on the wiki maps). If you are defeated you need another Darksteel Ingot to respawn the NM."] = "Entrega el Darksteel Ingot a la ??? en (I-8) del mapa 1 para invocar a Gerwitz's Axe (NM). Si entraste desde La Theine Plateau o usaste la Survival Guide, toma el camino este (B en los mapas de la wiki). Si te derrotan necesitas otro Darksteel Ingot para reinvocar al NM.",
    ["Trade the Davoi Storage Key to the targetable Storage Hole, which moves randomly around the zone at the start or end of each game day and is usually in open areas. Known locations: (E-10), (F-6), (F-7), (F-9), (G-9), (G-10), (H-8), (I-7), (I-8), (J-7), (J-8), (K-7), (K-8), (K-9) and (K-10). The center island Storage Hole at (H-8) can be reached from the river."] = "Entrega la Davoi Storage Key al Storage Hole seleccionable, que se mueve aleatoriamente por la zona al inicio o al final de cada día de juego y suele estar en zonas abiertas. Ubicaciones conocidas: (E-10), (F-6), (F-7), (F-9), (G-9), (G-10), (H-8), (I-7), (I-8), (J-7), (J-8), (K-7), (K-8), (K-9) y (K-10). Al Storage Hole de la isla central en (H-8) se llega desde el río.",
    ["Trade the Demon Pen to Koblakiq to complete the quest and receive the Goblin Grenade."] = "Entrega la Demon Pen a Koblakiq para completar la quest y recibir la Goblin Grenade.",
    ["Trade the Derfland Humus to Chalvatot to complete the quest and receive the Map of the Northlands area."] = "Entrega el Derfland Humus a Chalvatot para completar la quest y recibir el Map of the Northlands area.",
    ["Trade the Desert Venom to Edigey for your reward. The first time you complete the quest you receive a Dotanuki and the title Desert Hunter; each time after that you only receive gil. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega el Desert Venom a Edigey por tu recompensa. La primera vez que completas la quest recibes un Dotanuki y el título Desert Hunter; las siguientes veces solo recibes gil. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade the Eagle Button to her, which prompts her to admit she was the thief."] = "Entrégale el Eagle Button, lo que la lleva a admitir que fue la ladrona.",
    ["Trade the Earth Pendulum to the Protocrystal to enter the battlefield."] = "Entrega el Earth Pendulum al Protocrystal para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Trade the Elixir to the correct imp. If you choose incorrectly, wait one Vana'diel day before trying again."] = "Entrega el Elixir al imp correcto. Si eliges mal, espera un día de Vana'diel antes de volver a intentarlo.",
    ["Trade the Elshimo Marble to Rauteinot. You receive Rauteinot's parcel."] = "Entrega el Elshimo Marble a Rauteinot. Recibes el Rauteinot's parcel.",
    ["Trade the Engraved Key to Vamorcote to complete the quest and receive 10,000 gil."] = "Entrega la Engraved Key a Vamorcote para completar la quest y recibir 10,000 gil.",
    ["Trade the Fish Bait to the ??? at (E-8) to pop Isonade, a fish NM with approximately 6,100 HP."] = "Entrega el Fish Bait a la ??? de (E-8) para invocar a Isonade, un NM pez con unos 6,100 de HP.",
    ["Trade the Flame Degen to Radeivepart to complete the quest and receive the Map of Castle Zvahl."] = "Entrega la Flame Degen a Radeivepart para completar la quest y recibir el Map of Castle Zvahl.",
    ["Trade the Flint Stone x4 to Aquillina to complete the quest and receive 100 gil. The page notes that the quest can be repeated but has a restriction of 15 Earth minutes that applies to everyone, so if another player completed it recently it will not be available."] = "Entrega la Flint Stone x4 a Aquillina para completar la quest y recibir 100 gil. La página indica que la quest se puede repetir pero tiene una restricción de 15 minutos terrestres que se aplica a todos, así que si otro jugador la completó hace poco no estará disponible.",
    ["Trade the Galkan Sausage to Hungry Wolf to complete the quest and receive 300 gil."] = "Entrega el Galkan Sausage a Hungry Wolf para completar la quest y recibir 300 gil.",
    ["Trade the Garnet to the Cermet Headstone in Yuhtunga Jungle (L-7) at any time during or after Zilart Mission 5 to receive an Opo-opo Necklace and the title Friend of the Opo-opos."] = "Entrega la Garnet al Cermet Headstone de Yuhtunga Jungle (L-7) en cualquier momento durante o después de la Zilart Mission 5 para recibir un Opo-opo Necklace y el título Friend of the Opo-opos.",
    ["Trade the Giant Scale to Unstable Displacement (G-8) at (G-8)."] = "Entrega la Giant Scale al Unstable Displacement (G-8) en (G-8).",
    ["Trade the Giant Sheep Meat to the campfire to begin cooking it, then wait one minute (Earth time). Do not zone out, or you will have to repeat the steps."] = "Entrega la Giant Sheep Meat a la campfire para empezar a cocinarla, y espera un minuto (tiempo terrestre). No salgas de la zona, o tendrás que repetir los pasos.",
    ["Trade the Glittersand to Perchond, who gives you the temporary key item Perchond's envelope and explains that a merchant in Jugner Forest has also seen the creature, and that Semih Lafihna is probably there."] = "Entrega la Glittersand a Perchond, que te da el key item temporal Perchond's envelope y te explica que un mercader de Jugner Forest también ha visto a la criatura, y que Semih Lafihna probablemente esté allí.",
    ["Trade the Gold Earring to Koh Lenbalalako for a second cutscene and the key item Koh's letter."] = "Entrega el Gold Earring a Koh Lenbalalako para una segunda escena y el key item Koh's letter.",
    ["Trade the Hare Meat to the ???."] = "Entrega el Hare Meat a la ???.",
    ["Trade the Honey to Zayhi-Bauhi, the speaker by the bridge to Heavens Tower, then speak with Kalupa-Tawalupa and Rutango-Botango."] = "Entrega la Honey a Zayhi-Bauhi, el orador junto al puente a Heavens Tower, y luego habla con Kalupa-Tawalupa y Rutango-Botango.",
    ["Trade the Honey x5 to Raimbroy to complete the quest and receive 400 gil."] = "Entrega la Honey x5 a Raimbroy para completar la quest y recibir 400 gil.",
    ["Trade the Ice Pendulum to the Protocrystal to enter the battlefield."] = "Entrega el Ice Pendulum al Protocrystal para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Trade the Judgment Key to the Brass Door."] = "Entrega la Judgment Key a la Brass Door.",
    ["Trade the Kaiser Sword to Imasuke to complete the quest and receive the Map of Delkfutt's Tower."] = "Entrega la Kaiser Sword a Imasuke para completar la quest y recibir el Map of Delkfutt's Tower.",
    ["Trade the Knuckles of Trials back to Oggbi. The Bostaunieux Oubliette page lists the notorious monster Bodach for this quest."] = "Entrega los Knuckles of Trials de vuelta a Oggbi. La página de Bostaunieux Oubliette indica el notorious monster Bodach para esta quest.",
    ["Trade the Kodachi of Trials back to Ryoma, then go back and speak with him to receive your reward, the weapon skill Blade: Ku."] = "Entrega el Kodachi of Trials de vuelta a Ryoma, luego vuelve a hablar con él para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Blade: Ku.",
    ["Trade the Lilac to Ojha Rhawash to complete the quest."] = "Entrega el Lilac a Ojha Rhawash para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Lilac to the Weathered Gravestone to complete the quest and obtain the Tiny Memory Fragment."] = "Entrega el Lilac a la Weathered Gravestone para completar la quest y obtener el Tiny Memory Fragment.",
    ["Trade the Lizard Egg to Alois (J-8)."] = "Entrega el Lizard Egg a Alois (J-8).",
    ["Trade the Lufet Salt x3 to Nogelle to complete the quest and receive 600 gil."] = "Entrega la Lufet Salt x3 a Nogelle para completar la quest y recibir 600 gil.",
    ["Trade the Luminicloth, the Revival Tree Root and the Wolf Hide to Kopuro-Popuro to complete the quest and receive 700 gil and Scentless Armlets."] = "Entrega la Luminicloth, la Revival Tree Root y la Wolf Hide a Kopuro-Popuro para completar la quest y recibir 700 gil y Scentless Armlets.",
    ["Trade the Marguerite to Kuu Mohzolhi to complete the quest."] = "Entrega la Marguerite a Kuu Mohzolhi para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Mary's Milk to Paouala to complete the quest and receive 5,000 gil."] = "Entrega el Mary's Milk a Paouala para completar la quest y recibir 5,000 gil.",
    ["Trade the Meat Jerky to Tami for your reward, a Rabbit Mantle. The quest is then complete and no longer repeatable."] = "Entrega el Meat Jerky a Tami por tu recompensa, un Rabbit Mantle. La quest queda completa y ya no se puede repetir.",
    ["Trade the Meteorite to Koru-Moru to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Entrega el Meteorite a Koru-Moru para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the Miner's Pendant to Oggbi to receive the Beat Cesti."] = "Entrega el Miner's Pendant a Oggbi para recibir el Beat Cesti.",
    ["Trade the Moblin Hotrok to the ??? to complete the quest."] = "Entrega el Moblin Hotrok a la ??? para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Moogle the items he asks for: a Power Bow and a Beetle Ring. The Power Bow can be bought from a Records of Eminence NPC using Sparks (equip level 10 to 19). The Beetle Ring +1 does not count."] = "Entrega al Moogle los objetos que pide: un Power Bow y un Beetle Ring. El Power Bow se puede comprar a un NPC de Records of Eminence con Sparks (nivel de equipo 10 a 19). El Beetle Ring +1 no cuenta.",
    ["Trade the Mythril Sallet to Detzo to complete the quest and receive your reward. The sallet is returned to you, so make sure you have space in your inventory."] = "Entrega el Mythril Sallet a Detzo para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa. El sallet te lo devuelven, así que asegúrate de tener espacio en el inventario.",
    ["Trade the Nashmau Stew to Kyokyoroon back in Nashmau (H-7)."] = "Entrega el Nashmau Stew a Kyokyoroon de vuelta en Nashmau (H-7).",
    ["Trade the Odontotyrannus to Zaldon, inside the Fisherman's Guild in Selbina (H-9), to receive the Knight's boots."] = "Entrega el Odontotyrannus a Zaldon, dentro del Fisherman's Guild de Selbina (H-9), para recibir las Knight's boots.",
    ["Trade the Ointment to Aaveleon, who gives you back an Ointment Case."] = "Entrega el Ointment a Aaveleon, que te devuelve un Ointment Case.",
    ["Trade the Old Earring to Perih Vashai for a cutscene and the Hunter's Beret."] = "Entrega el Old Earring a Perih Vashai para una escena y el Hunter's Beret.",
    ["Trade the Opal Silk and the Saber Shoot to Irmilant."] = "Entrega el Opal Silk y el Saber Shoot a Irmilant.",
    ["Trade the Orcish Axe to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria."] = "Entrega el Orcish Axe a cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria.",
    ["Trade the Orcish Axe to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8)."] = "Entrega el Orcish Axe a cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8).",
    ["Trade the Orcish Mail Scales to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria."] = "Entrega las Orcish Mail Scales a cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria.",
    ["Trade the Orcish Mail Scales to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8)."] = "Entrega las Orcish Mail Scales a cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8).",
    ["Trade the Ordrynite to Raibaht to complete the quest."] = "Entrega el Ordrynite a Raibaht para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Parchment and the Black Ink to Ahkk Jharcham. The reward is the ability to exit your Mog House to any zone within the city of Aht Urhgan."] = "Entrega el Parchment y la Black Ink a Ahkk Jharcham. La recompensa es poder salir de tu Mog House a cualquier zona dentro de la ciudad de Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Trade the Philosopher's Stone to Fey Blossoms (F-5) in Grauberg (S)."] = "Entrega la Philosopher's Stone a los Fey Blossoms (F-5) en Grauberg (S).",
    ["Trade the Pick of Trials back to Brutus."] = "Entrega el Pick of Trials de vuelta a Brutus.",
    ["Trade the Pole of Trials back to Shantotto. You are instructed to travel to Ifrit's Cauldron."] = "Entrega la Pole of Trials de vuelta a Shantotto. Te indican viajar a Ifrit's Cauldron.",
    ["Trade the Punch Bug to Veridical Conflux (F-5) in Grauberg [S]."] = "Entrega el Punch Bug al Veridical Conflux (F-5) en Grauberg [S].",
    ["Trade the Pup. Testimony to Shamarhaan to initiate the Navukgo Execution Chamber battlefield; you are warped there. Just like the Maat fight, you have to fight Shamarhaan to break the level cap limit."] = "Entrega el Pup. Testimony a Shamarhaan para iniciar el campo de batalla Navukgo Execution Chamber; te teletransportan allí. Igual que en el combate contra Maat, tienes que luchar contra Shamarhaan para romper el límite de nivel.",
    ["Trade the Purple Ribbon to the Hume Bones at (M-10) to spawn the NM Lich C Magnus."] = "Entrega la Purple Ribbon a los Hume Bones en (M-10) para invocar al NM Lich C Magnus.",
    ["Trade the Rain Lily to the Cermet Headstone in Cape Teriggan (H-5) to receive a Flagellant's Rope and the title Bearer of Bonds Beyond Time."] = "Entrega la Rain Lily al Cermet Headstone de Cape Teriggan (H-5) para recibir una Flagellant's Rope y el título Bearer of Bonds Beyond Time.",
    ["Trade the Rarab Tail to Kohlo-Lakolo for a cutscene and your reward, which completes the quest."] = "Entrega la Rarab Tail a Kohlo-Lakolo para una escena y tu recompensa, que completa la quest.",
    ["Trade the Red Oven Mitt to Leonhardt for a brief cutscene."] = "Entrega la Red Oven Mitt a Leonhardt para una breve escena.",
    ["Trade the Rhinostery Canteen to the Giddeus Spring at (K-12) or (E-12) in Giddeus to receive a Canteen of Giddeus water."] = "Entrega la Rhinostery Canteen al Giddeus Spring en (K-12) o (E-12) de Giddeus para recibir una Canteen of Giddeus water.",
    ["Trade the Rolanberry 874 to Hilda to receive the Unfinished letter."] = "Entrega el Rolanberry 874 a Hilda para recibir la Unfinished letter.",
    ["Trade the Rose Wand, the Oak Staff and the Mythril Rod to Hakkuru-Rinkuru for the cutscene that completes the quest. Two of the items are returned to you at the end, together with your reward and a new title."] = "Entrega la Rose Wand, el Oak Staff y la Mythril Rod a Hakkuru-Rinkuru para la escena que completa la quest. Dos de los objetos te los devuelven al final, junto con tu recompensa y un nuevo título.",
    ["Trade the Royal Jelly to Maysoon in Windurst Waters (E-9) to complete the quest and receive the key item Super soup pot."] = "Entrega la Royal Jelly a Maysoon en Windurst Waters (E-9) para completar la quest y recibir el key item Super soup pot.",
    ["Trade the Rusty Key to the Iron Door at (K-9) on the second map."] = "Entrega la Rusty Key a la Iron Door en (K-9) del segundo mapa.",
    ["Trade the Sand Charm to Celestina to complete the quest and receive the Map of Bostaunieux Oubliette."] = "Entrega la Sand Charm a Celestina para completar la quest y recibir el Map of Bostaunieux Oubliette.",
    ["Trade the Sapara of Trials back to Curilla."] = "Entrega el Sapara of Trials de vuelta a Curilla.",
    ["Trade the Saruta Cotton x4 to Chamama, then return to Kohlo-Lakolo for a cutscene to complete the quest and receive a Heko Obi."] = "Entrega la Saruta Cotton x4 a Chamama y luego vuelve con Kohlo-Lakolo para una escena que completa la quest y recibir un Heko Obi.",
    ["Trade the Scorpion Stinger to Soni-Muni to complete the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Entrega el Scorpion Stinger a Soni-Muni para completar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
    ["Trade the Scythe of Trials back to Novalmauge."] = "Entrega la Scythe of Trials de vuelta a Novalmauge.",
    ["Trade the Sharp Stone to Varun to complete the quest and receive 2,100 gil."] = "Entrega la Sharp Stone a Varun para completar la quest y recibir 2,100 gil.",
    ["Trade the Shelling Piece to Ropunono to complete the quest and receive 4,800 gil."] = "Entrega la Shelling Piece a Ropunono para completar la quest y recibir 4,800 gil.",
    ["Trade the Silver Name Tag to Pavvke for your reward, 550 gil."] = "Entrega la Silver Name Tag a Pavvke para recibir tu recompensa, 550 gil.",
    ["Trade the Slime Oil and the Frost Turnip to Hariga-Origa at the same time to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Entrega el Slime Oil y el Frost Turnip a Hariga-Origa a la vez para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the Smooth Stone to Chamama."] = "Entrega la Smooth Stone a Chamama.",
    ["Trade the Spear of Trials back to Balasiel."] = "Entrega la Spear of Trials de vuelta a Balasiel.",
    ["Trade the Sword of Trials back to Gumbah."] = "Entrega la Sword of Trials de vuelta a Gumbah.",
    ["Trade the Tachi of Trials back to Jaucribaix. Then go back and speak with him to receive your reward, the weapon skill Tachi: Kasha."] = "Entrega la Tachi of Trials de vuelta a Jaucribaix. Luego vuelve a hablar con él para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Tachi: Kasha.",
    ["Trade the Tavnazia Bell to the ???."] = "Entrega la Tavnazia Bell a la ???.",
    ["Trade the Tavnazian Mask to Narcheral in the Cathedral, upstairs in Northern San d'Oria (M-6), to receive your reward."] = "Entrega la Tavnazian Mask a Narcheral en la Cathedral, arriba en Northern San d'Oria (M-6), para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the Test Answers to Fuepepe, who tells you to take them to Koru-Moru in Windurst Walls."] = "Entrega los Test Answers a Fuepepe, que te dice que se los lleves a Koru-Moru en Windurst Walls.",
    ["Trade the Test Answers to Koru-Moru in Windurst Walls."] = "Entrega los Test Answers a Koru-Moru en Windurst Walls.",
    ["Trade the Testimony to the Burning Circle to enter a one-on-one battle against Maat. The time limit is 10 minutes, and after about 5 minutes from engaging Maat, he begins to use Asuran Fists. Maat has all the relevant abilities and spells of your main job."] = "Entrega el Testimony al Burning Circle para entrar en una batalla uno contra uno contra Maat. El límite de tiempo es de 10 minutos, y tras unos 5 minutos desde que te enfrentas a Maat, empieza a usar Asuran Fists. Maat tiene todas las habilidades y hechizos relevantes de tu trabajo principal.",
    ["Trade the Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud, the Insect Wing and the Rabbit Hide to Kopuro-Popuro to complete the quest and receive 200 gil."] = "Entrega el Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud, el Insect Wing y la Rabbit Hide a Kopuro-Popuro para completar la quest y recibir 200 gil.",
    ["Trade the Unlit Lantern to the Altar of Rancor for a Rancor Flame, then use it to light the four lanterns outside the Sacrificial Chamber. Repeat as needed."] = "Entrega la Unlit Lantern al Altar of Rancor a cambio de una Rancor Flame y úsala para encender las cuatro linternas fuera de la Sacrificial Chamber. Repite si es necesario.",
    ["Trade the Vellum at the Optistery door, then obtain the Lynx Pelt from the ??? in Castle Oztroja (S) at (G-8)."] = "Entrega el Vellum en la Optistery door y luego obtén el Lynx Pelt de la ??? en Castle Oztroja (S) en (G-8).",
    ["Trade the Well Water to the tombstone to receive a Tomb Waterskin."] = "Entrega el Well Water a la tombstone para recibir un Tomb Waterskin.",
    ["Trade the Well Weight to the Village Well for a cutscene and the key item Knight's confession."] = "Entrega el Well Weight al Village Well para una escena y el key item Knight's confession.",
    ["Trade the Wild Pamamas to the Altar. The NPC mentions needing to shout your name, but that is not necessary."] = "Entrega la Wild Pamamas al Altar. El NPC menciona que hay que gritar tu nombre, pero no es necesario.",
    ["Trade the Yagudo Drink to the ??? to spawn Huu Xalmo the Savage."] = "Entrega el Yagudo Drink a la ??? para invocar a Huu Xalmo the Savage.",
    ["Trade the Yagudo Necklace x4 to Nanaa Mihgo to complete the quest and receive 200 gil."] = "Entrega el Yagudo Necklace x4 a Nanaa Mihgo para completar la quest y recibir 200 gil.",
    ["Trade the Zinc Ore to Talib."] = "Entrega el Zinc Ore a Talib.",
    ["Trade the Zinc Ore x4 to Talib to complete the quest and receive 350 gil. You do not have to zone to repeat it."] = "Entrega el Zinc Ore x4 a Talib para completar la quest y recibir 350 gil. No tienes que cambiar de zona para repetirla.",
    ["Trade the aged Rolanberries to Vuntar to complete the quest. The payment depends on the Rolanberry you hand in. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega las Rolanberries maduradas a Vuntar para completar la quest. El pago depende de la Rolanberry que entregues. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade the egg to one of the VCS Trainers located in Bastok Mines, Southern San d'Oria or Windurst Woods to begin raising a chocobo."] = "Entrega el huevo a uno de los VCS Trainers de Bastok Mines, Southern San d'Oria o Windurst Woods para empezar a criar un chocobo.",
    ["Trade the food orders: a Grilled Hare to Kerutoto, plus the orders you got from Ohbiru-Dohbiru and Kenapa-Keppa."] = "Entrega los pedidos de comida: un Grilled Hare a Kerutoto, además de los pedidos que recibiste de Ohbiru-Dohbiru y Kenapa-Keppa.",
    ["Trade the fork to the Earth Protocrystal to enter the fighting arena."] = "Entrega el fork al Earth Protocrystal para entrar en la arena de combate.",
    ["Trade the fork to the Fire Protocrystal to enter the fighting arena."] = "Entrega el fork al Fire Protocrystal para entrar en la arena de combate.",
    ["Trade the fork to the Ice Protocrystal to enter the fighting arena."] = "Entrega el fork al Ice Protocrystal para entrar en la arena de combate.",
    ["Trade the fork to the Lightning Protocrystal to enter the fighting arena."] = "Entrega el fork al Lightning Protocrystal para entrar en la arena de combate.",
    ["Trade the fork to the Water Protocrystal to enter the fighting arena."] = "Entrega el fork al Water Protocrystal para entrar en la arena de combate.",
    ["Trade the fork to the Wind Protocrystal to enter the fighting arena."] = "Entrega el fork al Wind Protocrystal para entrar en la arena de combate.",
    ["Trade the items to Maat to complete the quest, which raises your level cap to 55."] = "Entrega los objetos a Maat para completar la quest, que sube tu límite de nivel a 55.",
    ["Trade the items to Shantotto to complete the quest and receive a Misery Staff."] = "Entrega los objetos a Shantotto para completar la quest y recibir un Misery Staff.",
    ["Trade the logs to Ramua for your reward. She also returns the logs to you."] = "Entrega los troncos a Ramua para recibir tu recompensa. También te devuelve los troncos.",
    ["Trade the requested training item to the ??? near Undulating Confluence (G-5) at (G-5)."] = "Entrega el objeto de entrenamiento solicitado a la ??? cerca del Undulating Confluence (G-5), en (G-5).",
    ["Trade the root to Balasiel to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Entrega la raíz a Balasiel para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the same testimony to the Ornamental Door to initiate a battle against Raubahn. If you have the key item Rhapsody in Umber, you can summon Trust Magic to aid you. If the attempt fails, return to the Imperial Whitegate with a usable testimony and trade it again."] = "Entrega el mismo testimonio a la Ornamental Door para iniciar una batalla contra Raubahn. Si tienes el key item Rhapsody in Umber, puedes invocar Trust Magic para que te ayude. Si el intento falla, vuelve a la Imperial Whitegate con un testimonio utilizable y entrégalo de nuevo.",
    ["Trade the second Giant Scale to Unstable Displacement (E-10) at (E-10)."] = "Entrega la segunda Giant Scale al Unstable Displacement (E-10) en (E-10).",
    ["Trade the testimony to the Imperial Whitegate (L-8) and you are teleported to Jade Sepulcher."] = "Entrega el testimonio a la Imperial Whitegate (L-8) y te teletransportan a Jade Sepulcher.",
    ["Trade whichever brother you want to help Moat Carp and/or Forest Carp x10,000."] = "Entrega al hermano al que quieras ayudar Moat Carp y/o Forest Carp x10,000.",
    ["Trade with Blatherix (F-8).: either 30 Goblin Chocolate or 5,000 gil for the Mine Shaft Key."] = "Intercambia con Blatherix (F-8): 30 Goblin Chocolate o 5,000 gil por la Mine Shaft Key.",
    ["Trade your Pickaxe to the ??? for a cutscene and your reward."] = "Entrega tu Pickaxe a la ??? para una escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade your Yagudo Headgear to the Stone Lid for a cutscene; it is replaced by Tsoo's Headgear."] = "Entrega tu Yagudo Headgear a la Stone Lid para una escena; se sustituye por Tsoo's Headgear.",
    ["Travel back to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Femitte to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Femitte para completar la quest.",
    ["Travel east and use another Ratstail Explosive on explosive wall (I-9)."] = "Viaja al este y usa otro Ratstail Explosive en la explosive wall (I-9).",
    ["Travel east to Map 2 and examine Wooden Crates (H-9) to enter Ghoyu's Reverie; the party leader must perform this examination."] = "Viaja al este hasta el Map 2 y examina las Wooden Crates (H-9) para entrar en Ghoyu's Reverie; el líder del grupo debe hacer este examen.",
    ["Travel from Southern San d'Oria [S] to East Ronfaure [S]."] = "Viaja de Southern San d'Oria [S] a East Ronfaure [S].",
    ["Travel north from the Beaucedine Glacier [S] Campaign Arbiter."] = "Viaja al norte desde el Campaign Arbiter de Beaucedine Glacier [S].",
    ["Travel northeast through Ceizak Battlegrounds."] = "Viaja al noreste por Ceizak Battlegrounds.",
    ["Travel northwest through Ulbuka."] = "Viaja al noroeste por Ulbuka.",
    ["Travel through Caedarva Mire and enter Arrapago Reef."] = "Atraviesa Caedarva Mire y entra en Arrapago Reef.",
    ["Travel through Castle Zvahl Baileys [S] and Castle Zvahl Keep [S]."] = "Atraviesa Castle Zvahl Baileys [S] y Castle Zvahl Keep [S].",
    ["Travel through Fei'Yin and assist the Carmine Swallows."] = "Atraviesa Fei'Yin y ayuda a los Carmine Swallows.",
    ["Travel through Ghelsba Outpost to Yughott Grotto and enter battlefield entrance."] = "Atraviesa Ghelsba Outpost hasta Yughott Grotto y entra por la entrada del campo de batalla.",
    ["Travel through Giddeus to Balga's Dais and enter the Rank 2 Final Mission battlefield."] = "Atraviesa Giddeus hasta Balga's Dais y entra en el campo de batalla de la Rank 2 Final Mission.",
    ["Travel through Jugner Forest and enter Davoi from (G-12)."] = "Atraviesa Jugner Forest y entra en Davoi desde (G-12).",
    ["Travel through Maze of Shakhrami to the Fossil Rocks around (G-6)."] = "Atraviesa Maze of Shakhrami hasta las Fossil Rocks cerca de (G-6).",
    ["Travel through Palborough Mines, obtain Mine Gravel and turn it into Mythril Sand, then return to Savae E. Paleade (I-9)."] = "Atraviesa Palborough Mines, obtén Mine Gravel y conviértela en Mythril Sand, luego vuelve con Savae E. Paleade (I-9).",
    ["Travel through Riverne - Site #A01."] = "Viaja por Riverne - Site #A01.",
    ["Travel through Riverne - Site B01."] = "Viaja por Riverne - Site B01.",
    ["Travel through West Ronfaure and enter Ghelsba Outpost."] = "Atraviesa West Ronfaure y entra en Ghelsba Outpost.",
    ["Travel through Yhoator Jungle to the Den of Rancor."] = "Viaja por Yhoator Jungle hasta el Den of Rancor.",
    ["Travel through Zeruhn Mines to Korroloka Tunnel."] = "Viaja por Zeruhn Mines hasta Korroloka Tunnel.",
    ["Travel through the Temple of Uggalepih to the Den of Rancor and reach the Sacrificial Chamber."] = "Atraviesa el Temple of Uggalepih hasta el Den of Rancor y llega a la Sacrificial Chamber.",
    ["Travel through the forest canopy."] = "Atraviesa el dosel del bosque.",
    ["Travel through the tunnel in Valkurm Dunes (C-6) to the Secret Beach and examine the Song Runes (B-7) for a last cutscene."] = "Viaja por el túnel de Valkurm Dunes (C-6) hasta la Secret Beach y examina las Song Runes (B-7) para una última escena.",
    ["Travel to (G-10) in Beaucedine Glacier, at the ice pond, and click on the Mirror Pond. It only appears on days without snow or clouds."] = "Viaja a (G-10) en Beaucedine Glacier, en el estanque de hielo, y haz clic en el Mirror Pond. Solo aparece en días sin nieve ni nubes.",
    ["Travel to (H-8) in The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah to locate a ???, in the middle of the pool. The Survival Guide of The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah is the quickest way to get there."] = "Viaja a (H-8) en The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah para localizar una ???, en medio del estanque. La Survival Guide de The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah es la forma más rápida de llegar.",
    ["Travel to (I-10) in Xarcabard and examine the Perennial Snow at the end of the short tunnel. You must now wait one Earth minute before you can retrieve the ring."] = "Viaja a (I-10) en Xarcabard y examina la Perennial Snow al final del túnel corto. Ahora debes esperar un minuto terrestre antes de poder recuperar el anillo.",
    ["Travel to (I-6) of the basement map and touch the Cermet Door to pop 3 NMs: Orna, the boss, and 2 Fomorian Spear."] = "Viaja a (I-6) del mapa del sótano y toca la Cermet Door para invocar 3 NMs: Orna, el jefe, y 2 Fomorian Spear.",
    ["Travel to (I-7) in Yhoator Jungle. The quickest way is Survival Guide teleportation from Elshimo Uplands to Yhoator Jungle, with one east of Home Point #1 in Norg. The Unity warp (level 122) teleports you to (J-7)."] = "Viaja a (I-7) de Yhoator Jungle. La forma más rápida es el teletransporte de la Survival Guide de Elshimo Uplands a Yhoator Jungle, con una al este del Home Point #1 de Norg. El warp de Unity (nivel 122) te teletransporta a (J-7).",
    ["Travel to (J-11) and use the Sahagin Key on Ornamental Door (J-11)."] = "Viaja a (J-11) y usa la Sahagin Key en la Ornamental Door (J-11).",
    ["Travel to (J-12) in Sea Serpent Grotto."] = "Viaja a (J-12) en Sea Serpent Grotto.",
    ["Travel to (J-9) in North Gustaberg and look for a ???. It appears randomly up and down the length of the river. Taking Port Bastok Home Point #1 to North Gustaberg is the quickest way to reach the river."] = "Viaja a (J-9) en North Gustaberg y busca una ???. Aparece al azar a lo largo del río. Tomar el Home Point #1 de Port Bastok hacia North Gustaberg es la forma más rápida de llegar al río.",
    ["Travel to (K-8) in La Theine Plateau, at the tail end wall of the Crag of Holla, and look for the NPC Faurbellant."] = "Viaja a (K-8) en La Theine Plateau, en la pared del extremo del Crag of Holla, y busca al NPC Faurbellant.",
    ["Travel to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and enter the Palace."] = "Viaja a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y entra en el Palace.",
    ["Travel to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Viaja a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Travel to Al'Taieu."] = "Viaja a Al'Taieu.",
    ["Travel to Alzadaal Undersea Ruins."] = "Viaja a Alzadaal Undersea Ruins.",
    ["Travel to Arrapago Reef and speak with the Apkallu Guide on Map 3."] = "Viaja a Arrapago Reef y habla con el Apkallu Guide en el Map 3.",
    ["Travel to Arrapago Reef by way of the (I-6) entrance from Caedarva Mire and open the first Iron Gate at (J-10) with the Lamian Fang Key."] = "Viaja a Arrapago Reef por la entrada (I-6) desde Caedarva Mire y abre la primera Iron Gate en (J-10) con la Lamian Fang Key.",
    ["Travel to Arrapago Reef."] = "Viaja a Arrapago Reef.",
    ["Travel to Attohwa Chasm and examine the Loose Sand around (K-8), defeat Lioumere, then examine the Loose Sand again to obtain the Mimeo Jewel."] = "Viaja a Attohwa Chasm y examina la Loose Sand cerca de (K-8), derrota a Lioumere y luego examina de nuevo la Loose Sand para obtener el Mimeo Jewel.",
    ["Travel to Attohwa Chasm with a Sickle and harvest the Solidago flower."] = "Viaja a Attohwa Chasm con una Sickle y recoge la flor Solidago.",
    ["Travel to Balga's Dais in Giddeus and complete the Saintly Invitation battlefield."] = "Viaja a Balga's Dais en Giddeus y completa el campo de batalla Saintly Invitation.",
    ["Travel to Bastok Markets (S) and speak with young Offa. You are given two options, which lead to two different paths through the quest."] = "Viaja a Bastok Markets (S) y habla con el joven Offa. Te dan dos opciones, que llevan a dos caminos distintos por la quest.",
    ["Travel to Bastok Markets [S]."] = "Viaja a Bastok Markets [S].",
    ["Travel to Bastok Markets and speak with Brygid (K-9) twice."] = "Viaja a Bastok Markets y habla dos veces con Brygid (K-9).",
    ["Travel to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Cid (H-8)."] = "Viaja a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Travel to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Cid (H-8). Complete the three paths in any order."] = "Viaja a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Cid (H-8). Completa los tres caminos en cualquier orden.",
    ["Travel to Bastok and speak with Patt-Pott (I-7)."] = "Viaja a Bastok y habla con Patt-Pott (I-7).",
    ["Travel to Bastok and speak with Savae E. Paleade (I-9), Pius (J-8), and Grohm (G-9)."] = "Viaja a Bastok y habla con Savae E. Paleade (I-9), Pius (J-8) y Grohm (G-9).",
    ["Travel to Bastok to continue with the second leg."] = "Viaja a Bastok para continuar con la segunda parte.",
    ["Travel to Batallia Downs (S) and enter The Eldieme Necropolis (S) via (J-10)."] = "Viaja a Batallia Downs (S) y entra en The Eldieme Necropolis (S) por (J-10).",
    ["Travel to Batallia Downs [S]."] = "Viaja a Batallia Downs [S].",
    ["Travel to Batallia Downs."] = "Viaja a Batallia Downs.",
    ["Travel to Beadeaux and defeat 20 Copper Quadavs."] = "Viaja a Beadeaux y derrota a 20 Copper Quadavs.",
    ["Travel to Beadeaux as a Dark Knight of level 50 or higher, and zone in from Pashhow Marshlands (this is important) to receive a cutscene that starts the quest. The quest follows Dark Puppet."] = "Viaja a Beadeaux siendo Dark Knight de nivel 50 o superior, y entra desde Pashhow Marshlands (esto es importante) para recibir una escena que inicia la quest. La quest sigue a Dark Puppet.",
    ["Travel to Beadeaux, follow the left wall to (H-7), enter Qulun Dome, and obtain the magicite."] = "Viaja a Beadeaux, sigue la pared izquierda hasta (H-7), entra en Qulun Dome y obtén la magicite.",
    ["Travel to Beadeaux. Upon entry, proceed straight in, then turn left (north) when you reach the wall at (F-7). Go north to the wall in (F-6), then due east to (H-6)."] = "Viaja a Beadeaux. Al entrar, ve recto y luego gira a la izquierda (norte) al llegar a la pared en (F-7). Ve al norte hasta la pared en (F-6) y luego directo al este hasta (H-6).",
    ["Travel to Beaucedine Glacier (S) and examine Hoarfang (F-10) to complete the quest and receive the reward."] = "Viaja a Beaucedine Glacier (S) y examina Hoarfang (F-10) para completar la quest y recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Travel to Beaucedine Glacier [S] and examine Regal Pawprints (G-9)."] = "Viaja a Beaucedine Glacier [S] y examina las Regal Pawprints (G-9).",
    ["Travel to Beaucedine Glacier [S]."] = "Viaja a Beaucedine Glacier [S].",
    ["Travel to Beaucedine Glacier and examine Lonely Evergreen (G-7) at (G-7)."] = "Viaja a Beaucedine Glacier y examina el Lonely Evergreen (G-7) en (G-7).",
    ["Travel to Benedikt Watchtower in North Gustaberg (S) and speak with Roderich (E-11)."] = "Viaja a Benedikt Watchtower en North Gustaberg (S) y habla con Roderich (E-11).",
    ["Travel to Bhaflau Thickets through the northern exit from Aht Urhgan Whitegate at (H-7)."] = "Viaja a Bhaflau Thickets por la salida norte de Aht Urhgan Whitegate en (H-7).",
    ["Travel to Bibiki Bay and examine ??? (F-6) at (F-6)."] = "Viaja a Bibiki Bay y examina la ??? (F-6) en (F-6).",
    ["Travel to Bibiki Bay, reach Purgonorgo Isle, and examine ??? Warmachine (H-11) at (H-11). Speak with Yoran-Oran at (E-5) in Windurst Walls for additional dialogue."] = "Viaja a Bibiki Bay, llega a Purgonorgo Isle y examina la ??? Warmachine (H-11) en (H-11). Habla con Yoran-Oran en (E-5) en Windurst Walls para más diálogo.",
    ["Travel to Caedarva Mire and examine the Vexing Sniffles at (E-10)."] = "Viaja a Caedarva Mire y examina las Vexing Sniffles en (E-10).",
    ["Travel to Caedarva Mire and reach Hediva Isle."] = "Viaja a Caedarva Mire y llega a Hediva Isle.",
    ["Travel to Caedarva Mire through the western exit of Nashmau."] = "Viaja a Caedarva Mire por la salida oeste de Nashmau.",
    ["Travel to Cape Teriggan (F-5) to enter the Cloister of Gales and ring the tuning fork upon the protocrystal."] = "Viaja a Cape Teriggan (F-5) para entrar en la Cloister of Gales y hacer sonar el tuning fork sobre el protocrystal.",
    ["Travel to Carpenters' Landing and examine ??? (I-9) at (I-9)."] = "Viaja a Carpenters' Landing y examina la ??? (I-9) en (I-9).",
    ["Travel to Carpenters' Landing through the (E-6) entrance from Jugner Forest and speak with Guilloud (H-10) at (H-10) to face Overgrown Ivy."] = "Viaja a Carpenters' Landing por la entrada (E-6) desde Jugner Forest y habla con Guilloud (H-10) en (H-10) para enfrentarte a Overgrown Ivy.",
    ["Travel to Carpenters' Landing to obtain a Garhada Teak Lumber. It can be obtained from monsters that appear on the Phanauet Channel barge, or that spawn from fishing on the barge or on the Carpenters' Landing pier."] = "Viaja a Carpenters' Landing para obtener una Garhada Teak Lumber. Se puede obtener de monstruos que aparecen en la barcaza Phanauet Channel, o que surgen al pescar en la barcaza o en el muelle de Carpenters' Landing.",
    ["Travel to Castle Oztroja and enter through the trap door at (I-8)."] = "Viaja a Castle Oztroja y entra por la trampilla en (I-8).",
    ["Travel to Castle Oztroja and obtain the Judgment Key from the Flagellants around (H-5)."] = "Viaja a Castle Oztroja y obtén la Judgment Key de los Flagellants cerca de (H-5).",
    ["Travel to Castle Oztroja, reach the Brass Door at (H-9), light the torch, and continue to the Altar Room to obtain the magicite."] = "Viaja a Castle Oztroja, llega a la Brass Door en (H-9), enciende la antorcha y continúa hasta la Altar Room para obtener la magicite.",
    ["Travel to Castle Oztroja. You do not need the three passwords to enter the Altar Room."] = "Viaja a Castle Oztroja. No necesitas las tres contraseñas para entrar en la Altar Room.",
    ["Travel to Castle Zvahl Baileys and examine Shadowy Pillar (J-8) at (J-8)."] = "Viaja a Castle Zvahl Baileys y examina el Shadowy Pillar (J-8) en (J-8).",
    ["Travel to Castle Zvahl Baileys and go to (F-8) on the first map. Click on one of the torches to spawn Dark Spark."] = "Viaja a Castle Zvahl Baileys y ve a (F-8) en el primer mapa. Haz clic en una de las antorchas para invocar a Dark Spark.",
    ["Travel to Castle Zvahl Baileys."] = "Viaja a Castle Zvahl Baileys.",
    ["Travel to Castle Zvahl Keep and enter the Throne Room."] = "Viaja a Castle Zvahl Keep y entra en la Throne Room.",
    ["Travel to Castle Zvahl Keep and examine Throne Room door."] = "Viaja a Castle Zvahl Keep y examina la Throne Room door.",
    ["Travel to Castle Zvahl Keep and examine Valhallan Rift (G-7)."] = "Viaja a Castle Zvahl Keep y examina la Valhallan Rift (G-7).",
    ["Travel to Castle Zvahl Keep and proceed to the Throne Room."] = "Viaja a Castle Zvahl Keep y avanza hasta la Throne Room.",
    ["Travel to Castle Zvahl Keep and reach the Throne Room."] = "Viaja a Castle Zvahl Keep y llega a la Throne Room.",
    ["Travel to Ceizak Battlegrounds."] = "Viaja a Ceizak Battlegrounds.",
    ["Travel to Cermet Grate in the Hall of the Gods between 18:00 and 05:00."] = "Viaja a la Cermet Grate en la Hall of the Gods entre las 18:00 y las 05:00.",
    ["Travel to Chateau d'Oraguille and enter Bostaunieux Oubliette."] = "Viaja a Chateau d'Oraguille y entra en Bostaunieux Oubliette.",
    ["Travel to Chateau d'Oraguille and examine Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7)."] = "Viaja a Chateau d'Oraguille y examina la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7).",
    ["Travel to Chateau d'Oraguille and examine the Great Hall."] = "Viaja a Chateau d'Oraguille y examina el Great Hall.",
    ["Travel to Chateau d'Oraguille and head toward (F-7)."] = "Viaja a Chateau d'Oraguille y dirígete hacia (F-7).",
    ["Travel to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Halver (I-9)."] = "Viaja al Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Halver (I-9).",
    ["Travel to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Prince Trion in Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7)."] = "Viaja a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Prince Trion en la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7).",
    ["Travel to Chateau d'Oraguille in San d'Oria."] = "Viaja a Chateau d'Oraguille en San d'Oria.",
    ["Travel to Chateau d'Oraguille."] = "Viaja a Chateau d'Oraguille.",
    ["Travel to Cid's Lab at (G-8) in Metalworks and speak with Cid (H-8)."] = "Viaja al Cid's Lab en (G-8) de Metalworks y habla con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Travel to Cid's Lab in Bastok Metalworks and speak with Cid (H-8)."] = "Viaja al Cid's Lab en Bastok Metalworks y habla con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Travel to Cirdas Caverns."] = "Viaja a Cirdas Caverns.",
    ["Travel to Crystalwater Spring at (J-9) in Jugner Forest and obtain a Crystal Bass."] = "Viaja al Crystalwater Spring en (J-9) de Jugner Forest y obtén un Crystal Bass.",
    ["Travel to Dangruf Wadi and head north from the entrance. The quickest method is the Survival Guide; otherwise zone in from South Gustaberg (D-9)."] = "Viaja a Dangruf Wadi y ve al norte desde la entrada. El método más rápido es la Survival Guide; si no, entra desde South Gustaberg (D-9).",
