    ["Travel to Jugner Forest and log the five items on the checklist: Arrowwood Log, Ash Log, Yew Log, Willow Log and Walnut Log. Each one you log shows a message that data was recorded; you must log them yourself and cannot buy them from shops or the Auction House."] = "Viaja a Jugner Forest y registra los cinco objetos de la lista: Arrowwood Log, Ash Log, Yew Log, Willow Log y Walnut Log. Cada uno que registras muestra un mensaje de que se grabaron datos; debes registrarlos tú mismo y no puedes comprarlos en tiendas ni en la Auction House.",
