    ["Travel to Norg and speak with Ryoma (H-8) to receive the quest. You need to be a Ninja of level 50 or higher, Outlands fame level 1 and the Rise of the Zilart pack; this quest follows 20 in Pirate Years. If you just completed 20 in Pirate Years, you need to zone and re-enter Norg for Ryoma to begin it. The trick box you brought back has been identified as a fake, and he needs help finding the real box."] = "Viaja a Norg y habla con Ryoma (H-8) para recibir la quest. Debes ser Ninja de nivel 50 o superior, tener el nivel 1 de fama de Outlands y el pack Rise of the Zilart; esta quest sigue a 20 in Pirate Years. Si acabas de completar 20 in Pirate Years, tienes que cambiar de zona y volver a entrar en Norg para que Ryoma la empiece. El trick box que trajiste se ha identificado como falso, y necesita ayuda para encontrar el verdadero.",
    ["Travel to Norg and speak with Ryoma at (H-8), who gives you the key item Sealed dagger."] = "Viaja a Norg y habla con Ryoma en (H-8), que te da el key item Sealed dagger.",
