    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Bard of level 50 or higher to begin the quest."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Bard de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest.",
