    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Ranger of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. This quest follows Fire and Brimstone."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Ranger de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Esta quest sigue a Fire and Brimstone.",
