    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Samurai of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. This quest requires the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Samurai de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Summoner of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. You need the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Summoner de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Necesitas el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
