    ["Travel to the roof of the Rhinostery in Windurst Waters and speak with Leepe-Hoppe (J-8)."] = "Viaja al tejado del Rhinostery en Windurst Waters y habla con Leepe-Hoppe (J-8).",
    ["Travel to the stone circle in La Theine Plateau."] = "Viaja al stone circle de La Theine Plateau.",
    ["Travel to the three required locations and obtain three key items from Treasure Chests: Un Moment, L'Ephemere and L'Ancienne, the missing parts of the Chanson de Liberte."] = "Viaja a las tres ubicaciones requeridas y obtén tres key items de Treasure Chests: Un Moment, L'Ephemere y L'Ancienne, las partes que faltan de la Chanson de Liberte.",
    ["Travel to the top floor of Palborough Mines (map 3). Palborough Mines Home Point #1 is the fastest way."] = "Viaja al piso superior de Palborough Mines (mapa 3). El Home Point #1 de Palborough Mines es la forma más rápida.",
    ["Travel to the top floor of Tavnazian Safehold."] = "Viaja al piso superior de Tavnazian Safehold.",
    ["Travel to the tower around (H-8) and speak with Goblin Grenadier (H-8)."] = "Viaja a la torre cerca de (H-8) y habla con el Goblin Grenadier (H-8).",
    ["Travel to the waterfall in North Gustaberg (S) at (F-8) and examine the ???."] = "Viaja a la cascada de North Gustaberg (S) en (F-8) y examina la ???.",
    ["Travel west into the tunnel entrance, then north to find the Rock Slab. Examine it for a cutscene that ends the quest and gives you your reward, the Corsair Die."] = "Viaja al oeste hasta la entrada del túnel y luego al norte para encontrar la Rock Slab. Examínala para una escena que termina la quest y te da tu recompensa, el Corsair Die.",
    ["Travel west through Ceizak Battlegrounds."] = "Viaja al oeste por Ceizak Battlegrounds.",
    ["Travel west through Lufaise Meadows toward Tavnazian Safehold."] = "Viaja al oeste por Lufaise Meadows hacia Tavnazian Safehold.",
    ["Travel west to (F-7) and speak with Uu Zhoumo (F-7) to offer the Shield Offering."] = "Viaja al oeste hasta (F-7) y habla con Uu Zhoumo (F-7) para ofrecer la Shield Offering.",
    ["Trial 1, push-ups: count three NPCs doing push-ups and determine who did the least; it is either one of the three, or none. A reliable way is to use a piece of paper and make a mark in three different sections each time an NPC does a push-up."] = "Prueba 1, flexiones: cuenta a tres NPCs haciendo flexiones y determina quién hizo menos; es uno de los tres, o ninguno. Una forma fiable es usar un papel y hacer una marca en tres secciones distintas cada vez que un NPC hace una flexión.",
    ["Trial 2, sit-ups: you must give a message advancement prompt with proper timing as the three NPCs do sit-ups. The Windower addon Enternity must be unloaded for this trial, as it repeatedly queues the advancement prompt. You can practice indefinitely with Abquhbah. In the real challenge, three NPCs have slightly different timings."] = "Prueba 2, sentadillas: debes dar un aviso de avance de mensaje con el tiempo adecuado mientras los tres NPCs hacen sentadillas. El addon de Windower Enternity debe estar descargado en esta prueba, porque pone en cola repetidamente el aviso de avance. Puedes practicar sin límite con Abquhbah. En el reto real, los tres NPCs tienen tiempos ligeramente distintos.",
    ["Trial 3, running: you must give prompts to the three NPCs so that they finish running at the same time. If you select an NPC who is not behind, you are penalized and can fail the trial."] = "Prueba 3, carrera: debes dar avisos a los tres NPCs para que terminen de correr a la vez. Si eliges a un NPC que no va rezagado, te penalizan y puedes fallar la prueba.",
    ["Troll mercenary leader Martial Maestro Megomak has finished his newest creation, the Khimaira 14X, and taken it to Ilrusi Atoll for combat testing. Mission orders: defeat Khimaira 14X."] = "El líder mercenario Troll Martial Maestro Megomak ha terminado su última creación, el Khimaira 14X, y la ha llevado a Ilrusi Atoll para pruebas de combate. Órdenes de la misión: derrotar al Khimaira 14X.",
    ["Trust Magic is unavailable during the battle."] = "La Trust Magic no está disponible durante la batalla.",
    ["Trust magic cannot be used in this battlefield."] = "La Trust magic no se puede usar en este campo de batalla.",
    ["Turn Shantotto's new spell in to Rukususu. If you kill too many monsters while carrying it, it breaks and is replaced by Shantotto's ex-spell; return to Torino-Samarino to get another scroll."] = "Entrega Shantotto's new spell a Rukususu. Si matas demasiados monstruos mientras lo llevas, se rompe y es sustituido por Shantotto's ex-spell; vuelve con Torino-Samarino para conseguir otro pergamino.",
    ["Turn in the Quadav Backplate to Corann to complete the quest."] = "Entrega el Quadav Backplate a Corann para completar la quest.",
    ["Turn south at (F-7) and continue west, following the path as it turns north at (B-7)."] = "Gira al sur en (F-7) y sigue al oeste, siguiendo el camino cuando gira al norte en (B-7).",
    ["Turn the whispers in to Leepe-Hoppe to receive a Moon bauble."] = "Entrega los whispers a Leepe-Hoppe para recibir una Moon bauble.",
    ["Ufanne in Port San d'Oria (H-8) keeps track of how many fish you have turned in, and to which brother. You may need to speak to her multiple times."] = "Ufanne en Port San d'Oria (H-8) lleva la cuenta de cuántos peces has entregado y a qué hermano. Puede que tengas que hablar con ella varias veces.",
    ["Unequip all weapons and your shield."] = "Desequipa todas las armas y tu escudo.",
    ["Unequip your weapons and shield."] = "Desequipa tus armas y tu escudo.",
    ["Unequip your weapons in order to pick up the item if needed, and keep it in your inventory."] = "Desequipa tus armas para recoger el objeto si hace falta, y guárdalo en tu inventario.",
    ["Unlock your support job with The Old Lady (Vera in Mhaura) or Elder Memories (Isacio in Selbina). You can only do one of the two."] = "Desbloquea tu support job con The Old Lady (Vera en Mhaura) o Elder Memories (Isacio en Selbina). Solo puedes hacer una de las dos.",
    ["Up to 200 gil"] = "Hasta 200 gil",
    ["Upon arrival at Navukgo Execution Chamber, trade the Testimony to the Decorative Bronze Gate to begin the battle. Shamarhaan is accompanied by his automaton Valkeng, so prepare for a fight against both of them. The time limit is 10 minutes."] = "Al llegar a la Navukgo Execution Chamber, entrega el Testimony a la Decorative Bronze Gate para comenzar la batalla. Shamarhaan va acompañado de su autómata Valkeng, así que prepárate para luchar contra ambos. El límite de tiempo es de 10 minutos.",
    ["Upon defeating Maat for the last time, speak with him to receive the cutscene and your new Maat's Cap."] = "Al derrotar a Maat por última vez, habla con él para recibir la escena y tu nueva Maat's Cap.",
    ["Upon defeating the battlefield you receive the Whisper of radiance. Examine the Imperial Whitegate in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) for a cutscene."] = "Al derrotar el campo de batalla recibes el Whisper of radiance. Examina la Imperial Whitegate en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) para una escena.",
    ["Use 200 Imperial Standing to travel to the staging point, or use an Assault tag to enter Nyzul Isle Investigation and reach Alzadaal Undersea Ruins."] = "Usa 200 Imperial Standing para viajar al staging point, o usa un Assault tag para entrar en Nyzul Isle Investigation y llegar a Alzadaal Undersea Ruins.",
    ["Use Delkfutt's Key to enter the Cermet Door at (L-7) in the basement of Delkfutt's Tower."] = "Usa la Delkfutt's Key para entrar por la Cermet Door en (L-7) en el sótano de Delkfutt's Tower.",
    ["Use Mistmelts when Ouryu takes flight."] = "Usa Mistmelts cuando Ouryu eche a volar.",
    ["Use Prism Powder while traveling through areas guarded by True Sight Hippogryphs."] = "Usa Prism Powder mientras viajas por zonas vigiladas por True Sight Hippogryphs.",
    ["Use Shu'Meyo Salt during the battle to extend the time available when needed, then return to Cid (H-8) after all three paths are complete."] = "Usa Shu'Meyo Salt durante la batalla para ampliar el tiempo disponible cuando haga falta, luego vuelve con Cid (H-8) cuando los tres caminos estén completos.",
    ["Use Sneak and Invisible while traveling through the aqueducts."] = "Usa Sneak e Invisible mientras avanzas por los acueductos.",
    ["Use a Ratstail Explosive on explosive wall (G-8/9)."] = "Usa un Ratstail Explosive en la explosive wall (G-8/9).",
    ["Use a Ratstail Explosive on explosive wall (H/I-9)."] = "Usa un Ratstail Explosive en la explosive wall (H/I-9).",
    ["Use a Ratstail Explosive on southeast explosive wall (I-9)."] = "Usa un Ratstail Explosive en la explosive wall sureste (I-9).",
    ["Use a Unity Concord NPC warp to the Temple of Uggalepih (level 125), or walk in. Part of the route leads you back outside to Yhoator Jungle; head left and re-enter the Temple at (H-11)."] = "Usa un warp del NPC Unity Concord al Temple of Uggalepih (nivel 125), o entra andando. Parte de la ruta te devuelve al exterior, a Yhoator Jungle; ve a la izquierda y vuelve a entrar al Temple en (H-11).",
    ["Use another Ratstail Explosive on explosive wall (H-8)."] = "Usa otro Ratstail Explosive en la explosive wall (H-8).",
    ["Use at least 15 Imprimaturs on completed Coalition Assignments."] = "Usa al menos 15 Imprimaturs en Coalition Assignments completadas.",
    ["Use both brands to reach the third floor."] = "Usa ambas marcas para llegar al tercer piso.",
    ["Use the (I-7) Bhaflau Thickets entrance to Aydeewa Subterrane (not the Survival Guide entrance) and find the ??? at (H-8) after sliding down the ramp. Trade the Colorful Hair for a cutscene."] = "Usa la entrada (I-7) de Bhaflau Thickets a Aydeewa Subterrane (no la entrada de la Survival Guide) y encuentra la ??? en (H-8) tras deslizarte por la rampa. Entrega el Colorful Hair para una escena.",
    ["Use the /check command before you fight. Monsters that check as \"easy prey\" or \"decent challenge\" are good targets at low levels. Watch for aggressive monsters (marked on each zone page) and beastmen camps."] = "Usa el comando /check antes de pelear. Los monstruos que salen como \"easy prey\" o \"decent challenge\" son buenos objetivos a niveles bajos. Cuidado con los monstruos agresivos (marcados en la página de cada zona) y con los campamentos de beastmen.",
    ["Use the Angel Skin Key to select your scenario reward."] = "Usa la Angel Skin Key para elegir tu recompensa del escenario.",
    ["Use the Chaosbringer to slay 100 more enemies. If you discarded your Chaosbringer, take the boat from Palborough Mines to Zeruhn Mines to receive a new one from Zeid; this resets the blade, so you will have to kill a total of 200 monsters with it to complete the quest."] = "Usa el Chaosbringer para matar 100 enemigos más. Si descartaste tu Chaosbringer, toma el barco de Palborough Mines a Zeruhn Mines para recibir uno nuevo de Zeid; esto reinicia la hoja, así que tendrás que matar un total de 200 monstruos con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Use the Consummate simulacrum at the Augural Conveyor to enter the battlefield."] = "Usa el Consummate simulacrum en el Augural Conveyor para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Use the Den of Rancor Home Point or Unity Warp if available. Otherwise, enter through the Temple of Uggalepih and use the Paintbrush of Souls route."] = "Usa el Home Point del Den of Rancor o el Unity Warp si los tienes. Si no, entra por el Temple of Uggalepih y usa la ruta del Paintbrush of Souls.",
    ["Use the Garlaige Key to enter the Incinerator room at (I-7) on map 3. The quest Rubbish Day also sends you there, so it is recommended to do both at the same time."] = "Usa la Garlaige Key para entrar en la sala del Incinerator en (I-7) del mapa 3. La quest Rubbish Day también te envía allí, así que se recomienda hacer ambas a la vez.",
    ["Use the Memory Receptacle to reach the fifth floor."] = "Usa el Memory Receptacle para llegar al quinto piso.",
    ["Use the Memory Receptacle to reach the fourth floor."] = "Usa el Memory Receptacle para llegar al cuarto piso.",
    ["Use the Paintbrush of souls on the empty Picture frame to open the door to the Den of Rancor. Use the Home Point warp to Den of Rancor #2 if you can."] = "Usa el Paintbrush of souls en el Picture frame vacío para abrir la puerta del Den of Rancor. Usa el warp del Home Point a Den of Rancor #2 si puedes.",
    ["Use the Rainbow resonator to enter the battlefield."] = "Usa el Rainbow resonator para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Use the Runic Portal to return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Usa el Runic Portal para volver a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Use the Spatial Displacement to progress through the area."] = "Usa el Spatial Displacement para avanzar por la zona.",
    ["Use the Uggalepih Key to reach the ??? and obtain the Ancient Verse of Uggalepih."] = "Usa la Uggalepih Key para llegar a la ??? y obtener el Ancient Verse of Uggalepih.",
    ["Use the appropriate Maw to continue."] = "Usa el Maw adecuado para continuar.",
    ["Use the crank at the Sluice Gate to open the route."] = "Usa la manivela en la Sluice Gate para abrir el camino.",
    ["Use the elevator beside Porphyrion at (H-8) to descend, then take the long staircase down to the basement."] = "Usa el ascensor junto a Porphyrion en (H-8) para bajar, luego toma la larga escalera hasta el sótano.",
    ["Use the handles in front of the door to activate the trap door on purpose and fall down it."] = "Usa las manijas frente a la puerta para activar a propósito la trampilla y caer por ella.",
    ["Use the job ability Scavenge in the pool until you get the Old Earring. You can come as a high-level job with Ranger as your subjob to use Scavenge."] = "Usa la habilidad de trabajo Scavenge en el estanque hasta conseguir el Old Earring. Puedes venir con un trabajo de nivel alto con Ranger como subjob para usar Scavenge.",
    ["Use the key on a chest inside to receive the key item Torn-out pages."] = "Usa la llave en un cofre del interior para recibir el key item Torn-out pages.",
    ["Use the key to open a chest in the zone to receive a Guiding bell."] = "Usa la llave para abrir un cofre de la zona y recibir una Guiding bell.",
    ["Use the key to open a chest inside the castle to receive a Beast Collar."] = "Usa la llave para abrir un cofre dentro del castillo y recibir un Beast Collar.",
    ["Use the red portals in Ru'Aun Gardens to reach the five La'Loff Amphitheater battlefields."] = "Usa los portales rojos de Ru'Aun Gardens para llegar a los cinco campos de batalla del La'Loff Amphitheater.",
    ["Use the required keys on Double-keyhole door (H-7) at (H-7)."] = "Usa las llaves requeridas en la Double-keyhole door (H-7) en (H-7).",
    ["Use the transporter at (G-4) to return to the second map."] = "Usa el transportador en (G-4) para volver al segundo mapa.",
    ["Use the weight device at (G-8) and reach the ??? at (H-8) in front of the mural."] = "Usa el dispositivo de peso en (G-8) y llega a la ??? en (H-8) frente al mural.",
    ["Valkurm Dunes, near the port of Selbina, reached through La Theine Plateau or Konschtat Highlands."] = "Valkurm Dunes, cerca del puerto de Selbina, a la que se llega por La Theine Plateau o Konschtat Highlands.",
    ["Visit Cavernous Maw (E-4) in La Theine Plateau, Cavernous Maw (I-12) in Konschtat Highlands, or Cavernous Maw (H-12) in Tahrongi Canyon."] = "Visita el Cavernous Maw (E-4) en La Theine Plateau, el Cavernous Maw (I-12) en Konschtat Highlands o el Cavernous Maw (H-12) en Tahrongi Canyon.",
    ["Visit Cavernous Maw (J-10) in South Gustaberg, Cavernous Maw (H-8) in Xarcabard, or Cavernous Maw (G-6) in North Gustaberg."] = "Visita el Cavernous Maw (J-10) en South Gustaberg, el Cavernous Maw (H-8) en Xarcabard o el Cavernous Maw (G-6) en North Gustaberg.",
    ["Visit Cavernous Maw (J-8) in Jugner Forest, Cavernous Maw (I-9) in Valkurm Dunes, or Cavernous Maw (F-7) in Buburimu Peninsula."] = "Visita el Cavernous Maw (J-8) en Jugner Forest, el Cavernous Maw (I-9) en Valkurm Dunes o el Cavernous Maw (F-7) en Buburimu Peninsula.",
    ["Visit Qu'Hua Spring in Ro'Maeve and obtain the Ancient Verse of Ro'Maeve."] = "Visita el Qu'Hua Spring en Ro'Maeve y obtén el Ancient Verse of Ro'Maeve.",
    ["Visit the five northernmost Pso'Xja towers and examine their Regal Pawprints."] = "Visita las cinco torres de Pso'Xja más al norte y examina sus Regal Pawprints.",
    ["Visit the three Halls of Transference and enter Promyvion-Dem, Promyvion-Mea, and Promyvion-Holla in any order."] = "Visita las tres Halls of Transference y entra en Promyvion-Dem, Promyvion-Mea y Promyvion-Holla en cualquier orden.",
    ["Visit the three magicite locations in any order."] = "Visita las tres ubicaciones de magicite en cualquier orden.",
    ["Wahid, Bastok Mines"] = "Wahid, Bastok Mines",
    ["Wait 8 Vana'diel days after completing His Name Is Valgeir to begin this quest. Speak with Take in Mhaura (I-8), inside the Sailor's Stay. She wants you to bring back one of Valgeir's dishes from Selbina."] = "Espera 8 días de Vana'diel tras completar His Name Is Valgeir para empezar esta quest. Habla con Take en Mhaura (I-8), dentro del Sailor's Stay. Quiere que le traigas uno de los platos de Valgeir de Selbina.",
    ["Wait a game day and speak with Fari-Wari to complete the quest and receive 1,000 Imperial Standing and an Imperial Gold Piece."] = "Espera un día de juego y habla con Fari-Wari para completar la quest y recibir 1,000 Imperial Standing y una Imperial Gold Piece.",
    ["Wait a game day and zone at least once, then return to Abquhbah for a cutscene. Choose \"Helping his fellow mercenaries\" to complete the quest. You receive the LC Wildcat badge, access to LC Assaults, and a varying amount of Imperial currency, up to 2 Imperial Gold Pieces."] = "Espera un día de juego y cambia de zona al menos una vez, luego vuelve con Abquhbah para una escena. Elige \"Helping his fellow mercenaries\" para completar la quest. Recibes el LC Wildcat badge, acceso a los LC Assaults y una cantidad variable de moneda Imperial, hasta 2 Imperial Gold Pieces.",
    ["Wait on the bridge and speak with Quemaricond (H-7) to receive the Royal Knights' Davoi Report."] = "Espera en el puente y habla con Quemaricond (H-7) para recibir el Royal Knights' Davoi Report.",
    ["Wait one Earth minute, then speak with Kerutoto again; she gives the ribbon back."] = "Espera un minuto terrestre, luego habla de nuevo con Kerutoto; te devuelve el lazo.",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day after Fire in the Hole, then enter Bastok Markets (S) from North Gustaberg (S)."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel tras Fire in the Hole y luego entra en Bastok Markets (S) desde North Gustaberg (S).",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day after Gifts of the Griffon."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel tras Gifts of the Griffon.",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day after In a Haze of Glory, then change zones."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel tras In a Haze of Glory y luego cambia de zona.",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day after Wrath of the Griffon, then change zones and speak with Rholont (E-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel tras Wrath of the Griffon, luego cambia de zona y habla con Rholont (E-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day and change zones."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel y cambia de zona.",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day and return to the Optistery to receive the Scroll of Retrace."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel y vuelve al Optistery para recibir el Scroll of Retrace.",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel.",
    ["Wait one in-game day since completing Beginnings and re-zone into Aht Urhgan Whitegate if you have not already. You need to be a Blue Mage of level 50 or higher."] = "Espera un día de juego tras completar Beginnings y vuelve a cambiar de zona a Aht Urhgan Whitegate si aún no lo has hecho. Debes ser Blue Mage de nivel 50 o superior.",
    ["Wait one minute, then speak to Ceraulian again."] = "Espera un minuto y vuelve a hablar con Ceraulian.",
    ["Wait until 0:00 to 3:00 game time. At any other time the tree says nothing is out of the ordinary; during those hours you get the message \"A frost deposit at the base of the tree twinkles in the starlight.\""] = "Espera de 0:00 a 3:00 hora del juego. A cualquier otra hora el árbol no dice nada fuera de lo normal; durante esas horas recibes el mensaje \"A frost deposit at the base of the tree twinkles in the starlight.\"",
    ["Wait until after Japanese midnight, then zone into Northern San d'Oria."] = "Espera hasta después de la medianoche japonesa y luego entra en Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["Wait until after Japanese midnight."] = "Espera hasta después de la medianoche japonesa.",
    ["Wait until midnight (JST), then speak with Mamaulabion once more to receive the Evoker's Ring."] = "Espera hasta medianoche (JST) y habla de nuevo con Mamaulabion para recibir el Evoker's Ring.",
    ["Wait until one Earth minute has passed and speak with Mulaujeant again to be given the Sublime statue of the Goddess."] = "Espera a que pase un minuto terrestre y habla otra vez con Mulaujeant para que te dé la Sublime statue of the Goddess.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day after Curilla Unleashed."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel tras Curilla Unleashed.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day after Undying Light."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel después de Undying Light.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day after the previous mission if necessary."] = "Si hace falta, espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel tras la misión anterior.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day after the previous mission."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel tras la misión anterior.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day and speak with Kocco Ehllek (H-8) again to receive the reward."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel y habla de nuevo con Kocco Ehllek (H-8) para recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day before Glimmer of Portent."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel antes de Glimmer of Portent.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day before continuing if necessary."] = "Si hace falta, espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel antes de continuar.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day before continuing to The Light Shining in Your Eyes."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel antes de continuar con The Light Shining in Your Eyes.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day before continuing."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel antes de continuar.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day if necessary."] = "Si hace falta, espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel.",
    ["Wait until the next in-game day after completing Storms of Fate to activate this quest. If you reset your memories, this wait does not apply."] = "Espera hasta el siguiente día de juego tras completar Storms of Fate para activar esta quest. Si reseteas tus memorias, esta espera no se aplica.",
    ["Wait until the required transition has passed before continuing."] = "Espera a que pase la transición requerida antes de continuar.",
    ["Wait up to 1 minute after completing Behind the Smile. Talk with Enaremand in Tavnazian Safehold (J-7)."] = "Espera hasta 1 minuto tras completar Behind the Smile. Habla con Enaremand en Tavnazian Safehold (J-7).",
    ["Walk beneath the roofed stall at (I-11) to trigger a cutscene."] = "Camina bajo el puesto con techo en (I-11) para activar una escena.",
    ["Walk downstairs to the pillar at (J-8) for a cutscene."] = "Baja las escaleras hasta el pilar en (J-8) para una escena.",
    ["Walk forward and examine Qe'lov Gate in Upper Delkfutt's Tower to enter the battlefield."] = "Avanza y examina la Qe'lov Gate en Upper Delkfutt's Tower para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Walk into the Palace in Ru'Lude Gardens for the cutscene in which you receive the key item Note written by Esha'ntarl. It is a different cutscene from the one that ended Storms of Fate, which does not give a key item."] = "Entra en el Palace de Ru'Lude Gardens para la escena en la que recibes el key item Note written by Esha'ntarl. Es una escena distinta de la que terminó Storms of Fate, que no da key item.",
    ["Walk south to the pond around (J-8)."] = "Camina al sur hasta el estanque, cerca de (J-8).",
    ["Walk to (I-11), down the ramp beside the ferry, for a cutscene to obtain the key item Letter from Bernahn."] = "Camina hasta (I-11), por la rampa junto al ferry, para una escena y obtener el key item Letter from Bernahn.",
    ["Walk to Transcendental Radiance."] = "Camina hasta la Transcendental Radiance.",
    ["Walk to the small circular room at (I-8) with the altar in it. After clearing the Orcs, examine the altar to spawn Bugaboo."] = "Camina hasta la pequeña sala circular en (I-8) con el altar. Tras eliminar a los Orcs, examina el altar para invocar a Bugaboo.",
    ["Walk towards the crates at (F-9)."] = "Camina hacia las cajas en (F-9).",
    ["Waoud then asks for one item, giving clues. The possible items include Sunsand, Dangruf Stone and Siren's Tear; read the item entries themselves for how to get each one. Sunsand is the only requested item that can be bought at the Auction House."] = "Waoud te pide entonces un objeto, dando pistas. Los posibles objetos incluyen Sunsand, Dangruf Stone y Siren's Tear; lee las entradas de los propios objetos para saber cómo conseguir cada uno. La Sunsand es el único objeto pedido que se puede comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["Warning: Trust magic cannot be used in the final battle at the Full Moon Fountain."] = "Advertencia: la Trust magic no se puede usar en la batalla final de la Full Moon Fountain.",
    ["Weapons can sometimes be broken with critical-hit weapon skills and critical hits."] = "A veces se pueden romper las armas con weapon skills críticas y golpes críticos.",
    ["Wear both pieces of equipment. Only some jobs can wear both items at the same time."] = "Ponte ambas piezas de equipo. Solo algunos trabajos pueden llevar ambos objetos a la vez.",
    ["Welcome"] = "Bienvenida",
    ["Welcome to Phoenix! This guide covers your first hours in Vana'diel: what to do in town, where to level, how to make your first gil, and the milestones along the way to level 75."] = "¡Bienvenido a Phoenix! Esta guía cubre tus primeras horas en Vana'diel: qué hacer en la ciudad, dónde subir de nivel, cómo conseguir tus primeros gil y los hitos del camino hasta el nivel 75.",
    ["When Maat gives up, you receive the title Maat Masher and a Scroll of Instant Warp."] = "Cuando Maat se rinde, recibes el título Maat Masher y un Scroll of Instant Warp.",
    ["When asked what to drink, choose either Chai or coffee. Do not choose \"I'll pass, thanks.\". When choosing a cup, select the cup with the suspicious vapor."] = "Cuando te pregunten qué beber, elige Chai o café. No elijas \"I'll pass, thanks.\". Al elegir una taza, escoge la taza con el vapor sospechoso.",
    ["When every Opo-opo has received its item, you receive the Opo-opo Crown and the title King of the Opo-opos."] = "Cuando todos los Opo-opos han recibido su objeto, recibes el Opo-opo Crown y el título King of the Opo-opos.",
    ["When he returns from his trip, your Mog Safe capacity is increased to 70 items."] = "Cuando vuelve de su viaje, la capacidad de tu Mog Safe aumenta a 70 objetos.",
    ["When he returns from his trip, your Mog Safe capacity is increased to 80 items."] = "Cuando vuelve de su viaje, la capacidad de tu Mog Safe aumenta a 80 objetos.",
    ["When ready, click the Hide Flap to pop Deloknok (PLD) and Bilopdop (MNK)."] = "Cuando estés listo, haz clic en la Hide Flap para invocar a Deloknok (PLD) y Bilopdop (MNK).",
    ["When the cutscene ends, trade her the Silver Ingot to complete the quest and receive 2,200 gil."] = "Cuando termina la escena, entrégale el Silver Ingot para completar la quest y recibir 2,200 gil.",
    ["When the cutscene ends, trade him the Cinnamon to complete the quest and receive a Cotton Headband."] = "Cuando termina la escena, entrégale la Cinnamon para completar la quest y recibir un Cotton Headband.",
    ["When the cutscene is over, you are returned to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and able to change to Blue Mage. You receive the key item Mark of Zahak, and the item you brought is still in your inventory."] = "Cuando termina la escena, vuelves a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y puedes cambiar a Blue Mage. Recibes el key item Mark of Zahak, y el objeto que llevaste sigue en tu inventario.",
    ["When the pool at (F-5) is examined, the NM Dabotz's Ghost spawns. It uses Curse often."] = "Al examinar el estanque de (F-5) aparece el NM Dabotz's Ghost. Usa Curse a menudo.",
    ["When your Moogle returns from his trip after one Earth minute (without ever leaving your Mog House), he gives you a Mog Safe that holds 60 items and you receive the title Mog's Kind Master."] = "Cuando tu Moogle vuelve de su viaje tras un minuto terrestre (sin salir nunca de tu Mog House), te da un Mog Safe que guarda 60 objetos y recibes el título Mog's Kind Master.",
    ["Where Messengers Gather: travel to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Hinaree (B-6) at (B-6), then zone into Port San d'Oria and speak with Chasalvige (L-6) in Northern San d'Oria."] = "Where Messengers Gather: viaja a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Hinaree (B-6) en (B-6), luego entra en Port San d'Oria y habla con Chasalvige (L-6) en Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["Where to go next"] = "Adónde ir después",
    ["Whichever coin you pick, correct or not, you receive a Shelling Piece."] = "Elijas la moneda que elijas, correcta o no, recibes una Shelling Piece.",
    ["Whichever way you completed the previous section, once you have the Rolanberry, travel to Bastok Markets (S) one more time and speak with young Offa, then return to Bastok Markets and speak with Offa there to complete the quest and obtain the Withered Berry."] = "Hayas completado la sección anterior por el camino que sea, cuando tengas la Rolanberry viaja una vez más a Bastok Markets (S) y habla con el joven Offa, luego vuelve a Bastok Markets y habla allí con Offa para completar la quest y obtener la Withered Berry.",
    ["While on Corsair at level 50 or higher, head to the Shararat Teahouse in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) for a cutscene and the key item Life float. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Como Corsair de nivel 50 o superior, ve a la Shararat Teahouse de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) para una escena y el key item Life float. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["While the quest Ode to the Serpents is active, speak with Gaweesh in Al Zahbi (G-8). You may only get the cutscenes when General Najelith is in Al Zahbi."] = "Mientras la quest Ode to the Serpents esté activa, habla con Gaweesh en Al Zahbi (G-8). Solo ves las escenas cuando General Najelith está en Al Zahbi.",
    ["While the quest Ode to the Serpents is active, speak with Talhaal in Al Zahbi (H-6). You may only get the cutscenes when General Zazarg is in Al Zahbi."] = "Mientras la quest Ode to the Serpents esté activa, habla con Talhaal en Al Zahbi (H-6). Solo ves las escenas cuando General Zazarg está en Al Zahbi.",
    ["While the two-hour ability is active, speak with Erlene (J-8) again."] = "Mientras la habilidad de dos horas esté activa, habla de nuevo con Erlene (J-8).",
    ["While you are on Summoner as your main job, examine the House of the Hero in Windurst Walls (Home Point #1) to speak with Carbuncle. You must be level 40 or higher and have the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Mientras tengas Summoner como trabajo principal, examina la House of the Hero en Windurst Walls (Home Point #1) para hablar con Carbuncle. Debes ser nivel 40 o superior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["While your main job is Summoner, examine the House of the Hero in Windurst Walls for a cutscene with Carbuncle, who gives you the key item Carbuncle's Tear."] = "Mientras tu trabajo principal sea Summoner, examina la House of the Hero en Windurst Walls para una escena con Carbuncle, que te da el key item Carbuncle's Tear.",
    ["Win 3 rounds of Boom or Bust."] = "Gana 3 rondas de Boom or Bust.",
    ["Win the battle to complete the quest and receive 10,000 gil."] = "Gana la batalla para completar la quest y recibir 10,000 gil.",
    ["Windurst"] = "Windurst",
    ["Windurst First:"] = "Windurst First:",
    ["Windurst Path: enter Windurst Waters and speak with Ohbiru-Dohbiru (J-9) at (J-9), then speak with Yoran-Oran (E-5) at (E-5) and Kyume-Romeh (F-10) at (F-10)."] = "Windurst Path: entra en Windurst Waters y habla con Ohbiru-Dohbiru (J-9) en (J-9), luego con Yoran-Oran (E-5) en (E-5) y con Kyume-Romeh (F-10) en (F-10).",
    ["Windurst first: travel to Port Windurst and speak with Melek at (F-6) inside the Bastokan Consulate."] = "Primero Windurst: viaja a Port Windurst y habla con Melek en (F-6), dentro del Bastokan Consulate.",
    ["Windurst: Windurst Waters (F-5), Windurst Walls (C-6), Port Windurst (B-5), or Windurst Woods (J-10)."] = "Windurst: Windurst Waters (F-5), Windurst Walls (C-6), Port Windurst (B-5) o Windurst Woods (J-10).",
    ["Windurst: complete Knot Quite There and A Manifest Problem."] = "Windurst: completa Knot Quite There y A Manifest Problem.",
    ["Windurst: complete The Shadow Awaits."] = "Windurst: completa The Shadow Awaits.",
    ["Windurst: complete When One Man Is Not Enough and In a Haze of Glory."] = "Windurst: completa When One Man Is Not Enough y In a Haze of Glory.",
    ["Windurst: speak with Miah Riyuh (H-9) in Windurst Waters [S] and complete Snake on the Plains, The Tigress Stirs, and The Tigress Strikes."] = "Windurst: habla con Miah Riyuh (H-9) en Windurst Waters [S] y completa Snake on the Plains, The Tigress Stirs y The Tigress Strikes.",
    ["With one or two Orbs, fifteen Custom Cardians appear; with three Orbs, ten appear; with all four, five appear."] = "Con uno o dos Orbs aparecen quince Custom Cardians; con tres Orbs, diez; con los cuatro, cinco.",
    ["With the Axe of Trials equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points: 7 points for a level 1 skillchain, 9 for level 2 and 11 for level 3. Your elemental resistances are listed underneath your equipped gear grid."] = "Con el Axe of Trials equipado en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas para acumular 300 Trial Points: 7 puntos por una skillchain de nivel 1, 9 por una de nivel 2 y 11 por una de nivel 3. Tus resistencias elementales aparecen debajo de la cuadrícula de equipo.",
    ["With the Carbuncle's Ruby in your inventory, zone into areas while each weather is occurring to get a cutscene for each color. You cannot just idle in a zone, and the Storm spells of a Scholar do not count. You can check the Weather Forecast for the current weather and the next 2 game days."] = "Con el Carbuncle's Ruby en tu inventario, entra en zonas mientras ocurre cada clima para obtener una escena por cada color. No basta con esperar en una zona, y los hechizos Storm de un Scholar no cuentan. Puedes consultar el Weather Forecast para el clima actual y los próximos 2 días de juego.",
    ["With the Gun of Trials equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points: 7 points for a level 1 skillchain, 9 for level 2 and 11 for level 3. Your elemental resistances are listed underneath your equipped gear grid."] = "Con la Gun of Trials equipada en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas para acumular 300 Trial Points: 7 puntos por una skillchain de nivel 1, 9 por una de nivel 2 y 11 por una de nivel 3. Tus resistencias elementales aparecen debajo de la cuadrícula de equipo.",
    ["With the Knuckles of Trials equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points."] = "Con los Knuckles of Trials equipados en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas para acumular 300 Trial Points.",
    ["With the Moon bauble key item, interact with the fountain to enter the battlefield. Up to 6 party members can enter, each needs their own Moon bauble, and the time limit is 30 minutes."] = "Con el key item Moon bauble, interactúa con la fountain para entrar en el campo de batalla. Pueden entrar hasta 6 miembros del grupo, cada uno necesita su propia Moon bauble, y el límite de tiempo es de 30 minutos.",
    ["With the Sapara of Trials equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points."] = "Con el Sapara of Trials equipado en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas para acumular 300 Trial Points.",
    ["With the Scythe of Trials equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points."] = "Con la Scythe of Trials equipada en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas para acumular 300 Trial Points.",
    ["With the Sword of Trials equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points."] = "Con la Sword of Trials equipada en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas para acumular 300 Trial Points.",
    ["With the Tonberry key (Zilart) you can reset your Tonberry Hate at any time: use it on the secret door at (F-11) on map 1 of the Temple of Uggalepih, where the Tonberry Priest resets your Tonberry Hate in exchange for a gil penance."] = "Con la Tonberry key (Zilart) puedes reiniciar tu Tonberry Hate cuando quieras: úsala en la puerta secreta de (F-11) del mapa 1 del Temple of Uggalepih, donde el Tonberry Priest reinicia tu Tonberry Hate a cambio de una penitencia en gil.",
    ["With the key item Biyaada's letter, go to Al Zahbi and speak with Gaweesh (G-8) and Talhaal (H-6)."] = "Con el key item Biyaada's letter, ve a Al Zahbi y habla con Gaweesh (G-8) y Talhaal (H-6).",
    ["You are directed to head to the secret entrance to Wajaom Woodlands, at (G-10)/(H-10) of Aht Urhgan Whitegate. Upon zoning, you receive another cutscene."] = "Te dirigen a la entrada secreta de Wajaom Woodlands, en (G-10)/(H-10) de Aht Urhgan Whitegate. Al cambiar de zona, ves otra escena.",
    ["You are instructed to travel to Gustav Tunnel. Take Silent Oils and Prism Powders with you. You will also find a Grounds Tome close to your spawn point, where you can get Sneak and Invisible."] = "Te indican que viajes a Gustav Tunnel. Lleva Silent Oils y Prism Powders. También encontrarás un Grounds Tome cerca de tu punto de aparición, donde puedes conseguir Sneak e Invisible.",
    ["You are not provided with the Kindred's Seals and need to get them yourself. Check your inventory and the Port Jeuno NPCs Shemo and Shami (Status, Currencies, Kindred's Seals Stored), as you may already have enough seals."] = "No te dan los Kindred's Seals y tienes que conseguirlos tú. Revisa tu inventario y a los NPCs de Port Jeuno Shemo y Shami (Status, Currencies, Kindred's Seals Stored), ya que puede que ya tengas suficientes.",
    ["You are placed on a Chocobo and must ride to the destination. If you dismount, the quest ends in failure."] = "Te montan en un Chocobo y debes cabalgar hasta el destino. Si desmontas, la quest termina en fracaso.",
    ["You begin in one of the three starting nations: San d'Oria, Bastok, or Windurst. Your nation decides which city you start in, which storyline missions you follow, and which gate guards give you Signet. The fields around each city are similar in difficulty, so pick the city and story you like best."] = "Empiezas en una de las tres naciones iniciales: San d'Oria, Bastok o Windurst. Tu nación decide en qué ciudad empiezas, qué misiones de historia sigues y qué guardias de puerta te dan Signet. Las zonas alrededor de cada ciudad tienen una dificultad parecida, así que elige la ciudad y la historia que más te gusten.",
    ["You can buy a Nest Chest Key from the Curio Vendor Moogle for 2,500 gil if you have the key item Rhapsody in White, from completing Rhapsodies of Vana'diel Mission 1-6."] = "Puedes comprar una Nest Chest Key al Curio Vendor Moogle por 2,500 gil si tienes el key item Rhapsody in White, que se obtiene al completar la Rhapsodies of Vana'diel Mission 1-6.",
    ["You can get the Mini tuning fork again from Castilchat at any time and repeat the fight, but he will no longer teleport you to the Cloister."] = "Puedes volver a obtener el Mini tuning fork de Castilchat en cualquier momento y repetir el combate, pero ya no te teletransportará al Cloister.",
    ["You can get the Mini tuning fork again from Ferrol at any point and repeat the fight, but he will no longer teleport you to the Cloister."] = "Puedes volver a obtener el Mini tuning fork de Ferrol en cualquier momento y repetir el combate, pero ya no te teletransportará al Cloister.",
    ["You can only work on this quest after you have obtained an Airship Pass, as completing it requires a trip on the airship. You need Bastok fame level 3."] = "Solo puedes hacer esta quest tras obtener un Airship Pass, ya que completarla requiere un viaje en airship. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["You can rent a chocobo in Southern San d'Oria, Bastok Mines, and Windurst Woods, once you have a license."] = "Puedes alquilar un chocobo en Southern San d'Oria, Bastok Mines y Windurst Woods, una vez que tengas una licencia.",
    ["You can repeat this quest as often as you like."] = "Puedes repetir esta quest tantas veces como quieras.",
    ["You can repeat this quest once per Conquest Tally."] = "Puedes repetir esta quest una vez por Conquest Tally.",
    ["You can repeat this quest once per Earth day."] = "Puedes repetir esta quest una vez por día terrestre.",
    ["You can repeat this quest once per Earth day: after completing it, speak with Leepe-Hoppe again for another Moon bauble, without collecting the whispers again."] = "Puedes repetir esta quest una vez por día terrestre: tras completarla, habla de nuevo con Leepe-Hoppe para otra Moon bauble, sin reunir los whispers otra vez.",
    ["You can return to Waoud and ask him to \"gaze away\" at your fate to get a cutscene. This is necessary for the next quest."] = "Puedes volver con Waoud y pedirle \"gaze away\" a tu destino para obtener una escena. Es necesario para la siguiente quest.",
    ["You can skip this quest by purchasing the key item PFC Wildcat badge from a Curio Vendor Moogle once you meet the 25 Mercenary Rank points requirement and have the key item Rhapsody in Azure from Rhapsodies of Vana'diel."] = "Puedes saltarte esta quest comprando el key item PFC Wildcat badge a un Curio Vendor Moogle cuando cumplas el requisito de 25 puntos de Mercenary Rank y tengas el key item Rhapsody in Azure de Rhapsodies of Vana'diel.",
    ["You can toss the Ice Pendulum after completing the quest, as it serves no further purpose."] = "Puedes tirar el Ice Pendulum tras completar la quest, ya que no tiene más utilidad.",
    ["You can trade the Sutlac back to Hadahda if you prefer an Imperial Bronze Piece."] = "Puedes devolver el Sutlac a Hadahda si prefieres una Imperial Bronze Piece.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active or if you are on the quest Cid's Secret. You need level 71 and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa o si estás en la quest Cid's Secret. Necesitas nivel 71 y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. Speak with Jakoh Wahcondalo in Kazham (J-9) to receive the Dagger of Trials."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Habla con Jakoh Wahcondalo en Kazham (J-9) para recibir la Dagger of Trials.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Axe skill 240 or higher and level 71."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Axe 240 o superior y nivel 71.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Great Axe skill 240 or higher, level 71, and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Great Axe 240 o superior, nivel 71 y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Great Sword skill 250 or higher and level 71."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Great Sword 250 o superior y nivel 71.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Scythe skill 240 or higher and level 71."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Scythe 240 o superior y nivel 71.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need a Ninja of level 71 and Katana skill 250 or higher, and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas un Ninja de nivel 71 y habilidad de Katana de 250 o superior, y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need level 71, and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas nivel 71 y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need to be level 71 with a base Great Katana skill of 250 or higher."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Debes ser nivel 71 con una habilidad base de Great Katana de 250 o superior.",
    ["You cannot start this quest while another Weapon Skill quest is active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. It requires Staff skill 230 or higher and level 71."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest mientras otra quest de Weapon Skill esté activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Requiere habilidad de Staff 230 o superior y nivel 71.",
    ["You cannot start this quest while another Weapon Skill quest is active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Archery skill 250 or higher, level 71, and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest mientras otra quest de Weapon Skill esté activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Archery 250 o superior, nivel 71 y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You cannot start this quest while another Weapon Skill quest is active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Club skill 230 or higher, level 71 and the Rise of the Zilart pack, and your main job must be WAR, MNK, WHM, BLM, PLD, SMN, BLU, SCH or GEO."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest mientras otra quest de Weapon Skill esté activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Club 230 o superior, nivel 71 y el pack Rise of the Zilart, y tu trabajo principal debe ser WAR, MNK, WHM, BLM, PLD, SMN, BLU, SCH o GEO.",
    ["You cannot start this quest while another Weapon Skill quest is active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Polearm skill 240 or higher, level 71 and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Polearm 240 o superior, nivel 71 y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You do not need to be on Bard when opening the coffer. You receive the key item Old gauntlets from the coffer."] = "No necesitas ser Bard al abrir el cofre. Recibes el key item Old gauntlets del cofre.",
    ["You do not need to be on Monk when opening the coffer. You receive the key item Old gauntlets from the coffer."] = "No necesitas ser Monk al abrir el cofre. Recibes el key item Old gauntlets del cofre.",
    ["You do not need to be on Summoner when opening the coffer, only when accepting the quest. A Grotto Coffer Key and a Mythril Beastcoin (if you do not have access to the Proto-Waypoints) are required for this quest."] = "No necesitas ser Summoner al abrir el cofre, solo al aceptar la quest. Para esta quest hacen falta una Grotto Coffer Key y una Mythril Beastcoin (si no tienes acceso a los Proto-Waypoints).",
    ["You enter on the east side of the map, in the room at (I-8), which is also where the Rune of Release appears."] = "Entras por el lado este del mapa, en la sala de (I-8), que es también donde aparece la Rune of Release.",
    ["You have 12 Vana'diel hours and 30 Vana'diel minutes to collect all nine."] = "Tienes 12 horas y 30 minutos de Vana'diel para reunir los nueve.",
    ["You have 30 minutes to complete the quest."] = "Tienes 30 minutos para completar la quest.",
    ["You have 30 minutes. Escort Wanzo-Unzozo until he stops on his own, then speak with him to receive the key item Completion certificate. If he vanishes before you speak with him, you do not get the key item and must do the quest again."] = "Tienes 30 minutos. Escolta a Wanzo-Unzozo hasta que se detenga por sí solo y luego habla con él para recibir el key item Completion certificate. Si desaparece antes de que hables con él, no obtienes el key item y debes repetir la quest.",
    ["You have to zone after completing Welcome to Bastok. You must be level 31 or higher. Speak with Powhatan in Port Bastok (E-6) to start the quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Welcome to Bastok. Debes ser nivel 31 o superior. Habla con Powhatan en Port Bastok (E-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["You know the latent is broken when the elemental resistances listed in the Sapara of Trials description have disappeared from the elemental resistances in the equipment window."] = "Sabrás que el latent está roto cuando las resistencias elementales indicadas en la descripción del Sapara of Trials hayan desaparecido de las resistencias elementales de la ventana de equipo.",
    ["You know the latent is broken when the elemental resistances listed in the Scythe of Trials description have disappeared from the elemental resistances in the equipment window."] = "Sabrás que el latent está roto cuando las resistencias elementales indicadas en la descripción de la Scythe of Trials hayan desaparecido de las resistencias elementales de la ventana de equipo.",
    ["You may additionally speak with Ailbeche, Exoroche and Vemalpeau for more quest-related dialogue. Vemalpeau takes your Knight's confession key item."] = "Además puedes hablar con Ailbeche, Exoroche y Vemalpeau para más diálogo de la quest. Vemalpeau se queda tu key item Knight's confession.",
    ["You may also keep the whisper to meet the requirements of the quest The Moonlit Path."] = "También puedes conservar el whisper para cumplir los requisitos de la quest The Moonlit Path.",
    ["You may also keep the whisper to meet the requirements of the quest The Moonlit Path. Do not turn in the quest if you want to complete The Moonlit Path."] = "También puedes conservar el whisper para cumplir los requisitos de la quest The Moonlit Path. No entregues la quest si quieres completar The Moonlit Path.",
    ["You may prepare for the upcoming battle and, whenever you are ready, trade Dodmos the tuning fork to be transported to the arena."] = "Puedes prepararte para el combate y, cuando estés listo, entrega el tuning fork a Dodmos para que te transporte a la arena.",
    ["You may prepare for the upcoming battle and, whenever you are ready, trade Lacia the tuning fork to be transported to the arena."] = "Puedes prepararte para el combate y, cuando estés listo, entrega el tuning fork a Lacia para que te transporte a la arena.",
    ["You may prepare for the upcoming battle and, whenever you are ready, trade Rahi Fohlatti the tuning fork to be transported to the arena."] = "Puedes prepararte para el combate y, cuando estés listo, entrega el tuning fork a Rahi Fohlatti para que te transporte a la arena.",
    ["You may re-obtain the Mini Tuning Fork from Dodmos at any point if you want to repeat the fight, but he will no longer teleport you to the Cloister. Try to fight Ifrit on Watersday and do not fight him on Firesday."] = "Puedes volver a conseguir el Mini Tuning Fork de Dodmos en cualquier momento si quieres repetir el combate, pero él ya no te teletransportará a la Cloister. Intenta luchar contra Ifrit en Watersday y no luches contra él en Firesday.",
    ["You may re-obtain the Mini Tuning Fork from Lacia at any point if you want to repeat the fight, but she will no longer teleport you to the Cloister."] = "Puedes volver a conseguir el Mini Tuning Fork de Lacia en cualquier momento si quieres repetir el combate, pero ella ya no te teletransportará a la Cloister.",
    ["You may re-obtain the Mini Tuning Fork from Rahi Fohlatti at any point if you want to repeat the fight, but she will no longer teleport you to the Cloister."] = "Puedes volver a conseguir el Mini Tuning Fork de Rahi Fohlatti en cualquier momento si quieres repetir el combate, pero ella ya no te teletransportará a la Cloister.",
    ["You may re-obtain the Mini Tuning Fork from Verctissa at any point if you want to repeat the fight, but she will no longer teleport you to the Cloister."] = "Puedes volver a conseguir el Mini Tuning Fork de Verctissa en cualquier momento si quieres repetir el combate, pero ella ya no te teletransportará a la Cloister.",
    ["You must already have signed up with the Woodworking Guild: speak to the Guild Master, Cheupirudaux, in Northern San d'Oria (F-3)."] = "Debes haberte inscrito ya en el Woodworking Guild: habla con el Guild Master, Cheupirudaux, en Northern San d'Oria (F-3).",
    ["You must be a Summoner of level 20 or higher. Speak with Castilchat in Northern San d'Oria (E-7) to begin the quest and obtain a Mini tuning fork of ice."] = "Debes ser Summoner de nivel 20 o superior. Habla con Castilchat en Northern San d'Oria (E-7) para empezar la quest y obtener un Mini tuning fork of ice.",
    ["You must be a Summoner of level 20 or higher. Speak with Ferrol in Port Bastok (I-8) to begin the quest and obtain a Mini tuning fork of earth."] = "Debes ser Summoner de nivel 20 o superior. Habla con Ferrol en Port Bastok (I-8) para empezar la quest y obtener un Mini tuning fork of earth.",
    ["You must be level 10 or higher. First, zone at (C-7) in Northern San d'Oria."] = "Debes ser nivel 10 o superior. Primero, cambia de zona en (C-7) de Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["You must be level 5 or higher on any job."] = "Debes ser nivel 5 o superior con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["You must be on Bard for the next step."] = "Debes ser Bard para el siguiente paso.",
    ["You must complete Storms of Fate to trigger this quest, and you need the key item Whisper of the Wyrmking."] = "Debes completar Storms of Fate para activar esta quest, y necesitas el key item Whisper of the Wyrmking.",
    ["You must first have Zilart Mission 5, Headstone Pilgrimage, active or complete, and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. The Opo-opos are not happy that you stole their \"red treasure\"."] = "Debes tener primero la Zilart Mission 5, Headstone Pilgrimage, activa o completada, y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart. Los Opo-opos no están contentos de que les robaras su \"red treasure\".",
    ["You must first have completed Zilart Mission 7 and have the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Primero debes haber completado la Zilart Mission 7 y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You must hand out all 15 flyers or the quest will not be completed. If you lose them, you can buy more from Regine for 10 gil each."] = "Debes repartir los 15 flyers o la quest no se completará. Si los pierdes, puedes comprar más a Regine por 10 gil cada uno.",
    ["You must have Zilart Mission 5, Headstone Pilgrimage, activated (or already completed), and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. Is there any way to soothe the spirits that wander about Cape Teriggan? Perhaps a Rain Lily."] = "Debes tener la Zilart Mission 5, Headstone Pilgrimage, activada (o ya completada), y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart. ¿Hay alguna forma de calmar a los espíritus que vagan por Cape Teriggan? Quizá una Rain Lily.",
    ["You must have the Damp Scroll in your inventory when you speak with Shivivi in Norg (J-8) to begin the quest."] = "Debes tener la Damp Scroll en tu inventario cuando hables con Shivivi en Norg (J-8) para empezar la quest.",
    ["You must have zoned once after finishing Forever to Hold to receive this quest."] = "Debes haber cambiado de zona una vez tras terminar Forever to Hold para recibir esta quest.",
    ["You must now find a targetable location in Al Zahbi to find Munahda's package."] = "Ahora debes encontrar un lugar seleccionable en Al Zahbi para hallar el Munahda's package.",
    ["You must trade items in order to a list of Opo-opos. The first is Lulupp (G-7), who wants a Broken Mithran Rod, which can be bought at the Auction House."] = "Debes entregar objetos en orden a una lista de Opo-opos. El primero es Lulupp (G-7), que quiere un Broken Mithran Rod, que se puede comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["You must wait until the next game day after completing The Talekeeper's Truth before you can activate this quest. You must be a Warrior of level 50 or higher."] = "Debes esperar al siguiente día de juego tras completar The Talekeeper's Truth antes de poder activar esta quest. Debes ser Warrior de nivel 50 o superior.",
    ["You must zone after completing A Greeting Cardian before you start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar A Greeting Cardian antes de empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing As Thick as Thieves before you start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar As Thick as Thieves antes de empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing Chasing Tales before you can start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Chasing Tales antes de poder empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing Delivering the Goods before Ulamaal gives you this quest. Speak with Ulamaal in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) to begin the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. The leader of the Epicureans has been missing since saying he was going to the port."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Delivering the Goods antes de que Ulamaal te dé esta quest. Habla con Ulamaal en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. El líder de los Epicureans lleva desaparecido desde que dijo que iba al puerto.",
    ["You must zone after completing Fire and Brimstone before you start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Fire and Brimstone antes de empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing Food for Thought before you can start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Food for Thought antes de poder empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing Gullible's Travels before you can flag this quest. You need Kazham fame level 7 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Magriffon has spent all of his (your?) money to save a maiden in distress."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Gullible's Travels antes de poder activar esta quest. Necesitas el nivel 7 de fama de Kazham y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Magriffon ha gastado todo su dinero (¿tuyo?) para salvar a una doncella en apuros.",
    ["You must zone after completing Making Headlines before you start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Making Headlines antes de empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing Omens to start this quest; if you do not zone and get a divination from Waoud, you will have to wait for the next game day. You need the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Omens para empezar esta quest; si no cambias de zona y pides una adivinación a Waoud, tendrás que esperar al siguiente día de juego. Necesitas el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["You must zone after completing Sin Hunting before you start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Sin Hunting antes de empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing The Sacred Katana to begin this quest. Speak with Jaucribaix in Norg (K-8). You need to be a Samurai of level 50 or higher and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. A ritual is needed to send the souls of those who died in a long-ago war to their proper resting place."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar The Sacred Katana para empezar esta quest. Habla con Jaucribaix en Norg (K-8). Debes ser Samurai de nivel 50 o superior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart. Se necesita un ritual para enviar a su lugar de descanso a las almas de los muertos en una guerra de hace mucho.",
    ["You must zone after completing Yomi Okuri to begin this quest. Speak with Jaucribaix in Norg (K-8). You need to be a Samurai of level 50 or higher and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. At the close of the Great War, Gilgamesh's father trapped a terrible spirit within a helm, and that helm has been stolen."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Yomi Okuri para empezar esta quest. Habla con Jaucribaix en Norg (K-8). Debes ser Samurai de nivel 50 o superior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart. Al final de la Great War, el padre de Gilgamesh encerró a un espíritu terrible en un yelmo, y ese yelmo ha sido robado.",
    ["You must zone after completing the previous quest. This quest cannot be started while Windurst Mission 9-2 or the quest The Kind Cardian is open."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar la quest anterior. Esta quest no se puede empezar mientras la Windurst Mission 9-2 o la quest The Kind Cardian estén abiertas.",
    ["You must zone after the previous quest, The Wayward Automaton, in order to start this quest. Speak with Iruki-Waraki in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-9) as a Puppetmaster of level 50 or higher. You discover that he is trying to get his automaton back and has formed a plan, and he gives you a shopping list of items. From here on you can be on any job."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras la quest anterior, The Wayward Automaton, para empezar esta quest. Habla con Iruki-Waraki en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-9) como Puppetmaster de nivel 50 o superior. Descubres que intenta recuperar su autómata y ha ideado un plan, y te da una lista de la compra. A partir de aquí puedes ir con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["You must zone again if you have not done so since receiving the Bouncer Club."] = "Debes cambiar de zona de nuevo si no lo has hecho desde que recibiste el Bouncer Club.",
    ["You need Bastok fame level 3 and to have completed Father Figure. Obtain a Cinnamon from the Auction House or, if you have the Kazham Airship Pass, from the port shop in Kazham. You can reach the vendor without being on the airship side: take the Survival Guide or Home Point to Kazham and buy Cinnamon from Ghemi Sinterilo."] = "Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok y haber completado Father Figure. Obtén una Cinnamon en la Auction House o, si tienes el Kazham Airship Pass, en la tienda del puerto de Kazham. Puedes llegar al vendedor sin estar en el lado de la airship: toma la Survival Guide o el Home Point a Kazham y compra Cinnamon a Ghemi Sinterilo.",
    ["You need a Broken Lu Shang's Rod, which you can get by breaking your own Lu Shang's Fishing Rod or buying a broken one. You need the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Necesitas una Broken Lu Shang's Rod, que puedes conseguir rompiendo tu propia Lu Shang's Fishing Rod o comprando una rota. Necesitas el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You need the scent from Even More Gullible's Travels. This scent repulses all Mithra in Kazham, but it is required to start The Opo-opo and I, so if you plan to do that quest, do not wash it off before you start it. You need the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Necesitas el olor de Even More Gullible's Travels. Este olor repele a todos los Mithra de Kazham, pero es necesario para empezar The Opo-opo and I, así que si piensas hacer esa quest, no te lo quites antes de empezarla. Necesitas el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You need to be a Corsair of level 66 or higher and have a Corsair's Testimony. Obtain a Corsair's Testimony from Merrow Icedancer, Merrow Kabukidancer, Merrow Chantress or Lamia Fatedealer enemies."] = "Debes ser Corsair de nivel 66 o superior y tener un Corsair's Testimony. Consigue un Corsair's Testimony de los enemigos Merrow Icedancer, Merrow Kabukidancer, Merrow Chantress o Lamia Fatedealer.",
    ["You need to be a Summoner of level 20 or higher and have Other fame level 2. Speak with Lacia in Mhaura (I-9) to begin the quest and obtain a Mini Tuning Fork of Lightning."] = "Debes ser Summoner de nivel 20 o superior y tener el nivel 2 de fama de Other. Habla con Lacia en Mhaura (I-9) para empezar la quest y obtener un Mini Tuning Fork of Lightning.",
    ["You need to be a Summoner of level 20 or higher, Kazham fame level 2 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Speak with Dodmos in Kazham (J-9) to begin the quest and obtain a Mini Tuning Fork of Fire."] = "Debes ser Summoner de nivel 20 o superior, tener el nivel 2 de fama de Kazham y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Habla con Dodmos en Kazham (J-9) para empezar la quest y obtener un Mini Tuning Fork of Fire.",
    ["You need to be a Summoner of level 20 or higher, Outlands fame level 2 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Speak with Verctissa in Norg (H-9) to begin the quest and obtain a Mini Tuning Fork of Water."] = "Debes ser Summoner de nivel 20 o superior, tener el nivel 2 de fama de Outlands y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Habla con Verctissa en Norg (H-9) para empezar la quest y obtener un Mini Tuning Fork of Water.",
    ["You need to be a Summoner, Rabao fame level 2 and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. Speak with Rahi Fohlatti in Rabao (G-9) to begin the quest and obtain a Mini Tuning Fork of Wind."] = "Debes ser Summoner, tener el nivel 2 de fama de Rabao y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Habla con Rahi Fohlatti en Rabao (G-9) para empezar la quest y obtener un Mini Tuning Fork of Wind.",
    ["You need to be level 30 or higher. Examine the Door: Merchant's House on the second floor in Lower Jeuno (G-11), above the chocobo stables."] = "Debes ser nivel 30 o superior. Examina la Door: Merchant's House en el segundo piso de Lower Jeuno (G-11), encima de los establos de chocobos.",
    ["You need to be level 30 or higher. Speak with Bki Tbujhja in Lower Jeuno (H-8), inside the Merry Minstrel."] = "Debes ser nivel 30 o superior. Habla con Bki Tbujhja en Lower Jeuno (H-8), dentro del Merry Minstrel.",
    ["You need to be level 66 or higher. Speak with Shamarhaan, the Puppetmaster standing near the fountain in Bastok Markets (F-9), as a Puppetmaster to begin the quest."] = "Debes ser nivel 66 o superior. Habla con Shamarhaan, el Puppetmaster que está junto a la fuente en Bastok Markets (F-9), siendo Puppetmaster, para empezar la quest.",
    ["You need to be on or past the Chains of Promathia mission Flames for the Dead. Speak with Buffalostalker Dodzbraz in Uleguerand Range (F-9), just southeast of the Unity warp level 128. He is an Orc who despises snolls."] = "Debes estar en la misión de Chains of Promathia Flames for the Dead o más allá. Habla con Buffalostalker Dodzbraz en Uleguerand Range (F-9), justo al sureste del warp de Unity de nivel 128. Es un Orc que detesta a los snolls.",
    ["You need to break the latent on the Dagger of Trials before completing the rest of the quest. You know you have enough points when the latent breaks and the weapon's elemental resistances disappear from your active resistances (the colored dots below the gear grid)."] = "Necesitas romper el latent de la Dagger of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest. Sabrás que tienes puntos suficientes cuando el latent se rompa y las resistencias elementales del arma desaparezcan de tus resistencias activas (los puntos de colores bajo la cuadrícula de equipo).",
    ["You need to break the latent on the Kodachi of Trials. With it equipped in your main hand, fight experience-yielding monsters (Incredibly Easy Prey or higher) and perform Weapon Skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points. A weapon skill with no skillchain gives 5 points and a level 1 skillchain gives 7."] = "Necesitas romper el latent del Kodachi of Trials. Con él equipado en la mano principal, lucha contra monstruos que den experiencia (Incredibly Easy Prey o superior) y haz Weapon Skills o cierra skillchains para acumular 300 Trial Points. Un weapon skill sin skillchain da 5 puntos y una skillchain de nivel 1 da 7.",
    ["You need to break the latent on the Tachi of Trials. With it equipped in your main hand, fight experience-yielding monsters (Incredibly Easy Prey or higher) and perform Weapon Skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points."] = "Necesitas romper el latent de la Tachi of Trials. Con ella equipada en la mano principal, lucha contra monstruos que den experiencia (Incredibly Easy Prey o superior) y haz Weapon Skills o cierra skillchains para acumular 300 Trial Points.",
    ["You need to have completed Aht Urhgan Mission 11, and Mihli Aliapoh must be present in Al Zahbi. Go to (G-9) in Aht Urhgan Whitegate and talk to Eunheem."] = "Debes haber completado la Aht Urhgan Mission 11, y Mihli Aliapoh debe estar presente en Al Zahbi. Ve a (G-9) de Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla con Eunheem.",
    ["You need to have completed Chains of Promathia Mission 3-2. Speak with Taillegeas in Ru'Lude Gardens (I-7) to begin the quest."] = "Debes haber completado Chains of Promathia Mission 3-2. Habla con Taillegeas en Ru'Lude Gardens (I-7) para empezar la quest.",
    ["You need to have completed Rise of the Zilart Mission 17 and Chains of Promathia Mission 8-4. You must zone and wait until the next game day after completing the previous quest."] = "Debes haber completado Rise of the Zilart Mission 17 y Chains of Promathia Mission 8-4. Debes cambiar de zona y esperar hasta el siguiente día de juego tras completar la quest anterior.",
    ["You need to have finished Under the Sea to get this quest. Speak with Oswald in Selbina (I-9). He wants to order something nutritious to cheer his girlfriend up a bit, and asks you for the special ingredient, a Danceshroom."] = "Debes haber terminado Under the Sea para conseguir esta quest. Habla con Oswald en Selbina (I-9). Quiere encargar algo nutritivo para animar a su novia, y te pide el ingrediente especial, una Danceshroom.",
    ["You need to wait 8 real-life hours (8 game days) after completing Way of the Cook before this quest is offered. Speak with Rycharde in Mhaura (I-8). He wants you to get him an ingredient called a puffball."] = "Debes esperar 8 horas reales (8 días de juego) tras completar Way of the Cook antes de que se ofrezca esta quest. Habla con Rycharde en Mhaura (I-8). Quiere que le consigas un ingrediente llamado puffball.",
    ["You need to wait 8 real-life hours after completing Rycharde the Chef before this quest is offered. Speak with Rycharde in Mhaura to begin it. He needs your help finding some ingredients: a beehive chip and some dhalmel meat."] = "Debes esperar 8 horas reales tras completar Rycharde the Chef antes de que se ofrezca esta quest. Habla con Rycharde en Mhaura para empezarla. Necesita ayuda para encontrar unos ingredientes: un beehive chip y algo de dhalmel meat.",
    ["You need to wait 8 real-life hours after completing The Clue before this quest is offered. Speak with Rycharde in Mhaura (I-8), who asks you to take Mhauran couscous to Valgeir in Selbina."] = "Debes esperar 8 horas reales tras completar The Clue antes de que se ofrezca esta quest. Habla con Rycharde en Mhaura (I-8), que te pide que lleves Mhauran couscous a Valgeir en Selbina.",
    ["You need to wait two, possibly three game days after completing Unending Chase before this quest is offered. Speak with Rycharde in Mhaura (I-8). He gives you an Aragoneu pizza to deliver to his father, Valgeir, in Selbina."] = "Debes esperar dos, posiblemente tres días de juego tras completar Unending Chase antes de que se ofrezca esta quest. Habla con Rycharde en Mhaura (I-8). Te da una Aragoneu pizza para entregar a su padre, Valgeir, en Selbina.",
    ["You no longer have to be on Corsair for the rest of this quest. You are asked to fish up a Hydrogauge."] = "Ya no tienes que ser Corsair para el resto de esta quest. Te piden pescar un Hydrogauge.",
    ["You obtain the key item Orcish dried food after trading the key."] = "Obtienes el key item Orcish dried food tras entregar la llave.",
    ["You receive a cutscene and the Ninja Hakama, and the quest is complete. You can repeat the quest."] = "Recibes una escena y la Ninja Hakama, y la quest se completa. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["You receive the 10,000 gil back at the end of the quest. Trading Magriffon the 10,000 gil continues this specific quest even if other quests that involve giving Magriffon gil are active."] = "Recibes de vuelta los 10,000 gil al final de la quest. Entregar a Magriffon los 10,000 gil continúa esta quest concreta aunque haya otras quests activas que impliquen darle gil a Magriffon.",
    ["You receive the Bat Earring and the title Guider of Souls to the Sanctuary."] = "Recibes el Bat Earring y el título Guider of Souls to the Sanctuary.",
    ["You receive the key item Old gauntlets from the coffer."] = "Recibes el key item Old gauntlets del cofre.",
    ["You should now be in a watchtower in West Ronfaure, and Vilatroire should be up ahead after zoning in (H-5). Speak with him to activate the quest."] = "Ya deberías estar en una torre de vigilancia de West Ronfaure, y Vilatroire debería estar delante al entrar en la zona (H-5). Habla con él para activar la quest.",
    ["You start with your race's starting clothes, a weapon for your job, a map of your nation, and 10 gil. Before you head out:"] = "Empiezas con la ropa inicial de tu raza, un arma para tu trabajo, un mapa de tu nación y 10 gil. Antes de salir:",
    ["You will know the latent is broken when its bonus stats disappear on un-equipping and re-equipping the Kodachi of Trials; the elemental resistances also disappear from your stats."] = "Sabrás que el latent está roto cuando sus bonificaciones desaparezcan al desequipar y volver a equipar el Kodachi of Trials; las resistencias elementales también desaparecen de tus estadísticas.",
    ["You will know the latent is broken when the elemental resistances listed in the description of the Tachi of Trials have disappeared from the elemental resistances in the equipment window."] = "Sabrás que el latent está roto cuando las resistencias elementales indicadas en la descripción de la Tachi of Trials hayan desaparecido de las resistencias elementales de la ventana de equipo.",
    ["Your Mog House"] = "Tu Mog House",
    ["Your Mog House is in your home city. Each nation has a quest that lets your Mog House exit into a different part of the city: Growing Flowers (San d'Oria), A Lady's Heart (Bastok), and Flower Child (Windurst). Complete all three to unlock the second floor of your Mog House."] = "Tu Mog House está en tu ciudad de origen. Cada nación tiene una quest que hace que tu Mog House salga a una parte distinta de la ciudad: Growing Flowers (San d'Oria), A Lady's Heart (Bastok) y Flower Child (Windurst). Completa las tres para desbloquear el segundo piso de tu Mog House.",
    ["Your allegiance does not prevent you from helping the other nations."] = "Tu lealtad no te impide ayudar a las otras naciones.",
    ["Your buffs are removed upon entering the battlefield, so summon Trusts after entering."] = "Tus buffs se eliminan al entrar en el campo de batalla, así que invoca a los Trusts tras entrar.",
    ["Your elemental resistances are listed underneath your equipped gear grid. The latent is broken when the elemental resistances of the Knuckles of Trials disappear from them."] = "Tus resistencias elementales aparecen debajo de la cuadrícula de equipo. El latent está roto cuando las resistencias elementales de los Knuckles of Trials desaparecen de ellas.",
    ["Your first gil"] = "Tus primeros gil",
    ["Your first home point is your starting city. If you're knocked out, you can return to the last home point you set. Home points can't teleport you between cities."] = "Tu primer home point es tu ciudad de inicio. Si te noquean, puedes volver al último home point que fijaste. Los home points no te pueden teletransportar entre ciudades.",
    ["Your first steps in town"] = "Tus primeros pasos en la ciudad",
    ["Your level is capped at 50 until you complete Limit Break quests, starting with In Defiant Challenge. Each one raises the cap on the way to 75."] = "Tu nivel está limitado a 50 hasta que completes las quests de Limit Break, empezando por In Defiant Challenge. Cada una sube el límite en el camino hacia el 75.",
    ["Your moogle wants to take a raptor mantle and a wool hat to his friends in the Outlands. Trade him the items he requests."] = "Tu moogle quiere llevar un raptor mantle y un wool hat a sus amigos de las Outlands. Entrégale los objetos que te pida.",
    ["Your moogle wants to take a shrimp lure and some Selbina butter back home. He would be very happy if you found them for him; trade him the items."] = "Tu moogle quiere llevarse un shrimp lure y algo de Selbina butter a casa. Se alegraría mucho si se los encontraras; entrégale los objetos.",
    ["Your race has a home nation: Humes and Galka come from Bastok, Elvaan from San d'Oria, and Tarutaru and Mithra from Windurst. If you start in your race's home nation you also receive its nation ring. You start with extra fame in your chosen nation and some in your race's home nation."] = "Tu raza tiene una nación de origen: los Humes y los Galka vienen de Bastok, los Elvaan de San d'Oria, y los Tarutaru y los Mithra de Windurst. Si empiezas en la nación de origen de tu raza, también recibes su anillo de nación. Empiezas con fama extra en la nación que elijas y algo en la nación de origen de tu raza.",
    ["Your reward depends on how quickly you deliver the Chocobo. To San d'Oria: Miratete's Memoirs at 27:00 to 28:36, a Chocobo Ticket at 28:37 to 29:59, Gysahl Greens at 30:00 or more."] = "Tu recompensa depende de lo rápido que entregues el Chocobo. A San d'Oria: Miratete's Memoirs entre 27:00 y 28:36, un Chocobo Ticket entre 28:37 y 29:59, Gysahl Greens a 30:00 o más.",
    ["Zone after completing A Test of True Love. You need Bastok fame level 6."] = "Cambia de zona tras completar A Test of True Love. Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Zone after completing Healing the Land to begin this quest."] = "Cambia de zona tras completar Healing the Land para empezar esta quest.",
    ["Zone after completing Love and Ice. You need Bastok fame level 6."] = "Cambia de zona tras completar Love and Ice. Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Zone and return to Charlaimagnat after one Earth minute for your reward, the Scroll of Teleport-Altep."] = "Cambia de zona y vuelve con Charlaimagnat tras un minuto terrestre por tu recompensa, el Scroll of Teleport-Altep.",
    ["Zone and return to Kohlo-Lakolo to receive your reward."] = "Cambia de zona y vuelve con Kohlo-Lakolo para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Zone and speak with Fyi Chalmwoh again to receive your reward, a mannequin matching your race and gender."] = "Cambia de zona y habla de nuevo con Fyi Chalmwoh para recibir tu recompensa, un mannequin que coincide con tu raza y género.",
    ["Zone and then speak with Tehf Kimasnahya once more to receive your reward, the Bibiki Seashell."] = "Cambia de zona y habla una vez más con Tehf Kimasnahya para recibir tu recompensa, el Bibiki Seashell.",
    ["Zone and wait until the next Vana'diel day after completing the battlefield, then talk to Gilgamesh in Norg for a cutscene to complete the quest and receive an earring of your choice."] = "Cambia de zona y espera hasta el siguiente día de Vana'diel tras completar el campo de batalla, luego habla con Gilgamesh en Norg para una escena que completa la quest y recibir un pendiente a tu elección.",
    ["Zone back into Aht Urhgan Whitegate from Al Zahbi for a cutscene."] = "Vuelve a entrar en Aht Urhgan Whitegate desde Al Zahbi para una escena.",
    ["Zone back into Bastok Markets and return to Michea to receive the key item Mythril hearts."] = "Vuelve a entrar en Bastok Markets y regresa con Michea para recibir el key item Mythril hearts.",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed Chocobilious."] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar Chocobilious.",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed Early Bird Catches the Bookworm."] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar Early Bird Catches the Bookworm.",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed Inspector's Gadget!"] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar Inspector's Gadget!",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed Know One's Onions."] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar Know One's Onions.",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed Overnight Delivery."] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar Overnight Delivery.",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed the previous quest."] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar la quest anterior.",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed the quest Truth, Justice, and the Onion Way!"] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar la quest Truth, Justice, and the Onion Way!",
    ["Zone in and out if you have just completed Blast from the Past."] = "Sal y vuelve a entrar en la zona si acabas de completar Blast from the Past.",
    ["Zone in and out if you have just completed Star Struck."] = "Sal y vuelve a entrar en la zona si acabas de completar Star Struck.",
    ["Zone in for a cutscene to complete the quest."] = "Entra en la zona para ver una escena que completa la quest.",
    ["Zone into Ceizak Battlegrounds for the final event."] = "Entra en Ceizak Battlegrounds para el evento final.",
    ["Zone into Chateau d'Oraguille."] = "Entra en Chateau d'Oraguille.",
    ["Zone into Crawlers' Nest from Rolanberry Fields. If you get a cutscene with a Hume female NPC named Olavia, you are ready to head out. If you do not, another team may already be on the quest, so wait a while and try zoning in again. You can summon Trusts, but zoning in with an Adventuring Fellow makes the escort NPC disappear."] = "Entra en Crawlers' Nest desde Rolanberry Fields. Si ves una escena con una NPC Hume femenina llamada Olavia, estás listo para salir. Si no, puede que otro equipo ya esté haciendo la quest, así que espera un rato y prueba a entrar otra vez. Puedes invocar Trusts, pero entrar con un Adventuring Fellow hace desaparecer al NPC escoltado.",
    ["Zone into Fei'Yin from Beaucedine Glacier."] = "Entra en Fei'Yin desde Beaucedine Glacier.",
    ["Zone into Lower Delkfutt's Tower from Qufim Island."] = "Entra en Lower Delkfutt's Tower desde Qufim Island.",
    ["Zone into Lufaise Meadows by taking the south exit at (I-6), then head to (H-10). Clear any nearby Orcs, as they will link."] = "Cambia de zona a Lufaise Meadows por la salida sur en (I-6) y ve a (H-10). Despeja los Orcs cercanos, ya que se enlazarán.",
    ["Zone into Mamook from the Mamool Ja Staging Point exit."] = "Entra en Mamook por la salida del Mamool Ja Staging Point.",
    ["Zone into Northern San d'Oria for the Rites of Succession."] = "Entra en Northern San d'Oria para los Rites of Succession.",
    ["Zone into Northern San d'Oria."] = "Entra en Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["Zone into Oldton Movalpolos, then travel to Mine Shaft #2716 and face Chekochuk, Movamuq, Swipostik, Trikotrak, and Bugbby."] = "Entra en Oldton Movalpolos, luego viaja a la Mine Shaft #2716 y enfréntate a Chekochuk, Movamuq, Swipostik, Trikotrak y Bugbby.",
    ["Zone into Oldton Movalpolos."] = "Entra en Oldton Movalpolos.",
    ["Zone into Ordelle's Caves for a cutscene. The Survival Guide and the Voidwatch warp bring you to the same entrance."] = "Entra en Ordelle's Caves para ver una escena. La Survival Guide y el warp de Voidwatch te llevan a la misma entrada.",
    ["Zone into Ru'Aun Gardens to unlock access to Tu'Lia."] = "Entra en Ru'Aun Gardens para desbloquear el acceso a Tu'Lia.",
    ["Zone into Ru'Aun Gardens."] = "Entra en Ru'Aun Gardens.",
    ["Zone into Southern San d'Oria for the final epilogue."] = "Entra en Southern San d'Oria para el epílogo final.",
    ["Zone into Windurst Walls from an adjacent area."] = "Entra en Windurst Walls desde una zona adyacente.",
    ["Zone into Xarcabard for a cutscene that hints you to look near Castle Zvahl Baileys."] = "Entra en Xarcabard para una escena que te sugiere buscar cerca de Castle Zvahl Baileys.",
    ["Zone out and back in again, then speak with Ronan to complete the quest."] = "Sal de la zona y vuelve a entrar, luego habla con Ronan para completar la quest.",
    ["Zone out and back in and wait for the game day to change. Return to both patches of mushrooms between 04:00 and 06:00 game time to harvest young Scourshrooms. You need at least 2 young Scourshrooms to complete the quest."] = "Cambia de zona y vuelve a entrar y espera a que cambie el día de juego. Vuelve a ambas matas de hongos entre las 04:00 y las 06:00 hora del juego para recoger Scourshrooms jóvenes. Necesitas al menos 2 Scourshrooms jóvenes para completar la quest.",
    ["Zone out of Heavens Tower first if you have just completed Recollections."] = "Sal primero de Heavens Tower si acabas de completar Recollections.",
    ["Zone out of Heavens Tower first if you have just completed The Three Magi."] = "Sal primero de Heavens Tower si acabas de completar The Three Magi.",
    ["Zone out of Norg, then return to Jaucribaix for your reward, the Myochin Kabuto, and the title Paragon of Samurai Excellence. You can toss the Banishing Charm after completing the quest, as it serves no further purpose."] = "Sal de Norg y vuelve con Jaucribaix por tu recompensa, el Myochin Kabuto, y el título Paragon of Samurai Excellence. Puedes tirar el Banishing Charm al completar la quest, porque ya no sirve de nada.",
    ["Zone out of and back into your Mog House, then wait some time (between 10 and 15 real-world minutes)."] = "Sal de tu Mog House y vuelve a entrar, luego espera un tiempo (entre 10 y 15 minutos reales).",
    ["Zone out to the south of the Altar Room and then back into the zone for a cutscene and a Gold Beastcoin. You receive the title Yagudo Initiate."] = "Sal de la zona hacia el sur de la Altar Room y vuelve a entrar para una escena y una Gold Beastcoin. Recibes el título Yagudo Initiate.",
    ["Zone to West Ronfaure and look for Aaveleon at (G-6)."] = "Cambia de zona a West Ronfaure y busca a Aaveleon en (G-6).",
    ["Zone, then return to Magriffon, who gives you a Treasure map key item."] = "Cambia de zona y vuelve con Magriffon, que te da un key item Treasure map.",
    ["Zones: every area, with monsters, levels, shops, and fishing."] = "Zones: cada zona, con monstruos, niveles, tiendas y pesca.",
